window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1601,"title":"Chapter 1601 - A Snake?","paragraphs":["Sacred Cry was stunned by the way Lin Yuan addressed it.","Although it had been alive for more than 1,000 years, it had the mentality of a child. Otherwise, it would not have done something like pouring its tears down White Phoenix’s throat.","When Sacred Cry saw the Mother of Bloodbath, the Mother of Bloodbath addressed it as ‘Senior Sacred Cry’.","However, Sacred Cry had not thought much of it at the time.","I’ve lived for so long while the Mother of Bloodbath only just started its life. I am indeed its senior.","!!","Since Sacred Cry was a wolf, it had a faithful yet indifferent nature.","Although Jade Sundial had died, Sacred Cry did not transfer how it felt toward Jade Sundial to the Mother of Bloodbath.","Hence, Sacred Cry still had not fully acknowledged the Mother of Bloodbath.","But since Lin Yuan was able to revive Jade Sundial, Sacred Cry did acknowledge him.","In such a circumstance, Lin Yuan addressed it as ‘Auntie Sacred Cry’.","This made Sacred Cry feel very grown up!","It was well aware that the Moon Empress was leaving it in the marsh world because she wanted it to protect Lin Yuan.","Sacred Cry would not shirk this duty from a logical standpoint and because it was grateful toward him.","Sacred Cry decided that as long as Lin Yuan was in the marsh world, it would keep its gaze fully trained on him and do whatever it took to safeguard him.","The Moon Empress looked up and surveyed the light green moon in the sky before she said, “Little Yuan, I am going to swallow the moon! Feel free to do whatever you want. I will need about two hours.”","The moment she was done speaking, she lifted her hand, and a staff made of moonbeams appeared in her grip.","There were two gems, one white and one red on top of the staff.","Upon closer inspection, Lin Yuan realized that the two gems were two miniature moons.","It was likely that they were puppets of the moon from the main world and the moon from the abyssal world.","Clearly, the staff was not Forage Moon’s original appearance.","However, Forage Moon’s moon power was too concentrated that it covered the staff with a layer of moonbeams.","Given Lin Yuan’s current power, he could not break through the moonbeams layer to check for Forage Moon’s original appearance.","However, he could faintly sense that Forage Moon’s original body was not in the staff. Something else had curved himself into a staff.","This was because Lin Yuan noticed that the staff’s shape was changing slightly with every passing moment.","Soon, Lin Yuan watched as the Moon Empress raised the staff into the sky, and it immediately turned into a shroud of moonbeams that covered the light green moon in the sky.","This made the light green moon appear more blurry yet clear at the same time.","As Lin Yuan stared at the light green moon, he made out a twisting figure within.","A snake?","Lin Yuan felt that the figure seemed more and more like a snake.","He had learned about the formation of sacred source lifeforms from White Speak.","In order for a sacred source lifeform to consume celestial phenomena as sustenance, it had to be on a higher level than all the sacred source lifeforms that Lin Yuan was familiar with.","Since the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was formed from two sacred source lifeforms, it was impossible to give it a ranking.","However, Lin Yuan felt that it had to be at a lower level than Forage Moon.","Lin Yuan had assumed that the Grace Queen had been formed from a dead Dictator’s totem.","This meant that Forage Moon was a Dictator that had entered the Turning Wheel Realm. Or rather, a sacred source lifeform transformed from a dimensional lifeform that was of a higher level than Dictator!","The Moon Empress had been lucky to catch a sacred source lifeform of this level from a Class 5 dimensional rift.","At that moment, the Moon Empress’ eyes were closed, and moon energy, spirit qi, and spiritual power were overflowing from her.","It was as though she had become one with the light green moon in the sky.","However, because of the screen that Sacred Cry put up, not even Lin Yuan nor the Medusa Snake Demons, who were not far off, could sense anything.","When he saw that the light green moon and the Moon Empress had fully fused together, Lin Yuan smiled brightly.","Lin Yuan did not think of the pure spirit qi that he gave the Moon Empress as a gift.","But this light green moon was definitely considered one.","The Class 6 dimensional rift that had opened in the Spirit Mother Federation was an alien insect dimensional rift.","Once Bu Po became the Spirit Mother’s disciple, it would be possible for him to enter the alien insect world with Lin Yuan’s help.","There was also a high chance of Lin Yuan gaining access to the water world through Yin Lin.","The subterranean world also had a black moon.","However, Lin Yuan still did not have access to that backward world.","Regardless, Lin Yuan now had a new goal of helping the Moon Empress’ staff gain the complete set of six moonstones.","He knew how much the Moon Empress spoiled him.","Previously, he had been powerless.","But now that he was capable, he was going to properly repay his master.","...","Night had fallen in the Radiance Federation’s Royal Capital.","The fiery clouds on the horizon were breathtaking but were such a common sight in the Royal Capital that its citizens were already used to it.","However, although the sun had not fully set, the sky had already darkened.","Black clouds gathered in an angry swirl as torrents of rain fell in a crashing waterfall onto the Royal Capital.","At that moment, toward the west of the imperial court inside the visitor’s lobby, a middle-aged man dressed in blue robes was listening to a report from an elderly man as he massaged his temples with his fingers.","A moment later, the elegant man wearing a blue robe raised his head and asked the elderly man suspiciously, “Are you saying that the fourth Azure Envoy Yin Lin already secretly met with the Moon Empress’ disciple Lin Yuan long ago and that they’ve developed feelings for each other?”","The elderly man nodded seriously.","But at the same time, a voice bellowed into his ears, “He Chuan! Do you think that I’m incapable of reprimanding others? You are not only making a mountain out of a molehill but might even be stirring trouble out of nothing and besmirching Lordess Yin Lin’s name! If news of this gets out, not only will Lordess Yin Lin have your head, but the Azure Cloud Leopard aristocratic family and the entire Azure Federation will destroy you!”","The elderly man’s eyes widened.","Making a mountain out of a molehill? Stirring trouble out of nothing? I saw it with my own eyes! You didn’t see how Lordess Yin Lin acted and the way she gazed at the Moon Empress’ disciple! Moreover, I only got to see what took place outside of the carriage. Who knows what happened inside the carriage?"]},{"number":1602,"title":"Chapter 1602 - Envoy Group Trouble","paragraphs":["The longer the elderly man thought about it, the more hurt he felt.","Lan Xun, you’re the one who asked me to stay by Lordess Yin Lin’s side. Am I not supposed to tell you about such a matter? You even brought up how Lordess Yin Lin will have my head, and the Azure Cloud Leopard family and Azure Federation will destroy me? What did I do? All I did was lay out the events that took place.","The elderly man shot a begrudged look at Lan Xun.","At the same time, he knew that Lan Xun had said that to remind him to filter his words.","The elderly man was not stupid.","He was a pinnacle Immortal expert who was only one step away from Eternal. As such, he knew his role well.","For the past decade, even before the next Azure Envoy had been confirmed, he had been Yin Lin’s Protector.","Nothing was more important for a girl than her virtue.","It would be fine if she fell in love with one of the elites in the Azure Federation. But the reality was that she was in love with the Moon Empress’ disciple!","Regardless of whether Lan Xun believed him, the elderly man was certain that Yin Lin was interested in the Moon Empress’ disciple. Otherwise, she would not have looked at him in such a way.","When he saw the way that the elderly man was looking at him bitterly, Lan Xun’s fist itched.","He waved his hand and said, “Elder Meng, you should return! Lordess Yin Lin is going to be locked away for a few days, and you should watch over her. I will take that group of brats with me to go on the tours.”","The elderly man pouted.","He had no choice but to do as Lan Xun said.","After he left, Lan Xun frowned.","He knew that although Elder Meng’s words were exaggerated, he would never stir trouble out of nothing and lie about Yin Lin.","It was very likely that he was speaking the truth.","Lan Xun was well aware of Yin Lin’s background.","He felt that there was no way that Yin Lin could have known Yin Lin for some time.","But why did she act so familiarly with Lin Yuan if this was the case? Could it be that Lin Yuan’s sacred source lifeform had the ability of allurement?","Impossible!","Yin Lin’s contraction of two sacred source lifeforms was a major secret of the Azure Federation.","With her second sacred source lifeform, no one in her generation would be able to control her.","The longer Lan Xun mulled over it, the more confused he became.","It was not like he could go and ask Yin Lin!","Yin Lin and the Moon Empress’ disciple had had a secret discussion.","Elder Meng had not sensed any spies from the Freedom Federation envoy group, so it was unlikely that they had gleaned any information.","What did the Moon Empress’ disciple invite Yin Lin into his fey carriage to talk about? There was no question that it was related to the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","When Lan Xun saw Yin Lin refuse to work with the Freedom Federation envoy group, he assumed that it was because Yin Lin did not want to get involved in the mess.","But now, it seemed that she had other intentions as well.","Was it possible that she had been leaning toward the Radiance Federation from the beginning?","The Azure Federation had always remained neutral and worked with both the Radiance Federation and Freedom Federation.","But once the Freedom Federation and Radiance Federation truly started crossing swords, it would be impossible for the Azure Federation to remain on the fence because the other two federations would force them to make a decision.","The 12 aristocratic families in the Azure Federation were split on which side they were going to take.","The goal of this trip to the Radiance Federation was to debut Yin Lin as the fourth Azure Envoy.","She was the leader of this envoy group.","Although Lan Xun was her teacher, he was only accompanying her on this trip.","Thus, no matter how Yin Lin felt or what decision she made, it would represent the will of the entire Azure Federation envoy group.","Lan Xun did not intend to think too much about it because all he needed to do was protect Yin Lin.","Lan Xun was very confident about being able to accomplish this.","...","After the Freedom Federation envoy group came to the Radiance Federation, they did not stay at the accommodation that the Radiance Federation had arranged for them.","Rather, they chose to stay at a villa at Flowing Rocks Mountain.","Evidently, the Freedom Federation never bothered to act like they trusted the Radiance Freedom Federation.","Although the Freedom Federation had come to the Radiance Federation with a special intention, they were also afraid that the Radiance Federation would tamper with the arranged accommodations.","A powerful shield had been set up in the villa at Flowing Rocks Mountain and locked in the entire mountain.","At present, the Freedom Federation envoy group was having a meeting.","Thanks to the shield, the contents of the meeting would not be leaked to outsiders.","As the official Freedom Envoy amongst the Freedom Federation envoy group, Qian Yu sat on the main seat.","Three elderly men were standing next to him.","You Changjian, Yan Ling, and Cai Huo sat around the table, and the rest of the Freedom Federation’s chosen members of the Freedom Hundred Sequence all held their breaths and lowered their heads.","The members of the Freedom Hundred Sequence did not have the right to participate in this meeting.","Yan Ling serenely said, “Big Brother Qian, I think you’re making a much bigger issue out of this than it actually is. How strong can the new members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence be? There’s no need for Chanjian and Ah Huo to join in. I will be able to handle it on my own.”","Qian Yu’s face fell, and he said to Yan Ling, “Yan Ling, if you continue to be so arrogant, I will report this to the members of royalty when we return. The three of you are aware of our purpose for coming here. Anyone out of the three of you will be enough if we’re just killing the ten new members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","“Besides the three of you, Yu Hairun might be a better choice. The three of you were sent out because your sacred source lifeforms can work together. Suppose your arrogance causes us to fail in our purpose and affects the members of royalty’s plan to attack the current Radiance Envoys. In that case, you will have to deal with the consequences when you return to the Freedom Federation.”","Yan Ling’s expression froze when she heard what Qian Yu said.","Although she still felt that she was strong enough on her own, she no longer dared to act in such a manner.","She was haughtier than You Changjian and Cai Huo because she was favored by three of the Freedom Federation’s royalty while Cai Huo and You Changjian were only favored by two.","However, she could not act in a truly superior way.","If she really flipped the table on their plan in the Radiance Federation, Qian Yu would report the chain of events to the royalty in the Freedom Mystic Temple."]},{"number":1603,"title":"Chapter 1603 - No! It Has to Be Reported to the","paragraphs":["Yan Ling would definitely be reprimanded by the members of royalty and possibly punished as well.","If that happened, it would be very difficult for her to become a Freedom Envoy!","You Changjian, Yan Ling, and Cai Huo’s confidence came from the cooperative abilities of their sacred source lifeforms.","When they acted together, they were much more valuable than they were on their own.","The Freedom Federation’s royalty never favored one young expert.","For example, Du Miao had the favor of six members of royalty.","Yan Ling knew that she was important but not irreplaceable.","Hence, she conceded and said, “Big Brother Qian, I underestimated the Radiance Federation’s young generation. Since you’re the one leading the envoy group, the three of us will listen to you!”","Cai Huo and You Changjian’s expressions soured when they heard what Yan Ling said.","Qian Yu had been trying to obtain speaking leadership the entire trip.","But the fact was that being favored by the members of royalty meant that the three of them also held considerable authority.","If the three of them agreed on something, Qian Yu might have to listen to them even if he held an opposing opinion.","But now, Yan Ling gave up all three of their authorities just because of one thing that Qian Yu said.","The more disciples of the Radiance Federation’s royalty that they could kill, the weaker the Radiance Federation would become, and the more accomplished the three of them would be.","Qian Yu was very selfish and put his benefits above everything else.","Their team had to hunt down the Radiance Federation’s younger generation during this battle, no matter what.","But if the Radiance Federation’s younger generation turned out to be stronger, they would change from the hunters to the hunted instead.","Thus, they needed to preserve their authority.","Cai Huo hastily said, “Big Brother Qian, I heard that there is a man called Black amongst the Radiance Federation’s younger generation and that he’s very powerful! We saw many people dressed as him on the streets while on the way here. Although we have not looked into him, he must be a top expert to be put on such a pedestal. I suggest we deal with him like he’s a disciple of a member of royalty. He wears a mask, so it’s likely that he truly is a disciple of royalty!","“Hence, I suggest pulling in another disciple of royalty into the battle! If we take down Black, another disciple of royalty, and the nine members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, we will fulfill the task given by the members of royalty.”","When Cai Huo said what You Changjian wanted to say, he did not pile anything on.","If Qian Yu had a different opinion, and he spoke in support of Cai Huo, then his words would pack more punch.","When Qian Yu heard what Cai Huo said, he felt that Yan Ling, You Changjian, and Cai Huo’s dynamic was rather interesting.","Yan Ling was arrogant, Cai Huo was conservative, while You Changjian preferred to take a step back once one of his teammates had a stronger voice.","The three of them could perfectly make up for what each other lacked.","Qian Yu did not plan on doing as Cai Huo said.","The royalty from the Freedom Mystic Temple would never agree to treat Black as a disciple of the Radiance Federation’s royalty.","That would make this a wasted trip, and the other four Freedom Envoys would mock him.","Thus, Qian Yu decided that he had to do something big.","Nonetheless, he was in no rush to reveal his plan. Instead, he said, “I received news today that Cicada Song has accepted a new disciple. He is a support-type spirit qi professional named Gao Feng and will be participating in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.”","Qian Yu paused before he went on to say, “Cicada Song’s disciple is purely support-type. I think that both he and Black can be seen as one disciple of royalty. Yan Ling, what do you think?”","Qian Yu knew that the hubristic Yan Ling would definitely agree with him.","Just as he expected, she said, “Unless there are two powerful combat forces, there’s no point in there being a support-type spirit qi professional. It would be an overestimation to treat Gao Feng and Black as one disciple of royalty!”","Qian Yu looked at Cai Huo and saw that his expression had soured.","Cai Huo was also a pure support-type spirit qi professional, just like Gao Feng.","You Changjian could no longer hold back and said, “If this is the case, if we involve another disciple of royalty, we will have to face two disciples of royalty and the mysterious Black at the same time.”","Qian Yu shook his head and said, “Not two, but four.”","Now, even the haughty Yan Ling’s face fell.","How were the three of them supposed to defeat four disciples of the Radiance Federation’s royalty?","Just as the three of them were about to protest, Qian Yu said, “I’m only 28 years old this year and am the youngest of the current Freedom Envoys. Do you think the Radiance Federation will agree for three of their royalty’s disciples to take on one of me?”","Yan Ling, You Changjian, and Cai Huo were astonished.","That’s right! There’s no way the Radiance Federation knows who the three of us are.?","There was already a disciple of royalty amongst the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","If another three were also called into battle against Qian Yu, there was no way that the Radiance Federation would disagree or risk tarnishing its reputation.","Qian Yu’s age was still within range for the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","If he managed to take down four disciples of royalty and Black, the power of the Radiance Federation’s younger generation would definitely be seriously affected.","Once they returned, the three would definitely become Freedom Envoys.","Moreover, Qian Yu would definitely leave a way out for himself.","As the Freedom Federation’s youngest Freedom Envoy, he had to value his life.","Thus, Yan Ling, You Changjian, and Cai Huo nodded and said, “We shall go with your plan.”","You Changjian pondered for a moment before he said, “Big Brother Qian, if the Radiance Federation rejects it, I can still call down another disciple of royalty. Given that quantity, I’m sure the members of royalty who favor me will understand if I don’t participate.”","Qian Yu did not respond.","Rather, the three elderly men felt a wave of exhaustion wash over them.","Qian Yu dragged them into such a serious situation. Once they returned to the Freedom Federation, all the pressure would fall on their shoulders.","No! They had to report this to the Freedom Mystic Temple. Just to be safe, a member of royalty had to come to the Radiance Federation!"]},{"number":1604,"title":"Chapter 1604 - Don’t Be Picky!","paragraphs":["It was always daytime in the marsh world, and the sky never darkened.","Actually, this was not fully accurate.","According to Lin Yuan’s observation, the marsh world did have night and day.","During the day, the sky was light green. But at night, it became faintly purple, and both the moon and sun hung in the sky side by side, with the moon slightly brighter.","None of the lifeforms in the marsh world could sense a difference.","By now, the Moon Empress’ body had disappeared. In her place was the energy from the moon.","The Sacred Cry Moon Beast had turned into a moon and gathered the moon energy from the marsh world to camouflage itself so that it could stay in the marsh world to protect Lin Yuan.","The light green moon seemed brighter than usual.","The moonbeams that fell tangled together and formed a staff in the Moon Empress’ hand.","The staff used to only have one white and one red stone. But now, there was another light green one as well.","The light green stone was evidence that Forage Moon had gained another moon puppet.","At that moment, the Moon Empress opened her eyes and said with a smile, “Little Yuan, thank you for bringing me this opportunity!”","Lin Yuan hastily replied, “Master, you don’t have to thank me. You saved my life countless times! I should be the one thanking you!”","The Moon Empress did not thank others easily and had only uttered the words a few times in her life.","She said it to Lin Yuan because he had truly given her major opportunities.","He enabled her to have an endless lifespan, pure spirit qi that she used to cross that step and gain a third moon puppet.","The Moon Empress felt that she would not have been able to achieve these three things on her own.","But Lin Yuan was right as well. It seemed overly polite for her to thank her disciple.","Lin Yuan went on to say, “Master, I can now produce even purer spirit qi. Additionally, I can produce even purer elemental energy than that within heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls. I’ve already harvested more than 1,000 Spirit-Mouthed Peonies. You can take them now.”","Lin Yuan handed a Diamond fey storage box to the Moon Empress.","When the Moon Empress received the Diamond fey storage box, she felt as though Lin Yuan had become her Master instead.","Where did he go to obtain such treasures?","By being able to produce elemental energy even purer than what was within heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, he could already be considered a Class 6 Creation Master.","The Moon Empress did not stand on ceremony because she could do many things with the pure spirit qi.","Mystic Moon had also reached that step.","With pure spirit qi, Cold Moon would also have the ability to take that step.","The Moon Empress had learned about Chu Ci’s talent from Cold Moon.","She had been shocked by what Cold Moon told her.","Despite not having even reached 16 years old, she was already a B-rank spirit qi professional.","Although the rate at which one’s spirit qi professional rank was raised could not be a measure of strength because their power could be limited by their inability to provide their fey with resources, this was not the case for Chu Ci.","Chu Ci had an endless supply of resources.","As long as her spirit qi professional rank continued to rise, her feys would also become stronger.","Cold Moon had helped Chu Ci to roll grades.","As such, Chu Ci was now on par with most members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","In another year, she would be able to study at the Royal Capital Advanced Spirit Qi University and take part in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","Chu Ci was supposed to participate in this year’s Radiance Hundred Sequence selection along with Lin Yuan.","However, Cold Moon had opposed the idea because she did not want Chu Ci to become involved in the conflict between the Radiance Federation and Freedom Federation at such a young age.","Cold Moon was already worried enough that Lin Yuan was involved in it. She could not bear to allow Chu Ci to join the fray as well.","Moreover, she felt that she would not be able to answer Lin Yuan if she allowed Chu Ci to participate in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","Cold Moon estimated that even at the slowest rate, Chu Ci would become an A-rank spirit qi professional within five years.","At that time, Chu Ci would be able to possess a Myth Breed fey.","Cold Moon had never gauged Chu Ci before.","But now, she felt that Chu Ci might have the ability to join the Radiance Envoy selection two years later. Or, at the very least, she would become a Radiance Knight.","But eventually, Cold Moon decided not to allow Chu Ci to participate two years later.","Chu Ci would turn 26 years old ten years later, and it would not be too late to become a Radiance Envoy then.","Becoming a Radiance Envoy directly rather than a Radiance Knight was much better.","Cold Moon could dedicate her whole life to the Moon Empress and the Radiance Federation.","When it came to Chu Ci, all she hoped was that Chu Ci would be able to lead a carefree life.","The Moon Empress received Lin Yuan’s Diamond fey storage box and said, “Lin Yuan, let’s go back. By this time, Cold Moon and Little Ci should have arrived back at the Radiant Moon Palace.”","Lin Yuan took out the Jeweled Cave Golden Toad and stored the Moon Empress within before he returned to the Spirit Lock spatial zone through Klein Hub.","He jumped out of the Spirit Lock spatial zone and back into the breeding room before releasing the Moon Empress.","The Moon Empress became more curious about Lin Yuan’s method when she found herself back in the Radiant Moon Palace in an instant.","Nonetheless, she was not going to ask Lin Yuan about it. Rather, she would help him to keep his secret.","When he pushed open the door of the breeding room, he saw Chu Ci standing there. She had clearly been waiting for him.","The instant that she spotted Lin Yuan, Chu Ci smiled innocently and spread her arms.","Lin Yuan took a step forward and hugged her. He picked her up and spun around.","This was when he realized that Chu Ci had grown taller.","Previously, she had only reached his shoulder. But now, she was up to the height of his face.","Additionally, she seemed lighter.","Lin Yuan frowned and asked, “Chi Ci, have you picked up your bad habit of being picky again? I’ve always told you to eat whatever you’re given and not to be picky!”"]},{"number":1605,"title":"Chapter 1605 - Comprehension From the Genes!","paragraphs":["Chu Ci pouted and thought,? I haven’t been picky! I didn’t know better when I was young. Whenever I saw food, I would eat it because I was afraid that I wouldn’t get to eat it again. I know how to control myself now.","The Moon Empress looked at Lin Yuan with shock and thought,? Lin Yuan, you’re pretty smart. So, why do you act like a dumb boy sometimes? Girls naturally become vainer as they grow older. It’s normal for her to want to watch her weight!","However, Chu Ci was visibly skinnier.","The Moon Empress reached out and patted down the stray hairs on Chu Ci’s head as she said, “I will go and help Mystic Moon and Cold Moon prepare dinner. The two of you should have many things to talk about.”","The Moon Empress turned and left the breeding room.","Mystic Moon had heard about the Moon Empress’ lifespan being reduced to three years from Cicada Song.","If not for Cicada Song, Mystic Moon would not have learned about it until the end.","Mystic Moon did not want to tell Cold Moon about this.","However, Cold Moon was also a Moon Envoy and deserved to know.","Luckily, the Moon Empress was no longer in danger and had returned to her regular state.","Mystic Moon said seriously, “Cold Moon, when you called me last month, you asked me why I seemed listless. I didn’t give you an answer then, but I can tell you why now. Ten years ago, the Moon Empress’ roots were injured during battle. As a result, she was only left with three years of her lifespan.”","Cold Moon had been cooking soup with the intention of having Chu Ci drink it later.","But when she heard what Mystic Moon said, fury immediately filled her gaze.","It was as though all her blood had gathered in her pupils.","When Mystic Moon saw this, he hurriedly said, “Luckily, Young Lord found a way out for her, and she’s fine now. She even gained a blessing and managed to increase her power.”","The red in Cold Moon’s eyes did not diminish at all. She picked up the ladle and thrust it into Mystic Moon’s hand as she said, “Can you get to the point and mention the conclusion first next time!?”","Mystic Moon immediately recoiled and thought,? I did pause while I was speaking, but that’s because her eyes went red. I didn’t get a chance to get to the ending because I was worried about her!","The little white rabbit saw all of this. It lazily gnawed on its carrot and thought,? Given how Cold Moon feels about the Moon Empress, she won’t forgive Mystic Moon for making her worry. This is definitely not over.","It so happened that the Moon Empress walked over at this moment.","Cold Moon pushed Mystic Moon aside and asked the Moon Empress, “Moon Empress, you...”","When the Moon Empress saw the expression on Cold Moon’s face, she knew that she had learned about everything from Mystic Moon.","The Moon Empress never intended to hide this from Cold Moon.","She knew that Cold Moon would not want her to keep it a secret.","Mystic Moon knew, but Cold Moon had not been informed of it.","As such, the Moon Empress had intended to ask Cold Moon to admire the night scenery with her and tell her then.","The Moon Empress shook her head at the worried-faced Cold Moon and said, “I’m fine now. Cold Moon, I’ll be at the imperial meeting for the next two days. Mystic Moon will help you with your breakthrough!”","Cold Moon asked with worry and shock, “Moon Empress, in order to breakthrough, spirit qi—”","Before Cold Moon could finish speaking, Mystic Moon cut in and said, “My powers have already advanced. I definitely needed more pure spirit qi than your feys need to breakthrough.”","This revelation made Cold Moon start to ponder.","When she last sparred with Mystic Moon, he always easily dodged her jade staff.","Cold Moon immediately asked the Moon Empress with delight, “Moon Empress, has your Creation Master power improved again?”","The Moon Empress remained silent but did not deny it.","She felt that the pure spirit qi was also one of Lin Yuan’s secret weapons, so the fewer people knew about it, the better it would be.","The Moon Empress started to personally prepare dinner while Cold Moon and Mystic Moon assisted her.","They watched as the Moon Empress started cooking the tendons of a Creation Breed fey.","Lin Yuan had been chatting with Chu Ci for some time.","He listened to her happily announce that she had been promoted to a B-rank spirit qi professional.","Lin Yuan almost did not believe his ears.","He was currently a B-rank spirit qi professional!","Chu Ci was two years younger than him but had already caught up to him.","Chu Ci went on to say, “Lin Yuan, Master has evolved my two Fantasy Breed feys to Diamond X. Like you, Master told me not to evolve the Burning Sunflower Twins’ grade until they comprehended a Willpower Rune. However, I haven’t comprehended a suitable Willpower Rune for it yet.”","However, Chu Ci did not appear sad at all because there was something else that came out of her improvement that she wanted to show Lin Yuan.","With a wave of her hand, a white crystallized Willpower Rune shot out of her spiritual spatial zone and started circling her finger.","Lin Yuan did not expect Chu Ci to have comprehended another Willpower Rune already.","Lin Yuan immediately sensed the Willpower Rune and found that it was very similar to the one that she comprehended from iron and gave to the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull.","It was clear that it was suitable for defense-type feys.","When he checked on this Willpower Rune, he remembered the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster that he had prepared for Chu Ci.","This Willpower Rune was very suitable for it. It was practically made for the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster.","As of now, Chu Ci had comprehended three Willpower Runes.","This rate was staggering.","Lin Yuan always credited his strong sensing abilities to having souls from two worlds.","But now, it seemed that that was not the full story.","Judging from Chu Ci’s comprehension of Willpower Runes, their parents’ genes had to be remarkable!","His genes played a big role in his strong comprehension powers.","Lin Yuan did not take out the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster immediately.","Instead, he said, “Summon the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull and Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly.”"]},{"number":1606,"title":"Chapter 1606 - Don’t Wag Your Tail, Little Iron Block!","paragraphs":["It could be said that Lin Yuan was the one who had molded the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull and Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly.","When the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull had only been the Sharp Rock Bull, it had been injured by the open alien insect dimensional rift.","At that moment, Yang Mingkai had not been able to do anything about the seriously injured Obsidian Iron Wild Bull. He almost ended up consuming it as beef.","It was Lin Yuan who had discovered the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull’s ability Sacrifice and saved it. He also gave Chu Ci the chance to change her life.","Lin Yuan had only just realized his body was special at that time, and it would have been impossible for him to gather the money to buy a high-quality Bronze fey within a short span of time.","Lin Yuan had also traded for the Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly from Liu Jie when it was still a larva.","At that time, Liu Jie had been in the pits of despair because the Insect Queen had been about to die, and he was about to lose his chance to become a spirit qi professional.","He had put on a mask and hid his identity as he went up a mountain to collect spiritual resources.","He had not only been supporting himself but also many orphans. He had even educated them.","At that time, the Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly had been a small pink larva.","Later, it evolved into the Vajra Butterfly and eventually managed to use the pollen of the Golden Curtain Peony and pure spirit qi to mutate away from the path of becoming the Jadeite Butterfly.","This was proof that the metal-type Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly was even more suited for Chu Ci than the wood-type Jadeite Butterfly.","The Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly had even stronger defensive and combat powers than the Jadeite Butterfly.","However, it was not perfect.","The Jadeite Butterfly had a certain level of supporting effect.","According to Chu Ci, the Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly had evolved to Diamond grade.","This meant that the Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly’s bloodline had evolved.","However, there was still the question of whether the Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly would be able to maintain the mutation that the Golden Curtain Peony’s pollen had brought it when it evolved into the Tourmaline Emperor Butterfly.","Under Cold Moon’s guidance, Chu Ci started to understand how important being able to keep one’s lips sealed was.","If she leaked information about her feys and happened to be faced with an opponent who could counter her feys, she might be defeated even if her opponent was objectively weaker than her.","If any outsider wanted to see Chu Ci’s feys, she would never summon them.","However, she did not put up any guard when she was with Lin Yuan.","Although people on Star Web called her the Radiance Federation’s youngest genius, she knew that all the glory she had came from Lin Yuan.","She would never forget how Lin Yuan supported her despite being so weak that he was prone to fainting spells.","When the two of them were fending for themselves and were so poor that they could only afford one bowl of porridge, Lin Yuan had given that bowl of porridge to her.","He had snuck off in the middle of the night to eat the Usneas.","The Usnea was not as soft or palatable as the Soldier Ration Radish.","The leaves of the Usnea would prick one’s stomach and often leave the spirit qi professionals who ate them with painful stomachaches because they did not have strong stomachs like herbivorous feys did.","Hence, no matter what happened, Lin Yuan would be the most important person in Chu Ci’s life.","With a wave of her hand, Chu Ci summoned her two feys.","Lin Yuan was immediately faced with a five-meter-long and two-meter-tall bull.","The bull’s skin resembled the silver surface of a mirror. Its tough and sinewy muscles could be seen under its skin.","Amongst all the feys that Lin Yuan had seen, not even tiger-species feys were as magnificent as this bull-species fey.","Its one-meter-long tail swayed gently and created waves of noise.","At that moment, Chu Ci crossed her legs and gently patted the bull’s face as she said, “Little Iron Block, I know you’re happy to see Lin Yuan, but I’ve told you many times not to swing your tail! Don’t learn from that hippopotamus! People might think you’re farting!”","The Obsidian Iron Wild Bull mooed twice in reply, stopped moving its tail, and stared at Lin Yuan joyfully.","Lin Yuan’s lips twitched when he heard the way Chu Ci addressed the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull.","How can this be considered a Little Iron Block? It’s just a bull-shaped tank!","Since the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull had turned silver, it meant that its bloodline had evolved.","The Obsidian Iron Wild Bull’s new skin was only the third-most shocking change that had happened to it.","There were also black clusters of gems embedded all over its body. The gems refracted rainbow light.","The color was similar to the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull’s original color and appeared like colorful patches.","It was likely that the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull stored the energy from its original bloodline within the black gem clusters.","The biggest change had to be the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull’s horns.","The Obsidian Iron Wild Bull’s horns used to be made of elements and were not connected to its head.","However, the black horns flashed on its head intermittently. But its shapes changed each time.","In a battle, the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull could choose the best shape according to the fey that it was facing off against.","Although it charged with brute force, it could change the shape of its horns to inflict the most damage on its enemy.","If any other cow-species fey charged against the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull thinking that it was hornless, it would end up with a hole in its body from the impact.","The Obsidian Iron Wild Bull could protrude its horns from next to its eyes to pierce through the eyes and cleanly into the skull of the opponent cow-species fey.","The Obsidian Iron Wild Bull’s horns were enough for it to be deemed a killing machine in the form of a defense-type fey.","Now, Lin Yuan realized that the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull’s elemental horns remained mostly silver. Only a small part of it was black.","A few of the horns were covered with a layer of black on silver or a layer of silver on black.","Evidently, the evolved Obsidian Iron Wild Bull could actively make use of the power in its bloodline.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull."]},{"number":1607,"title":"Chapter 1607 - Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull","paragraphs":["[Fey Name]: Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull","[Fey Species]: Horned species/Bull species","[Fey Grade]: Diamond grade (5/10)","[Fey Type]: Metal","[Fey Quality]: Fantasy III","Abilities:","[Piercing Horn]: Hold the horns in position and charge at a target without holding back.","[Sacrifice]: When the contractor is injured, automatically split the damage with the contractor. If the contractor is injured, it will feed the contractor with its vitality.","[Pain Buffer]: When damaged by elemental energy, form a shield of elemental energy on the surface of the body that will slow the elemental energy damage for a period of time. Further damage will only be incurred after the shield breaks.","[Mirror Surface Skin]: Change the body’s skin into a mirror-like texture. When attacked by elements, the mirror skin will be able to reflect elemental energy and send a portion of the elemental attack back at the opponent.","[Sun’s Angry Horn]: Draw out energy from metal and combine it with sunlight. The sun energy will activate the energy within the metal and break through physical entities. When used against an enemy, the metal energy will spread throughout the target and condense within the target.","[Taste of Pain]: Each time it is used against a target, the pain experienced will multiply. The pain will train one’s willpower to temporarily increase one’s spiritual energy.","Exclusive Skill:","[Pain Absorption]: When receiving damage, absorb a portion of the damage and turn it into vitality.","[Annihilation Gaze]: Domineering battle consciousness and war fervor drive its instinctive footsteps. The Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull instantly transforms all the damage taken in a battle into a mental impact on the opponent.","Lin Yuan noticed that the Obsidian Iron Will Bull’s name had changed to the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull.","Its fey-type was still metal-type, but its fey grade had changed to Diamond V/Fantasy III.","With this power at her age, Chu Ci had surpassed all who came before her.","Besides truly top experts like Zong Ze and An He, there was no other young expert whose fey’s power fell below that of Chu Ci.","If Lin Yuan wanted to, he could easily find resources to evolve the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull to Diamond X/Fantasy V.","However, even if the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull did evolve to Diamond X/Fantasy V, Chu Ci still could not be compared with the likes of Zong Ze and An He.","Firstly, she did not have a fey with the Barren bloodline. Secondly, she was too young to form a marrow contract with a sacred source lifeform. Forming a marrow contract with a sacred source lifeform too young could harm one’s soul.","The soul was the most important part of a person.","No one who truly had her best interests would be willing to let her take on such a risk.","Its abilities Piercing Horn, Sacrifice, and Pain Buffer had not changed much.","This was to be expected because it was in a different situation from Chimey and Genius.","Previously, Chimey and Genius were not even feys.","They managed to evolve continuously by tapping into their bloodlines’ potential.","The Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull’s bloodline had been set from the beginning.","It managed to evolve to this point thanks to the help of Lin Yuan’s pure spirit qi.","Lin Yuan wanted to help Chu Ci to evolve her feys using pure spirit qi. The improvement of one’s bloodline would generate more opportunities for evolution.","However, Cold Moon had already evolved Chu Ci’s feys.","Chu Ci’s feys would still be able to achieve the same outcome when they were nourished by spirit qi in the future.","Lin Yuan would evolve the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull and try to trigger an evolution of its bloodline after Chu Ci became an A-rank spirit qi professional.","All of the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull’s Gold abilities emerged while Chu Ci was out training, and Lin Yuan had never seen them before.","It was likely that Mirror Surface Skin emerged because Cold Moon had used Mirror Silver on the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull, which led to the transformation of its bloodline and obtaining this ability.","Mirror Surface Skin perfectly complemented Pain Buffer and increased Pain Buffer’s sustainability. It also greatly increased the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull’s resistance against elements.","When used alongside Pain Absorption, the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull’s overall power would increase and recover at the same time. This would undoubtedly make the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull a greater force to be reckoned with during battle.","At the same time, the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull could also reflect elemental damage back at its opponents.","It could be said that even without Explosive Shield Counterattack, the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull could still reflect damage and become a true gasoline tank.","If anyone lit a flame, it would stay in its place and burn alongside everything.","The Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull was already very resistant to physical entities. Now that its elemental resistance was also increased, it would be difficult for feys of the same grade to cause it pain.","Sun’s Angry Horn allowed the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull to gain another combat attack. It was extremely powerful and could not only damage and support but also control.","The black gem clusters on the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull could activate the metal energy within its body. By condensing the metal energy into its horns, it could charge at enemies and break through its enemies’ defenses.","It would be able to support any fey that mainly caused physical damage.","Through condensing the metal energy in its body, the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull could condense a seven to eight-meter-long metal horn that could pierce through its target, leaving a deep hole in its wake.","After the horn pierced through its target, it would fuse with the target’s body like mercury.","When the metal energy condensed inside a target’s body, it would essentially be like burying a sword within a target.","Such an attack could cause unimaginable damage to a target.","Sun’s Angry Horn sealed the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull’s role as Chu Ci’s main combat fey.","Taste of Pain seemed ordinary or even useless. It was basically torture to feel multiplied pain when being attacked.","It would be considered a very negative ability to most feys because pain was a type of spiritual damage.","But to the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull, it was a godsend."]},{"number":1608,"title":"Chapter 1608 - Gold Seal Emperor Butterfly","paragraphs":["The Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull could temporarily rely on such pain to increase its spiritual energy.","Moreover, Annihilation Gaze would enable the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull to use all the damage it received, including the multiplied pain, and reflect it back at its opponent as spiritual damage.","This ability would strengthen the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull’s accumulation of pain and shorten the time needed to accumulate the pain.","The Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull would be able to absorb high amounts of pain and use Annihilation Gaze.","Now, the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull was almost too well-rounded!","At that moment, Chu Ci said, “Lin Yuan, amongst my two feys, Little Iron Block isn’t the one with the bigger change. Little Gold Block’s changes are even more impressive! With Little Gold Block, my little mine will be even more powerful during battle! Little Iron Block might seem boorish, but it can’t last long during battle. But with Little Gold Block, Little Iron Block will be able to last much longer now!”","Lin Yuan’s gaze moved away from the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull and onto the Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly.","The Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly’s appearance had changed completely.","The most significant change was the color of its body.","Previously, the Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly had been translucent. It looked like flowing gold and had dark gold peony patterns on its wings that made it look like a blooming peony when it was flying.","Now, the Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly was almost fully transparent. It only glowed mesmerizing gold under the sunlight. When it flapped its wings and dispersed scale powder, patterns of peony petals glittered under sunlight.","The crossing peony patterns enabled the shining Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly to shoot out rainbow beams of light. It resembled tourmaline.","At the same time, the tentacles on the Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly’s head formed a crown.","When he saw this, Lin Yuan became certain that the Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly had evolved into the Tourmaline Emperor Butterfly.","It looked like this because it retained its original mutation.","Lin Yuan immediately used True Data to check on the Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly.","[Fey Name]: Gold Seal Emperor Butterfly","[Fey Species]: Nymphalidae/Heliconius","[Fey Grade]: Diamond (1/10)","[Fey Type]: Metal","[Fey Quality]: Fantasy III","Abilities:","[Wing Block]: Congeal hard metal on its wings for blocking. While blocking, there will be a certain level of rebounding attacks.","[Golden Seal Shield]: Rapidly produce a strong mobile shield in front of a target that will move in accordance with its movements.","[Mistified Butterfly Dust]: When flapping its wings and dispersing dust, the butterfly dust can protect a target by providing it with natural elemental separation effects. It can also replenish the metal energy of metal-type feys.","[Butterfly Fantasy]: Apply itself to a target of the same type. If the target is friendly, metal energy can be transferred into it to give the target the abilities of flight and temporary shielding. If the target is unfriendly, the metal energy in the target will be locked, and the target will become susceptible to injuries.","[Butterfly Wings Sacrifice]: By sacrificing parts of the butterfly wings, the shielding effects will be temporarily improved. The longer the effects, the more parts of the wings will be sacrificed.","[Tourmaline Revival Shield]: Form a sturdy shield in front of a target. As the shield sustains more and more attacks, its shielding abilities will weaken. When the lifeform that the shield is protecting starts to lose its lifeforce, the shield will absorb the lifeforce and be strengthened by it.","Exclusive Skill:","[Counterattack Tremor]: When attacked, it will rebound a portion of the damage from physical attacks or elemental attacks in the form of an energy tremor.","[Explosive Shield Counterattack]: Explode the target’s shield while combining all the attacking power that the shield can handle into launching a deadly blow.","Lin Yuan noticed that the Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly’s name had changed to the Gold Sea Emperor Butterfly.","The Gold Seal Emperor Butterfly had one of the most elite butterfly-species bloodlines.","If it could advance another step forward, its bloodline would become even more elite than that of the Nirvana Blaze Butterfly and Kill Food Sky Butterfly.","Its fey type was still metal, but its grade had changed to Diamond I/Fantasy III.","Wing Block and Golden Seal Shield have not changed.","When Mistified Butterfly Dust was used, the Gold Seal Emperor Butterfly’s golden rain of butterfly dust that was produced when it flapped its wings would be able to protect a group as well as support them.","Defense was useful to any type of fey.","By being able to separate from elements, the Gold Seal Emperor Butterfly would be able to reduce its opponents’ fey’s reliance on elements during battle.","It also had a similar effect on friendly parties. But its friendly parties would not only be protected by the ability, but Chu Ci could also manipulate its range so that it would help other gold-type feys.","The Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull was a metal-type fey.","When Mistified Butterfly Dust was used on it, its defense would be improved, and it would also essentially gain a moving battery.","It was no wonder that Chu Ci said that the Gold Seal Emperor Butterfly would be able to help the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull last longer.","Butterfly Fantasy further evidenced this claim.","When the Gold Seal Emperor Butterfly applied itself to the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull, the Gold Seal Emperor Butterfly could rapidly transfer the metal energy in its body to the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull.","Mistified Butterfly Powder was a battery that took a long time for its effects to be seen.","But the Gold Seal Emperor Butterfly could use Butterfly Fantasy to transfer its abilities to the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull and give it the ability to fly as well as temporary shielding.","Flying would improve the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull’s agility as well as speed.","The Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull would be able to take on flying targets as well.","Now, besides being unable to go underwater, there was no environment where the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull would be at a disadvantage.","Besides being able to apply itself to friendly targets, Butterfly Fantasy also allowed the Gold Seal Emperor Butterfly to apply itself onto enemy metal-type feys and lock the metal energy within their bodies while making them more susceptible to damage.","Although this controlling ability had its limits, it could be coupled together with the Gold Seal Emperor Butterfly’s other effects to turn Butterfly Fantasy into an impressive ability that fit perfectly with the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull."]},{"number":1609,"title":"Chapter 1609 - If Youre Lost, Ill Take You Home!","paragraphs":["In order for a spirit qi professional to become strong, his feys’ abilities needed to be complementary. This was very important enough to produce compounded effects.","Tourmaline Revival Shield was a very strong individual defensive ability.","After applying a shield onto a target and the target’s lifeforce starts to diminish, the lost lifeforce would reinforce the shield.","It would be able to help a fey to take on more damage.","This was the strongest individual defensive ability that Lin Yuan had ever encountered.","!!","Butterfly Wings Sacrifice would sacrifice a portion of the butterfly wings to toughen the shield. This was directly correlated to the shield’s defensive ability.","Amongst all of Chu Ci’s feys, the Gold Seal Emperor Butterfly was the one that Lin Yuan was most satisfied with.","The Gold Seal Emperor Butterfly seemed more like a girl!","Previously, when the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull was still the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull, Chu Ci had been called Princess Iron Bull because of her performance during the Allstar Match’s challenger fight.","Although the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull was much more attractive than the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull, Chu Ci’s title would only be changed to Princess Silver Bull. It did not sound much better than Princess Iron Bull. It could even lead to some inappropriate thoughts.","The Gold Seal Emperor Butterfly would allow Chu Ci’s combat style to not only be impulsive but also work seamlessly together.","All of the Gold Seal Emperor Butterfly’s shields and the increasing toughness would strengthen the effects of Counterattack Tremor and Explosive Shield Counterattack.","As Chu Ci looked at him with shining eyes of anticipation, Lin Yuan did not hold back the praise.","“Chu Ci, you’re amazing! With your current power, you’ll be able to make it to the top 20 ranks of the Radiance Hundred Sequence if you participate in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.”","From the way that Chu Ci’s power increased to such an extent in such a short period, Lin Yuan could only imagine how difficult her training had been.","Now, she really needed to gain validation through praise.","One could only be satisfied with the effort put in and gain the motivation to work even harder to achieve one’s goals when one felt validated.","Moreover, Lin Yuan’s praise was not a lie.","Chu Ci pouted and said with disappointment, “Teacher won’t let me participate in this year’s Radiance Hundred Sequence selection! Otherwise, I would have been able to fight side by side with you!”","Lin Yuan’s mood immediately improved, and he felt immensely grateful to Cold Moon.","If Chu Ci had registered to take part in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection, there was no way she would be eliminated, given her current power.","If Lin Yuan was faced with her during the selection, he would immediately do all he could to eliminate her.","As her older brother, he could put himself at any risk but would never allow the 16-year-old Chu Ci to be in any danger.","She was still underage. Since their parents were gone, he needed to ensure her safety as her older brother!","Once Chu Ci came of age, she would be able to participate in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection or even the Radiance Envoy selection.","She would then be free to choose if she wanted to sacrifice herself for the sake of the Radiance Federation.","If she decided to do so, Lin Yuan would smile with pride before going off to take revenge.","But as of now, he would never allow her to be in such danger. He would protect her no matter what.","Since Cold Moon had stopped Chu Ci, there was nothing more for Lin Yuan to say to Chu Ci.","He took out the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster he had prepared for her.","Now that the Gold Seal Emperor Butterfly was so impressive, his plan to change his sister was well underway.","When Lin Yuan took out the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster, Chu Ci let out a squeal.","She was not a Creation Master and could not tell what the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster’s abilities and exclusive skills were.","However, the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster’s appearance was pleasing to everyone.","Lin Yuan had not picked the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster for Chu Ci just for its exclusive ability Tool Transformation but also because of its outstanding abilities.","Iron Thorn Cross would be able to defend as well as shoot out spikes for defense. When the spikes hit a friendly party, their bloodthirst would rise.","This suited the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull well, as it would make it even wilder.","When the spikes hit an enemy, they would become enamored. This would lower their motivation for battle.","Bubble Crystal Shield could be used on a group and increase their defenses.","Multiple layers could be applied on a target.","Although the defensive effects were not strong, it could be used in conjunction with the Gold Seal Emperor Butterfly’s Explosive Shield Counterattack and increase the damage caused by the explosion of the shield.","Lin Yuan said to Chu Ci, “This is the new fey I prepared for you. It just so happens to be very compatible with the new Willpower Rune you comprehended. The Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster has reached Bronze X/Legend. You can form a contract with it now.”","Chu Ci gave Lin Yuan a big hug before she used her spiritual energy to form a contract with the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster.","Once the contraction was done, she flipped over her hand, and a pink sword appeared in her hand.","She flicked the sword and sent a shower of sparks flying through the air.","Chu Ci could use the sword to utilize the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster’s abilities.","The Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster’s Tool Transformation form was also extremely sharp and strong. When it was swung, the strength of its abilities would match its grade.","Chu Ci did not immediately combine her Willpower Rune with the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster. Instead, she wanted to familiarize herself with using the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster’s abilities first before evolving it to Fantasy Breed.","Taking it step by step was the most reliable way to improve one’s battle skills.","Lin Yuan picked up Chu Ci’s hand just like he did when they were children and led her out of the breeding room to have dinner with the Moon Empress, Cold Moon, and Mystic Moon at the inner palace.","Meanwhile...","A plain-looking girl with glasses and dressed in a gray robe clutched a black-bound tome tightly.","Her head was cocked as she was deep in thought.","A moment later, the patterns of scars appeared in her eyes.","The images disappeared as quickly as they appeared.","A Spirit Guard spotted the girl and walked over to ask, “You can’t play around here. Where are your parents? If you’re lost, I’ll take you home!”","The Spirit Guard squatted down to wait for the girl’s reply.","At that moment, a bizarre smile appeared on the girl’s face."]},{"number":1610,"title":"Chapter 1610 - Lend Me Your Body!","paragraphs":["1","Ever since the incident at Whale Ocean Commerce and Night Leaning Moon found out about it from Lin Yuan, she immediately instructed the Spirit Guards to lock down Whale Ocean Commerce’s residence.","When the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection ended, she would launch a thorough investigation and wipe out Whale Ocean Commerce’s old site.","The Spirit Guards who were stationed here were all the cream of the crop.","Although they had not reached king-class, all of them had a Platinum fey at least.","There were also many people who had come to Whale Ocean Commerce’s residence looking for information.","!!","Whale Ocean Commerce was a top faction in the Radiance Federation, and they worked with many other veteran factions, top factions, and even rising factions.","All the members of these factions who had come to investigate were turned away by the Spirit Guards.","However, this was the first time a young girl had appeared in the area by herself.","Hence, the Spirit Guard on roster first assumed that the little girl was lost and was not on his guard against her.","But when he saw the bizarre smile on the girl’s face, his expression immediately changed, and he knew that he had been careless.","This smile had extremely dark undertones. It carried a complete disregard for life and cavalier contempt.","She was definitely not an innocent young girl.","But before the Spirit Guard could put distance between them, the little girl reached out and grabbed hold of his belt.","Her hand seemed to have endless strength.","No matter how hard the Spirit Guard pulled away, he could not get free of her hand.","Just as the Spirit Guard was about to call out to his companions, he suddenly felt something enter his body and start moving around within him.","This thing choked him and froze every joint and blood vessel in his body.","The young girl said in her innocent voice, “Big Brother, you’re so nice! Why don’t you lend me your body?”","This shocking statement took the Spirit Guard by such surprise that he did not even have time to blink before he felt something pry open his brain, and he lost consciousness.","The people who saw this only saw a sweet man squatting on the ground, trying to help a young girl. It made for a heartwarming picture.","At this moment, the man squatting on the ground suddenly jumped to his feet and grabbed the young girl’s black-bound tome and gray robe.","In an instant, the girl disappeared, and it was as though she had never existed.","The Spirit Guard returned to his original station, and he looked as though he had found out something.","He continued patrolling his route and greeted the several colleagues he encountered. Everything went on as it usually did.","At this point, Second Page Revival had fully assumed the Spirit Guard’s identity and infiltrated the Radiance Federation.","This was a complete deviation from Second Page Revival’s original plan.","Second Page Revival wanted to investigate Whale Ocean Commerce, but this was not the time!","According to the plan, she should have waited until the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection began.","All the Radiance Federation’s royalty’s attention was fixed on the Freedom Federation envoy group, and Second Page Revival would be able to move more freely during her investigation.","She should be working together with Sixth Page Lashing and activating the Black Mass Cup.","But to Second Page Revival’s frustration, Sixth Page Lashing was missing!","He had not turned up at their agreed-upon meeting place.","If Second Page Revival activated her sacred source lifeform, the Death Declaration Angel, she would be able to sense Sixth Page Lashing’s position.","However, she would not dare to do so in the Royal Capital because the Radiance Federation’s royalty would instantly pick up on her.","Moreover, after Second Page Revival came to the Radiance Federation and realized that Sixth Page Lashing could not be found, she started to secretly consume the Radiance Federation’s spirit qi professionals."]},{"number":1611,"title":"Chapter 1611 - Don’t Be Shocked No Matter What You See!","paragraphs":["Second Page Revival was certain that Di Wanmi was dead from this small section of root.","Second Page Revival had not expected the Radiance Federation to be so powerful that they actually managed to kill a Class 5 Creation Master.","Second Page Revival instinctively knew that the Gardener Konjac’s ramet and seeds had fallen into the hands of the Radiance Federation’s royalty.","If this was so, the soft way would no longer do.","In order to retrieve the Gardener Konjac’s ramet and seeds, they would have to grab hold of the Radiance Federation’s life vessel so that they had no choice but to give up the Gardener Konjac’s ramet and seeds.","A moment later, a plain-looking girl dressed in a gray robe and carrying a black-bound tome walked off in the direction of the Freedom Federation envoy group’s accommodations.","At that moment, a righteous-looking man was voraciously digging into a candied pork chop, roasted ham, and fish in the Spirit Food Pavilion while gulping down the Spirit Food Pavilion’s signature beer.","Many people were staring at the man, but it was hard to be annoyed by his face. They instinctively associated him with kindness.","At that moment, a middle-aged woman holding a pearl-like precious instrument while playing with a chain of jade in her hand appeared in front of the man’s table.","She shot him a sultry look and said, “I’m sure you won’t mind if I take a seat and have a few drinks with you!”","The woman took out an elemental pearl and tossed it into the man’s beer mug.","The men around them all became jealous.","Feng Rou was a Class 2 Creation Master.","After Feng Lun died, Feng Rou inherited an immense inheritance.","She was a Class 2 Creation Master and already had an income of her own.","She had spent a significant amount of money in the past few years to become desirable to the opposite gender.","It seemed that this righteous-faced man was Feng Rou’s next target.","Once Feng Rou set her sights on someone, she would not force them but become extremely clingy.","If anyone ended up following her home, she would surely be seen on the prowl again at the Spirit Food Pavilion less than a week later.","There was no helping it. She could do anything she wanted with her money!","Otherwise, she wouldn’t be able to sustain such a luxurious lifestyle as a Class 2 Creation Master.","She always bought the trendiest clothes and added her own precious gems to them as accessories. To her, the more there were, the merrier.","With such an aura of opulence, it was difficult for the spirit qi professionals who spent all their days trying to increase the power of their feys to tear their eyes away from her. Who did not like a rich woman?","Moreover, she was a rich woman who was willing to splurge on her men.","They were all jealous that the first thing she offered was already an elemental pearl.","The man opposite Feng Rou had such a righteous expression that everyone assumed that he was going to turn her down.","Yet, he said, “Ma’am, I fell deeply in love with you the moment I laid eyes on you. You’re like an epiphyllum blooming at night.”","The crowd watched as the man raised his glass and poured the contents out into his hand until the elemental pearl fell out.","He pocketed the elemental pearl.","This action that did not match his face could only be described as obscene.","With his righteous features, it would be difficult for people to dislike him even if he did such a thing.","Feng Rou did not expect her hunt to be over so soon.","Given his appearance, she expected at least two weeks’ worth of effort.","She stood up and said, “Why don’t we order a dish and take it home to eat?”","The man picked up her ring-covered hand and said, “Beautiful lady, let me feed you when we get back.”","As Feng Rou walked out of the Spirit Food Pavilion next to the man, she completely missed the look of amusement in his gaze.","His gaze was that of a butcher, and Feng Rou looked like a helpless rabbit to him.","As he looked at the night sky, a strange smile appeared on his face.","When he flipped over his palm, a black crystal cup that shone with blurry gray fog appeared in his hand.","He spun his finger, and the black crystal cup also started to spin.","The gray fog around the cup did not dissipate and had an ominous aura.","The man sighed to himself.","It looks like I’ll have a place to go for the next few days! Second Page Revival, I want to see just what about First Page Crimson makes him worthy of you addressing him as ‘Lord’.","As one of the Eight Pages of Tower Canon, shouldn’t I know all the secrets about Tower Canon? Otherwise, what’s the point of me being the Sixth Page?","For the next step of my plan, the Radiance Federation is going to dig out all of First Page Crimson’s secrets for me. If First Page Crimson doesn’t appear, you’re dead Second Page Revival!","Hehe, I wonder if someone new will take your place as Second Page after your death?","...","Lin Yuan did not stay in the Radiant Moon Palace for long after dinner.","Chu Ci had wanted to return to the mansion with Lin Yuan but was held back by Cold Moon.","The Radiance Hundred Sequence selection was about to begin, and Cold Moon did not want Chu Ci to distract Lin Yuan.","On the way back to the Return from Faraway Mansion, Blood New Moon climbed out from Lin Yuan’s hair, leaped onto his ear, and whispered, “Lin Yuan, I spoke with the Moon Empress. During your fight against the Freedom Federation envoy group, I will remain hidden in your hair like I have been doing, But remember that I will not step in if nothing out of the ordinary happens during the fight, even if you end up losing.”","Lin Yuan was silent for a moment before he asked, “Uncle Blood, do you think that the Freedom Federation envoy group will try something?”","Blood New Moon shook his head and replied, “I will not need to step in if it’s only the techniques of young experts. Tower Canon hasn’t shown itself yet. The Moon Empress guessed that Tower Canon will collude with the Freedom Federation envoy group.”","Lin Yuan was slightly stunned.","According to Blood New Moon, it was the Moon Empress’ idea to have him hide in Lin Yuan’s hair during the fight.","Although Blood New Moon could be certain that he would not step in during a regular battle, it was likely that the Freedom Federation envoy group would criticize them if they found out about this.","They could even use the matter to incite a witch hunt against Lin Yuan.","Evidently, the Moon Empress was worried about Lin Yuan’s safety.","For some unknown reason, Lin Yuan had had an ominous feeling for some time.","At that moment, delight abruptly spread across Lin Yuan’s face as he sensed that the Floating Island Whale’s shell was starting to crack.","Lin Yuan said to Blood New Moon, “Uncle Blood, accompany me to the outskirts of the Royal Capital. No matter what you see, don’t be surprised.”"]},{"number":1612,"title":"Chapter 1612 - Break Out of the Shell!","paragraphs":["Blood New Moon could not help but chuckle when he heard what Lin Yuan said.","There were very few things in this world that could shock him!","The only times he was shocked were when Lin Yuan said that he could gather Jade Sundial’s soul and awaken the memories within the pieces and when Blood Love said that her sacred source lifeform could help to recreate Jade Sundial’s body.","This was because both the revival of a soul or body went beyond Blood New Moon’s knowledge.","Not even Purple Love, who had power beyond Eternal, had this kind of ability.","If she did, she would have done whatever it took to revive Jade Sundial.","Blood New Moon had seen Blood Love’s sacred source lifeform and realized that it was not the Ten Thousand Medicine Hot Spring that could revive Jade Sundial’s body but the vitality that could trigger genetic models that Lin Yuan released.","During the time that this thought passed through Blood New Moon’s mind, he was brought by Lin Yuan to the outskirts of the Royal Capital using the Ethereal Jellyfish’s Node Teleportation.","This was the place where Endless Summer had evolved to Creation Breed and what used to be a desolate wasteland was now a thriving forest.","Lin Yuan lifted his hand and summoned the Floating Island Whale that had absorbed its fill of water- and wind-elemental energy and spirit qi.","From the moment that the egg cracked, the Floating Island Whale fetus stopped absorbing water- and wind-elemental energy and the spirit qi.","All it needed to do now was struggle slightly, and it would be able to hatch out of the shell.","A second was all Blood New Moon needed to recognize that this was the Island Whale and that it was in the process of hatching.","The Heavenly Family Cottage was well aware that spirit qi professionals were searching the seas for the Island Whale fetuses and hatching them.","Was the surprise that Lin Yuan was referring to just the Island Whale? He underestimated Blood New Moon!","But after observing the Island Whale fetus for a while more, Blood New Moon realized that the Island Whale fetus contained not only water-elemental energy but also wind-elemental energy.","But how could wind-elemental energy appear within the Island Whale fetus?","The Island Whale fetus was not blue but light green.","Blood New Moon’s expression turned solemn, and he was filled with surprise.","He was now certain that the Island Whale in Lin Yuan’s hand had mutated.","At that moment, a whale cry filled the area and the sound of cracking echoed.","It was as though there was something inside the egg that was trying to break out of it.","Lin Yuan could sense the Floating Island Whale inside the egg calling him through its bloodline.","After strengthening their bloodline link numerous times, Lin Yuan and the Floating Island Whale were practically family.","Lin Yuan encouraged the Floating Island Whale and said, “Go slowly. There’s no need to rush! Get used to the power bit by bit. You don’t have to force it. Just use your body to break the shell, and you’ll be able to get out!”","Although Lin Yuan was not a traditional Creation Master, he had learned from Genius’ knowledge that breaking out of the shell was the most important part of the Island Whale’s growth.","If someone helped the Island Whale break out of its shell, it would not hurt the Island Whale, but the lifeform that touched the shell would drain away the energy within the shell.","The shell was the most important source of nutrients for a newly-hatched Island Whale and could help it to quickly evolve.","If the Floating Island Whale could evolve to Diamond X/Legend, it would be able to easily comprehend its own Willpower Rune from nature and evolve to Myth Breed.","It did not need to slowly comprehend Willpower Runes like other feys.","This was likely the way that nature showed its love for the Island Whale.","A newly-hatched Island Whale was not large. It was only around two to three meters long. It would be able to fit perfectly back into its shell.","Its size would only start to grow rapidly when it reached Fantasy Breed. It would quickly be able to reach a length of 1,000 meters.","This applied to the Floating Island Whale.","Under normal circumstances, the Island Whale would eat its shell after it hatched and could evolve from Normal to Silver grade.","It took a lot to hatch the Island Whale, and it was also a large undertaking to nurture it.","However, Lin Yuan was not worried about having to nurture it.","The Spirit Lock spatial zone was currently 960 square meters.","This was enough space for the Floating Island Whale until it reached Fantasy Breed, and there was practically an endless supply of pure spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","After all, he could have as many energy ores as he wanted.","Given the concentration of the spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, the rate at which the Celestine Elemental Shellfish and Aquamarine Elemental Shellfish produced elemental pearls would be able to match the rate at which the Mother of Bloodbath ate.","Additionally, Yin Lin was going to give him another 30 young Elemental Shellfish.","Once the Floating Island Whale hatched, Lin Yuan was confident that he would be able to evolve the Floating Island Whale to Diamond X/Legend and comprehend a Willpower Rune to evolve to Myth Breed within three months.","At that time, the true Sky City could be built.","Another whale cry filled the area and attracted many feys.","Blood New Moon immediately used his aura to set up a shield as he continued to observe what kind of Island Whale this mutated fetus would hatch into.","He was also keeping watch on any enemies that could appear.","The Radiance Federation was currently very messy, and many factions were pulling strings from the shadows.","The Freedom Federation and Azure Federation had gathered in the Radiance Federation. A fight between the three federations was about to break out.","There was no way that the other factions like the Spirit Mother Federation, Sand Island Continent, Violent Wind Federation, Ancient Abyss Federation, and Extreme Ice Federation that had Class 5 Creation Masters would be able to ignore the situation in the Radiance Federation.","At that moment, more whale cries sounded out from inside the shell.","Every time the Floating Island Whale struggled, more cracks would appear on the shell.","Suddenly, there was a shattering noise, and pieces of the shell fell away and landed on the ground. The pieces shone with a faint light green light.","It was as though the Floating Island Whale could see the light at the end of the tunnel and was doing all it could to dash toward the light.","Finally, after another strong push, the Floating Island Whale managed to emerge from its egg.","According to the nature of the Island Whale, it should consume its shell the moment it hatched.","But instead, the Floating Island Whale hugged Lin Yuan and started wagging its tail at him."]},{"number":1613,"title":"Chapter 1613 - Giant Whales Body and Pilot Whale Master","paragraphs":["It was as though it was asking Lin Yuan to get on its back so it could take him out for a ride.","Blood New Moon’s eyes widened to such an extent that they almost fell out of their sockets.","W-What’s going on? Since when are Island Whales able to fly!?","Blood New Moon finally knew why there was wind-elemental energy inside the shell.","The wind-elemental energy allowed the Island Whale that should belong in the sea to become a creature of the sky.","!!","The Island Whale that was confined to the sea had a completely different connotation from the one that could exist in both the water and sky.","The newly-hatched Island Whale should not have such high intelligence.","Intelligence would dictate a fey’s thoughts and enable the fey to know what to do to evolve itself.","A high intelligence proved that the Island Whale had endless evolutionary possibilities. There was even a chance that it could become a Heavenly Family Fey.","Lin Yuan reached out and touched the Floating Island Whale’s head.","He realized that the feelers on the Floating Island Whale’s head felt different from flesh and almost like jade.","In Lin Yuan’s previous life, the blue whale would be the closest thing to the Floating Island Whale.","However, the Floating Island Whale’s body was not as streamlined as the blue whale. The Floating Island Whale’s body was very broad and not swollen at all.","Due to its mutation, the Floating Island Whale had a wingspan three times larger than the regular Island Whale, and it was much larger than the Floating Island Whale’s own body.","Lin Yuan said softly to the Floating Island Whale that was still acting affectionately toward him, “Do you still remember the name I gave you before you hatched? I called you Universe. After you eat your shell, I’ll take you to the place where you’ll be able to grow quickly.”","Universe reached out its find and hugged Lin Yuan for a moment before elegantly raising its body, opening its mouth, and chomping down on the shell.","During this entire process, Lin Yuan could feel Universe’s aura rising continuously.","Suddenly, three options appeared.","This proved that Universe had reached Elite X/Epic after eating the shell and was evolving toward Bronze grade.","Lin Yuan started to look into the three exclusive skills and was extremely solemn.","Universe was a fey and also had its own abilities and exclusive skills.","Different exclusive skills would result in different development results for Universe.","This was the reason not every Island Whale had the same quality.","Although they were all mature Island Whales, some Island Whales were given the rank of S-rank while others were only B-rank.","They differed in their abilities and exclusive skills. Evidently, the Island Whale’s abilities and exclusive skills were vital to it.","Out of the three exclusive skills, the first one was.","[Giant Whale’s Body]: By absorbing more energy, its body will grow past its limits and become even more gargantuan.","This was the ability that allowed an Island Whale to be ranked S-rank.","Although it would take up more energy and resources, the Island Whale that had this ability would be able to become 1/3 larger than its original size.","The effects would not be visible if it was used on an ant.","If a wingspan of over 100 meters increased by one-third, its wingspan would increase by just over 30 meters.","However, a mature Island Whale could easily reach a length of 30,000 to 50,000 meters.","An Island Whale nurtured by someone would be larger than a wild Island Whale.","If a 90,000-meter-long Island Whale used Giant Whale’s Body, its body would grow by 30,000 meters. At the same time, its width would also increase by one-third.","The Island Whale’s original purpose was to deliver goods.","The Island Whale that had multiplied in size could be utilized as two Island Whales.","Moreover, the larger the Island Whale, the heavier it would be.","The Island Whale’s main method of attack was using its body to slam against targets.","The larger its size, the stronger its combat and defense would be."]},{"number":1614,"title":"Chapter 1614 - Floating Island Secret Realm","paragraphs":["Given a choice, Lin Yuan would not hesitate to choose Giant Whale’s Body.","He stopped struggling over his dilemma and decided to look at Universe’s third exclusive skill.","He immediately widened his eyes because this exclusive skill was not recorded in the Hidden Moon Palace’s secret accounts of the Island Whale.","Lin Yuan was certain that this exclusive skill had come from the Island Whale’s mutation into the Floating Island Whale.","[Floating Island Secret Realm]: A special space will be opened within the whale’s abdomen by swallowing wind-elemental energy. The higher the purity of the wind-elemental energy, the larger the space will be. But the space will not exceed twice the size of the body. By swallowing water-elemental energy, the flesh will gain powerful fusion abilities that will enable the fats to stick to any lifeform, dead or alive, and drain nutrients from them. The purer the water-elemental energy, the stronger the fusion ability will be.","!!","Floating Island Secret Realm used both wind- and water-elemental energy.","Normally, the Island Whale did not contain wind-elemental energy.","After Universe flew into the air, Lin Yuan would have no need for it to have strong combat and defense power.","Dark Blue and Gray would be able to protect Universe well.","Moreover, the Island Whale that had been nurtured by someone would be fitted with protective feys on its back that had predictive abilities.","Giant Whale’s Body appealed to Lin Yuan because it could expand Universe’s size.","Lin Yuan wanted to build a new Sky City on Universe’s back. As such, the larger the size of Universe’s back, the better it would be.","If Universe chose Floating Island Secret Realm, it would be able to use wind-elemental energy to open a secret realm in its abdomen.","This would essentially increase the size of Universe’s back. It was just like how both increasing the size of a space and building a second floor on top of it were the same in that the space would still be increased.","Universe needed to stay hidden when it was in the air.","If Universe could gain more space without increasing its size, it would be good news to Lin Yuan.","After all, the larger its size, the bigger the target it would be.","It would also put a lot of strain on Gray to cover an overly large Floating Island Whale.","Additionally, the secret realm in Universe’s abdomen was a hidden space.","It would be a safe place to store resources or do other things.","Lin Yuan would be able to use Space Tunnel to set up a link between the Spirit Lock spatial zone’s basement and Universe’s abdomen.","Both Floating Island Secret Realm and Giant Whale’s Body had their own pros and cons.","Both could increase space.","Floating Island Secret Realm would provide secrecy, but Giant Whale’s Body would increase endurance, combat, and defense.","Ever since the Element Well had appeared in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, no one in the world had more wind-elemental energy than Lin Yuan.","Thus, Lin Yuan was confident that he would be able to increase the space in Universe’s abdomen to its greatest extent of two times Universe’s size.","This meant that choosing Floating Island Secret Realm would increase Universe’s size slightly more than Giant Whale’s Body could.","Additionally, Floating Island Secret Realm had another ability.","By consuming water-elemental energy, Universe’s flesh would become a bonding agent.","When building on top of Universe, the building materials would be practically planted into Universe’s flesh. This would make the structure extremely sturdy!"]},{"number":1615,"title":"Chapter 1615 - Subjugate the Sky!","paragraphs":["During this process, Universe’s body started to expand.","However, it did not expand to a large extent as it stopped once it reached a length of six meters.","At this point, there was no eggshell left to eat.","Lin Yuan immediately used True Data to check on Universe’s abilities.","[Fey Name]: Floating Island Whale","[Fey Species]: Large-winged-whale-species/island-whale-species.","[Fey Grade]: Silver (6/10)","[Fey Type]: Water/Wind","[Fey Quality]: Elite","Abilities:","[Whale Blood Screen]: Set fire to the essence blood inside its body and form a screen that can protect everything on its back.","[Water Vapor Whale Feelers]: Transform its feelers into water vapor and use them to gather nutrients from the environment to recover itself.","[Whale Spout Empowerment]: Through the blowhole in its head, it can shoot out the energy from its body and supply it to the entities fused with it to replenish their energy or fix them up in other ways.","Exclusive Skill:","[Floating Island Secret Realm]: A special space will be opened within the whale’s abdomen by swallowing wind-elemental energy. The higher the purity of the wind-elemental energy, the larger the space will be. But the space will not exceed twice the size of the body. By swallowing water-elemental energy, the flesh will gain powerful fusion abilities that will enable the fats to stick to any lifeform, dead or alive, and drain nutrients from them. The purer the water-elemental energy, the stronger the fusion ability will be.","When Lin Yuan saw Universe’s three abilities, he balled his fists as excitement spread across his face.","Normally, the Island Whale’s Normal and Elite abilities were set, and any changes were slight.","The Normal abilities could be Whale Blood Screen, Whale Fat Screen, or Elemental Screen.","Out of the three, Whale Blood Screen was the best.","Elemental Screen would use up the elemental energy inside its body, while Whale Fat Screen would use up the Island Whale’s fat.","After these two were used up, they would not be as easy to replenish as blood was.","The mature Island Whale’s heart was bigger than a house, and there were four spleens next to the heart.","Every time the heart contracted, the four spleens would pump out fresh blood.","Once the Island Whale grew to full size, it would be able to use Whale Blood Screen as a triggered ability.","It would not cause much damage to the Island Whale if the ability was turned on for an entire day. Rather, its metabolism would speed up.","The Elite abilities were usually Strengthen Whale Feelers, Extend Whale Feelers, Tentacle Whale Feelers, and Flowing Water Feelers.","All these abilities would be able to replenish the Island Whale’s energy and increase its endurance.","However, Strengthen Whale Feelers, Extend Whale Feelers, and Tentacle Whale Feelers could not escape their original limits.","However, one increased the feeler’s filtering abilities, the other increased the feelers’ ability to cover an area, and the last increased the feelers’ agility.","Still, all three of them could not compete with Flowing Water Feelers.","Flowing Water Feelers filtered the energy in the environment through the flowing water. As such, Universe would not have to open its mouth to filter food and absorb energy.","This would improve not only the Island Whale’s appearance but also its body to heal itself.","Water Vapor Whale Feelers was an extended version of Flowing Water Feelers.","Since Universe controlled two types of elemental energy, its feelers could turn into both of these types of elemental energy to filter food.","When water and air combined, they turned into clouds.","Universe would be able to spread the filtered clouds so that it mixed with Gray in cloud form.","The Island Whale with Flowing Water Feelers would be given the title of A-rank even if its other exclusive skills and abilities were useless.","This was because the Island Whale would be able to travel endlessly as long as it did not encounter anything urgent that used up a large amount of its energy. It would not need someone to replenish its energy.","Both Universe’s Normal and Elite abilities were the best.","Lin Yuan felt that Whale Spout Empowerment was an ability that would only be used in crises.","Firstly, all of the energy in Universe’s body would be released, and it would take a very long time to recover.","Whale Spout Empowerment’s effects depended on the amount of energy in Universe’s body.","When feys of the same grade were side by side, the larger one would contain more energy.","No fey in the world was larger than the Island Whale.","There was a terrifying amount of energy inside the Island Whale’s body.","When the Island Whale released all of the energy in its body, the damaged buildings built into its fat would immediately start to rebuild.","When faced with an enemy, the Island Whale would be able to play a game of tower defense.","In a battle, plant-type feys that used elemental attacks were the most important. However, the plant-type feys that relied on elemental energy could only release a few attacks before they were spent.","Now, with Whale Spout Empowerment, Universe’s attack and defense structures on its back would be able to rapidly explode outward to produce the strongest effects.","It took a large number of resources to build battle structures on an Island Whale’s back.","Even a federation would have to carefully consider before spending such resources.","However, Lin Yuan did not need to think that much about it.","After interacting with Universe for a while, Lin Yuan returned Universe to the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Blood New Moon was stunned for a moment before he said, “Lin Yuan, the Island Whale’s mutation is definitely a gift from nature. Despite being newly hatched, it has the intelligence of a mature Island Whale. I think that it only needs one opportunity to become a Heavenly Family Fey.”","Blood New Moon had wanted to go on but decided not to because no one could say if Universe could evolve into a Heavenly Family Fey.","Every natural environment had its own Heavenly Family Fey.","It was possible for one natural environment to have two Heavenly Family Feys, but it was very rare.","Even if it did happen, it would just be an overlap in a certain area.","The Heavenly Family Fey that was affiliated with the earth had appeared, and Blue Lotus controlled the sea.","However, there was still no Heavenly Family Fey affiliated with the sky.","If Universe could truly become a Heavenly Family Fey, it would definitely be able to subjugate the sky!"]},{"number":1616,"title":"Chapter 1616 - Stay With You Through the Night!","paragraphs":["When Lin Yuan returned to the mansion, he received Gao Feng’s call before he even reached his room.","Gao Feng had been locked away training for some time, and there had been no activity from him in the group chat since.","Now that Gao Feng was calling Lin Yuan, it had to mean that he was done evolving his power and contracting his sacred source lifeform.","When Lin Yuan picked up the call, he heard Gao Feng sob. “Lin Yuan, Master finally let me out! I have been working like a dog! Although I was only locked away for two months, it felt like I’d been training for two years!”","Lin Yuan smiled when he heard what Gao Feng said.","Gao Feng was already hard-working by nature.","In order to increase his power, he sought out a better team to fight in the Allstar Match with. He had been training consistently for a long time.","Without all his efforts, he would not have been able to seize the opportunity at the Guard Ye Banquet and become Cicada Song’s disciple.","It seemed that Cicada Song had been putting Gao Feng through the wringer for the past two months.","Gao Feng wanted to participate in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","As a disciple of royalty, he shouldered a heavy responsibility.","Cicada Song did not know that Lin Yuan was Black, and Lin Yuan had not told Gao Feng about it either.","It was likely that Cicada Song was placing all the responsibility of taking on the Freedom Federation envoy group on Gao Feng’s back.","It seemed that Gao Feng’s power had reached a whole new level.","Before Lin Yuan could ask about what was new with Gao Feng, the latter went on to say, “Brother, I’m done with what I need to do here. All of you will probably have to come and spectate the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection. You’ll be able to see me fight.”","Lin Yuan did not hear the relief of being let out after two months. Rather, he had a strangely heavy tone.","Gao Feng said hoarsely, “Brother, if you’re not too busy, I would like to ask you out to have a few drinks together.”","Lin Yuan immediately realized why Gao Feng’s tone was so austere.","The root of the matter lay in the fight against the Freedom Federation envoy group after the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","Gao Feng had either guessed this result on his own or was told by Cicada Song.","Regardless of which it was, Gao Feng had definitely decided to take on the responsibility.","This was part of his duty as a disciple of royalty.","Since he was about to fight side by side with Gao Feng, Lin Yuan decided that it was time to tell Gao Feng some things.","Thus, Lin Yuan said, “You’ve been to my mansion before. The last time you came, the Submerged Flood Dragon Lake was still being constructed. But now, many pavilions sit on the Sunlight King Lotus and glitter under the sunlight. I will prepare wine and wait for you on the lake.”","Wen Yu had used the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus’ flowers to brew a wine that did not have high alcohol content.","Lin Yuan had been intending to use this wine but eventually decided against it. Instead, he chose the Flames Wine that Zong Ze had served during their previous gathering.","The Flames Wine was a strong wine brewed from various fire-elemental spiritual ingredients and fire-element energy.","When drunk, one would feel as though their throat was on fire.","In the past, Zong Ze relied on the Flames Wine to suppress the bad luck that plagued him.","Lin Yuan walked toward the Submerged Flood Dragon Lake with the Flames Wine in hand.","When Blackie sensed Lin Yuan approaching, it flew out of the water and charged at Lin Yuan.","Every time Lin Yuan came to see Blackie, he would leave completely drenched.","However, Lin Yuan had business to attend to at this time and hurriedly used wings made of the Day and Night Spirit Silver and flew away from Blackie.","After he shook off the water that Blackie had splashed onto him, Lin Yuan landed on Blackie’s neck and said, “Blackie, I am meeting a friend for drinks at the pavilion tonight. Be good, and stop chasing the Angelfish of Bliss around the lake.”","Blackie replied gently, “Okay! I will take it as you spending time with me as you’re drinking on the surface of the Submerged Flood Dragon Lake. I’ll nap underwater.”","Lin Yuan admired the beauty of the Submerged Flood Dragon Lake.","The Sunlight King Lotus absorbed the sunlight and looked like another sun that was resting on the lake.","The rainbow Angelfish of Bliss swam around in schools in the water. They looked like rainbows adorning the sun.","There were over 100 pavilions on the leaves of the Sunlight King Lotus, and flowers surrounded each pavilion.","It looked like a bona fide celestial realm.","Blackie sent Lin Yuan to a pavilion.","Lin Yuan did not have to wait long before he spotted Gao Feng at the edge of the Submerged Flood Dragon Lake.","Gao Feng waved at Lin Yuan. Without Blackie having to fetch him, he waved his hand and summoned a three-meter-tall rose.","This rose was the Breeze Hibiscus.","Lin Yuan noticed that the Breeze Hibiscus had evolved to Diamond X/Fantasy V, the highest level a young expert could attain.","The Breeze Hibiscus’ leaves swayed, kicking up a breeze that blew Gao Feng over to Lin Yuan.","Gao Feng was smiling, but Lin Yuan could sense from his gaze that he was holding himself back.","Lin Yuan handed the Flames Wine to Gao Feng and said, “You said you wanted to drink, so I prepared this for you. Tonight, I will drink with you for the entire night. You can say whatever you want to say!”","Gao Feng reached out and hugged Lin Yuan before he took a swig of the Flames Wine.","This mouthful of wine seemed to set all of Gao Feng’s blood on fire.","Usually, Gao Feng was not very expressive.","Although he saw Lin Yuan as a good friend, he would normally never do something like hugging him.","Gao Feng took a deep breath and said, “Let me tell you a story! There was a little boy who was beloved by his grandfather from the moment he was born. He could have anything and everything that he asked for. Although his father was unreasonable and his mother was strict, he could still do whatever he wanted. When he was young, this boy did not have any friends. But once he came of age, he managed to make a few good friends. Because of these friends, he suddenly found himself the disciple of an expert. Now, the father who never acknowledged him is putting him on a pedestal. This delights the boy! But one day, the boy will have to put his life on the line as a disciple of royalty for the glory of the Radiance Federation.”","Gao Feng took another gulp of wine and went on to say."]},{"number":1617,"title":"Chapter 1617 - Strong Support-Type Sacred Source Lifeform!","paragraphs":["“Although that boy is of age, he still feels like a child. Do you know how that boy felt when all that pressure came crashing down on him?”","Lin Yuan did not respond because he knew that Gao Feng was not looking for a reply. He just needed someone to vent his true feelings to.","It was clear that Gao Feng was talking about himself.","Gao Feng picked up the jug of wine and took a few more gulps before he started to cough violently.","As he coughed, he said, “This boy is terrified of death because it will mean that he will no longer be able to see this world, eat good food, take part in the Allstar Match, or have drinks with his friends anymore.","“However, when the boy found out that the matter concerned the pride of the Radiance Federation, he felt all the blood rush to his head for some reason. He became willing to safeguard the Radiance Federation.","“Even if it means that he won’t be able to see the world, eat good food, participate in the Allstar Match, or have drinks with his friends anymore. He’s willing to accept all of it! Don’t you think that this boy is really stupid?”","Lin Yuan stared at Gao Feng’s eyes which had gone red from spluttering and coughing.","At that moment, Gao Feng seemed less like he was venting and more like he was bidding goodbye.","Although he was a disciple of royalty, and it was his duty to take on all of this, he did have the option to say no.","Being a support-type spirit qi professional, he would have plenty of opportunities during the Radiance Hundred Sequence’s qualifying rounds to get himself eliminated.","Once he did that, he would have nothing to do with everything that came next.","However, Gao Feng would not do so.","No matter how attached he was to the world or how afraid he was of dying, he was willing to take on all of the responsibility.","This meant that Gao Feng was worthy of his title.","Now that he knew Gao Feng’s choice, Lin Yuan gave him an internal thumbs-up.","At that moment, Lin Yuan did not know how he should comfort Gao Feng.","He summoned Genius and instructed it to use Tool Transformation.","Lin Yuan put on the silver mask.","When Gao Feng saw the cat that Lin Yuan summoned, he was immediately stunned.","After Gao Feng accepted his duty, he regarded Black as his teammate.","Gao Feng was a support-type spirit qi professional.","When he chose this path, he would need to trust his teammates during battle.","After he became a disciple of royalty, his horizons were expanded. Thus, he tried to find someone exceptional among those who were participating in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","Eventually, Black caught his eye.","Hence, Gao Feng searched for Black’s Celestial Stairway battle recordings so that he could study Black’s power.","He wanted to find the best way to support Black.","Gao Feng had watched Black’s battles many times.","The only thing that he remembered was the phantom image of the cat that had appeared behind Black.","Gao Feng had not managed to pick up on anything else.","This frustrated Gao Feng.","Black had only shown a few of his feys. If Gao Feng did not even know what feys Black had, how could he come up with a plan to support him?","The cat that Lin Yuan summoned did not resemble the phantom image of the cat that had appeared behind Black. However, both had eight tails.","Before Gao Feng could ponder even further, the cat used Tool Transformation and turned into a mask that Lin Yuan wore.","In an instant, a name flew out from Gao Feng’s lips—”Black!”","Lin Yuan nodded at the stunned Gao Feng and said, “That’s right. I’m Black. I will be by your side not just tonight over drinks but also during battle.”","Gao Feng had been excited when Cicada Song arranged for him to contract a sacred source lifeform.","But when he learned his sacred source lifeform’s abilities, he almost exploded on the spot.","I’m a pure support-type spirit qi professional! I don’t have any combat abilities, so all I can do is get beaten up. Unlike defense-type spirit qi professionals, I can’t hold out against enemies using my feys’ defense abilities. It would be fine if my sacred source lifeform was combat-type. At least I would be able to retaliate! But what am I supposed to do with a support-type sacred source lifeform!?","This was the reason Gao Feng looked like he was holding back when he came to see Lin Yuan.","At the break of dawn, he thought about how he would be sacrificed and was headed for his inevitable death.","He cared about the type of his sacred source lifeform because he was afraid that he would not be able to do anything other than get beaten up and humiliate himself in a fight that involved the Radiance Federation’s pride.","Gao Feng also came to see Lin Yuan to bid him goodbye.","So how did Lin Yuan suddenly become his teammate?","If Lin Yuan was Black, this meant that the person he would have to support during the fight was Lin Yuan.","Gao Feng had witnessed Lin Yuan’s power for himself at the Guard Ye Banquet’s Martial Arts Stage.","A strong wave of confidence rose within Gao Feng.","But his face fell again when he thought about the sacred source lifeform he had contracted.","He scratched his head and said uneasily, “Lin Yuan, the sacred source lifeform I formed a contract with is too lousy. I might end up being dead weight during the battle. I have no clue why Master said it’s the strongest support-type sacred source lifeform he’s ever seen.”","Gao Feng’s words immediately piqued Lin Yuan’s interest.","Cicada Song was a member of royalty and had seen more than the average person would see in their entire life.","If Cicada Song acknowledged it as the strongest support-type fey, it definitely had incomparable abilities and merits.","The Moon Empress had once mentioned to Lin Yuan that the strongest support-type fey on record was Cicada Song’s Alleviating Wind.","Yet, Cicada Song chose to remove the title from his own sacred source lifeform and hand it to Gao Feng’s sacred source lifeform.","This meant that Gao Feng’s sacred source lifeform had to be extraordinary.","So why did Gao Feng think of his sacred source lifeform as useless and dead weight?","At that moment, Gao Feng said, “Lin Yuan, have a look at my sacred source lifeform. Although neither of us will be able to depend on it during battle, the Breeze Hibiscus and Spirit Spring Lily will still be able to help to recover spirit qi while the Yellow Spring Lily will be able to extend your feys’ lives.”","While Gao Feng was speaking, a crystal box that shone with rainbow light appeared in front of him."]},{"number":1618,"title":"Chapter 1618 - Memory-Consuming Eight Tunes","paragraphs":["The shining rainbow crystal box was intricately made, and there was a fairy engraved on it.","The fairy seemed to be harvesting something while howling. It was as though there was something within her body that was trying to get out.","It could be said that the image engraved on the crystal box was peculiar.","However, Lin Yuan was not the most curious about the image carved on the crystal box but the rainbow light.","This light was very similar to that of an uncontracted sacred source lifeform.","Gao Feng noticed Lin Yuan observing his sacred source lifeform and said, “Lin Yuan, Master was willing to use his sacred source lifeform’s roots to evolve this thing to 6 Stars. I have no idea what’s going through his mind! How many of the young experts from the Freedom Federation that we’ll be facing even have a sacred source lifeform?”","Lin Yuan was shocked when he heard what Gao Feng said.","He could not believe that Cicada Song was willing to use his sacred source lifeform’s roots to evolve Gao Feng’s sacred source lifeform.","This meant that Gao Feng’s sacred source lifeform had to have very strong abilities.","A sacred source lifeform’s roots took a long time to recover after they were used.","After using this method to evolve Gao Feng’s sacred source lifeform, Cicada Song’s sacred source lifeform would not be able to evolve for another two years.","According to Gao Feng, his sacred source lifeform’s abilities targeted other sacred source lifeforms.","Clearly, Gao Feng had no clue about the strength of the enemies that they would be facing.","Lin Yuan could bet that there would be at least three of them who had sacred source lifeforms.","Lin Yuan could not help but be curious about Gao Feng’s sacred source lifeform and used True Data to check on its abilities.","[Sacred Source Name]: Memory-Consuming Eight Tunes Box","[Sacred Source Species]: Source genus/Sacred Source species","[Sacred Source Star Grade]: 6 Stars","[Sacred Source Type]: Light/Soul","Abilities:","[Memory Magic Cut]: Pick a sacred source lifeform and cut its memory of one of its abilities. The target sacred source lifeform will be unable to use that forgotten ability. Every time the life rank is raised, the Memory-Consuming Eight Tunes Box will be able to lock away another ability.","[Exile Tuning]: Exile itself outside of a memory. Every time its life rank is raised, it can choose another target sacred source lifeform to be exiled as well.","Lin Yuan’s jaw dropped open in shock, and he blinked mutely.","If Lin Yuan did not know Gao Feng well and know that he was not one to humble brag, he would be wondering if Gao Feng was humble bragging at that moment.","It could be said that the Memory-Consuming Eight Tunes Box was the bane of every sacred source lifeform.","Just Memory Magic Cut alone would be a nightmare for countless sacred source lifeforms.","When others were using their sacred source lifeforms, Gao Feng would be able to use the Memory-Consuming Eight Tunes Box to restrain them.","Sacred source lifeforms below 4 Stars only had one ability.","This meant that Gao Feng could now use his sacred source lifeform to cut other sacred source lifeforms’ memory of their abilities.","Sealing the abilities of other sacred source lifeforms seemed almost perverse.","Gao Feng’s sacred source lifeform had reached 6 Stars, which meant that it had entered the adolescent stage.","Gao Feng could use Memory Magic Cut to target two sacred source lifeforms at once and cut their abilities.","The extent to which sacred source lifeforms could restrict each other was linked to their Stars.","Normally, feys with controlling abilities would struggle to control feys that were higher Stars than them.","But the Memory-Consuming Eight Tunes Box would be almost invincible against feys of the same or lower Stars.","No matter how strong the experts in the Freedom Federation envoy group were, they could not be more than 6 Stars.","This was unless the Freedom Federation’s royalty were also willing to give up their own benefits to help their disciples.","Although Gao Feng’s sacred source lifeform did not have strong combat abilities, Memory Magic Cut would cause other sacred source lifeforms to forget two abilities.","Although every sacred source lifeform had a different comprehension ability at each stage, all of them had a main ability.","If the main ability was sealed off, the sacred source lifeform’s power would be greatly depressed.","If the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt was sealed off and it forgot that ability, all the worlds and laws engraved on the skirt would become useless, and Lin Yuan would not be able to utilize any of the Sword Skills.","That was not even the clincher. The clincher was the Memory-Consuming Eight Tunes Box’s second ability, Exile Tuning.","Memory Magic Cut could adjust its control over sacred source lifeforms when faced with many enemies. Its battle style was very dynamic.","When the Memory-Consuming Eight Tunes Box used Exile Tuning, it could exile two sacred source lifeforms of equal or lower Stars.","If the enemy’s fey had reached between 4 and 6 Stars, Gao Feng would be able to use his sacred source lifeform to take four abilities.","Now, Lin Yuan finally knew why Cicada Song had said that Gao Feng’s sacred source lifeform was the strongest support-type sacred source lifeform.","The Memory-Consuming Eight Tunes Box was currently only 6 Stars.","It might not be able to trigger celestial phenomena when it reached 10 Stars, but it would be able to restrain four sacred source lifeforms that could activate celestial phenomena.","This fey might not be able to increase Gao Feng’s battle power, but it still represented immense strategic significance.","No matter who Gao Feng encountered in the future, he could confidently say, “My sacred source lifeform might not be strong, but it’s definitely stronger than yours!”","Lin Yuan patted the despondent Gao Feng’s shoulder and said, “Gao Feng, as a disciple of royalty, you’ll eventually have to try and become a Radiance Envoy or at least a Radiance Knight. Your enemies at the Major Federation Meeting will be other elites. Don’t you think that they’ll have sacred source lifeforms?”","After being enlightened by Lin Yuan, Gao Feng immediately understood what he meant."]},{"number":1619,"title":"Chapter 1619 - How is the Disciple More Shameless Than the Master?","paragraphs":["After a moment, Gao Feng suddenly felt that the Memory-Consuming Eight Tunes Box was not as terrible as he originally thought.","Lin Yuan went on to say, “You’re walking the path of support-type. You would have to be worried if your sacred source lifeform had strong combat abilities because it wouldn’t gel with your combat style and would mess up your team. Now, you don’t have to worry about that.”","Gao Feng felt that what Lin Yuan said was very reasonable.","Previously, all his thoughts had surrounded the upcoming fight. But now, they went beyond that one fight.","His sacred source lifeform was actually pretty good!","After all, it was difficult for support-type abilities to be of any use against sacred source lifeforms.","But now, Gao Feng’s sacred source lifeform could.","Gao Feng immediately felt a burst of confidence.","As a pure support-type spirit qi professional, Gao Feng had not participated in the S Tournament because he could not find suitable teammates.","The teammates that he had managed to cobble together were all too lousy and could not match up to his power.","But now that his horizons were abruptly expanded after meeting Zong Ze, Gu Lang, and the rest, Gao Feng was afraid that he would be a burden to other disciples of royalty and that they would think of him as a piece of trash.","Gao Feng’s confidence has been low for the past few months.","This was because Liu Jie, Zong Ze, and Lin Yuan, who had all shown incredible power at the Martial Stage and Martial Arts Stage, would be participating in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","But now that he had regained his confidence, he was about to ask Lin Yuan to have a few drinks with him when Lin Yuan said, “We will have to enter the dueling ground in two days. At that time, Zong Ze and Gu Lang should have returned from their training in the abyssal world. It seems that An He has been staying in the Royal Capital. Liu Jie should be able to return to the mansion tomorrow night. I think that we should have a gathering.”","Lin Yuan told Gao Feng about his plan.","After Gao Feng found out that he was going to fight side by side with Lin Yuan, all the fear within Gao Feng vanished.","When he heard that Lin Yuan wanted to involve the other disciples of royalty to take on the young experts from the Freedom Federation envoy group, Gao Feng could not help but feel a rush of motivation.","As a support-type expert, the more teammates he had, the more valuable he became.","He would not be able to demonstrate his greatest value if he was only going to help one person. Rather, it would cause him to become the enemy’s first target.","With strong teammates, Gao Feng would be safer.","Gao Feng learned from Lin Yuan that three of the experts from the Freedom Federation they were going to be faced with were favored by the Freedom Federation’s members of royalty and that all three of them had sacred source lifeforms.","This meant that the Memory-Consuming Eight Tunes Box would definitely become a key player.","Gao Feng nodded and said, “Sounds good! I will go and contact Gu Lang and Zong Ze now! However, Zong Ze and Gu Lang have never been on good terms with An He. Will it really be okay to call An He over too?”","Lin Yuan gently shook his head.","No matter how much two people disliked each other, they would have no problems joining hands as long as everyone involved was rational.","Zong Ze and Gu Lang saw An He as an enemy because he was a rival young expert, and they competed for resources.","During such a circumstance, Zong Ze and Gu Lang would also invite An He for a chat even if Lin Yuan did not initiate contact.","Since the Freedom Federation had sent their young experts to stir trouble, the Radiance Federation would have to respond in kind.","The Radiance Federation would definitely not sit by and watch mutely when they knew that the Freedom Federation had tricks up their sleeve.","It was always said that no one would be a sitting duck when they knew they were being hunted.","Gao Feng called Gu Lang and Zong Ze, while Lin Yuan called An He.","Presently, An He was speaking to an elegant-looking middle-aged man. “Master, I need much more pure water- and earth-elemental energy in order for the Sudden Hibernating Wetland Dragon and Country Governor Kui to take the next step.”","The elegant-looking man put down the book he was holding, and frustration flashed across his face.","He had to attend the imperial meeting tomorrow, but in such a situation, he could not ask Chef Supreme, the Bamboo Monarch, and the Moon Empress for pure heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","Although he was extremely powerful as a member of the Radiance Federation’s royalty, he still had to seek out the three Class 5 Creation Masters in order to obtain such elite resources.","Ji Changdeng had no choice but to say, “I don’t think the Sudden Hibernating Wetland Dragon and Country Governor Kui will be able to evolve before the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.”","Ji Changdeng immediately thought of Elder Gu’s report and asked An He, “I heard that you clashed against the Moon Empress’ disciple. Is this true?”","An He retracted his neck.","As Ji Changdeng’s disciple, An He knew the feelings that Ji Changdeng had for the Moon Empress well.","An He felt that he and Lin Yuan had forged a bond through their rough encounter.","They had even exchanged contact details and could be considered friends.","Hence, An He replied, “Master, the Moon Empress’ disciple is named Lin Yuan, and we’re friends now.”","Ji Changdeng immediately felt that An He was even more shameless than he had been when he was courting the Moon Empress.","How is that normal? You fought but became friends afterward? I fought so many battles with the Moon Empress, so does that mean she should be in love with me now?","At this moment, An He’s phone rang.","An He’s phone only rang every few days because he had not given his number to many people.","Now that his phone was suddenly ringing, his eyes lit up when he saw who the call was coming from.","He showed the phone to Ji Changdeng and said, “Look, Lin Yuan is calling me.”","Ji Changdeng suddenly felt that fighting seemed like a good way to pull two people closer together.","An He picked up the call, and Lin Yuan asked him to come to the mansion for a gathering and discuss their plan for the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","Since this involved the Freedom Federation envoy group. An He waved at Ji Changdeng.","He did not care if Lin Yuan had set the meeting time as tomorrow afternoon. Despite it being night, he followed Lin Yuan’s address and arrived at the Return from Faraway Mansion.","During the journey, An He’s smile never left his face.","This was the first time that a friend had invited him over to their house as a guest.","It felt good!","A thought struck him, and a sharp gleam streaked across his gaze."]},{"number":1620,"title":"Chapter 1620 - Were All Disciples of Royalty, Why are You Putting On Airs?","paragraphs":["Chapter 1620: We’re All Disciples of Royalty, Why are You Putting On Airs?","Ever since the Freedom Federation envoy group arrived at the Radiance Federation, An He had been suppressing his urge to kill.","But once he stepped onto the dueling ground, he would definitely use his secret weapon that he had kept to himself during his fight with Lin Yuan and wipe all his enemies out!","An He’s role model was his senior brother, who was now the third Radiance Envoy.","As such, An He’s ambition had always been to become a Radiance Envoy.","!!","An He knew that Lin Yuan would definitely invite Zong Ze and Gu Lang to this meeting as well.","Recently, An He had snatched a sacred source lifeform from Gu Lang.","Although An He ended up surrendering the sacred source lifeform to Lin Yuan, the grudge between him and Gu Lang had already materialized.","He had already had many negative encounters with Zong Ze and Gu Lang.","An He had an explosive temper. Usually, he was the one who provoked the grudges.","But this time, he was determined not to rile up Zong Ze and Gu Lang.","When they had serious business to attend to, it had to take priority.","From the moment that An He arrived at the Return from Faraway Mansion, he immediately attracted the attention of Blood New Moon, White Phoenix, Blue Lotus, and the rest.","Luckily, the Mother of Bloodbath was acquainted with An He.","When the Mother of Bloodbath unlocked its Heavenly Family Fey bloodline, An He had even helped the Mother of Bloodbath to keep the aquatic feys at bay.","Thus, the Mother of Bloodbath reasonably felt indebted to An He and decided that it would go and greet An He personally.","When An He saw the Mother of Bloodbath, his eyes lit up. “Lin Yuan invited me to a banquet. Take me to him!”","The Mother of Bloodbath looked at An He strangely.","Why would Lin Yuan be inviting you to a banquet in the middle of the night? Moreover, isn’t Lin Yuan already drinking with Gao Feng on the Submerged Flood Dragon Lake tonight? Lin Yuan probably asked to meet with you in the daytime!","But since Lin Yuan did know An He, the Mother of Bloodbath said, “Let’s go. I’ll take you to see Lin Yuan.”","This was the first time that An He was at the Return from Faraway Mansion.","Before he could even marvel at the Return from Faraway Mansion’s decorations and design, he spotted the glittering Submerged Flood Dragon Lake that was as bright as day.","The Mother of Bloodbath led An He to the edge of the Submerged Flood Dragon Lake.","Gao Feng and Lin Yuan immediately spotted An He with the Mother of Bloodbath.","Lin Yuan’s eyebrow twitched.","Gu Lang had just ended the call with Zong Ze and Gu Lang while Lin Yuan had also only just finished his call with An He.","So why was An He already here?","At that moment, An He waved at Lin Yuan and said, “Lin Yuan, count me in if you’re drinking!”","An He was very hard to get close to but warmed up quickly to those who he acknowledged.","This was the reason An He had called Lin Yuan his friend in front of Wang Ce.","Lin Yuan knew what kind of person An He was, so he said with a smile, “There’s no question that we have enough alcohol. Let me introduce you to a new friend.”","The Sudden Hibernating Wetland Dragon had the ability to change water and earth into each other.","An He lifted a leg and started walking on the surface of the Submerged Flood Dragon Lake. The water below his feet solidified into land.","He walked all the way to one of the pavilions.","Once An He took his next step, the land would turn back into water.","This change startled all the nearby Angelfish of Bloss, and the rainbows underwater started twisting even quicker.","Lin Yuan had told Gao Feng about his plan, so the latter knew that the approaching An He was Long Lamplight’s disciple who would very likely become his teammate in two days.","Hence, Gao Feng took the initiative to greet An He by reaching out his hand.","But what An He did next filled Gao Feng with awkwardness.","All An He did was nod at Gao Feng.","Not only did An He fail to take Gao Feng’s hand, but his gaze never left Lin Yuan.","At that moment, Gao Feng wanted to punch An He’s face.","He finally understood why Zong Ze and Gu Lang were not welcoming toward An He.","We’re all disciples of royalty, so why are you putting on airs? Zong Ze, Gu Lang, and Lin Yuan are even Creation Masters on top of being spirit qi professionals. Yet, none of them are as pompous as you!","Gao Feng rolled his eyes, picked up his cup, and said, “Lin Yuan, let’s continue drinking! I remember you arranging for the meetup to take place tomorrow afternoon. Yet, someone turned up uninvited.”","An He frowned when he heard what Gao Feng said, and a purple worm appeared on his shoulder.","Lin Yuan knew that An He was not on good terms with Gu Lang and Zong Ze. But now, An He and Gao Feng were also off to a bad start.","Lin Yuan suddenly felt a headache coming on.","He was friends with all of them, so there was nothing he could say.","At that moment, An He said, “I came to see Lin Yuan about official business. Unlike someone, I don’t have time to speak in riddles.”","Gao Feng immediately felt anger bubbling to the surface.","Are you actually a girl? You sure sound like one now! I tried to greet you and even extended my hand, but you chose to be unfriendly. Yet, you claim that I’m the one speaking in riddles and even summoned your fey. Do you think that you scare me? I only have support-type feys and might not be able to defeat you, but there’s no way that Lin Yuan will stand by and watch me get beaten up.","Lin Yuan felt his head start to throb.","He shuddered upon thinking about the commotion that would follow if An He kept up this attitude when Gu Lang and Zong Ze arrived.","Lin Yuan felt that An He was the one who had started the confrontation between him and Gao Feng.","Thus, Lin Yuan’s expression darkened, and he said to An He seriously, “During a time like this, all of us need to work together. I hope that we can all be friends regardless of what happened in the past. An He, introduce yourself to Gao Feng. Once Zong Ze and Gu Lang arrive, we shouldn’t fight amongst ourselves. If we don’t work together now, we won’t be worthy of becoming Radiance Envoys.”","Lin Yuan’s words stunned An He, and he felt slightly uncomfortable.","But An He was not an unreasonable person. Moreover, he had acknowledged Lin Yuan.","As such, he carefully contemplated what Lin Yuan had just said, and his knitted brow eventually relaxed.","He turned and said to Gao Feng, “My name is An He. I don’t like touching strangers. From now on, we can be counted as acquaintances.”","Gao Feng had guessed the type of person that An He was, so he decided to forget about An He’s recent attitude.","He was very touched that Lin Yuan stood up for him in front of another disciple of royalty."]},{"number":1621,"title":"Chapter 1621 - Something Wrong With An He!","paragraphs":["Chapter 1621: Something Wrong With An He!","Gao Feng said to An He, “Don’t worry. I’m just a support-type spirit qi professional and don’t have much combat ability on my own. If I’m ever lucky enough to fight alongside you, I hope that you’ll be able to protect me, and I will do my best to support all the combat-type spirit qi professionals in the team.”","Lin Yuan was a healing-type spirit qi professional but had not used any healing abilities during the Martial Arts Stage.","Rather, he only used his physical body and clashed against Zong Ze’s Diamond X/Fantasy V Life-Changing Fire Beast.","Although An He also declared himself to be a healing-type spirit qi professional, he had shown himself to be skilled at defense.","!!","This was the reason Gao Feng said what he said.","Gao Feng did not care that An He disliked being touched by strangers and just took it as An He had a lower EQ.","He could understand why a person would be averse to being touched by strangers.","Lin Yuan nodded at An He.","If An He knew how to back down when necessary, there was a possibility that he would not be too difficult to manage when Zong Ze and Gu Lang arrived.","At that moment, Lin Yuan remembered that An He went to take over the large whale fall because he wanted to obtain the pure water-elemental energy within.","It was clear that he wanted the water-elemental energy to evolve his feys.","The Sudden Hibernating Wetland Dragon was both water- and earth-type. Thus, An He did not need to choose between water-elemental energy and earth-elemental energy.","Moreover, most of An He’s feys were earth-type.","It was much more difficult to obtain natural pure earth-elemental energy than it was to obtain pure water-elemental energy.","It could be said that what An He truly lacked was earth-elemental energy.","But regardless of whether it was earth-elemental energy or water-elemental energy, Lin Yuan had more than enough of both.","If An He’s power could be increased at this juncture, it would only be beneficial for them.","Thus, Lin Yuan asked, “An He, has the Sudden Hibernating Wetland Dragon’s bloodline evolved yet?”","An He shook his head and replied, “Unless I’m able to encounter another large whale fall, I will need close to 1,000 earth-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls of at least Floating Life quality to transform the Sudden Hibernating Wetland Dragon.”","An He could not help but be frustrated.","His master was not a Creation Master, and it would be too much to ask of him to obtain so many high-purity heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","He could not go and beg the Moon Empress, and his Master was on bad terms with Chef Supreme and the Bamboo Monarch.","Hence, it would be more difficult for his master to obtain high-class Creation Master resources than it would be for the other members of royalty.","Lin Yuan was silent for a moment before he asked, “If you are able to obtain the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls you need, how long will your fey’s bloodline take to transform?”","Now that the Element Well appeared in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, Lin Yuan would be able to produce elemental energy purer than what was within Heavenly Maiden Sleet elemental pearls.","There was now enough water in the Element Well to fill half a bowl.","If Zong Ze’s Fiery Sky Hou was able to obtain fire-elemental energy that was purer than the one within it, there was a chance that its bloodline would be evolved again.","Lin Yuan did not immediately offer the water from the Element Well to Zong Ze because the Fiery Sky Hou would need more than a few days for its bloodline to be evolved.","Thus, even if Lin Yuan offered the water to Zong Ze, it would not help in their upcoming fight against the Freedom Federation during the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","If An He’s fey could evolve its bloodline and become stronger before the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection began, there would be no need for Lin Yuan to give him 1,000 heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","An He did not hesitate and told Lin Yuan about his situation.","“If I have enough heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, the Country Governor Kui and Sudden Hibernating Wetland Dragon will definitely be able to be evolved! It will take longer for the Country Governor Kui’s bloodline to be evolved, about a day. The other feys will be able to transform within two hours.”","Now that An He said this, Lin Yuan took out a wooden box and threw it at An He.","“There are 1,000 earth-type Defined Life elemental pearls. Now that you have time, you should go and evolve your power. If you can finish evolving your power by tomorrow night, we can talk then.”","After the Spirit Lock spatial zone evolved, it produced heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls at an astonishing rate.","The Wind Speed Rapid Antelope managed the Spirit Lock spatial zone. It separated the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls into different types and stored 1,000 of each type in a wooden box.","After only a few days, there were already over 20 Heavenly Maiden Sleet elemental pearls in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","From now on, Heavenly Maiden Sleet elemental pearls would be common goods in Lin Yuan’s eyes.","An He’s master was not a Creation Master. Thus, high-class Creation Master resources were all the more precious to him.","This was the reason he always fought with Zong Ze and Gu Lang over resources.","Now that Lin Yuan was giving him such a mountain of resources, An He felt as though there was no one in the world besides his master and senior brother who treated him better than Lin Yuan.","An He stared at Lin Yuan for a moment before he downed the wine in his cup.","“I’m going back now. I’ll return once my feys have evolved.”","Lin Yuan replied with a smile, “It will be too much trouble to travel back and forth. I have space here. Why don’t you evolve your feys here? You don’t have to try and be frugal with the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls. Just let me know if you don’t have enough. I have more.”","An He was at a loss about how he could thank Lin Yuan.","Gao Feng noticed that An He was looking at Lin Yuan with an increasingly strange gaze and hurriedly said, “Go and evolve your feys. Accidents might happen during the evolution. What if a day isn’t enough?”","Lin Yuan set An He up inside the Dome Guild Club.","After being assessed by the association, the Dome Guild Club’s sign had been put up.","Gao Feng said to Lin Yuan suggestively, “Friend, does your guild club still need members?”"]},{"number":1622,"title":"Chapter 1622 - Add a New Spark to the S Tournament!","paragraphs":["Chapter 1622: Add a New Spark to the S Tournament!","Gao Feng had always wanted to find a suitable guild club to participate in the S Tournament with.","Normally, the only place Gao Feng could fight was on Star Web, and it was always individual battles.","Individual battles were a nightmare for Gao Feng.","They recently implemented duo battles, where one was allowed to fight on the Celestial Stairway with a teammate.","!!","This new mode of battle was good news for healing- and support-type spirit qi professionals.","Healing-type and support-type spirit qi professionals could seek out a combat- or defense-type spirit qi professional to form a team with.","Healing-type and support-type spirit qi professionals could only show their true value when they had teammates.","However, duo battles did not bode well for Gao Feng either.","Pure support-type spirit qi professionals were very rare. Most support-type spirit qi professionals had some level of combat and controlling abilities.","A pure support-type spirit qi professional’s value could only be exhibited in a group with many people.","Even if Gao Feng did seek out a teammate to fight a duo battle with, he would only be a burden to them.","If Gao Feng’s partner could not take on two opponents at once, their opponents could just target and eliminate Gao Feng first.","After all, a pure support-type spirit qi professional was easy prey if he did not have many self-protection techniques. He could only continue living if his teammates protected him.","Given that Gao Feng was the only direct descendant of a top faction, it should be easy for him to find a powerful teammate for fighting a duo battle with him.","However, doing so would be meaningless for Gao Feng.","After Gao Feng became Cicada Song’s disciple, many top guild clubs approached him to try and recruit him.","However, he had turned all of them away.","He knew he was only invited because he was Cicada Song’s disciple.","Otherwise, it was rare for there to be a support-type spirit qi professional, even in a team of five members.","With a support-type spirit qi professional, there would only be four usable team members.","Unless all four members were strong enough, Gao Feng would not be able to be fully useful.","Thus, Gao Feng had no choice but to give up on the idea of participating in the S Tournament.","This had always been a sore spot for Gao Feng.","Now that an opportunity was suddenly presenting itself to Gao Feng, he was so excited that he started blinking continuously.","Gao Feng did not know if there were still available places in Lin Yuan’s Dome Guild Club’s main team.","Even if there was no place in the main team, he was also willing to be part of the reserve team.","After all, he was so familiar with Lin Yuan, and he could ask to be put in more often.","To Gao Feng, there was not much difference between being part of the main and reserve teams.","Lin Yuan was momentarily silent when he heard what Gao Feng said.","He had intended to invite Gao Feng to join Dome Guild Club after the Guard Ye Banquet ended.","But at that time, Gao Feng had just become a disciple of royalty and was busier than usual.","Thus, Lin Yuan decided to put off the invite till after the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","Yet now, Gao Feng stumbled on the fact that Lin Yuan had a guild club and even asked to join.","Alas, Lin Yuan was hesitant.","This was not because he was questioning Gao Feng’s eligibility but because Lin Yuan was unsure if he would even participate in the S Tournament.","Lin Yuan felt that, given his power, he would be a bully if he took part in the S Tournament.","Moreover, disciples of royalty never participated in the S Tournament.","Lin Yuan asked Gao Feng, “I was going to invite you to join the Dome Guild Club. It won’t be any problem for you to join. Liu Jie, Listen, Chu Ci, and I are members. Zhang Xiaobai, Xin Ying, Tan Ran, and Lu Pinru, who used to be part of the Extreme Guild Club, are members of Dome now too. Chu Ci and the four ex-members of the Extreme Guild Club make up the reserve team. Do you think it’s still appropriate for us to participate in the S Tournament?”","Gao Feng was stunned by what Lin Yuan said.","He’s right! I’m a disciple of royalty now. Everyone at the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection will know my identity. From now on, it will be inappropriate for me to participate in the S Tournament.","But now, Gao Feng felt rather indignant.","Why can’t disciples of royalty participate in the S Tournament? There isn’t such a rule laid out by the Guild Alliance! I might be a disciple of royalty, but I’m only 23 years old! The Guild Alliance’s rules state that any young expert in the Radiance Federation below the age of 30 can participate in the S Tournament!","Moreover, the popular participants of the S Tournament only retire at 30 years old. Long Tao, Shi Xu, and the rest are all stars of the S Tournament. Long Tao and Shi Xu are members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence but are allowed to join. How are disciples of royalty any different? I won’t be able to defeat either of them.","Thus, Gao Feng replied, “Friend, I think it’s doable. We’re still within the eligible range of age. So why can’t we join? I’m only 23 years old this year and should be able to take part for another seven years! Those few A-level guild clubs have always dominated the S Tournament. Dome can do whatever it can. With you and Chu Ci participating, our team has the youngest average age of members. It’s time for the S Tournament to change and for there to be some new sparks!”","Lin Yuan had felt that it would be no different from bullying if he took part in the S Tournament with his current power. But there was also no need for him to completely back out.","Firstly, his age fit the acceptable age range.","Secondly, Zhang Xiaobai, Lu Pinru, Tan Ran, and Xin Ying had been training non-stop for the past few months with the goal of participating in the S Tournament. If Dome did not participate in the S Tournament, it would be unfair to the four of them.","Thus, Lin Yuan said, “Okay! We’ll take part! After the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection ends, every time will return to calm. At that time, we’ll choose Dome’s final main team member! Zhang Xiaobai, Xin Ying, Lu Pinru, and Tan Ran will take part in the elimination rounds. We’ll decide on our next step after we get through to the round-robin.”","Lin Yuan felt that given the four of their powers, it would be easy for them to get through the elimination rounds.","Although the four of them had only comprehended one Willpower Rune, they were all B-rank spirit qi professionals.","Although Lu Pinru used to be C-rank, she broke through while she was in the Return from Faraway Mansion."]},{"number":1623,"title":"Chapter 1623 - Everyone Rejoices!","paragraphs":["Chapter 1623: Everyone Rejoices!","Also, after Master Hong Shen evolved their main feys, they had reached Platinum X.","This was the limit that a B-rank spirit qi professional could reach without using the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds to roll grades.","When Lin Yuan said that they were going to register, Gao Feng patted Lin Yuan’s shoulder and said, “Lin Yuan, to tell you the truth, this is a childhood dream come true for me! Thank you!”","Lin Yuan smiled back at Gao Feng and said, “There’s nothing to be thankful for! Other people might not think that support-type spirit qi professionals are worth much, but you are a treasure to our team!”","!!","Lin Yuan and Gao Feng were both free at the moment, unlike An He, who was in a rush to increase his power after obtaining resources.","This was because Lin Yuan and Gao Feng had already reached their peak battle state.","Zong Ze and Gu Lang arrived together in the evening, and Liu Jie returned not long after them.","An He had finished unexpectedly quickly.","After the six of them greeted each other, they sat soberly around a table in one of the pavilions on the Submerged Flood Dragon Lake.","Blue Lotus, Blood New Moon, White Phoenix, and the Mother of Bloodbath watched the young men speaking at the center of the Submerged Flood Dragon Lake.","They felt that this conversation seemed like a version of the imperial meeting with younger members.","The six young men were all considered the cream of the crop of the Radiance Federation.","There were only five Radiance Envoy spots.","That elderly man also had a direct descendant who was definitely going to participate in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","Thus, it would be impossible for all six of them to become Radiance Envoys.","But even if they did not become Radiance Envoys, they would still become members of the royalty in the future and protect the Radiance Federation.","With such an outstanding batch of young people, the Radiance Federation’s future was sure to be bright.","...","Wind was always freezing at the highest peaks.","Although it was still warm and sunny on the ground with blooming almond flowers, the winds at high altitudes could still cut through iron boards.","The real imperial meeting would last for two days.","Lin Yuan and the rest were preparing for battle.","However, this year’s Radiance Hundred Sequence selection was going to be much more crowded than in previous years.","In previous years, the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection took place in the Radiance Sacred Hall, and spectatorship was controlled.","Regular citizens could not watch the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection, only the final ten who were chosen and their fight against the current 90 members.","In spite of this, the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection was always much more crowded than the S Tournament.","Only the S Tournament’s finals and Allstar Match attracted crowds that could be compared to that of the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","But this year, the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection’s structure had changed, and this was also the first year that it would be taking place on Star Web, where it would be broadcast to the public.","Throughout the selection, any citizen of the Radiance Federation who had access to Star Web would be able to watch.","Normally, the people who were chosen came from those who had already been picked by 36 cities’ City Lords.","For example, Chu Ci caught Ling Xiao’s attention back in Redbud City.","Some of the City Lords’ chosen people did not have favorable reputations in other cities. Still, they were considered geniuses in their home cities and represented their city’s best and brightest.","As such, there were always people wildly rejoicing when people from their city were chosen to be part of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","A month ago, the cities had sent out their chosen members and drummed up a huge commotion.","Besides the people the cities sent, some powerful members of the Guild Alliance used their connections to be sponsored as contenders for the selection.","There were also people like Lin Yuan who made a name for themselves and managed to be eligible of their own accord.","The Radiance Sacred Hall strictly controlled the eligible contestants.","Hence, there were usually around 10,000 contestants for every Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","But this year, the eligibility was relaxed to accommodate the fact that the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection was taking place on Star Web this year.","In order to encourage the younger generation to expand their horizons and find the motivation to push forward, any person below 20 years old who owned Silver feys and those between 20 and 30 years old who owned Gold feys were allowed to participate.","However, every contestant’s personality and background were also checked thoroughly.","Their traits would be compared against the list of qualities that the members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence should have that the Radiance Federation’s royalty came up with.","There were special teams on Star Web who designed the battleground for the selection.","They designed a 1,000 square meter space with several open dimensional rifts.","All the contestants would enter the space together.","This method of testing was more comprehensive than just fighting on a stage because it would only test a person’s combat abilities.","Meanwhile, this style of testing would also test a person’s adaptive abilities, survival instincts, battle knowledge, and even interpersonal skills.","These abilities might not be as direct of a way to test one’s strength, but they were all necessary.","This was the reason the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection was mostly made up of healing-type spirit qi professionals.","A team would have a higher chance of surviving in the wild than individuals did.","Moreover, it was easy to tell one’s true colors if they saw their teammates as competitors.","The Radiance Hundred Sequence selection was the Radiance Federation’s way of passing on its legacy.","The members of royalty were all taking this change in structure seriously.","With Mystic Moon’s breakthrough, Star Web had improved, and the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection’s location was even more complete.","At that moment, every post on Star Web was about this matter.","Even the Purchase With No Loss store was not excluded from this.","At that moment, an elderly man watching the selection inside the Radiance Sacred Hall saw an elegant man appear behind him.","The elderly man turned and said, “Long Lamplight, how can you be in the Radiance Sacred Hall at such a time? Are you here to check on the space like I am? I have to admit that the design is pretty good! The dimensional rifts will open at the same time and will remain open for 72 hours. Three days of struggle will be the only way to push these imps to their limits.”","Ji Changdeng’s lips twitched.","The old man usually seemed amiable and friendly, but he was actually a Pandora’s Box."]},{"number":1624,"title":"Chapter 1624 - Radiance Envoy, Liu Yifan!","paragraphs":["Chapter 1624: Radiance Envoy, Liu Yifan!","There was so much more to him than what met the eye!","The Moon Empress had been the one who suggested the change in this year’s Radiance Hundred Sequence structure, but Liu Wencheng was the one who was truly behind the design.","Even the creation of the battleground and the types of dimensional rifts that were opened were all spearheaded by Liu Wencheng.","The Radiance Hundred Sequence selection used to be over in a day, but it took three days now.","!!","But there was no denying that the more danger a person was in, the less able they would be to keep their true colors to themselves.","People could manage their emotions and put on a facade for a day.","When Mystic Moon’s power increased, Star Web’s sensitivity was raised significantly as well because he was in charge of Star Web’s spiritual sensitivity.","Now, being injured on Star Web would feel the same as being injured in real life.","Many people had discovered this while fighting on the Celestial Stairway.","Luckily, Star Web’s sensitivity could be manually adjusted.","If it was adjusted to 10%, one would not feel weak even in a near-dead state.","However, in order to make their live streams exciting and generate more popularity for themselves, many Star Web hosts set their sensitivity to 100%.","As a result, they could not act as cavalierly as they used to while fighting.","Although dying on Star Web would not affect their true selves, they would still feel the pain of a gaping wound and their vitality slipping away.","As such, none of the hosts dared to drop their guard for fear of experiencing what it would be like to die.","The hosts who could not take it anymore would lower the sensitivity.","However, this added a layer of excitement for the spectators of the fights.","Now, they liked watching the hosts be driven into a corner after taking several hits, and the live-streaming rooms with the most comments were also the ones that had 100% sensitivity.","Many second-level Star Web hosts pushed themselves to turn up the sensitivity to 100% and went viral.","In less than two days, there was an unspoken fact known amongst Star Web hosts that those who did not set their sensitivity to 100% would inevitably lose a good portion of their audience.","The members of royalty had expected that adding the sensitivity setting to Star Web would lead to people going full throttle.","Now that the Class 6 abyss dimensional rift had opened in the Radiance Federation, every spirit qi professional would be able to enter it to develop themselves.","The Radiance Federation had also set itself firmly against the Freedom Federation.","This was the beginning of an era where spirit qi professionals had to possess some level of bloodthirst.","At 100% sensitivity, the Star Web fights would feel like they have real stakes of life or death.","This would train their entire population.","Presently, the sensitivity could be weakened, and most of the Star Web users could continue to watch the Star Web hosts with blissful naivety.","However, they had no idea that it was decided at an imperial meeting that after the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection, only those of advanced age would be allowed to set their sensitivity below 60%.","Everyone else’s sensitivity would be automatically locked at 100%.","This would truly change Star Web into another world where spirit qi professionals would be able to revive themselves constantly.","Ji Changdeng shook his head and said, “Wencheng, I’m in no mood to admire the design. Those brats are in for a hard time with you at the helm. 10,000 square meters, 20 dimensional rifts, and three days. The alien beasts will have taken up every corner of the space in just half a day. Wencheng, are you trying to induce the true meaning of being a hero from this event or test to see how dark the human heart can actually be?”","“The true meaning of being a hero won’t emerge from this Radiance Hundred Sequence selection. Black and Cicada Song’s disciple Gao Feng will definitely tamper with the balance. Do you remember what Cicada Song said during the imperial meeting? He said that the Alleviating Wind is no longer the strongest support-type sacred source lifeform and that the title now belongs to his disciple’s sacred source lifeform!","“Can you imagine how powerful Gao Feng’s sacred source lifeform must be for the humble Cicada Song to say such a thing? Black and Gao Feng will eventually be fighting for the sake of the Radiance Federation, and they’re the true heroes of the selection. As for the darkness of the human heart, I’m sure we’ll see a fair share of that,” replied Liu Wencheng.","Ji Changdeng nodded.","In order for a person to achieve something, they could choose to attack their teammates at the right time.","But if they did this, they would be crossing over to the dark side.","Dangers would abound during the battle. It would be impossible for anyone to get any sleep during that time.","If a person did not sleep for three days straight, their exhaustion would lead them to act on instinct.","There had been people within the Radiance Sacred Hall who had failed in terms of character and were rejected by Liu Wencheng.","But now that the method of selection had changed, it would be impossible for these people to even appear amongst the Radiance Hundred Sequence anymore.","Ji Changdeng had come to see Liu Wencheng about serious business.","Thus, he took a step forward and said, “All the current Radiance Envoys are out training. Yet, a Freedom Envoy has arrived from the Freedom Federation. The girl leading the group from the Azure Federation is also the current fourth Azure Envoy. Thus, that old man decided to recall Yifan as an added level of protection.”","Liu Wencheng fell silent for a moment before commenting. “Yifan has evolved his fey with the Barren bloodline in the mystic realm. Now, the other four are lagging slightly behind. You’re probably the one who suggested this!”","Ji Changdeng nodded.","“Yifan is a power offense-type spirit qi professional who also has strong defense abilities. He is more suitable than the other four to watch over the situation.”","Ji Changdeng’s voice was full of pride when he mentioned Liu Yifan.","Liu Yifan was Ji Changdeng’s first disciple and An He’s senior brother.","Compared to An He, who rarely left the house and had an eccentric temper, there was no doubt that Ji Changdeng placed more hope in Liu Yifan.","But given that An He was his youngest disciple, there was no question that Ji Changdeng spoiled An He slightly more than Liu Yifan.","“An He might be able to take part in next year’s Radiance Envoy selection. However, the current Radiance Envoys will have to be the ones to step in during the Major Federation Meeting two years later. Those chosen next year can only be the reserves and gain experience,” said Liu Wencheng."]},{"number":1625,"title":"Chapter 1625 - Lin Yuan is Called a Fake Fan!","paragraphs":["Chapter 1625: Lin Yuan is Called a Fake Fan!","Ji Changdeng nodded.","He felt that the two generations of Radiance Envoys, who had a gap of three years between them, could not be compared.","After all, every batch of chosen Radiance Envoys was regarded as the strongest people of that generation. One year made a great difference!","Ji Changdeng had come to see Liu Wencheng because he wanted to ask him to add a seat for Liu Yifan in the audience stands.","The Radiance Envoys represented the entire Radiance Federation’s younger generation, and they were only second to the members of royalty. The words they said carried almost as much weight as the members of royalty.","The change in Star Web’s sensitivity affected every Star Web user.","However, this topic’s popularity was overtaken by the conversations surrounding the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","When Lu Shuang lost to Black, she assumed that her popularity would take a hit.","But instead, she became even more popular than ever.","This allowed her to understand the extent of Black’s popularity.","Lu Shuang had been tracking Black’s movements of late.","Ever since he fought against her, he had now shown up on Star Web and had not even accepted an interview after the fight.","As Black’s exclusive reporter, Tian Ningning also had not released any private interviews that she did with him.","Through this, Lu Shuang became aware that Black could not care less about his popularity.","Nonetheless, Black’s persisting popularity proved how charismatic and alluring he was.","Lu Shuang felt that part of Black’s attraction came from how mysterious he was.","Even after deep pondering, Lu Shuang could not figure out how to replicate that same shroud of mystery.","This was because his mystery stemmed from the string of miracles that he created.","He had beaten all 100 levels on Star Tower, made it to the Celestial Stairway, become god-class, and even taken the record for the most consecutive wins on the Celestial Stairway, replacing the one set by a Radiance Envoy.","Black’s talent only intensified his mystique.","Moreover, no one knew what his feys were.","Although so much time had passed, he was still the seventh most trending search topic, while his eight-tailed cat took the ninth spot.","Lu Shuang had never seen someone remain on the most-searched list for so long.","At that moment, Lu Shuang was not fighting on the Celestial Stairway because she realized that talking about Black in her live stream brought a lot more income.","River Tea: Shuang, do you think that Black will be able to successfully become a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence?","Lu Shuang immediately replied, “Let’s go! Bets are starting in my live-streaming room! I bet that Black will not only be able to become a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence but that he will even manage to become Sequence #90!”","Lu Shuang turned on the betting function in her live-streaming room.","But even after some time passed, not many people placed bets against her.","Clearly, the general consensus was that Black would be able to attain Sequence #90.","Lu Shuang had fought against many members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence and even won against the top 20 members.","Everyone now saw Black as being powerful enough to become one of the top 20 members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Lu Shuang was unaffected by the lack of bets against her as they would all end up losing.","Another comment appeared.","Devil in Heaven: Shuang, I want to hear you talk about Black’s eight-tailed cat.","Lu Shuang had already replied to this matter many times.","Devil in Heaven was one of Lu Shuang’s old fans, and people always showered her with gifts when she addressed the matter.","“Black’s eight-tailed cat reflected the Exquisite Rhino Giraffe’s spiritual attack. So, it definitely is a spiritual-type fey! Given Black’s age, there’s no way that he’s an A-rank spirit qi professional. This means that he has rolled grades! That eight-tailed cat is Diamond X/Fantasy V. It is not a Myth Breed fey like what some analysts said. This, I can be sure of!”","After chatting about Black for a while, the comments about the Radiance Hundred Sequence started to increase in quantity.","Unplanned Meeting: This Radiance Hundred Sequence selection has a completely different structure from the past! It’s so cool that it’s being broadcast on Star Web! Shuang, you should live stream then! I will definitely watch it! According to the official information, it will be broadcast from different angles. We will focus on Black. I don’t believe that Black will be able to refrain from summoning a single fey throughout the entire Radiance Hundred Sequence selection!","Lu Shuang’s eyes lit up, and she replied, “Good idea! The Radiance Hundred Sequence selection will be starting tomorrow. I will be live-streaming from Black’s angle. Please come and watch! If Black does well, don’t forget to leave me gifts!”","This immediately triggered another wave of comments.","All a Dream: It’s so shameless for a host to ask for gifts!","Soundless Laughter: Shuang has been led to the dark side! She’s been trying to gain gifts by taking advantage of Black! Although you don’t act like a woman, you are still a woman. I’ll give you gifts daily if you manage to woo him into your clutches!","Moonlight: Go and grab snacks! All the snacks on Star Web have become more expensive! If you don’t grab them now, you won’t have anything to eat when you’re watching tomorrow!","Every citizen of the Radiance Federation was looking forward to the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection!","The 100 Buildings near the Radiance Sacred Hall were now open and filled with the chosen participants from the major cities.","The 100 Buildings was now a collection of the Radiance Federation’s best and brightest.","All of them were waiting for tomorrow to come.","A young man staying in one of the single suites in the 100 Buildings was buttoning his collar.","The silver mask he was wearing hid his facial features.","However, his bone structure was so exceptional that he still exuded a magnificent beauty despite wearing the mask.","This person was Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan did not expect to have fans amongst the major cities’ chosen participants.","They were all wearing silver masks, and everyone besides Lin Yuan who passed by them mistook them for Black.","After Genius’ bloodline transformed, the silver mask also changed significantly.","When he returned to the accommodation, a girl had even sneered at him and called him one of Black’s fake fans because his mask was wrong.","After buttoning his collar, Lin Yuan thought, By now, Liu Jie has probably arrived in the Radiance Sacred Hall and is going through the ranking!"]},{"number":1626,"title":"Chapter 1626 - The Test Before the Selection!","paragraphs":["Chapter 1626: The Test Before the Selection!","Liu Jie had actually completed the Radiance Hundred Sequence ranking and had come in at Sequence #30, reclaiming his title of Heart of the Insect Swarm.","Liu Jie could regain his ranking because it was an honor that the Radiance Sacred Hall bestowed on heroes.","When the Insect Queen had been in a near-dead state that not even the Bamboo Monarch could heal, Liu Jie had no choice but to pull out of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Liu Jie had been so depressed he hid from the rest of the world and became a hermit.","!!","But now that the Insect Queen had healed, it was only natural for Liu Jie to return to the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Liu Jie’s return would undoubtedly make this year’s Radiance Hundred Sequence selection even more exciting.","Sequence #91 to Sequence #100 should be the ones to fight against the new contenders.","But now that Liu Jie beat out the original Sequence #30 Lan Baobao, the Sequences below Sequence #30 all shifted down a spot.","There could only be 100 members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Thus, the original Sequence #90 would now be part of the fray as well, and there would be 11 members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence taking on the new contenders during the selection.","This undoubtedly made this year’s selection even more competitive.","Due to Star Web’s update, Liu Wencheng had decided that this year’s Radiance Hundred Sequence would be taking place on Star Web.","Every member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence was eyeing the Radiance Envoy selection that would be taking place a year later.","Although many of them felt they would definitely fail, they would still fight for the chance to be a Radiance Knight.","Those who had been keeping their true powers under wraps would be showing their hands now.","This was because only the top 30 members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence were eligible to become a Radiance Envoy or Radiance Knight.","Liu Jie was aware of this and thus made sure that he just made the cut at Sequence #30.","But now, Liu Jie knew that Lin Yuan was going to announce his identity as the Moon Empress’ disciple and that he was Black at the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","Since Lin Yuan was going to reveal how outstanding he truly was, Liu Jie had to follow him as his retainer knight.","Liu Jie was not intending to hide his power at the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection like he did last time.","Rather, he was going to try and attain Sequence #1.","The Radiance Hundred Sequence’s Sequence #1 had remained tightly in the grip of a girl.","Many members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence had missed out on the chance to compete to become a Radiance Envoy but had also reached the age limit.","At that time, they would exhibit their power.","The best opponents for these people would be Sequence #1 of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, Xia Qing.","Three years ago, despite not having even reached 20 years old, Xia Qing had passed the selection and become a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","At that time, she had been a black horse that appeared like a force of nature.","Before her appearance, there had been no news of her on Star Web.","In her second year, when she was Sequence #91, she beat out Sequence #1 of her batch Li Ang. As a result, he fell to Sequence #2.","From the moment she reached the top, Xia Qing requested to change her title from Lack of Oxygen to Fable.","After her title changed, Xia Qing said, “I have to become a Radiance Envoy.”","The meaning behind her title did not have to be analyzed.","News about Fable caused a serious buzz amongst that batch of Radiance Hundred Sequence members.","Many of them had been curious about Xia Qing’s identity, and Liu Jie was no exception.","Many guild clubs had sent her invitations, including the Rhine Guild Club and Dragon Gate Guild Club.","Almost every A-level guild club had sent her an invite.","Given her identity as Sequence #1, she would boost any team.","Moreover, she was powerful enough that Li Ang could not even hold out more than 20 moves against her.","Li Ang had summoned four feys, while Xia Qing only summoned two.","Besides special circumstances like what happened to Liu Jie, the other members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence usually contracted three feys and more as well as some source-type lifeforms.","Thus, Xia Qing had not used her full power against Li Ang yet had been able to crush him.","Liu Jie had been curious about Xia Qing’s background.","She did not come from any veteran or top faction. Otherwise, those within the Radiance Hundred Sequence who came from top and veteran factions would have recognized her.","Moreover, Xia Qing was a recluse.","Besides the annual Radiance Hundred Sequence ranking, she only appeared when she had to announce matters for the Radiance Sacred Hall.","Liu Jie had been unaware of Xia Qing’s background, but he learned about it after becoming Night Leaning Moon’s disciple.","It turned out that she was the granddaughter of that old man.","During this year’s ranking, Liu Jie had focused on her so that he would be able to properly test himself against her.","There was a stage at the front of the Radiance Sacred Hall’s main hall.","At that moment, Liu Wencheng was standing on that stage.","There were five seats below the stage that were usually empty as they were reserved for the Radiance Envoys.","There were 100 seats behind the five seats, and Liu Jie was seated on one of them.","Normally, the Radiance Hundred Sequence members had their designated seats and could not sit anywhere else.","However, there was one day a year when there was an exception, and that was during the ranking.","It was only on this day that there was free seating.","Bai Hao, who was seated next to Liu Jie, asked him, “Jie, why do I feel like you’re different than usual? There is a strong fire in your eyes! Are you planning on climbing even higher?”","Liu Jie nodded.","Wang Fan rubbed his hands together and said, “Bai Hao, out of the three of us, your rank is the lowest now. If you put in real effort, you can break past Sequence #79. Won’t it feel good to reach Sequence #50 and above?”","Bai Hao shrugged.","He was not interested in his Radiance Hundred Sequence ranking.","Bai Hao was well aware that his feys were rather unorthodox. They had explosive power but were not made for endurance battles.","After three moves, they would be as good as useless.","Given his unique battle style, he was not suited to become a Radiance Knight or Radiance Envoy."]},{"number":1627,"title":"Chapter 1627 - Liu Jie is Stunned By a Question!","paragraphs":["Chapter 1627: Liu Jie is Stunned By a Question!","Thus, Bai Hao did not care about his Radiance Hundred Sequence ranking.","When Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess had come under fire due to the misunderstanding over the Warm Sun Fund, Bai Hao had not been able to provide any practical help.","All he could do was voice his support on Star Web.","As a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, positioning himself directly against those attacking Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess resulted in him appearing on Star Web’s most-searched topics list.","!!","But the next day, the tides had been turned.","Before Bai Hao could jump for joy, he realized that Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess had stopped live-streaming since then.","After going several days without Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess’ live streams, all of his thoughts surrounded how she had been attacked and under suspicion.","She must have been so upset!","Bai Hao badly wanted to comfort her, but she had not even shown a strand of hair on Star web since then. Hence, he could not comfort her no matter how much he wanted to.","Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess had revealed that she was acquainted with Black.","Bai Hao had even thought about trying to contact Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess through Black so that he would be able to comfort her privately.","But now that the Radiance Hundred Sequence ranking was taking place, he had no choice but to invest his efforts into increasing his power.","If he used his full power, there was a chance that he would be able to become one of the top 50 members.","If his enemies pinpointed his weaknesses, they might also be able to kick him down from his position of Sequence #79.","Sequence #91 to #100 had only joined last year, and many of them were strong.","There were even a few of them who had the potential to reach the top 50.","Although Bai Hao was currently Sequence #79, many sharks lurked below him.","The oldest of these people were mostly 26 or 27 years old, while the youngest ones were 22 or 23 years old.","Given their ages, they were all eligible to fight for a chance to be Radiance Envoys.","Thus, all of them were going to reveal their true powers.","If Bai Hao did not increase his power, he would be humiliated if he was kicked out of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Thus, Bai Hao decided to put off asking Black about Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess’ contact details until the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection ended.","“Forget about the top 50. I just need to keep myself in the top 80.”","Bai Hao looked at Liu Jie with gratitude and said, “Jie, where are all of your recent riches coming from? You lent me 80,000 Radiance dollars at once and even gave me spiritual ingredients that would be difficult to purchase with money. Do you still have enough left for yourself?”","Wang Fan said, “Jie, I used the spiritual ingredients you gave me but didn’t spend the money. You managed to make it to Sequence #30. If you continue trying to climb the ranks, you’ll definitely be able to fight for a chance to become a Radiance Envoy! You have much more potential than Bai Hao and me. We are even considering leaving our resources to you so you can use them to increase your power!”","Before Liu Jie got to know Lin Yuan, he shared resources with Wang Fan and Bai Hao.","If there was any time when one of the three needed money, the other two would not hold back.","Liu Jie had also received significant help from Wang Fan and Bai Hao in the past.","Without them, the Insect Queen would have been able to gain the rare insect-species feys that were the Lightning Gathering Moths.","After Liu Jie became Lin Yuan’s retainer, he could not use Lin Yuan’s resources to help Bai Hao and Wang Fan.","But after he became Night Leaning Moon’s disciple, she gave him a mountain of resources.","Lin Yuan and Night Leaning Moon had prepared all the resources that Liu Jie would need to increase his power.","Thus, Liu Jie gave all the resources he had on hand to Wang Fan and Bai Hao two weeks ago to help them to increase their power.","When he heard how concerned Wang Fan and Bai Hao were for him, Liu Jie smiled and said, “I no longer need resources to increase my power. The resources will be better off used to help the two of you increase your powers.”","Liu Jie’s words were so filled with confidence that he seemed almost pompous.","What did he mean by no longer needing resources to increase his power?","Wang Fan and Bai Hao had not seen the Insect Queen in a long time.","Could it be that the Insect Queen had evolved to Diamond X/Fantasy V?","Wang Fan and Bai Hao hastily shook their heads.","That level of power would be that of a disciple of royalty.","Only six months had passed since the Insect Queen’s roots had healed, and there was no way that it could have evolved so rapidly.","At that moment, Shi Xu said, “Liu Jie, you were Black’s partner in all the duo Celestial Stairway battles that he participated in. You know him, right?”","Liu Jie turned toward Shi Xu and nodded.","Liu Jie knew that Shi Xu, Long Tao, Zhao Xiaochun, Fang Duoduo, and the rest had all brushed past death alongside Lin Yuan in the dimensional rift and that they were all his friends.","“Yes, I know Black.”","Shi Xu immediately slapped Liu Jie’s shoulder and asked, “Then, do you know what kind of fey Black’s eight-tailed cat is? When I fought abyss demons with him, he used two plant-type feys. One of them was healing-type, while the other could unleash a lethal sea of flowers. I’ve never seen him use cat-species feys!”","Shi Xu’s words attracted the attention of numerous members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence who were close by.","Almost every member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence had watched the match between Black and Lu Shuang, but none of them were able to figure out the secret of the phantom image of the eight-tailed cat.","Lu Shuang’s Diamond X/Fantasy IV Earth-Walking Witch Snake and Diamond X/Fantasy V Exquisite Rhino Giraffe’s powers exceeded the combat powers of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Although all of them hid their powers, their true powers still did not reach Lu Shuang’s level.","Every member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence was younger than 30 years old, while Lu Shuang was already 37 years old.","With such a large age gap, there was no way to make a fair comparison.","After another seven or eight years, the current members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence would be able to reach the same level of power as Lu Shuang or even become more powerful than her.","During the Starlight Dueling Ground battle, Black used an unknown tactic to defeat Lu Shuang.","Black’s performance and powers caused a commotion in the Radiance Hundred Sequence’s group chat.","All of the members were certain that Black would become a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence and that Liu Wencheng would soon add him to the group chat.","A few of them had already begun to discuss what his title would be.","Shi Xu’s question left Liu Jie stunned."]},{"number":1628,"title":"Chapter 1628 - Is It That Delicious?","paragraphs":["Chapter 1628: Is It That Delicious?","Liu Jie had been training in the Spirit Guards’ land and immediately joined the discussion with Lin Yuan, Gao Feng Zong Ze, Gu Lang, and An He when he returned.","After the discussion, he received Liu Wencheng’s order and headed to the Radiance Sacred Hall.","He barely had time to eat or drink in the two weeks that he had been in seclusion.","Each time he had the chance to eat, he would eat as quickly as if he was training in the wild and finish within three minutes.","This was so he would be able to spend more time increasing his power.","As such, he had not had the time to log onto Star Web and learn about recent events.","Because of this, Shi Xu’s question befuddled Liu Jie.","Eight-tailed cat? Could he be referring to Genius, who spent its day clinging and nuzzling up to Lin Yuan?","Liu Jie was not a Creation Master and could not see a fey’s abilities and exclusive skills. But he was able to tell what their grades were.","In Liu Jie’s memory, Genius had been Diamond I/Fantasy III when he last saw it.","Moreover, Liu Jie had assumed that Genius was a support-type fey because it had used Connected Tails on him.","Wang Fan had mentioned the fight between Black and Lu Shuang.","Before the Insect Queen’s roots were injured, Liu Jie had encountered Lu Shuang on the Celestial Stairway in the past.","At that time, she had not attained the level of power that she had now.","Liu Jie was skilled at formation battles because of the Insect Queen’s combat skills.","However, the battles on the Celestial Stairway took place at random locations, and there were no bunkers at the locations.","Hence, it was very difficult to succeed by using formations.","Liu Jie had lost to Lu Shuang and was well aware of how powerful the Exquisite Rhino Giraffes and two Earth Walking Witch Snakes were.","If not for the fact that they were currently in the Radiance Sacred Hall, Liu Jie would have immediately logged onto Star Web to watch the battle between Black and Lu Shuang.","Genius was a support-type fey.","Liu Jie was shocked when he heard that Genius managed to defend against one of Lu Shuang’s full-strength attacks.","Liu Jie suddenly realized that he really did not understand Lin Yuan.","He did not even know Lin Yuan as well as Genius.","Since he did not have the answers, he could not give Shi Xu a reply.","Moreover, Liu Jie would never expose the details of Lin Yuan’s feys.","Luckily, Shi Xu had only asked because he had never seen Black’s cat-species fey before.","Liu Jie nodded and said, “Black does have a cat-species fey called Genius.”","Liu Jie’s words were like bait that hooked the others’ interest.","If Liu Wencheng was not currently standing on the stage, all the members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence would have crowded around Liu Jie.","At first, they all assumed that Liu Jie would continue talking.","But Liu Jie did not go on to mention the eight-tailed cat.","Shi Xu blinked and thought, Hello? Are you going to stop at merely telling us the cat-species fey’s name? What’s the point in us knowing that it’s called Genius? What about its abilities and exclusive skills? We want to know how it managed to block one of Lu Shuang’s full-power attacks!","Li Ang was also extremely curious and was about to ask a question when a short-haired girl dressed in silver half-armor walked in.","Once she walked in, all discussions that were going on stopped, and she became the center of attention.","Li Ang stared fearfully at the girl, and all his curiosity about Black vanished. He still remembered fighting her three years ago when he was 22 years old, and she was 19 years old.","During the fight, she had toyed with him and had no intention of retaliating against him.","That battle had ripped apart Li Ang’s pride.","He had been training doggedly for the past three years so that he would be able to clash against her again at this year’s Radiance Hundred Sequence ranking.","He was not expecting to overturn his embarrassing defeat. He just wanted to see if he had managed to close the gap between them in the past three years.","Long Tao walked over and sat next to Bai Hao before asking Liu Jie, “All of us have three chances to challenge. Once the last chance is used, our ranks will be confirmed. We will have to wait to be challenged if we want to change ranks in the future. If you want to climb the ranks, why don’t I challenge you so that you can defeat me and take my rank? This will save you one of your own challenges, and you will be able to make it further.”","There were many rules within the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Those of higher ranks could challenge those of lower ranks at any time, but those of lower ranks could only challenge those ten ranks above them.","As such, if one hid too much of their power and ended up in the bottom 60 ranks, they would only be able to reach the top 30 at best unless someone of a higher rank challenged them.","But once a challenge failed, they could still continue to challenge until they used up his three chances.","This would give the challenger time to learn about their opponent and come up with a battle strategy.","Long Tao had spoken softly, and only Bai Hao and Liu Jie had heard him.","Astonishment spread across Bai Hao’s face.","What was Long Tao saying? He implied that he would not be able to defeat Liu Jie and wanted to help Liu Jie.","Long Tao was Sequence #3 of the Radiance Hundred Sequence and was the Young Leader of Coiling Dragon’s Valley.","He was always cruel and standoffish toward outsiders and only smiled at his teammates.","When did Liu Jie and Long Tao become so well-acquainted?","Additionally, Long Tao seemed to be certain that Liu Jie would be able to defeat him.","One could not put up too much pretense during the Radiance Hundred Sequence rankings because Liu Wencheng forbade it.","When they gathered together at Zong Ze’s place, Long Tao, Li Xuan, Gao Feng, Zong Ze, Gu Lang, and the rest had discovered that Liu Jie was the Night Empress’ disciple and that the Guard Ye Banquet had been held for his benefit.","The Radiance Envoy selection would be taking place next year.","At that time, all of them were going to try out, including Liu Jie.","Liu Jie nodded and said, “Thank you, I do want to see how far I can go!”","Liu Jie’s gaze fell on Xia Qing, and shock soon appeared in his eyes.","Zhao Xiaochun had taken a seat next to Xia Qing and handed her a braised pig trotter.","Zhao Xiaochun herself was holding and happily gnawing on another pig trotter. It seemed delicious."]},{"number":1629,"title":"Chapter 1629 - The Ranking Begins!","paragraphs":["Chapter 1629: The Ranking Begins!","Not only did Xia Qing not reject Zhao Xiaochun’s offer, but she received the pig trotter without hesitation and started munching on it.","Although Xia Qing ate much more elegantly than Zhao Xiaochun, she was not any slower.","It was at this moment that Liu Jie suddenly recalled the rumor that Zhao Xiaochun sometimes brought along a wingman with her when she terrorized hotel buffets.","Could it be that Xia Qing was the wingman?","Suddenly, the image of Xia Qing that had been built up in their minds crumbled.","Shi Xu was the only one who remained calm.","Ever since he opened the House of Enviable Fragrance, Shi Xu had essentially placed shackles on Zhao Xiaochun, and she no longer frequented other restaurants.","For the sake of love, Shi Xu went back to being the Working Emperor so he could earn enough to feed her.","During this time, he noticed that Zhao Xiaochun often brought Xia Qing with her to the house of Enviable Fragrance.","After getting into a relationship with Zhao Xiaochun, Shi Xu realized that she ate continuously because of a source-type lifeform she had contracted.","By eating, she was increasing the source-type lifeform’s power.","Evidently, this was the case for Xia Qing as well.","There was once when Xia Qing was feasting in the House of Enviable Fragrance that a strange noise appeared from within her body.","It sounded like the low growl of a beast.","But Shi Xu had never seen Xia Qing summon a beast-type fey that made such a noise during battle.","Xia Qing hid it too well!","Liu Wencheng stood on the stage and gazed with pride at the 100 people below him who represented the best and brightest of the Radiance Federation’s younger generation.","Inside the hall, a large bronze clock rang out as it struck 12.","Every member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence straightened this posture and looked at Liu Wencheng.","At that moment, the Radiance Hundred Sequence’s ranking was going to officially begin.","Liu Wencheng announced, “In the past, the rankings took place on battle stages. That structure was unfair to many people’s fighting styles. This time, the ranking is going to take place on Star Web.","“Although it will still be one-on-one battles which are disadvantageous for support-type and healing-type spirit qi professionals, the battleground has been expanded to a square kilometer. Grassland, a mountain, a river, trenches, a forest, and a desert can be found within the area. The ground is also uneven.","“With such a battleground, all of you should be able to sufficiently make use of your combat styles. In past years’ rankings, all of you always held back. But this time, you can give it your all.”","Many members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence inhaled sharply.","Frankly, most of them had guessed that this year’s Radiance Hundred Sequence ranking would take place on Star Web.","After Star Web was updated, the members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence had fought on the Celestial Stairway and sparred against their teammates on Star Web with the sensitivity set at maximum so that they would be able to experience what it was like to die over and over.","This realistic experience of dying was completely different from what it used to be like fighting on the Celestial Stairway.","When the Radiance Hundred Sequence members were out on assignments, they often got injured and brushed against death. However, none of them had truly experienced death.","Those who had experienced death recoiled at the memory.","At that moment, Liu Wencheng changed the topic and said, “In February of next year, the Radiance Envoy selection will take place, and the next Radiance Hundred Sequence ranking will only happen in March. Thus, this is your last chance to show what you’re capable of. Let me see if you are truly worthy of being part of the Radiance Hundred Sequence!”","While he spoke, Liu Wencheng’s gaze fell on Xia Qing and Liu Jie.","Xia Qing was done eating by the time the bronze clock rang and had stored the bones inside a Diamond fey storage box.","On the other hand, Zhao Xiaochun had still been munching away, but her expression soon became stern, and she even stopped chewing.","She was waiting for Liu Wencheng to finish speaking before she continued eating.","When Liu Wencheng noticed this, he shook his head vexedly and said, “Zhao Xiaochun, your source-type lifeform is more special, and you will be in a state of starvation if your belly isn’t kept full. I give you permission to finish the pig trotter!”","Zhao Xiaochun blushed and hastily swallowed the food in her mouth.","She would never eat while Liu Wencheng was talking, even if it meant that her source-type lifeform would die.","Liu Wencheng’s words lit a fire within the members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence who aimed to become Radiance Envoys.","Even if they knew that they could not become Radiance Envoys, they were determined to become Radiance Knights.","The Radiance Knights received better treatment and resources than the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","More importantly, it was an honor to be a Radiance Envoy!","The Radiance Federation and Freedom Federation would be carrying out their bet two years later.","This new batch of Radiance Envoys and Radiance Knights would be the substitutes.","But even so, all of them wanted to do their part for the Radiance Federation.","Liu Wencheng looked at the Radiance Hundred Sequence members, who were burning with passion, and said, “Now, take out your Star Web Cards and step into the Radiance Sacred Hall in Star Web! Starting from Sequence #1 Xia Qing, the battles will take place going down the ranks.”","Inside the Radiance Sacred Hall on Star Web, Xia Qing stood up and said, “I give up my three challenges!’","This challenge structure gave the lower-ranked members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence more chances and also those who were eliminated would have no reason to complain.","If they could not even defeat the three challengers they chose, there was no excuse for their elimination.","After Xia Qing gave up her three chances, Li Ang stood up and said, “I would like to challenge Sequence #1, Xia Qing!”","Li Ang had been doing this every year for the past three years, and everyone had become accustomed to it.","Li Ang walked over to Xia Qing and spoke with resolution."]},{"number":1630,"title":"Chapter 1630 - Suck Burst Oxygen Toad 1","paragraphs":["Chapter 1630: Suck Burst Oxygen Toad 1","“I haven’t used my secret weapon since the last battle on the dueling ground. But this time, the Radiance Hundred Sequence is taking place on Star Web. This means that I will be able to use my secret weapon without holding back!”","Xia Qing’s expression did not change when she heard what Li Ang said.","But as Li Ang’s teammate, Shi Xu was surprised by what he heard, and a smile spread across his face.","Li Ang, you can finally use that move!","!!","Besides being part of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, Shi Xu and Li Ang were also part of the Rhine Guild Club’s main team.","Both of them knew each other’s secret weapons better than anyone else.","Li Ang’s words attracted the attention of many Radiance Hundred Sequence members.","Although Xia Qing had defeated Li Ang, he was still Sequence #2 of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Many had challenged him, but none had truly defeated him.","Thus, everyone saw his challenge to Xia Qing as performative. This year was no exception!","But there was one person who did not share this sentiment, and that person was Liu Jie.","Two years ago, the Insect Queen had entered a near-dead state, and Liu Jie had backed out of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","As such, he had missed the fight between Li Ang and Xia Qing for the past two years.","Liu Jie’s goal was Xia Qing, but he did not know anything about her. If he could watch a fight between Xia Qing and Li Ang, he could see how Li Ang pushed Xia Qing as far as he could.","This would allow Liu Jie to gain an understanding of Xia Qing and make it easier for him to take her on.","Liu Jie was skilled at formation combat and needed to choose the right strategy to be effective during battle.","Long Tao was aware of this, which was why he was willing to give up one of his chances to Liu Jie. Otherwise, Liu Jie would only be left with one challenge chance by the time he reached rank 10.","But now, if Liu Jie could take over Long Tao’s spot as Sequence #3, he would have all three of his chances that he could use to try and defeat Xia Qing and claim the throne of Sequence #1 of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","By challenging her multiple times, he would be able to force her to reveal more of her methods and eventually adapt.","When Li Ang saw how indifferent Xia Qing looked, he took a deep breath and said, “In previous years, I always got the feeling that you didn’t use your full power. This year, I hope that you’ll take it more seriously!”","Xia Qing lifted her head to look at Li Ang and said, “You aren’t powerful enough for me to use my full strength. I didn’t even summon my main feys during our previous fights. Don’t challenge me three times in a row this year. I won’t hide my power this year. I will show you just how large the gap between us is.”","Xia Qing’s tone became increasingly cold, but there was not a hint of arrogance.","Her words did not leave a bad taste in the mouths of Li Ang and the other members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","All of them were just shocked by her power.","It turned out that Xia Qing had not once used her main fey in all of Li Ang and Xia Qing’s previous fights and when she was challenged by the previous members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence who had retired after aging out.","Not using one’s main fey was different from hiding one’s power.","Li Ang said honestly, “If you can defeat me to the point that I’m fully satisfied, I will give up the chances to challenge you a second and third time.”","Xia Qing’s lips curled upward, and she said, “That’s a deal!”","Soon, Liu Wencheng led both of them to the area where the rank fights would take place.","Since the actual locations were randomized, they could not be sure of where they would end up.","Li Ang and Xia Qing found themselves in a trench.","A square kilometer in size was considered neither large nor small.","It was difficult for two people to coincidentally end up at the same spot.","But Li Ang was a power offense-type spirit qi professional and did not need to warm up before fights.","He raised his hand, and three faceless elemental figures rose around him.","Soon a long-eared squirrel with three tails, each a different color, appeared in Li Ang’s arms.","Li Ang’s looks were plain, and he had been learning the art of wooing girls from Shi Xu.","With his unkempt beard, he came off even drabber.","But when he became serious, his resolute gaze had a unique magnetism to it.","Liu Jie knew what feys Li Ang had.","It was clear that Li Ang had not shown his secret weapon.","Li Ang had and nurtured contracted three source-type lifeforms.","They were completely different from Lin Yuan’s Source Sand, Zong Ze’s Source Fire, and Wen Yu’s Elemental Paper.","Li Ang did not need as much pure elemental energy. After all, he could not invest all of his resources into the three elemental source-type lifeforms.","Li Ang used the easiest method of utilizing his spiritual-type spiritual ingredients and his blood as a medium to guide the three source-type lifeforms’ focus toward maturing.","Li Ang’s faceless wind, water, and snow element could produce powerful elemental attacks.","They could even change the terrestrial shapes.","As for the squirrel in Li Ang’s arms, it was his main fey, the Three Mystic Currents Mouse, that he had not revealed up till now.","The Three Mystic Currents Mouse was also a machine gun for spells.","Its three tails contained a sea of elemental energy.","It would work with the three faceless elements to unleash elemental attacks that could last at least three hours.","Just as Li Ang was about to summon his secret weapon, Xia Qing waved his hand and summoned a large toad with a half-red and half-blue body.","The toad was as large as a small building, and there were air currents and flame patterns on each side of its body.","It was as though the flames would ignite the air currents at any time.","Xia Qing had never summoned this toad-species fey before.","Before Li Ang could summon his secret weapon, Xia Qing exclaimed, “Suck Burst Oxygen Toad, use Flaming Flowing Oxygen!”","The enormous toad opened its mouth and forcefully sucked in a breath.","The air currents in the surroundings seemed to be pushed by a powerful force as they were sucked into the Suck Burst Oxygen Toad’s mouth.","Soon, the air current patterns on the Suck Burst Oxygen Toad’s body dispersed, and the flame patterns became increasingly active.","The black flames ignited all over the Suck Burst Oxygen Toad’s body."]},{"number":1631,"title":"Chapter 1631 - Youll See the Difference After This Attack!","paragraphs":["Chapter 1631: You’ll See the Difference After This Attack!","Li Ang quickly realized that he could not breathe!","Rather, no matter how hard he inhaled, no oxygen entered his nose.","He immediately realized that after Xia Qing’s main fey used its ability, it burned up all the oxygen in the space.","Li Ang needed to put distance between himself and this space so that the airflow around him would be out of the giant toad’s reach.","!!","Once the air behind him circulated over, he would have access to oxygen again.","Li Ang commanded, “Three Mystic Currents Mouse, use the three of them to create an elemental shield!”","Three walls made of elemental energy immediately appeared in front of Li Ang.","At that moment, Li Ang had not noticed that the Suck Burst Oxygen Toad’s eyes had rolled and that it had stopped sucking in the air.","Suddenly, the black flames on the Suck Burst Oxygen Toad grew even brighter.","As the black flames continued to burn the air, the air turned into sticky tar.","Star Web’s battleground was a replica of a space in the main world.","The stickiness was a sign that the air was about to disintegrate.","Long Tao choked as he watched the fight between Li Ang and Xia Qing. “The Suck Burst Oxygen Toad has reached Diamond X/Fantasy V! One of Li Ang’s faceless elemental figures is at Diamond V/Fantasy III, while the other two are at Diamond IV/Legend.","“Although the Three Mystic Currents Mouse has reached Diamond VII/Fantasy III, every small increase in a Fantasy Breed fey’s quality is the equivalent of three or four increases in grade.","“The Suck Burst Oxygen Toad’s combat style is also related to elemental energy. The difference in grades between elemental-type feys will have definite implications during battle. Even if Li Ang does have a secret weapon, he won’t be able to beat a Diamond X/Fantasy V fey. Just who is Xia Qing?”","While Long Tao was speaking, Li Ang summoned a new fey.","A white-haired four-winged fairy source-type lifeform appeared on Li Ang’s shoulder.","Li Ang immediately commanded it to fuse with the three faceless elemental figures.","The appearance of the white-haired fairy source-type lifeform instantly attracted the attention of the other members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Four-winged fairies were not a common sight!","Everyone had expected Li Ang to use his secret weapon in this battle against Xia Qing and had been waiting for it.","But it turned out that Li Ang’s secret weapon was the Diamond VIII/Fantasy IV four-winged fairy.","Many people’s gazes fell on Liu Jie.","Liu Jie’s Insect Queen was also a four-winged fairy.","Long Tao was not the only Creation Master among the Radiance Hundred Sequence members.","At that moment, Sequence #7 Lei Ou said, “I can’t believe Li Ang contracted the mutated fairy source-type lifeform Elemental Puppet! Suppose the Element Puppet absorbs the energy inside the Three Mystic Currents Mouse while it’s fused with the three faceless elemental figures. In that case, it will definitely be able to produce an attack of Diamond X/Fantasy V level.”","Liu Jie shook his head gently.","The full-powered attack of any fey that reached Diamond X/Fantasy V would be of Diamond X/Fantasy V level. They could produce ten consecutive attacks before they were drained.","But the Elemental Puppet that had fused with the faceless elemental figures would be out of energy before it could even produce five attacks.","Li Ang’s secret weapon would not be of any help against Xia Qing’s Suck Burst Oxygen Toad.","Moreover, Xia Qing was that old man’s granddaughter.","As such, the feys she contracted had to have the ability to roll grades during combat.","Hence, it was still up to Xia Qing to give Li Ang the chance to take down the Suck Burst Oxygen Toad.","The Elemental Puppet had fused with the three faceless elemental figures, and representative colors of water, wind, and thunder appeared on its body.","Its originally skinny body was now as rotund as a balloon.","The Elemental Puppet did not stop absorbing elemental energy.","The Three Mystic Currents Mouse removed the seal on its tail, and a large amount of elemental energy flowed into the Elemental Puppet’s body.","Just as Li Ang was about to remove the elemental walls to properly clash against Xia Qing, the huge toad with black flames all over its body appeared on the other side of the elemental walls.","The black flames on its body had turned into hundreds of long whips.","When the black whips of flames moved in the air, the viscous air was like the glue that picked up ink.","This scene was like a demon standing by and watching as a knight strengthened himself, not making a move because he still had absolute faith in his victory.","When the elemental walls were removed, Li Ang was stunned by the sight in front of him.","However, Xia Qing did not order the Suck Burst Oxygen Toad to attack. Instead, she said, “Up till now, I have only instructed the Suck Burst Oxygen Toad to use one ability. Why don’t you use your strongest attack? Then, the distance between us will become obvious to you.”","Although Li Ang knew that he would not be able to beat Xia Qing, her words still pricked his pride.","Li Ang bellowed, “Elemental Puppet! Use Elemental Benefit and Elemental Tremors! Unleash the elemental energy through Elemental Whirlpool!”","The Elemental Puppet’s four wings immediately started to move.","A large three-colored whirlpool appeared next to the Elemental Puppet.","When the whirlpool appeared, the Elemental Puppet immediately slimmed down and fell to the ground weakly.","Li Ang said to Xia Qing, “This is my strongest attack!”","Xia Qing said softly, “Suck Burst Oxygen Toad, use Gather Oxygen Toad Croak!”","The Suck Burst Oxygen Toad had wanted to use the long flame whips to break apart the whirlpool.","But when it received Xia Qing’s instruction, it tossed away its original idea, and its throat immediately started to inflate and deflate rapidly.","Soon, a croak filled the air.","What happened next made every spectating member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence widen their eyes."]},{"number":1632,"title":"Chapter 1632 - I Want to Challenge Liu Jie!","paragraphs":["Chapter 1632: I Want to Challenge Liu Jie!","Everyone watched as the whirlpool made of all the elemental energy that the Elemental Puppet gathered collapsed.","The elemental energy within the whirlpool was like timber that had come into contact with fire as they were immediately set alight.","Li Ang wanted to use the elemental energy within the whirlpool to test out a full-powered attack.","This would allow him to see the difference between his and Xia Qing’s power.","!!","But now, there was no way he would be able to do the test.","When she saw the shock on Li Ang’s face, Xia Qing said, “My Gather Oxygen Toad Croak can quickly gather the oxygen in the air. The high-magnitude tremors will be set alight by the pure oxygen. It can be said that the Suck Burst Oxygen’s existence directly counters your battle style. I don’t want to attack a friend. Give up!”","Li Ang fell silent for a moment before he looked deeply into Xia Qing’s eyes.","He raised his left fist as a white flag.","Unless it was absolutely necessary, Li Ang was also unwilling to attack a friend.","Thus, he understood what Xia Qing was trying to say.","However, he needed to properly digest the facts.","Previously, he had been unable to defeat her when she was not using her main fey.","He had no idea if the Suck Burst Oxygen Toad was Xia Qing’s main fey, but it was enough to render him helpless.","The gap between them could no longer be measured.","After Li Ang left the location, he said to Liu Wencheng, “I give up my remaining challenges.”","Li Ang returned to his seat, and his body seemed to crumple slightly.","Shi Xu did not know how he should comfort Li Ang.","Liu Wencheng looked at Xia Qing and said, “Little Qing, at this point, there’s no point in continuing to hide your identity. Tell Li Ang who you are and save him some misery.”","Xia Qing did not immediately reveal her identity.","Rather, she said to Li Ang, “I had already reached god-class on the Celestial Stairway three years ago. It’s only to be expected that you’re no match for me. If you can become a Radiance Knight, you will have no lack of Creation Master resources. You won’t have to go out and earn them for yourself.","“At that time, all your feys will increase in power. Your faceless elemental figures were too impatient and lacked resources. As a result, they didn’t fully release their powers. Once you have access to purer elemental energy, your combat power will double at least.”","Liu Wencheng knew that Xia Qing’s character was like this. She was very straightforward and did not like to beat around the bush.","He had wanted her to offer Li Ang comfort. Yet, she taught him a lesson instead.","When Li Ang heard what Liu Wencheng said, he realized that Xia Qing had to come from an extraordinary background.","If she had already reached god-class three years ago, she had to either be a disciple of royalty or related to one.","If that were the case, there really was no choice in them competing.","Li Ang had been holding out hope of becoming a Radiance Envoy.","But now, he redirected his aspirations onto becoming a Radiance Knight.","Just as Xia Qing had said, he would definitely transform once he became a Radiance Knight.","Xia Qing and Li Ang’s combat had quenched the fighting spirit of many.","A full-powered Diamond X/Fantasy I level attack was the extent of power that a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence could reach.","Since Li Ang had given up his remaining two challenges, Long Tao was up next.","Everyone assumed he would challenge Xia Qing as well before challenging Li Ang.","Long Tao had kept a low profile these past few years and had not challenged anyone else.","Clearly, he had been hiding something big.","Li Ang came from a veteran faction, while Long Tao came from a top faction.","Coiling Dragon’s Valley had immense Creation Master resources, and Long Tao was a Class 3 Creation Master.","Hence, Long Tao had greater access to Creation Master resources than Li Ang did.","Moreover, there had been a rumor floating around that Whale Ocean Commerce had been sealed off by the Spirit Guards for an unknown reason and struck off the list of top three top factions.","There was a report that came out of Coiling Dragon’s Valley recently that said that their Elder Leader’s main fey had reached Immortal.","Now, many people saw Coiling Dragon’s Valley as having taken over Whale Ocean Commerce’s place as one of the top three top factions.","Everyone was looking forward to seeing Long Tao display his power.","Yet, Long Tao said, “I want to challenge Liu Jie!”","Liu Wencheng immediately looked amused when he heard what Long Tao said.","Liu Wencheng had seen the way Liu Jie fought at the Guard Ye Banquet.","Liu Wencheng’s eyes were opened when he saw the way that Liu Jie fought with insect-species carcinoma fey formations.","This combat style was highly compatible with his title of Heart of Insect Swarm.","After the Guard Ye Banquet ended, Liu Wencheng had even asked Night Leaning Moon about Liu Jie’s nurturing process.","Night Leaning Moon had not held back, and Liu Yancheng had learned about Night Leaning Moon’s ‘Final Weapon Plan’ that she had for Liu Jie.","Liu Wencheng sucked in a sharp breath.","It was terrifying to think about a spirit qi professional commandeering tens of Diamond X/Legend insect-species carcinoma feys.","As long as Liu Jie had enough time to hide, he could even use his insect-species carcinoma feys to wreak havoc on an entire continent.","No matter how powerful an individual was, they would not be able to turn the tide when they were faced with a disaster brought on by insect-species carcinoma feys.","It was easy to solve a problem when it had just started.","But if matters progressed too far, the members of royalty would not be able to use methods that caused widespread damage for fear of harming the citizens.","Trying to protect citizens in the face of carcinoma feys was a problem that had never been solved.","However, carcinoma feys could often counter each other.","When the Sawtooth Devour Ants and Poison Dust Flying Moths appeared in Golden Edge City, the battle between the two types of insect-species carcinoma feys was what had given Chef Supreme the chance to solve the crisis.","With so many insect-species carcinoma feys, Liu Jie would be able to create disasters as well as fix disasters.","It was all a matter of which he preferred.","Thus, Liu Wencheng felt that the crux of Liu Jie was now how powerful he was but what kind of character he had.","The way Liu Jie had single-handedly took on the insect tide at Cold Frost City proved that he had a kind heart."]},{"number":1633,"title":"Chapter 1633 - This Moth?","paragraphs":["Chapter 1633: This Moth?","It can be said that Liu Jie had become the Radiance Federation’s top strategic resource.","That night, all the elders of the Radiance Federation had witnessed the events for themselves.","They knew that Long Tao was challenging Liu Jie to help him.","Liu Jie’s goal was not Li Ang but Xia Qing.","Xia Qing had just used the Suck Burst Oxygen Toad and needed to conserve power.","But if Liu Jie was targeting her, how was she going to conserve her power?","It seemed that there was going to be a preview of the fight between Liu Jie and Xia Qing that would be taking place a year later at the Radiance Envoy selection.","Liu Wencheng looked at Liu Jie and asked, “Liu Jie, are you going to accept Long Tao’s challenge?”","The lower-ranked members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence could turn down challenges.","But there was no way that Liu Jie was going to do so.","Liu Jie stood up.","Now, all the eyes of the Radiance Hundred Sequence were on him.","They all looked at Long Tao and Liu Jie with confusion.","Was there some grudge between them? Long Tao had clearly walked over to Liu Jie and started chatting with him. The two of them had appeared to be on friendly terms.","Why was Long Tao suddenly challenging Liu Jie, who had just regained his rank as Sequence #30 of the Radiance Hundred Sequence?","Long Tao had not told anyone about Liu Jie’s identity.","Zhao Xiaochun and Fang Duoduo looked at Long Tao with confusion.","Xia Qing’s gaze also landed on Liu Jie.","She did not know Liu Jie because she had not attended the Guard Ye Banquet. She also had no clue that he was eventually going to challenge her.","But she was very interested in watching fights because it was also a way of strengthening herself.","When Wang Fan and Bai Hao heard the whole story, they realized that Liu Jie must have gained an opportunity. Otherwise, someone with Long Tao’s personality would not have involved himself with Liu Jie.","Liu Jie would also not have been able to provide the two of them with so many resources.","When Liu Jie nodded, Liu Wencheng sent him and Long Tao to the battleground.","Before they were transported, Long Tao said to Liu Jie seriously, “I want to see how large the gap in our abilities is. I will give my all in this fight.”","Liu Jie nodded and said, “I will take this seriously.”","Long Tao was sent to the edge of a river.","A large amount of water-elemental energy flowed within the river.","Liu Jie found himself in a dense forest.","There were many places to hide in the forest, making it very compatible with his formation battle styles.","It could be said that both of them had been transported to favorable territories.","After a moment of silence, Long Tao waved his hand, and a four-meter-long dragon appeared behind Long Tao.","The dragon was the Sea King Cretaceous Dragon.","The Sea King Cretaceous Dragon had changed significantly from the last time that Lin Yuan saw it.","The Sea King Cretaceous Dragon was walking down the path of becoming a terrifying-dragon species fey.","As the Young Leader of Coiling Dragon’s Valley, he had nurtured the Sea King Cretaceous Dragon to Diamond X/Fantasy IV.","One more evolution of its grade and it would reach the limit of the younger generation’s power.","Long Tao did not use the Sea King Cretaceous Dragon to scout out Liu Jie’s location. Instead, he ordered it, “Sea King Cretaceous Dragon, use Water Overseer and Maximum Seas!”","The moment the last word left his lips, all the water-elemental energy in the area started to gather together. Even the water-elemental energy within the river was pulled toward the growing mass of water-elemental energy.","The mass of water-elemental energy turned into a flowing river midair as more and more water swirled around the Sea King Cretaceous Dragon.","In an instant, a mammoth entity of water was formed.","The Sea King Cretaceous Dragon manipulated the water so that it moved along with its own movements.","The water had fully become part of the Sea King Cretaceous Dragon.","The Sea King Cretaceous Dragon also used Eight Dragon Shadows, and eight dragon shadows appeared in the water.","Each of the shadows was equally mighty.","Two dragons, one red and the other blue, appeared in midair.","As the two dragons moved their invisible feelers, rain started pouring from the sky.","The rain increased the size of the mass of water, and a seven-meter-long shark appeared in front of Long Tao.","Long Tao jumped onto the shark’s back.","When he met Lin Yuan, the Reef Sturgeon had been Platinum VI/Epic. Now, it was Diamond X/Legend.","Clearly, Long Tao was not going to provide the Reef Sturgeon with a Willpower Rune.","Long Tao’s actions shocked the Radiance Hundred Sequence’s members.","The Diamond X/Fantasy IV Sea King Cretaceous Dragon and the two Diamond X/Fantasy III Deep Blue Dragon Jellyfishes were enough to demonstrate that Long Tao was even stronger than Li Ang.","If they fought, there was a good chance that Long Tao would be able to defeat Li Ang.","Additionally, Long Tao had not used his secret weapon.","Long Tao had won the Wave Halberd Killer Whale at the auction. No one knew the extent to which he had nurtured it.","Everyone could not help but look at Liu Jie with concern.","They had no idea how Liu Jie was going to deal with Long Tao with just the Insect Queen.","No matter how many types of insects the Insect Queen summoned and how many different abilities those insects had, it would not be strong enough.","Once it entered the water that was under the Sea King Cretaceous Dragon’s control, the eight dragon shadows that were each 60% as strong as the main body would rip the insects to shreds.","The Deep Blue Dragon Jellyfish had control of the skies and put a damper on the Hurricane Owlet Moths and Plasma Caterpillars.","Unless the Insect Queen was able to produce Diamond X/Fantasy III Hurricane Owlet Moths and Plasma Caterpillars, they would stand no chance against the two Deep Blue Dragon Jellyfishes.","While everyone was looking at Liu Jie with worry, Liu Jie gave a thumbs up, and a large purple moth appeared in the air around him.","The moth’s abdomen glowed faintly, and black patterns were all over its body.","When it flapped its wings, the black patterns on its body seemed to extend into the air.","The space around it seemed to ripple.","Most of the Radiance Hundred Sequence members were unfamiliar with this moth.","But those who came from top and veteran factions were all too familiar with it.","The moth had appeared two months ago at the Guard Ye Banquet.","The one who had wielded the moth at that time was the Chief Spirit Guard’s disciple. He had summoned it when he challenged a group of young experts from top factions.","The people who realized this all looked at Liu Jie with astonishment.","Could it be that Liu Jie was Chief Guard Ye’s disciple?"]},{"number":1634,"title":"Chapter 1634 - How Can Such a Coincidence Exist?","paragraphs":["Chapter 1634: How Can Such a Coincidence Exist?","The members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence who came from top and veteran factions all widened their eyes.","As they scrutinized the moth, they became certain that it was definitely the Dimensional Light Moth.","Chief Guard Ye’s disciple’s fight on the Martial Stage and the battle between Lin Yuan and Zong Ze had exploded the horizons of the young experts from top and veteran factions.","Zong Ze had used his fey with the Barren bloodline and his sacred source lifeform.","Even the young experts from top and veteran factions could not hope to obtain such things.","There was no certainty if there were any elders of veteran factions who had sacred source lifeforms, and only a few elders of top factions had sacred source lifeforms.","Moreover, only Radiance Envoys and the disciples of royalty could obtain feys with the Barren bloodline.","Everyone feared and respected Zong Ze.","Not only was the younger generation of experts befuddled by Lin Yuan’s combat style, but even the leaders of veteran and top factions were at a loss.","They could tell that Lin Yuan’s combat style involved combat skills and fighting strategies.","How did any spirit qi professional have time to learn all that?","Lin Yuan had definitely used a sacred source lifeform.","The silhouette of a girl that had appeared behind him was proof of this.","But what abilities did this sacred source lifeform have? No one could tell.","Firstly, Lin Yuan had extremely powerful immunity to elements, unbelievable combat abilities, and the ability to hide his spirit qi professional rank.","Next, he could use that sword that could unleash crows.","None of these were definitive tells.","Thus, Liu Jie was the one at the center of most discussions after the Guard Ye Banquet.","He had not only used insect-species carcinoma feys, but every fey had also reached Diamond X/Legend.","This was an unprecedented combat style.","At that time, the Dimensional Light Moth had spat out 40 Shield Ladybugs in succession.","This had left the members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, who came from veteran and top factions, scratching their heads.","Clearly, there was no way he could have contracted so many insect-species feys.","Moreover, one of the Insect Queen’s abilities was to produce a large number of Shield Ladybugs.","But at that time, no one had connected the dots and guessed that Liu Jie was Chief Guard Ye’s disciple.","But now, the two identities were finally overlapping in their minds.","How could such a coincidence exist?","Moreover, no regular person was able to control the Dimensional Light Moth.","Instead of summoning the Insect Queen, Liu Jie had summoned the Dimensional Light Moth and kept the Insect Queen within the Dimensional Light Moth’s abdomen.","This was because Liu Jie did not want to continue hiding his identity.","The Radiance Envoy selection was going to take place a year later, and there was no need to continue hiding.","He had already informed Night Leaning Moon that he would not be trying out to become a Radiance Envoy. Instead, he wanted to become Lin Yuan’s Radiance Knight.","Liu Jie felt that this was the best way he could carry out his duty as Lin Yuan’s retainer knight.","Additionally, Lin Yuan had given Liu Jie the Firefly Demon Fetus before the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection, and Liu Jie had fused it with the Insect Queen.","As a result, the Blade Queen Bee had evolved, and its psychotoxin was now much more potent!","When the Insect Queen absorbed the psychotoxin, its bloodline mutated again, and it gained another pair of wings.","Now, the Insect Queen was a six-winged fairy, and its ability to control insect-species carcinoma feys had become extremely powerful.","Liu Jie could now commandeer the insect-species carcinoma feys with greater proficiency.","The six-winged Insect Queen was now Liu Jie’s secret weapon.","It was only natural that one had to properly protect his secret weapon.","Liu Jie would only be willing to reveal it during his fight against Xia Qing.","There was no need for him to reveal the Insect Queen’s six wings in his fight against Long Tao.","After the Dimensional Light Moth was summoned, Liu Jie immediately ordered it to release 50 of the Shield Ladybugs that the Insect Queen had produced.","The Shield Ladybugs were the main method of defense for the Insect Queen.","In whatever situation, they could be living shields for Liu Jie.","Each of the 50 Shield Ladybugs had reached Diamond X/Fantasy I.","When the 50 Diamond X/Fantasy I Shield Ladybugs appeared, the spectating members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence were all stunned, and their gazes immediately fixed onto Liu Jie.","Xia Qing’s also focused her gaze on Liu Jie.","The 50 Shield Ladybugs opened the shells on their backs to reveal their wings and flew into the sky.","All the Shield Ladybugs chose a tree and landed in it to pre-empt any enemies that tried to use sneak attacks.","Liu Jie had too many ideas for how he could defeat Long Tao.","The easiest way would be for the Insect Queen to produce 10 Diamond X/Fantasy IV Plasma Caterpillars and a Diamond X/Fantasy V Lightning Gathering Moth.","The Lightning Gathering Moth would gather the plasma produced by the Plasma Caterpillars and produce a full-powered Fantasy Breed level attack.","Long Tao’s battle style required a supply of water.","Water was an exceptional natural conductor.","The Lightning Gathering Moth did not need to aim the attack at Long Tao’s feys but at the water, and all of Long Tao’s feys would end up seriously injured.","However, Liu Jie did not decide to do this because he had spent the past few months contracting insect-species carcinoma feys and had not had many opportunities to fight real battles that could raise his combat abilities.","He could not attack with his insect-species carcinoma feys when he fought on the Celestial Stairway.","Thus, Long Tao was the best sharpening stone for Liu Jie.","At that moment, Liu Jie spotted a mass of water approaching him.","The Deep Blue Dragon Jellyfishes were extremely eye-catching as they resembled red and blue streaks of light.","Since Long Tao had set up his water supply, Liu Jie gave another thumbs up, and a small insect-species carcinoma fey resembling a lightbulb appeared in his hand.","This was the insect-species carcinoma fey that Liu Jie had used when Lin Yuan was on Raging Waves City’s island and was afraid that his harvesting of the large whale fall would cause harm to the other aquatic lifeforms, the Quiet Floating Hat Insect."]},{"number":1635,"title":"Chapter 1635 - Long Tao’s Final Move","paragraphs":["Chapter 1635: Long Tao’s Final Move","Liu Jie had used the young miniatures produced by the Quiet Floating Hat Insect to send all the wild aquatic feys from the shallow shores to the deep sea.","Liu Jie ordered the Quiet Floating Hat Insect, “Go ahead and spawn! Turn the entire area of water into a sticky globe!”","The Quiet Floating Hat Insect immediately started twisting its body.","Through its translucent body, Liu Jie could see fluids moving.","Many eggs moved into its special organ, and it did not take long for translucent insect eggs to roll out of the Quiet Floating Hat Insect’s abdomen.","At that moment, one Hurricane Owlet Moth flew out of the Dimensional Light Moth. It picked up the sticky eggs and carried them toward the approaching rain.","The Hurricane Owlet Moth was Platinum/Normal, and Liu Jie had no intention of using it in combat.","The Hurricane Owlet Moth just needed to carry the eggs over to the water, and it would have fulfilled its purpose.","Long Tao caught sight of Liu Jie from far off.","He had no idea what methods Liu Jie was going to use. All the information he had on Liu Jie came from the fight on the Martial Stage during the Guard Ye Banquet.","At that time, Liu Jie had summoned insect-species carcinoma feys like the Blade Queen Bee and Hypha Tapeworm that were skilled at terrestrial battles.","Hence, Long Tao started using his spirit qi so that the Sea King Cretaceous Dragon could cover the ground and air with water.","From afar, Long Tao saw that Liu Jie was not moving much, yet he dared not attack immediately.","The power of a terrestrial battle came from being able to attack and defend from a contained area.","Long Tao planned on covering the entire area around Liu Jie with water and seeing how Liu Jie reacted to it.","Long Tao did not pay too much attention to the Hurricane Owlet Moth that was flying toward him.","Rather, he focused on Liu Jie.","He did not even use his Creation Master ability to sense the Hurricane Owlet Moth’s grade.","Rather, he used the two Deep Blue Dragon Jellyfishes to attack the Hurricane Owlet Moth using the rain.","The two Deep Blue Dragon Jellyfishes had an average power of Diamond X/Fantasy III.","When the rain made contact with the Platinum I/Normal Hurricane Owlet Moth, the droplets pierced through it, and it fell into the water below.","The Hurricane Owlet Moth’s sudden death without putting up any fight caused Long Tao’s expression to turn solemn.","The Quiet Floating Hat Insect’s eggs had entered the water.","Long Tao had not realized what was going on yet, but even if he did, it was already too late!","The Quiet Floating Hat Insect’s eggs needed to absorb the water-elemental energy from within the mass of water in order to hatch.","The Sea King Cretaceous Dragon produced the mass of water using water-elemental energy. It contained more water-elemental energy than a real body of water.","The heart of the water-elemental energy was the Sea King Cretaceous Dragon.","It could be said that in order to hatch, the Quiet Floating Hat Insect’s eggs had to steal the Sea King Cretaceous Dragon’s water-elemental energy.","As an insect-species carcinoma fey, the Quiet Floating Hat Insect could cause devastating damage to water territories.","The sea clans had been able to tolerate the Sea Burial Lotus Flower but not the Quiet Floating Hat Insect.","In a blink of an eye, light blue forms floated up to the surface of the water. Every floating form had a small hat and looked like small transparent islands floating on the water.","In order to maximize the size of the water, the Sea King Cretaceous Dragon had not made the water very deep. Its depth was only about 20 meters.","The young Quiet Floating Hat Insects could extend their tentacles to a depth of 500 meters. If they absorbed enough energy, they could even extend to 1,000 meters.","As such, the Quiet Floating Hat Insects’ transparent tentacles were all pressed at the bottom of the water, even blocking the flow of water.","According to Liu Jie’s instruction, the Quiet Floating Hat Insect instructed the young insects to dissolve their tentacles to change them into sticky fluids.","The spectating members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence watched as the water turned into a pool of glue.","The eight figures produced from Eight Dragon Shadows were all trapped within the glue.","The Sea King Cretaceous Dragon used Sea Bite in succession before using Sea Emperor’s Dragon Breath.","Finally, it broke through the glue and flew up into the air while covered in the disgusting sticky substance.","No matter how hard the Sea King Cretaceous Dragon tried to shake the sticky substance off, it was to no avail.","Moreover, once the glue left the water, it would start to dry rapidly.","This slowed down the Sea King Cretaceous Dragon’s movements. It was even difficult for the Sea King Cretaceous Dragon to open its mouth.","The Sea King Cretaceous Dragon was so uncomfortable that it wanted to use Extremity of Sea to gather water-elemental energy to wash off the glue.","But, it was immediately stopped by Long Tao.","Long Tao had already figured out that the glue-like substance had come from the Quiet Floating Hat Insect.","The Quiet Floating Hat Insect’s young insects had strong regenerative abilities.","Even when they were ripped to shreds by aquatic feys, they could regenerate as long as they had access to sufficient water-elemental energy.","It was likely that the Quiet Floating Hat Insect’s young insects’ detached tentacles were hidden within the glue.","If there was even one piece, the water-elemental energy that the Sea King Cretaceous Dragon gathered to wash itself off would cause the tentacles to regenerate.","If one of the Quiet Floating Hat Insect’s young insects attached itself to the Sea King Cretaceous Dragon, it would find a large amount of its water-elemental energy being drained away.","Although the Sea King Cretaceous Dragon was Diamond X/Fantasy IV while the Quiet Floating Hat Insect was only at Diamond X/Legend, wild Silver insect-species carcinoma feys were already capable of bringing down cities.","When a Diamond insect-species carcinoma fey was serious, even thearch-class experts would be rendered helpless.","After each Quiet Floating Hat Insect’s young insect hatched, they would have half the Insect Queen’s power. This meant that they would be at Diamond grade.","There were at least 500 insect eggs within the small area of water.","In order for the Sea King Cretaceous Dragon to escape from the glue, it would have to defeat 500 Diamond feys.","Long Tao had not clashed against Liu Jie directly before.","But now that he was, he suddenly felt the helplessness that the young experts from top factions felt when they fought against Liu Jie on the Martial Stage.","Long Tao planned on using his ultimate move.","He was not going to waste any more time because he had no clue what new insect-species carcinoma fey Liu Jie was going to pull out from his sleeve.","With a wave of his hand, an enormous whale larger than the Sea King Cretaceous Dragon appeared in midair.","The whale was around 90 meters long, and there were white patches all over its black body."]},{"number":1636,"title":"Chapter 1636 - Demon Flower Fragrance Shield Stinkbug","paragraphs":["Chapter 1636: Demon Flower Fragrance Shield Stinkbug","There was a 10-meter-long fin on its back that resembled a halberd.","After the whale was summoned, it immediately let out a roar.","Long Tao said to Liu Jie, “Now, I’m going to use my strongest attack!”","Liu Jie replied softly, “What a coincidence. I also want to try out my new defense technique.”","A flat-bodied insect-species carcinoma fey with complex flower patterns on its back appeared on Liu Jie’s palm.","At the same instant, Xia Qing said sternly, “The Demon Flower Fragrance Shield Stinkbug! It’s Diamond X/Legend too!”","Xia Qing looked at Liu Jie with fear.","She had a deep impression of him from two years ago.","Two years ago, he had single-handedly held off the insect tide from conquering Cold Frost City for half an hour.","As a result, the Insect Queen had entered a near-dead state.","Xia Qing was the one who had begged the Bamboo Monarch on Liu Jie’s behalf.","When she found out that the Bamboo Monarch could not heal the Insect Queen’s injured roots, she even asked her grandfather for a second opinion while simultaneously contacting Chef Supreme.","If the Moon Empress had not been in seclusion at that time, Xia Qing might have visited the Leaning Moon Mountain as well.","Xia Qing had never told Liu Jie about this.","She was genuinely happy for him that he had made it back to the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","However, the power that Liu Jie exhibited far exceeded that of his age group.","At that moment, Xia Qing suddenly remembered her grandfather mentioning that Chief Guard Ye’s disciple was a young man who excelled at using insect-species carcinoma feys in battle.","Xia Qing immediately drew a link between Liu Jie and Night Leaning Moon’s disciple.","The Spirit Guards had captured every carcinoma fey in the Radiance Federation.","Only the Spirit Guard Chief’s disciple would have access to so many insect-species carcinoma feys.","At that moment, Xia Qing seemed to understand something.","Long Tao was clearly friends with Liu Jie, so why would Sequence #3 challenge Sequence #30?","It could only be that Long Tao was trying to help Liu Jie and that Liu Jie had set her as his goal.","This immediately filled Xia Qing with an overflowing battle spirit.","Xia Qing did not even see Li Ang as a worthy match.","But now, there was no doubt that Liu Jie was one of the strongest young experts in the Radiance Federation.","Xia Qing felt that only this level of power was worthy of her.","When Liu Jie summoned the Demon Flower Fragrance Shield Stinkbug, Xia Qing realized that there was no longer any uncertainty about the outcome of this match.","The vapors from the Demon Flower Fragrance Shield Stinkbug would produce similar flowers that decorated its back in the air.","By consuming lifeforce, it could increase the strength of its demon flowers.","Every demon flower was only around the size of a fingernail.","The Insect Queen could produce numerous insect-species feys.","The demon flowers produced in the air already possessed Diamond defense attacks.","As the demon flowers consumed the insect-species feys consumed by the Insect Queen, their power would quickly reach that of Fantasy Breed.","If a punch landed on the shield in the form of the vapor shield, it would come into contact with 20 demon flowers.","Each of the demon flowers had Fantasy Breed-level defense. If they were not all broken at once, the attack would be unable to break through this wall of defense.","However, the attack from the Wave Halberd Killer Whale would definitely be stronger than that of a fist.","Although Long Tao was a Class 3 Creation Master, he had not recognized the Demon Flower Fragrance Shield Stinkbug because information on insect-species carcinoma feys was not available on Star Web, and there was no expert on them who could teach the information.","As such, it was very difficult to find a way to obtain such information.","Long Tao ordered the Wave Halberd Killer Whale, “Use Tide Ballad!”","The Wave Halberd Killer Whale’s body turned the color of blood.","The blood-red color spread outward until it stained the Reef Sturgeon, Sea King Cretaceous Dragon, and Deep Blue Dragon Jellyfishes.","The energy within the aquatic feys that Long Tao had contracted fused with the red energy and the combined energy was transferred to the Wave Halberd Killer Whale.","Tide Ballad could drain the energy of other aquatic feys and unleash it after combining it with its own energy.","After absorbing a large amount of energy, the Wave Halberd Killer Whale’s tail started to swish.","The clouds even turned into the shape of giant waves as they enveloped the Wave Halberd Killer Whale.","At that moment, the Demon Flower Fragrance Shield Stinkbug raised its abdomen and released a string of rainbow vapors into the air.","The rainbow vapors formed a pyramid-shaped shield that protected Liu Jie.","There were beautiful flowers all over the rainbow shield.","Soon, 200 Diamond I/Fantasy I Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects crawled out of the Dimensional Light Moth’s abdomen and entered the demon flowers. They became the demon flowers’ food and increased their defensive ability.","The demon flowers seemed to have a life of their own. As they consumed the Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects, their shields expanded until they eventually blocked Liu Jie’s anterior.","Long Tao sternly ordered the Wave Halberd Killer Whale, “Use Flood Blood Whale Fall! Charge!”","Flood Blood Whale Fall was the Wave Halberd Killer Whale’s Diamond ability. It was a method of combat that was self-sacrificing.","Since the Quiet Floating Hat Insect’s young insects had absorbed too much of the Sea King Cretaceous Dragon’s water-elemental energy, the Wave Halberd Killer Whale’s attack would not be at maximum strength.","However, it did exceed the power of a Fantasy Breed fey.","Li Ang sighed a small breath when he saw this.","It seemed that regardless of who won or lost this battle, his position as Sequence #2 of the Radiance Hundred Sequence would soon be taken from him.","The power that Long Tao was exhibiting now exceeded that of Li Ang.","Before Li Ang could sigh again, his eyes widened as he saw the previously calm sea of glue turn choppy.","Many invisible tentacles were moving within the sea of glue until they manipulated the sea of glue into a giant wave that reached the clouds in the sky.","The wave moved toward the Wave Halberd Killer Whale and prevented it from charging into Liu Jie.","This was occurring because the Quiet Floating Hat Insect was controlling its young insects.","Long Tao had only instructed the Sea King Cretaceous Dragon to escape from the sea of glue and not attack it. Hence, the Quiet Floating Hat Insect’s young insects within the sea of glue had not died.","Normally, the Quiet Floating Hat Insect would never use its young insects to attack in the air but continue consuming food within a body of water."]},{"number":1637,"title":"Chapter 1637 - I Have a Few Things to Say to Liu Jie!","paragraphs":["Chapter 1637: I Have a Few Things to Say to Liu Jie!","However, the Quiet Floating Hat Insect was under the Insect Queen’s control and had gained enough intelligence to know the best move to make during battle.","It could be said that everything that was happening now had surpassed what Long Tao knew about the Quiet Floating Hat Insect. As such, he was completely unprepared.","But the Wave Halberd Killer Whale had already used Flood Blood Whale Fall and had gathered all the energy in its body to a singular point.","Hence, Long Tao was completely unable to halt the Wave Halberd Killer Whale at this point.","If the Wave Halberd Killer Whale was stopped, it would not be able to continue fighting.","Thus, Long Tao felt that the best option would be to allow the Wave Halberd Killer Whale to crash into the sea of glue that enveloped invisible tentacles.","The sea of glue was fluid and was able to slow down anything that it came in contact with.","The sea of glue turned into a 500-meter-long wall of glue that the Wave Halberd Killer Whale charged into.","The Quiet Floating Hat Insect’s young insects’ feelers immediately extended toward the Wave Halberd Killer Whale.","At this point, the Wave Halberd Killer Whale had turned into a large blood-colored furnace and rapidly burned up the energy within its body.","Thus, the sea of glue quickly started to boil and bubble.","The Quiet Floating Hat Insect was very averse to heat.","As such, the high temperature of the Wave Halberd Killer Whale’s body instantly killed all of the Quiet Floating Hat Insect’s young insects.","Still, it was not over just because the young insects were dead.","The young insects’ bodies immediately turned to glue and made the sea of glue even stickier.","Long Tao pursed his lips when he sensed the energy inside the Wave Halberd Killer Whale being used up.","The Wave Halberd Killer Whale would definitely be able to break through the wall of glue, but once it did, the energy in its body would also be used up.","Long Tao knew that he had lost!","Even if the Wave Halberd Killer Whale used its self-sacrificing attack, there was no way he would be able to turn the tables.","When the Wave Halberd Killer Whale broke through the wall of glue, its body started to weaken visibly.","The high temperature of the Wave Halberd Killer Whale’s body boiled up the sea of glue until it was only half of its original size.","At that moment, the Shield Ladybugs that Liu Jie had set up in the trees started to make their moves, all crashing into the Wave Halberd Killer Whale.","The 50 Shield Ladybugs had all reached Diamond X/Fantasy I.","They flew in a straight line, and the combined noise of their flapping wings resembled that of a train.","They made a beeline for the Wave Halberd Killer Whale and used their bodies to protect Liu Jie.","This was the reason the Insect Queen had created them.","No one would think much of Liu Jie’s combat style if he lacked power.","But as long as he was strong enough, the 50 Diamond/Fantasy Shield Ladybugs using their bodies to protect Liu Jie would stun anyone who witnessed the sight.","When the Shield Ladybugs slammed against the Wave Halberd Killer Whale, they were all crushed and fell to the ground of the forest.","Every crash depleted the Wave Halberd Killer Whale’s power, and their shells left its body with bloody gashes. Many insect parts were also left buried in the Wave Halberd Killer Whale’s body.","When the 27th Shield Ladybugs broke apart on the Wave Halberd Killer Whale’s body, the Wave Halberd Killer Whale exploded as well.","Since the remaining 23 Shield Ladybugs had finished their mission, they flew back to Liu Jie and formed a line in front of the Demon Flower Fragrance Shield Stinkbug.","The Shield Ladybugs would not hesitate to attack anything that advanced to complete their mission.","The pieces of the Wave Halberd Killer Whale’s exploded body flew far and wide, but none of them made contact with the Demon Flower Fragrance Shield Stinkbug’s demon flower shield.","This sight allowed Long Tao and the members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence to see how far the canyon between them was and how powerful Liu Jie was.","After a moment of silence from the members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, a voice said, “No wonder he’s Chief Guard Ye’s disciple!”","This exclamation allowed those who had not realized the truth yet to learn what Liu Jie’s identity was.","Apparently, Liu Jie was Chief Guard Ye’s disciple!","All of Long Tao’s feys had been killed, so Liu Jie and Long Tao were transported out of the location.","Long Tao composed himself and said with a smile, “The gap between us truly is large!”","However, Long Tao was not dispirited in the slightest, and he went on to say, “I think that I’ll become an A-rank spirit qi professional within six months.”","Long Tao did not mean anything else when he said this. He said this because he and Liu Jie were friends.","Liu Jie replied with a smile, “Let me be the first to congratulate you then!”","Liu Jie thought, A year later, Zong Ze, Gu Lang, and the rest will probably be able to become A-rank spirit qi professionals. I will be at that level too. At that time, the 12 Firefly Demon Fetuses that Lin Yuan gave me will have reached Myth Breed. I will only reach my peak once I become an A-rank spirit qi professional.","Liu Wencheng walked up to Long Tao and Liu Jie and patted their shoulders as he said, “Long Tao, you might have passed this challenge and become Sequence #30, but the rules state that you still have to pick your challengers based on your original rank.”","Long Tao nodded apologetically at Li Ang.","After Li Ang challenged Xia Qing once, he had given up his other two chances.","This meant that Li Ang no longer had any chances to challenge.","Long Tao could challenge Li Ang now and push Li Ang down to Sequence #30.","But Long Tao felt that it would not be appropriate for him to do so.","If he did not challenge Li Ang, he would not have any challenges left.","Long Tao chose to challenge Sequence #7 Lei Ou and send him down to Sequence #30.","Next, it would be Lei Ou’s chance to use his three challenges and climb the ladder if he wanted to.","After challenging Lei Ou, Long Tao noticed that Lei Ou, at full strength, was not any weaker than Li Ang. He would likely be able to stand toe-to-toe against Li Ang.","After pushing Lei Ou down, Long Tao challenged Li Ang and rose to Sequence #2 of the Radiance Hundred Sequence while Li Ang became Sequence #7.","Li Ang looked gratefully at Long Tao.","As the challenges continued, many people challenged Xia Qing, but none succeeded.","Soon, it was Liu Jie’s turn to challenge.","Liu Jie told his two friends, Bai Hao and Wang Fan, about his situation. He also answered all their questions honestly.","At that moment, Xia Qing walked over to Liu Jie and said to Wang Fan, “Can I have your seat for five minutes? I have a few things to say to Liu Jie!”","Wang Fan hurriedly gave up his seat.","At that moment, Liu Jie’s mind was muddled.","He clearly had no ties with Xia Qing and had no idea what she would need to talk to him about"]},{"number":1638,"title":"Chapter 1638 - Do You Have Your Eye on Liu Jie?","paragraphs":["Chapter 1638: Do You Have Your Eye on Liu Jie?","Bai Hao had been staring at Liu Jie and thinking, Brother, you’ve caught the attention of a goddess. Can you show some sort of affable reaction? You’re so frustrating! How are you supposed to find a partner like this?","Xia Qing is one of the most beautiful girls of her generation. Her features are not only breathtaking, but her figure is outstanding too. Why aren’t you chatting her up?","Xia Qing had a small smile on her face as she sat next to Liu Jie.","Liu Jie’s actions had made him worthy of being called a hero of the Radiance Federation.","!!","Xia Qing had felt bad for Liu Jie when he was unable to cure the Insect Queen.","But now, the Insect Queen was fully healed and was given a new opportunity. Xia Qing was over the moon about this.","Liu Jie was slightly uncomfortable under Xia Qing’s gaze, and he wondered why she needed to talk to him.","At that moment, Xia Qing said, “Why don’t we put off our fight to next year’s Radiance Envoy selection? You have already reached Sequence #3 of the Radiance Hundred Sequence and are eligible to compete for one of the Radiance Envoy spots.”","Liu Jie was slightly stunned, and he replied, “I’m not challenging you because of the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection but because I want to be number one. Also, my goal isn’t to become a Radiance Envoy, and I won’t be vying for a spot. I’m good with just becoming a Radiance Knight.”","Liu Jie’s words left Xia Qing with a stupefied expression.","As Night Leaning Moon’s disciple, he had been carefully taught by her and had enough power to become a Radiance Envoy.","Xia Qing did not know how many insect-species carcinoma feys Liu Jie had under his control.","He had defeated Long Tao with just the Quiet Floating Hat Insect.","He had not even used the Demon Flower Fragrance Shield Stinkbug that he summoned.","This was partly because Long Tao had been too cautious and given the Quiet Floating Hat Insect’s young insects too much time to get prepared.","Otherwise, the Quiet Floating Hat Insect would not have been able to halt the Wave Halberd Killer Whale.","Additionally, Diamond/Legend insect-species carcinoma feys were much too powerful, and fighting against Liu Jie was no different from fighting a mini catastrophe.","The Quiet Floating Hat Insect and Demon Flower Fragrance Shield Stinkbug had not had the chance to work together.","But if the insect-species carcinoma feys that Liu Jie controlled could cooperate perfectly, he could produce power on an unimaginable scale.","Xia Qing did not want to fight Liu Jie because she did not like fighting in front of an audience and felt that it was overly tedious.","She was also not afraid of Liu Jie.","Although Liu Jie had control of more than eight insect-species carcinoma feys, Xia Qing was still confident that she would be able to emerge victorious.","The Suck Burst Oxygen Toad was not Xia Qing’s main fey.","Xia Qing was just afraid that the fight between her and Liu Jie would end up depressing the members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Thus, Xia Qing privately approached Liu Jie and said what she said to him.","However, she could not understand why he did not intend to become a Radiance Envoy.","Xia Qing looked into Liu Jie’s eyes and asked, “Why? Shouldn’t every member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence aim to become a Radiance Envoy?”","Liu Jie shook his head.","After a few days of pondering, he finally understood why Night Leaning Moon did not want him to become a Radiance Envoy.","It was true that if he was ever called to choose between Lin Yuan and the Radiance Federation, he would undoubtedly choose Lin Yuan.","He was not suited to become a Radiance Envoy with such a mentality because they needed to be focused on representing and protecting the Radiance Federation.","Liu Jie would only become a Radiance Knight if Lin Yuan became a Radiance Envoy.","If he could not protect Lin Yuan as a Radiance Knight, Liu Jie saw no point in being one.","However, there was no way that Liu Jie would tell Xia Qing this.","Eventually, Liu Jie just said, “Everyone has their own goal.”","Xia Qing glanced at the other members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence before saying, “If so, I can take the Sequence #3 spot and let you have Sequence #1. However, I have a request. I hope that you can give me an answer when you become a Radiance Knight.”","Xia Qing’s tone was full of confidence.","Liu Jie knew that Xia Qing’s confidence was not shallow but genuine belief in her own power.","Liu Jie replied, “That’s a deal. Even if you’re not a Radiance Envoy at that time, I will tell you the reason after I become a Radiance Knight.”","While he spoke, images of Lin Yuan, Zong Ze, Gu Lang, and An He appeared in Liu Jie’s mind.","As a support-type spirit qi professional, there was no way that Gao Feng would be able to become a Radiance Envoy. Hence, only Lin Yuan, Zong Ze, Gu Lang, An He, and Xia Qing could become Radiance Envoys.","The name list for the new batch of Radiance Envoys was all but confirmed, and they were only going through the selection to decide on the ranking.","Liu Jie and Xia Qing spoke softly to each other, so most of the people around them did not catch the contents of their conversation.","But Wang Fan and Bai Hao were just sitting next to them and had shocked expressions on their faces.","Was this the kind of conversation that bigshots had? They traded the position of Sequence #1 so easily!","But at the same time, Wang Fan and Bai Hao were genuinely happy for Liu Jie.","Liu Jie’s current status and power were unfamiliar to the two of them, but they still understood him as a person.","Liu Jie was still their good friend with whom they had gone on missions, overcome hardships, and shared blessings.","When it was Liu Jie’s turn, he chose to challenge Xia Qing.","Xia Qing only used the Suck Burst Oxygen Toad during the fight, and Liu Jie only used the Demon Flower Fragrance Shield Stinkbug and Hypha Tapeworm.","After fighting for a while, Xia Qing surrendered.","Every member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence now knew that Xia Qing and Liu Jie had to have made a deal with each other.","Both of them were hiding their power.","No one knew what Xia Qing’s secret weapon was.","However, Liu Jie had used the Dead Soul Demon Insect and Blade Queen Bee before but did not summon them during this fight.","The best match for the Blade Worms would be the Hypha Tapeworm.","Liu Wencheng had silently acknowledged the situation.","He looked at Xia Qing with an odd gaze.","He had watched the proud Xia Qing grow up and felt it was strange for Xia Qing to put herself at a disadvantage.","Liu Wencheng looked at the outstanding Liu Jie again and thought, Is it possible that Xia Qing has her eye on Liu Jie?"]},{"number":1639,"title":"Chapter 1639: The Selection Day is Here!","paragraphs":["Chapter 1639: The Selection Day is Here!","If that were the case, that old man would be in trouble.","Many Radiance Hundred Sequence members were disappointed that Liu Jie and Xia Qing had not fought properly.","However, this was just an appetizer.","Every fight that came next led to changes in the Radiance Hundred Sequence ranking.","All of them ended up fighting their most difficult opponent.","Lei Ou defeated Li Ang to raise himself from Sequence #7 to Sequence #4.","White Devil raised herself from Sequence #18 to Sequence #16, while Unknown Flame fell from Sequence #57 to Sequence #59.","She sat crumpled in her seat next to Wang Fan as he tried to comfort her.","Wang Fan raised himself from #63 to #46. But he was eventually targeted and defeated, leading to a fall to Sequence #55.","Compared to the unfortunate time that Wang Fan and Anna were having, Bai Hao was having a much better time as he raised himself from Sequence #87 to Sequence #52.","When he was challenged later, he did whatever he could to end the battle as soon as possible. He used his strongest attack without wasting any time and wiped out the few spirit qi professionals who challenged him in an instant.","As such, Bai Hao managed to keep his rank of Sequence #52.","Liu Jie was the biggest black horse present, and the second one had to be Zhao Xiaochun.","Zhao Xiaochun exposed the secret weapon she had been hiding up till now, the source-type lifeform Glutton Innkeeper Worm, and raised herself from Sequence #21 to Sequence #9.","Shi Xu managed to retain his position as Sequence #6.","Fang Duoduo did not fall far from Sequence #43 to Sequence #46.","This massive reshuffling of the Radiance Hundred Sequence ranks exceeded the expectations of everyone.","Now, the last ten people in the ranking who had to participate in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection were decided.","They would have to take on the new contenders to try and keep their spot in the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","After the Radiance Hundred Sequence’s reranking ended, Liu Wencheng coughed and said, “Now, take your seats according to your new rankings! Tomorrow, you will sit according to your new ranking to spectate the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.”","Liu Wencheng left Star Web to report the Radiance Hundred Sequence reranking outcome before attending the last imperial meeting before the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","...","A sunny rain had just fallen.","Lin Yuan was in the 100 Buildings and was about to enter the Spirit Lock spatial zone to evolve some feys when he received a call from Gao Feng.","“Lin Yuan, where are you? I’m in the 100 Buildings! I just finished talking to the City Lord of Wind Mist City. I can come and see you now!”","The faction that Gao Feng belonged to was situated in the Wind Mist City, and he was now Cicada Song’s disciple. Thus, it was unsurprising that the City Lord of Wind Mist City would seek Gao Feng out for a discussion.","It was likely that there were other City Lords who wanted to chat with Gao Feng.","Gao Feng’s Master was in charge of all of the City Lords.","Since Gao Feng was looking for him, Lin Yuan would not turn him down.","Today would be the last free time they would have before the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","Lin Yuan told Gao Feng his building and room number, “I’m in Building 13, Room 226 on the second floor.”","When Lin Yuan found out that Gao Feng wanted to participate in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection, he intended to take Gao Feng under his wing.","But now, it was clear that Gao Feng did not need Lin Yuan to protect him. The Breeze Hibiscus, Spirit Spring Lily, and Yellow Spring Lily had an average power of Diamond X/Fantasy V.","The only people who owned Diamond feys within the Radiance Hundred Sequence were those whose ranks were pushed down.","Although the Breeze Hibiscus was not skilled at combat, its grade was an unchangeable fact.","No normal fey would be able to handle the violent winds that the Breeze Hibiscus generated.","Soon, someone knocked on Lin Yuan’s room door.","When Lin Yuan opened the door, Gao Feng walked in and sobbed as he spoke. “Lin Yuan, you have to help me! I heard from An He that in the three days that the selection is taking place, 20 dimensional rifts will be opened! It will be a survival battle! Spirit qi professionals are allowed to form teams. I can handle normal opponents, but there’s no way I’ll be able to take on insect tides!”","Gao Feng now knew how the Memory-Consuming Eight Tunes Box could be useful.","Clearly, he was the best candidate to take on the Freedom Federation envoy group.","Hence, Gao Feng was afraid that he would run out of luck and be eliminated by the insect tides before meeting Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment before his eyes lit up.","He took out one of the Ethereal Jellyfish’s tentacles and handed it to Gao Feng.","If one entered Star Web with a Diamond fey storage box, all the items within it would be filtered out.","The spirit qi professionals would definitely be allowed to take items like food and water with them to a three-day-long survival battle.","At that time, Gao Feng would just need to take the Ethereal Jellyfish’s tentacle with him, and Lin Yuan would be able to sense Gao Feng’s location and go and meet up with him.","After their discussion yesterday, all of them reported the abilities of their feys.","As such, Gao Feng knew about Lin Yuan’s Ethereal Jellyfish, and all of his worries smoothed themselves out.","The selection was taking place tomorrow, and Gao Feng felt that he would have nothing to do if he returned to his own room.","Lin Yuan also had his own room and did not have any roommates. As such, Gao Feng stayed and spent the night with Lin Yuan.","The next morning, the sun hung high in the cloudless sky.","Although the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection was going to take place on Star Web, the opening ceremony was going to take place in real life.","Usually, this was the only day that people would be able to see the 13 members of royalty.","At Gao Feng’s strong insistence, Lin Yuan put on a set of black spirit qi clothes.","This set of spirit qi clothes was very similar to the one he wore when he first appeared as Black.","But the mask had changed significantly due to the transformation of Genius’ bloodline.","When Lin Yuan put on the new mask, he had even been called Black’s fake fan.","Although Lin Yuan was also dressed as Black today, no one would recognize him as long as he wore this new mask. Rather, those who wore the old silver mask were the ones who ended up being mistaken for Black.","When Gao Feng noticed this, he forcefully suppressed a smile.","But when he saw those people wearing silver masks sneer at Lin Yuan, Gao Feng could not help but guffaw loudly.","He laughed so hard that he ended up coughing and spluttering.","Lin Yuan felt extremely awkward standing next to Gao Feng.","At that moment, two strange yet elegant cries filled the air.","This immediately attracted the attention of the people walking out of the 100 Buildings."]},{"number":1640,"title":"Chapter 1640 The Radiance Federation’s Rules!","paragraphs":["1640 The Radiance Federation’s Rules!","It was not just these new candidates walking out of the 100 Buildings; even the people in the furthest corners of the Royal Capital could see the two twisting figures in the sky.","One green and one white figure were pulling a throne. There were moonstones that shone with moonlight embedded into the throne.","The people who saw this from afar immediately exploded with delight because they knew that the fey carriage pulled by giant snakes was called the Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage and that it belonged to the Moon Empress.","All the people cheered as the Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage neared because they knew that the Moon Empress was sitting inside.","She was a member of royalty who always protected the Radiance Federation.","However, the young people who walked out of the 100 Buildings and City Lords were all shocked and in fear rather than surprised and happy.","Lin Yuan had seen the Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage before.","The Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage had always been stored in the Leaning Moon Mountain’s Moon Stable.","The two snakes were usually in human form as they guarded the Moon Stable.","They had special bloodlines.","When Lin Yuan last saw the two snakes change from human to their original forms, they had only been about 1,000 meters long. But now, they were 3,000 meters long.","Evidently, the two snakes’ power had increased.","When Lin Yuan last used Morbius to check on the two snakes, Morbius had not been able to learn anything. This meant that they had reached Immortal.","Once a fey’s power reached a certain extent, it was unlikely for its size and appearance to change significantly unless it underwent a special evolution.","But the two snakes’ appearance and size had both changed drastically.","Previously, the two snakes’ wings had been rounder and glistened. But now, they resembled fins that extended to their tails. There also appeared to be lotus petals beside the fin-like wings.","Lin Yuan could tell from just the wings that the two snakes’ bloodlines had been purified.","The two snakes’ bodies were twisted together while they pulled the fey carriage.","A light green and white lotus throne was in front of the wings.","As they pulled the fey carriage, they exuded a strong frigid aura.","At the same time, the snakes’ scales had also changed from sharp and rough to resembling jade.","Lin Yuan guessed that the two snakes had reached Eternal.","The two roars had come from the snakes.","The tall pagoda was shrouded by moonlight that stretched out into the sky like ribbons.","Mystic Moon and Cold Moon stood on both sides of the moon palace, taking their place as the Moon Envoys.","Mystic Moon was dressed in a silver robe, while Cold Moon was dressed in a blue robe.","Although the two snakes had fully retracted their auras, the astonishing sight was still beyond the understanding of most members of the younger generation.","The City Lords also felt their souls tremble.","This was the Moon Empress of the Radiance Federation! Even her fey carriage had earth-shattering might.","Lin Yuan had always appeared next to the Moon Empress and often visited the Radiant Moon Palace to have question-and-answer sessions with her as well as enjoy the food she cooked.","Lin Yuan had never seen the Moon Empress from this angle.","Gao Feng gasped. “Brother, the Moon Empress’ carriage is so...”","Before Gao Feng could finish speaking, seven eagle cries broke through the clouds, and seven giant purple-winged eagles appeared on the horizon, pulling a castle-like palace.","The architectural style of the palace was different from that of the Radiance Federation.","All seven eagles had wingspan close to 1,000 meters and flew in a V-formation.","Every flap of the eagles’ wings came with bright blue and purple electric streaks, so the eagles immediately became the most eye-catching sight in the sky.","There were three elderly men standing in front of the palace, and their auras directly clashed against that of the Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage.","However, the two snakes did not react in any significant way.","Confused expressions appeared on the three elderly men’s faces.","Li Yang had decided to use the Mystic Thunderclap Kite Eagle Carriage to diminish the might of the Radiance Federation’s royalty.","There was nothing more impressive in the world than having seven Immortal Mystic Thunderclap Kite Eagles pull a fey carriage.","The group from the Freedom Federation had been waiting for the Radiance Federation’s royalty to ride out in their fey carriages.","Eventually, the first fey carriage to make its appearance belonged to the Moon Empress.","A decade ago, the Moon Empress killed one of the Freedom Federation’s royalty and eliminated one of the Freedom Federation’s legacies that they had not been able to replace up till now.","It could be said that the person that the Freedom Federation had the largest ax to grind with was the Moon Empress.","Thus, after the Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage appeared, the three elderly men immediately rode out on the Mystic Thunderclap Kite Eagle Carriage to deliver a blow to the Moon Empress.","At that moment, a chilling female voice said from within the Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage, “Soaring White, Soaring Green.”","The light green and white snakes immediately started to glow faintly, radiating an uncanny feeling.","Two 10,000-meter-long shadows appeared behind them.","An instant later, the two figures turned into two girls wearing light green and white dresses. The girls opened their mouths and breathed in sharply in the direction of the Mystic Thunderclap Kite Eagle Carriage.","The light green and white light immediately grabbed hold of the seven Immortal Mystic Thunderclap Kite Eagles, and it was as though something was being drained from within them.","A moment later, the seven Mystic Thunderclap Kite Eagles collapsed.","Lin Yuan had secretly tried to use Morbius to check on the seven Mystic Thunderclap Kite Eagles but could not see any abilities or exclusive skills.","After Morbius woke up, Morbius could hide so that targets did not notice that they were being probed.","At that moment, Lin Yuan suddenly realized he could see the seven Mystic Thunderclap Kite Eagles’ data.","Currently, the Mystic Thunderclap Kite Eagles’ grades had fallen to Sovereign IX/Creation VI.","The three elderly men bellowed, “Moon Empress, we came from the Freedom Federation to visit the Radiance Federation. Why did you attack the Mystic Thunderclap Kite Eagles?”","The chilling female voice said, “According to the Radiance Federation’s rules, any envoy group who visits must travel by foot. This is only a warning. If it happens again, Soaring White and Soaring Green will not stop at just absorbing a small portion of their qualities and grades.”"]},{"number":1641,"title":"Chapter 1641 Next Time it Will Be Death!","paragraphs":["1641 Next Time it Will Be Death!","The three elderly men were clearly unsatisfied with the Moon Empress’ reply.","Li Yang’s fey carriage was damaged, and they did not know how to account for it when they returned.","At that moment, the female voice turned even more vicious as she snarled, “Next time, it will be death!”","The three elderly men did not expect the feys pulling the Moon Empress’ fey carriage to have reached Eternal.","!!","Not even the aura of 700 of the Mystic Thunderclap Kite Eagles would be able to match up to the two Eternal Snow Splendid Celestial Soaring.","No one had more experience with the Moon Empress’ temper than the experts from the Freedom Federation. After all, one of the Freedom Federation’s royalty had died at her hands.","She was the type of person who acted without warning.","The Mystic Thunderclap Kite Eagle Carriage had been forced to land, and the three elderly men and young experts from the Freedom Federation were about to walk to the Radiance Sacred Hall when a hoarse voice said from the sky, “Moon Empress, was it really right for the feys pulling my fey carriage to have their grades depressed just because they were flying?”","A man in a long golden robe appeared in the sky in front of the Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage.","The Moon Empress replied coldly, “The Freedom Federation has not visited the Radiance Federation in a decade. Have you already forgotten the Radiance Federation’s rules? If you have forgotten, I don’t mind teaching you a lesson.”","While she spoke, the Moon Empress released her aura.","Now that the Moon Empress had obtained the Lifespan Mouse, her power had crossed a threshold, and she had taken a large step forward.","The aura the Moon Empress released was on the level she had been at when she first obtained the Lifespan Mouse.","Fear crossed his face when the man in golden robes sensed the Moon Empress’ aura.","The Moon Empress said, “Any non-Radiance Federation citizen is allowed in the Radiance Federation’s skies. As a member of the Freedom Federation’s royalty, are you trying to say that you want to be part of the Radiance Federation by entering our sky? Or are you going to go down? Otherwise, I will take your action as a provocation. I’m sure you’re well aware of why that person from the Freedom Federation died ten years ago.”","The Moon Empress’ words caused the man’s expression to change again.","Regulations were of the highest priority in the Radiance Federation.","The battle ten years ago had started because the Radiance Federation’s rules had been broken.","Li Yang knew that if he persisted, the Moon Empress would not hesitate to attack him.","From the aura the Moon Empress released, Li Yang felt that he had a similar level of strength to her, so there was no reason for him to be afraid even if she did attack him.","Still, there were 12 other members of royalty in the Radiance Federation.","Li Yang was not as stupid as that old fellow to start fighting with the Moon Empress the moment he arrived at the Radiance Federation.","As he thought about the plan and preparations they had in motion, a strange expression spread across the man’s face. His figure then disappeared from the air and appeared in front of the Freedom Federation envoy group.","Although a member of the Freedom Federation’s royalty had arrived, none of the people from the Freedom Federation envoy group looked excited.","Given how Li Yang had submitted after clashing against the Moon Empress’ aura, he had positioned himself as the weaker side.","Li Yang ignored this and said to the people behind him, “Come with me to the Radiance Sacred Hall!”","In stark contrast to the Freedom Federation envoy group were the young experts walking out of the 100 Buildings. They were all looking up at the Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage with excitement and admiration.","They knew that the Moon Empress had come out victorious in the clash against the Freedom Federation’s member of royalty. This was a huge boost to their pride.","However, Lin Yuan and Gao Feng had solemn expressions hanging on their faces.","The Freedom Federation had sent out a member of royalty during this visit, but he only appeared after events started to unfold.","This indicated that the Freedom Federation was definitely up to something. They had to be planning something by sending out a member of their royalty.","Lin Yuan and Gao Feng did not join the other members of the younger generation in cheering. They were more focused on the bigger picture. The two of them were aware that power was the only thing that allowed the Radiance Federation to win that pride.","If the two snakes pulling fey carriage had not evolved, there was no way they would have been able to compete with the might of the seven Mystic Thunderclap Kite Eagles.","If the Moon Empress was not strong enough, she would not have been able to fend off the member of the Freedom Federation’s royalty named Li Yang.","What had just happened was essentially a farce.","Now that the matter was settled, the two snakes continued pulling the carriage to the Radiance Sacred Hall.","Not long after the Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage arrived, more fey carriages appeared and headed toward the Radiance Sacred Hall.","These fey carriages were of all shapes and sizes.","The weakest feys pulling the carriages were Immortal.","Every fey carriage had the crest of a member of royalty.","This was a visual feast for the regular people.","At that moment, a young man at the back of the Freedom Federation envoy group passed Yan Ling, Cai Huo, and You Changjian.","Qian Yu walked over to Li Yang and asked, “Has the Freedom Federation finished the preparations?”","Li Yang looked at Qian Yu and said, “Since I’ve arrived, it’s to be expected that the Freedom Federation has finished preparations. Are you prepared?”","The young man’s eyes clouded over, and he said after a pause, “We are prepared. Sixth Page Lashing’s Black Mass Cup started pouring long ago. We are just waiting for the Freedom Federation to act, and we will instantly follow. Moreover, I have called all four knights over as an added safety net.”","Li Yang was not given a chance to ask more questions before this young man returned to his original position at the back of the group.","You Changjian, Cai Huo, and Cai Huo looked at this young man with fright, while the others looked at him with pure terror as they walked into the Radiance Sacred Hall.","When they reached the door of the Radiance Sacred Hall, Li Yang realized how large the interior actually was.","The Radiance Sacred Hall was ten times larger than the Radiance Palace.","The white pillars in the four corners jutted up into the clouds, and the space seemed almost dreamlike.","Thousands of white pillars circled the hall, and there was a connecting space between every pair of pillars.","These connecting spaces were the audience seats.","There were 13 golden pillars at the front, on top of which set 13 thrones.","This was where the members of royalty were going to sit."]},{"number":1642,"title":"Chapter 1642 Fourth Secure Federation Treasure!","paragraphs":["1642 Fourth Secure Federation Treasure!","There were five rainbow stone pillars lined up with the 13 golden pillars, and they were just as tall as the golden pillars.","The five rainbow stone pillars were where the Radiance Envoys would sit.","However, the Radiance Envoys generally did not participate in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","The stone pillars were rainbow-colored to represent the color of uncontracted sacred source lifeforms. This was clear enough to tell that the Radiance Federation valued their Radiance Envoys.","!!","Or rather, they valued their legacies.","There were 10 five-colored stone pillars below the 13 golden pillars and five rainbow pillars.","These five-colored stone pillars were shorter, and each pair flanked a rainbow pillar.","These 10 five-colored pillars were where the Radiance Knights sat.","There were also 100 silver pillars significantly shorter than the five-colored pillars.","This was where the Radiance Hundred Sequence sat.","However, the 100 seats would not be filled during the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection because Sequence #91 to Sequence #100 would be competing.","Before they passed the selection, they did not have the right to share in the glory of being a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Lin Yuan stood next to Gao Feng as the two followed the crowd into the courtyard.","At that moment, a moo filled the air, and a giant light green cow with flames at its feet and Yin-Yang patterns on its body appeared.","A young man dressed in red and gold robes was on the light green cow’s back. There was a long scar extending from the corner of his eye to his ear. Yet, the young man’s face did not seem malevolent at all. Rather, it gave him the aura of persistence.","Lin Yuan immediately used Morbius to check on the cow-species fey.","The Yin-Yang Double Instrument Cow was Suzerain X/pinnacle Myth II.","Given its grade and quality, the cow-species fey could already change into human form.","Despite clearly being younger than 30, the young man already possessed such power. Since he appeared at the Radiance Sacred Hall, it proved his identity.","Lin Yuan had received a call from An He when he was chatting with Gao Feng last night.","An He had told him that his senior brother, the current third Radiance Envoy Liu Yifan, would attend the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection and host the test.","An He worshiped his senior brother.","Lin Yuan realized this when he held a discussion with Liu Jie, Zong Ze, Gu Lang, Gao Feng, and An He.","There was no way that An He would call and lie to him.","The young man riding the Yin-Yang Double Instrument Cow apparently was An He’s senior brother, Long Lamplight’s first disciple, and the current third Radiance Envoy.","The Yin-Yang Double Instrument Cow landed on the center rainbow stone pillar, and the crowd cheered when they saw the young man take his seat.","It was very rare for the five Radiance Envoys to make an appearance.","Lin Yuan still had not had the chance to meet them, much less others.","Liu Yifan stood at the center rainbow stone pillar and looked down at the young experts who were about to participate in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","Liu Yifan felt as though he was looking at the 18-year-old version of himself.","He said loudly, “Everyone quiet. As the third Radiance Envoy, I hope that all of you will do your best during the test. Now, let us welcome the Radiance Hundred Sequence.”","The moment Liu Yifan finished speaking, 90 Jade-Holding Cinnabar Cranes carrying 90 members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence flew to the silver pillars.","The Jade-Holding Cinnabar Cranes were very lucky and usually kept in the Hundred Beasts Monastery. They were only used to carry the members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence during the annual Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","At that moment, Lin Yuan and Gao Feng noticed a maskless Liu Jie standing at the position of Sequence #1 while Long Tao took the position of Sequence #2.","Now, Liu Jie had the title of Sequence #1 of the Radiance Hundred Sequence and Heart of the Insect Swarm.","Liu Jie and Long Tao looked out into the crowd to find where Lin Yuan and Long Tao were.","It was very difficult to pick out two people amongst thousands.","Moreover, Liu Jie and Long Tao realized that many people were wearing silver masks.","When they realized that finding Lin Yuan and Gao Feng would be impossible, they shifted their gazes to Liu Yifan.","Clearly, Liu Yifan was acquainted with Xia Qing as he nodded at her.","Long Tao looked at Liu Yifan with both respect and yearning.","Long Tao wanted to become a Radiance Envoy.","But after discovering Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, and Zong Ze’s powers, he knew that becoming a Radiance Envoy would be an impossibility for him. Thus, Long Tao set his sights on the five-colored stone pillars behind Liu Yifan.","It was the same for Liu Jie, but he had a completely different idea from Long Tao.","Liu Jie was not giving up because he lacked power but because he realized what it was that he truly wanted. Hence, Liu Jie aimed for the five-colored stone pillars right from the beginning.","Nonetheless, Liu Jie’s gaze moved between the seven rainbow stone pillars as he wondered which seat Lin Yuan would be taking a year later.","At that time, he had to stand firmly behind Lin Yuan.","Most of the contenders for the Radiance Hundred Sequence were focused on the members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence because those were the positions that they were aiming for.","If they could prove themselves, they would be carried off on the back of the Jade-Holding Cinnabar Crane to one of the silver stone pillars before the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection ended.","Lin Yuan looked at the members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence and noticed that Zhao Xiaochun’s progress was the greatest.","The couple Zhao Xiaochun and Shi Xu—one of them was Sequence #6 while the other was Sequence #9.","Shi Xu and Zhao Xiaochun were the only couple in the top ten ranks of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","At that moment, Liu Yifan said austerely, “Let us welcome the fourth of the seven Secure Federation Treasures, the Mountain River Grain God Bells.”","The moment Liu Yifan spoke, a bell chime sounded out, followed by several more in succession.","A power rushed into the Radiance Sacred Hall.","Everyone watched as an enormous set of bells was suspended at the center of the Radiance Sacred Hall.","The bells were bronze and had the patterns of rivers carved into them. Every river had a ley line underneath it, and every line seemed capable of morphing into a dragon at any time.","Although no one had struck them, the bells continued to chime."]},{"number":1643,"title":"Chapter 1643 Officially Begin!","paragraphs":["1643 Officially Begin!","Lin Yuan had heard the Moon Empress mention that the seven Secure Federation Treasures were instruments made from the corpses of seven 10 Stars and above sacred source lifeforms, and they were able to influence celestial phenomena to a certain extent.","However, Lin Yuan did not know what the Mountain River Grain God Bells’ function was. It seemed that it was related to defense.","The entire area within the Radiance Sacred Hall had become a separate world.","After introducing the Mountain River Grain God Bells, Liu Yifan said, “Let us welcome the envoy groups from the Freedom Federation and Azure Federation to take their seats.”","As the fourth Azure Envoy of the Azure Federation, Yin Lin led the Azure Federation envoy group to their seats.","However, the Freedom Federation envoy group did not follow Liu Yifan’s instructions.","Li Yang stood unmovingly in front of the Freedom Federation envoy group. As such, Qin Yu could not move forward either.","Since a member of royalty had arrived, a Freedom Envoy had lost the yoke of authority.","This was where the Freedom Federation differed from the Radiance Federation.","At that moment, the Mountain River Grain God Bells suddenly grew brighter, and the 180 ley lines inscribed on the bells lit up.","The ley lines turned into dragons that reared their heads.","The power of the rivers crashed down on Li Yang.","Each anvil of power from a dragon was like a real flowing mountain river. This power was on par with that of a celestial phenomenon.","Li Yang glanced at the power that was plunging down on him and started walking toward the seats.","Li Yang was well aware of the power of the Radiance Federation’s Secure Federation Treasures.","In order to defend against it, Li Yang would have to reveal his power.","Once he revealed his power, it would be impossible for the members of royalty not to step in.","He thought about his reason for coming and forcefully suppressed his temper before continuing to walk forward.","Qian Yu scrambled to follow him.","Every member of the Freedom Federation’s royalty had their own motives.","No matter what Li Yang did, Qian Yu and the rest would be punished if they failed in their goal of coming to the Radiance Federation. Hence, Qian Yu did not want a clash to break out.","Ever since the power of the Mountain River Grain God Bells forced Li Yang to walk toward the seats, the mighty aura circled the sky and returned to the engravings on the Mountain River Grain God Bells.","The aftereffect of the returning power caused the Mountain River Grain God Bells to release another chime.","When the two visiting envoy groups took their seats, Liu Yifan announced, “Let us welcome in the members of royalty.”","13 fey carriages of various shapes and sizes appeared in front of the golden stone pillars.","The 13 members of royalty appeared dressed in their coronation costumes and took their seats on the golden stone pillars.","From the moment that the members of royalty sat down, the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection officially began.","Liu Wencheng oversaw the Radiance Hundred Sequence tests and said, “The Radiance Hundred Sequence selection will now officially begin.","“Everyone, use your Star Web card to enter Star Web and enter the transportation door in front of you. You will find yourself at the testing ground.","“This test will last three days. After two days, the area of the testing ground will start to shrink. Different dimensional rifts will also appear in the testing ground. The test will end when only ten participants are left, and these are the people who will take up Sequence #91 to #100 of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","“The original Sequence #91 to #100 of the Radiance Hundred Sequence will join the test as contestants. This is the end of what I have to say. Since the test is taking place on Star Web, none of you will be in any real danger. As such, no additional rules are required for this Radiance Hundred Sequence selection. Now, let us begin!”","After Liu Wencheng was done speaking, he said to the two elderly men beside him, “Wen Qu, Wu Qu, go and give the envoy groups temporary Star Web cards so they will be able to watch the selection.”","The two elderly men leaped toward where the two envoy groups were seated.","The two envoy groups were greatly looking forward to experiencing the marvel that was Star Web.","It was impossible to replicate something composed of three sacred source lifeforms.","There was no place more crowded and lively now than Star Web.","It was not an exaggeration to say that anyone with a Star Web Card had already entered Star Web to watch the official broadcast or was waiting in live-streaming rooms for their favorite hosts to live stream the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","If they had a particular contestant that they had their eyes on, they could adjust it so that they had a focused perspective on this expert.","There were five times the normal amount of posts and fan club activity.","The bad-tempered users had already started screeching in the live-streaming rooms.","“Why hasn’t it started yet? Hurry up! I don’t want to wait any longer! I will be setting my focused perspective on Black! There’s no way he won’t use any big moves or summon feys throughout the entire Radiance Hundred Sequence selection!”","“I think that Black will be able to continue hiding his power. He did not even have to expose his power when he fought against Lu Shuang. How can his opponents during the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection be stronger than her?”","“Didn’t you see the battle rules announced on Star Web two minutes ago? It’s a survival battle! Black will not only have to face opponents but also the insect tides from the dimensional rifts. Will Black continue to remain so high and mighty in such a situation?”","“As a citizen of Millstone Town, the test reminded me of Black’s plant-type fey. No one from Millstone Town will forget the sea of flowers that clashed and chewed up the insect tide.”","“Who cares about Black? My son is one of the 100 contestants sent from Raging Waves City. I will be watching him!”","Lu Shuang’s popularity had exploded after her fight with Black. Moreover, she had recently been using Black to boost her popularity.","As such, there was a huge audience in Lu Shuang’s live-streaming room.","After looking at the rules for a moment, Lu Shuang said, “This test is mainly assessing teamwork. There’s no way a person can defend against a Class 3 insect tide on their own!","“A Class 2 insect tide has the same power as Platinum feys! Even if they have Diamond feys, they won’t be able to last three days on their own unless their feys are suited for endurance battles.","“Moreover, the dimensional rifts will be opening at random. If two dimensional rifts happen to open close together, one will have to take on double damage at once. Thus, surviving the next three days will be impossible without forming a team! They will have to work together.”"]},{"number":1644,"title":"Chapter 1644 The Image is Here!","paragraphs":["1644 The Image is Here!","At that moment, Lu Shuang’s chest thudded. She knew that this would be not only a test of strength but also character.","Although Lu Shuang had never participated in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection or been a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, she was not weak.","She had not participated when she was eligible because she was a defense-type spirit qi professional who used spiritual-type feys. This combination was too unorthodox and made her an easy target.","Besides using up spiritual power, one also had to use spiritual energy during the fight.","It was easy to replenish spiritual power but replenishing spiritual energy took some time.","This was why Lu Shuang had given up on becoming a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","But this year’s test method eliminated the disadvantages faced by healing-type and support-type spirit qi professionals.","Healing-type and support-type spirit qi professionals were always more welcome in a team than power offense-type spirit qi professionals.","If this had been the method of testing when she was eligible for participation, the Exquisite Rhino Giraffe’s ability to recover the spiritual energy of other feys would definitely have led it to be protected by the other team members.","Lu Shuang felt confident that she would succeed with this method of testing.","Her father was a Spirit Guard, and her mother was an official secretary in Cloud Lake City, so the background she had been brought up in allowed her to hone a keener judgment than others.","A month ago, balloon flowers had bloomed in the Radiance Federation’s sky. These flowers had spat out lava that rained down from the sky, and a giant golden tree had protected the land from being burned by the rain of lava.","Lu Shuang knew that a violent clash between the Radiance Federation and Freedom Federation was inevitable.","The location of the clash would be the Major Federation Meeting.","However, the effects of the impending clash were already starting to roll out.","News of the opening of the Class 6 abyss dimensional rift and the construction of the representative cities in the abyssal world had appeared too abruptly.","As such, the price of feys in the Radiance Federation had skyrocketed.","The members of royalty had resorted to releasing thousands of their own resources to soothe the volatile market and bring the prices of resources back down to a stable level.","They also had to oversee the construction of the representative cities in the abyssal world.","Lu Shuang could tangibly feel the era shifting. Even the air was different!","Spirit qi professionals used to perform many tasks and could make a living for themselves without risk by harvesting wild crops.","But with the expansion of the abyssal world, they would become grievously injured or even lose their lives in an instant if they were careless.","The members of royalty had declared that all 36 major cities had to build a representative version of themselves in the abyssal world.","On the one hand, this increased the Radiance Federation’s territory and allowed them to gain more resources by controlling the source of the resources themselves, but it was also a military tactic as every spirit qi professional would have no choice but to undergo hard training.","In such times, the members of royalty felt that the mindset and characters of the Radiance Hundred Sequence took precedence over how much power they possessed.","A spirit qi professional’s power depended on their ability to comprehend Willpower Runes, the rate at which they promoted their rank, and how many Creation Master resources they had.","Creation Master was such a special occupation that one could evolve a Normal fey to Diamond grade in the span of a few short days.","As long as a person had the ability to comprehend Willpower Runes, did not promote his spirit qi professional rank too slowly, and had sufficient Creation Master resources, they would be known as a genius.","If one lacked Creation Master resources and only had talent, it would not translate into many practical effects.","After all, spirit qi professionals depended on their feys to do battle and not their own bodies.","As long as a member of royalty wanted to, they could turn the most seemingly useless chunk of carbon into a shining diamond.","Nonetheless, this was a slight exaggeration.","This method of selecting the members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence was much more objective than filtering them through battles.","Moreover, it would be impossible that the ten that emerged would be weak.","Lu Shuang did not feel any uncertainty about Black’s chances of becoming a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","He had defeated her, after all!","There was no doubt that he would secure a place for himself.","Lu Shuang felt that it was almost bullying for experts who had attained god-class to participate in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","However, most of the viewers in her live-streaming room were Black’s fans. Hence, she had no choice but to set her individual perspective on him.","Starlight Luan i: Shuang, what are you thinking about? Why aren’t you saying anything? If you don’t speak up more, Poison Beauty’s popularity will surpass yours! She has encountered Black thrice, and people are already calling her Black’s Wife. They’re saying that she and Black are fated and a match made in heaven!","Both Lu Shuang and Poison Beauty were veteran hosts.","If Lu Shuang knew how to take advantage of Black’s popularity to boost herself, so did Poison Beauty.","Moreover, Poison Beauty had been a sales host for some time and developed a very glib tongue.","During her live stream, Poison Beauty always noticed minute but accurate details.","It was true that Poison Beauty had encountered Black several times.","At present, Poison Beauty’s live-streaming room was booming with activity.","“I’m telling you! You have to believe me! Black’s blue sparrow-species fey is definitely light-type! How can I be wrong about my rival? During our previous right, I sensed movement in the ground below me. Black definitely used a sand-elemental source-type lifeform!”","Poison Beauty continued to describe Black as she instructed the official Star Web employees to block troublemakers.","Her live-streaming room was like a treasure chest that was continuously amassing treasures.","She did not want a few drops of ink to stain the entire picture.","When Starlight Luan i mentioned Poison Beauty, Lu Shuang went to check and discovered that Poison Beauty’s popularity had indeed shot past hers.","Poison Beauty’s live stream was now even more popular than those of the retired members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Lu Shuang anxiously brought out her moves and launched into an analysis of Black’s eight-tailed cat.","The information Poison Beauty gave out about Black could be found in posts all around Star Web.","However, Lu Shuang was the only one who had personally encountered the eight-tailed cat, and no one else could claim the same.","Until the time that Black summoned the eight-tailed cat again, Lu Shuang’s words were the closest to the truth that the public could access.","But before Lu Shuang could get her ball rolling, something appeared on Black’s perspective view."]},{"number":1645,"title":"Chapter 1645 Rejected Invite!","paragraphs":["1645 Rejected Invite!","The image showed a young man dressed in black spirit qi clothes.","Lu Shuang’s audience immediately went into a frenzy.","This Car Doesn’t Go to Kindergarten: Look! My husband has finally appeared! I’m so excited! Honey, quickly summon your feys so I can get a look at them!","Girl Who Doesn’t Step on Ants: Black’s perspective is finally showing something! The Radiance Hundred Sequence selection is starting! This time, the selection will last for 72 hours. The next 72 hours are going to be a sensory overload!","Free As Wing: Hm? Why isn’t Black moving? Move, Black! I can’t take it!","Your Psyche: Black’s female fans, please watch yourselves. As Black’s male mother, I don’t approve of you coupling up with my son!","Comments were streaming in like a waterfall.","But as they continued to post their reactions, everyone realized a problem.","The mask that Black was wearing was completely different from the one that everyone associated with him.","As such, everyone watching became confused.","Could it be that Black had put on a special mask for the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection?","Black’s previous mask had been light silver with three faint patterns on it. It was very easy to replicate.","With just 500 Federation dollars, any metalsmith would be able to create a replica.","This was why Black’s fans could imitate him so easily.","The mask that Black was currently wearing had four patterns running down it. They were very faint and resembled silk threads blowing in the wind.","Lu Shuang inhaled sharply when she noticed this.","On Star Web, it had been a point of debate whether Black’s mask was actually a fey that had used Tool Transformation.","Lu Shuang had always believed that there was more to Black’s mask than met the eye because it had lit up when Black took on the Exquisite Rhino Giraffe’s attack.","Given Black’s tendency to keep a low profile, he would not create a new mask just for the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","When feys that used Tool Transformation evolved their bloodlines and increased their power, the type of tool they transformed into would not change, but the design would become even more impressive.","The changes to Black’s mask perfectly fit this concept.","Lu Shuang was now certain that the cat-species fey that Black had used to defeat her was even stronger now!","Since Lin Yuan had not made a move, Lu Shuang’s audience became confused.","They were not alone. Everyone else watching Black’s perspective was also confused.","Why wasn’t he moving? He had a thoughtful look as though he was sensing something.","As a result, many audience members left the live-streaming room and switched to other perspectives.","They saw that everyone else had already started moving.","As a result, complaints started streaming into the live-streaming room.","Stupid Bean: No way! Can it be that Black thinks that he’s too powerful to become a target? Is he planning on standing there until the test ends?","Hating the World: If Black removes his mask, his visual feast will feed me for three days straight! But his mask is so boring!","Strange Father: If another five minutes pass and Black still doesn’t move, I will switch to another live-streaming room to watch other candidates!","Please Teach Me the Rest: Look, other people have appeared in Black’s perspective view!","At present, Lin Yuan was trying to sense Gao Feng’s location through the Ethereal Jellyfish.","A moment later, Lin Yuan got a general sense of where Gao Feng was.","Gao Feng was not far from him.","The test ground was 10,000 square kilometers, and every inch of it was unknown to the participating spirit qi professionals.","Liu Wencheng had said that the first dimensional rift would open three hours after they entered the testing ground. Then, the other dimensional rifts would open every two hours.","A day and a half later, all 20 dimensional rifts would be open.","Hence, after the candidates were sent to the testing ground, the first thing they wanted to do was to find a teammate.","A female candidate’s eyes lit up when she spotted Lin Yuan, and she dashed over him on her two-headed flaming dog.","“You must be one of Black’s fans too! Haha, I can tell you’re a fake fan. Your mask isn’t even right! But your mask sure is pretty. My name is Chen Lu. Let’s go and look for other candidates together! I’m sure you’ve realized that we have to cooperate for this test. Everything else can wait for after we manage to survive.”","Lin Yuan raised an eyebrow.","This girl named Chen Lu had sure thought of everything!","With such a testing technique, there was no need for a massacre to break out instantly.","Every other candidate was not just an opponent but also a potential teammate.","In the three hours before the first dimensional rift opened, it would be a test of leadership ability.","There had to be a firm decision-maker in every group.","Once the first dimensional rift opened, the tide of dimensional lifeforms would begin their march.","With a new dimensional rift opening every two hours, the battleground would slowly stretch out until the entire test ground was covered.","The appearance of the dimensional rifts made the test into a large-scale version of Capture the Flag.","However, every flag had a mind of its own.","Lin Yuan shook his head in response to Chen Lu’s invitation.","Chen Lu glared at Lin Yuan when he turned her down before charging full-speed at him on her two-headed flaming dog.","From the moment that Lin Yuan shook his head, he became an idiot in Chen Lu’s eyes.","She thought that he understood what needed to be done in this test.","It would be a waste of time to interact with idiots, and they served no real purpose.","Since she also did not know what kind of power Lin Yuan possessed, Chen Lu felt that it would be better just to eliminate Lin Yuan.","When Chen Lu drew near to Lin Yuan, a thought crossed her mind.","This idiot didn’t even summon a fey when he was transported to the testing ground. Having a teammate like him will just get in my way.","Chen Lu had not noticed anything, but the audience members focused on Lin Yuan had caught sight of an amber button falling from Lin Yuan’s wrist.","When the amber button landed on the ground, it turned into a grain of sand and burrowed underground.","The eyes of the audience members lit up because they knew Lin Yuan was using a sand-elemental source-type lifeform.","Currently, Lin Yuan was planning on journeying to meet up with Gao Feng.","Soon, to everyone’s astonishment, thousands of black feathers shot out of the ground.","The black feathers swirled around Black like a tornado and quickly took the shape of four pairs of wings that attached themselves to Black’s back.","With a flap of the wings, Black took to the sky."]},{"number":1646,"title":"Chapter 1646 The Contestants’ Hard Work Cannot Go to Waste!","paragraphs":["1646 The Contestants’ Hard Work Cannot Go to Waste!","The first time Lin Yuan logged into Star Web, he was 1.7 meters tall. After consuming the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar and Earth Center Fine Milk, considering the fact that he was still a growing 18-year-old boy, he had already reached a height of about 1.81 meters.","With such a height, he had the ideal height for a male spirit qi professional.","The wings on Lin Yuan’s back had different sizes.","Since the wings were mainly for flight and defense, the shape of every feather was molded after Lin Yuan’s observation of Gray’s feathers.","Hence, Lin Yuan’s wings greatly resembled that of a crane.","The wings were not arranged in an orderly manner. But when they flapped, they perfectly came together to fulfill the laws of mechanics.","Moreover, they had the rhythm of a soaring crane.","Overall, they were majestic!","Most of the spectators focused on Lin Yuan could not help but gasp.","Sunlight: What the hell? Black now has wings on his back! Has he fused with some sort of avian-type fey?","Cold Rain Ice: My husband is so handsome. If only he’ll pick me up bridal style and take me for a spin around the sky!","I Love Tigers!: When Black fought on the Celestial Stairway, he never showed this move! It looks like he will finally be revealing some new tricks during this Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","Heart of Dreams: I don’t think Black has fused with a fey. He grew wings, but no other part of him has changed. Didn’t you see that the black feathers came out of the ground? These black feathers are formed from the amber button that turned into a sand granule.","Speechless: I’m not going to guess! We’ll get an answer from a post soon! Those bigshots will figure out how Black’s wings came about in ten minutes.","Lin Yuan flew off in Gao Feng’s direction.","Along the way, he spotted many contestants and even passed Chen Lu riding on her two-headed flaming dog, who looked up at him in shock.","Lin Yuan was intentionally not picking another person to team with besides Gao Feng because he was confident that he would be able to keep any spirit qi professional alive for three days.","Thus, it would be unfair to the other contestants if Lin Yuan picked another teammate.","Every participating contestant had been preparing for this Radiance Hundred Sequence selection for a long time.","This was an important turning point in their lives.","All their hard work culminated at this moment.","They were chosen by their cities so they could bring glory as members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Lin Yuan, who worked night and day, could understand this.","He could not waste the contestants’ hard work.","When Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, Gu Lang, Zong Ze, An He, and Gao Feng met up for their discussion, An He suggested that Lin Yuan and Gao Feng take out the most powerful contestants right from the get-go until only eight contestants of average power were left.","They would then take on the Freedom Federation envoy group with these eight contestants.","Through this, they would use another method to preserve the Radiance Federation’s top young talents.","After An He brought up this suggestion, Lin Yuan shot it down.","If they ruined the Radiance Hundred Sequence test in front of the entire Radiance Federation and two federation envoy groups, they would be bringing disgrace to the Radiance Federation.","Additionally, this would make the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection meaningless, and it was likely that all the honor that came with being a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection would be stripped for the next few years.","Lin Yuan did not have the right to bring shame on the hard work that these contestants had put in, nor could he tarnish the Radiance Federation’s honor.","The Freedom Federation envoy group’s leader had changed from a Freedom Envoy to a member of royalty. But neither of them were stupid.","If Lin Yuan did such a thing, it would alert the Freedom Federation that the Radiance Federation was aware of an impending scheme.","That would be very bad news!","Lin Yuan had to see this test through with Gao Feng so they could survive the remaining three days together and emerge as two of the ten victors.","Once the Source Sand fell to the ground, it burrowed down to a depth of 50 meters and started smashing apart rocks rapidly to generate large amounts of sand.","The deeper underground it was, the slower it would generate sand and the more spiritual power it would have to use.","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan chose this option because he wanted to scout the underground.","Only rocks were present 50 meters underground.","The sand generated from breaking the rocks was stronger than the sand made from dirt.","Additionally, if there happened to be a Class 2 subterranean dimensional rift amongst the dimensional rifts that randomly opened, the thickness of 50 meters of sand above it would not cause the ground to collapse.","The Source Sand had reached Diamond X/Fantasy V and could generate sand rapidly.","One granule of sand could grind down all the rocks within a few seconds in a ten-square meter radius.","The yellow sand extended alongside Lin Yuan as he flew.","None of the audience members on Star Web was aware of this.","Only Mystic Moon, the Spacetime Elder, and another member of royalty raised their eyebrows in surprise. However, none of them said anything. Instead, they focused more of their attention on Lin Yuan.","The Spacetime Elder and the other member of royalty knew that Mystic Moon had intentionally sealed off Black’s information.","If he possessed a Diamond X/Fantasy V source-type lifeform at such a young age, he could only be the Moon Empress’ disciple Lin Yuan.","The audience members waiting for analysis posts quickly found a post written by Master Duan Li.","Duan Li had become an expert analyst on Black. She had been researching Black’s feys and trying to uncover his secrets before sharing what she learned on Star Web.","This allowed her reputation to rise, and she lived like an online celebrity now. Many people called her ‘The Sellout Class 4 Creation Master.”","However, Master Duan Li did not care. Her mind was only filled with increasing curiosity about Black.","Duan Li found it abnormal for a young expert to possess such power.","Duan Li: According to my observation, the black wings are not a result of Black fusing with a fey. If my eyes don’t deceive me, the wings’ feathers are made of Day and Night Spirit Silver. If Black injects spirit qi into them, they should be able to turn white.","As such, my hypothesis is that Black’s sand-elemental source-type lifeform either has the ability to consume and manipulate metal or Black has a fey or source-type lifeform with the ability to control metal, and that’s the thing that controls the wings’ movements."]},{"number":1647,"title":"Chapter 1647 Why Does it Seem Like a Vacation?","paragraphs":["1647 Why Does it Seem Like a Vacation?","When the Star Web users saw Master Duan Li’s post, they gained a basic understanding of Black’s wings.","After all, any person with half a brain would know not to question a Class 4 Creation Master.","Given the knowledge that a Class 4 Creation Master possessed, they could even analyze an emperor-class expert’s Myth Breed fey, much less a young talent like Black.","The Star Web users started following Master Duan Li’s account.","Master Duan Li seemed to have latched onto Black of late as she continuously searched for information about him.","No matter how astonishing Black’s performance was, they could just read Master Duan Li’s post and would immediately gain a better understanding of Black’s feys.","After Lin Yuan met Chen Lu and flew up into the air, many spirit qi professionals caught sight of him and started chasing him on their avian-type feys.","However, Lin Yuan was too quick.","When he was flying in a rush, he was even quicker than the Platinum Divine Travel Black Swallow.","Thus, none of the contestants with avian-type feys managed to stop Lin Yuan.","Gao Feng did not have an avian-type fey.","Two contestants appeared next to him when he was transported to the testing ground.","Both the contestants had invited Gao Feng.","Gao Feng knew that both these contestants wanted to gain authority, and the one he chose to side with would obtain that authority.","Just like Lin Yuan, Gao Feng had no intention of forming a team.","Gao Feng wanted Lin Yuan to use the Ethereal Jellyfish’s tentacle to sense his location and come to meet up with him.","Thus, Gao Feng rejected the two candidates.","Neither of the candidates recognized Gao Feng.","The fatter contestant was about to leave when the skinnier contestant invited Gao Feng again. He even summoned two other feys, and the three wolf-species feys started howling at Gao Feng.","The man was nonchalant toward his three wolf-species feys’ reaction. Evidently, he wanted to use them to threaten Gao Feng.","But there was no way that Gao Feng would allow himself to be threatened.","He came from a top faction and was used to being put on a pedestal. As such, he had developed a stubborn sense of pride.","Gao Feng immediately replied, “I’m not interested in joining.”","Gao Feng’s actions caused the contestant’s body to turn to jelly.","Every contestant had been assessed prior to the selection. They were all elites chosen from their generation and should not be dumb, albeit not all of them were geniuses.","This contestant was fully aware of how precious every second was at this stage. Yet, he had wasted so much time on this person only to still end up being shot down.","He had wasted all his time!","If he could convince someone to follow him and gain authority, it would make it easier to convince a third person to join their party because it was natural for a person to seek out the protection of a group when they were in danger.","Otherwise, this contestant would just have to wait to be recruited by another group.","When the dimensional rifts started opening in the testing ground, those without authority would become insignificant within their teams and be sent to the frontlines to fight the dimensional lifeforms.","As a result, they would easily be eliminated.","Thus, in order to become a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, Gao Feng became a necessary target to this boy.","This was why the young man revealed his true intentions despite knowing he was being watched.","“Friend, I’ll be straight with you! If you don’t leave with me, I will have no choice but to eliminate you.”","The young man was one of the 100 contestants sent from Golden Edge City and was considered one of the top 80% strongest contestants.","After basking in confidence for so long, the young man did not feel a shred of fear toward Gao Feng.","Gao Feng was only 24 years old this year, but he looked to only be about 21 years old.","During their conversation, the young man realized Gao Feng was a support-type spirit qi professional. This was the reason he dared to try and corner Gao Feng.","Gao Feng frowned.","He was well aware of what this young man’s intentions were.","The three wolves had not stopped howling from the moment they were summoned.","This annoyed Gao Feng greatly, but he did not immediately attack the young man. Instead, he said, “I have no plans to team up with you, and you don’t have to threaten me with your three feys. Otherwise, I will start fighting back!”","The young man was stunned as he could not understand what Gao Feng was thinking.","You’re just a support-type spirit qi professional. What makes you think you can take me on? I’m a power offense-type spirit qi professional. I am the worst match-up for support-type and healing-type spirit qi professionals in such close quarters. There is no one else besides the two of us here. If not me, do you even have a better teammate option available?","The young man decided to attack Gao Feng with his feys to see if Gao Feng would continue to be so stubborn.","As such, he ordered one of his wolf-species feys, “Black Rock Crushing Bone Wolf, bite him! Only release when he agrees to join me!”","At the same moment that the young man issued the order, a large light green and white rose appeared in Gao Feng’s hand.","The rose swayed and bloomed.","A strong gust of wind blew the young man and his three feys far away.","Gao Feng decided to give the young man a chance by not killing him. Otherwise, the violent wind from the Diamond X/Fantasy V Breeze Hibiscus could have ripped the Gold Black Rock Crushing Bone Wolves to pieces.","Gao Feng knew that Lin Yuan was sensing his location using the Ethereal Jellyfish’s tentacle. Hence, Gao Feng took out the Ethereal Jellyfish’s tentacle and did not move from his spot.","Gao Feng was confident that Lin Yuan would be able to find him within the next three hours before the first dimensional rift opened.","From Lin Yuan’s perspective view, Cicada Song could tell that Lin Yuan was flying in the direction of Gao Feng.","Cicada Song nodded when he saw how Gao Feng had handled the situation.","Despite being annoyed by the other party, Gao Feng still managed to forgive him. This was clear proof of his magnanimity.","However, a character like this needed to be properly trained. Otherwise, he would not be able to achieve success.","While he was flying, Lin Yuan attracted the attention of most of the audience.","The other contestants were preoccupied with teaming up and interacting with each other. The leaders of two teams were even communicating and negotiating an alliance to take on the insect tide together.","As for Black, he seemed more like he was on vacation than taking a test."]},{"number":1648,"title":"Chapter 1648 Debates About Black!","paragraphs":["1648 Debates About Black!","The Radiance Hundred Sequence selection had changed from a private event to a publicly broadcasted event.","The actions of every member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence would be put on display for everyone to see.","There were only a few thousand contestants but billions of Star Web users from the Radiance Federation.","On average, every person would have the eyes of millions of people on them.","Nonetheless, the more popular contestants would garner more attention.","For example, Black had been insulted for Lin Yuan’s sake for the past two weeks. Then suddenly, the tables were turned as he broke the Celestial Stairway record and made it to god-class.","All that activity had culminated in Black becoming the contestant with the most attention on him.","Even those who were not Black’s fans also chose to watch his perspective view out of sheer curiosity.","Black’s haters finally found something they could post about.","[I admit that Black is powerful. However, there’s no way he will be able to take on multiple dimensional rifts on his own! Even a Class 1 dimensional rift produces at least 1,000,000 alien beasts per wave!]","[I agree. Moreover, the test summary stated that Class 2 dimensional rifts would open as well. What is Black doing? I can’t help but think that he isn’t respecting the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection!]","[Agreed! My son is one of the contestants! He is already part of a five-man team, and they’ve found a cave to take cover in.]","Regardless of whether they meant to, the posts all disparaged Black.","These posts were posted in Black’s official forum. Thus, it did not take long for his fans to see them.","Black’s fans shot back angrily.","[All my husband is doing is flying around for a bit. Yet, people are calling him disrespectful! How is he disrespecting the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection? With his power, he will even be able to defeat seven- or eight-man teams!]","[Disgusting! The one who mentioned your son, please wake up! Many contestants are already part of teams of more than ten people. Your son’s team is done for if they encounter any one of these other teams!]","[I’m just curious whether Black is flying with a plan in mind or doing it aimlessly. If he just wants to scout out the environment, he can send out that small blue bird!]","Lin Yuan’s action was stirring up debate on Star Web, but he was none the wiser about it. His mind was focused on finding Gao Feng.","Lin Yuan did not stop observing his surroundings while he flew, and he caught sight of numerous contestants with leadership potential.","There was a team that grew to 17 members within five minutes.","The group chose a position that would be difficult to attack but easy to defend before they started setting up their defenses.","The young girl in charge of that team was orchestrating her earth-species fey to fortify the defenses.","Lin Yuan could be certain of her leadership abilities but found her foresight to be lacking.","If Lin Yuan did not possess as much power as he did and was an ordinary contestant, he would not want to put together a team so early on in the test.","This was because he did not know the other contestants well. They were all rivals, so how could they be trusted to watch each other’s backs?","Moreover, it was not realistic to be able to form a team capable of standing up against dimensional rifts with only three hours of preparation time.","After all, no one could control the movements of others, and trying to search such a vast space would be completely luck-dependent.","The first dimensional rift would be opening in three hours.","The formations of the alien beasts would cause many areas to become death zones.","This test was actually designed to eliminate many contestants from the beginning.","No matter how well-prepared one was at the beginning, it would be useless.","There would only be a point if one managed to make it to the final ten.","Before the test, Liu Wencheng had said that if more than ten people were left when the three days were up, the testing ground would start to shrink.","Hence, the best choice would be to head to the testing ground’s center and build defenses there.","No matter how sturdy the girl managed to build her stronghold, she could not withstand the alien beasts’ stampede.","A large stampede of alien beasts could cause the ground to shake.","While Lin Yuan was flying, he noticed many intelligent people.","These smart people would immediately scout out their surroundings to situate themselves before heading for the center.","They did not have to reach the center within three hours.","Within ten hours, before the fourth dimensional rift opened, they would have the chance to reach the center.","While they were heading to the center, it would also give them a chance to meet more people.","Although the random openings of the dimensional rifts were meant to make the test fair, they had to open from the edge and start moving inward.","If this system was not followed, the contestants would not survive unless they had Diamond feys.","At that moment, a man riding a small crimson avian-type fey chased after Lin Yuan and shouted, “You must be Black! I’m Sequence #93 of the previous Radiance Hundred Sequence! I can join your group!”","The members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence possessed far more foresight than the regular contestants.","From the speed of Lin Yuan’s flight, Sequence #93 Chao Tianlin immediately recognized his identity.","Although the mask was different, no one besides Black would be able to fly at such speed.","Chao Tianlin’s main fey could only catch up to Lin Yuan by using its exclusive skill. It could not be clearer that there was a problem!","Chao Tianlin was intelligent and would not ask Black to join his team from the moment they met.","Currently, Black was alone.","Chao Tianlin felt that it would be a great opportunity for him if he could become Black’s teammate.","Black first gained popularity on Star Web when he single-handedly saved Millstone Town from a Class 1 alien insect dimensional rift.","Black’s plant-type fey could take on alien beasts. As such, there was no question that he would make it to one of the ten survivors.","There could be no disadvantage that came from being by Black’s side.","However, Chao Tianlin did not expect Black to turn him down after he revealed his identity.","After rejecting Chao Tianlin, Lin Yuan flapped his wings, and another three pairs of wings sprouted from his back."]},{"number":1649,"title":"Chapter 1649 If They Win, Everyone Cheers! If They Lose, Everyone Grieves!","paragraphs":["1649 If They Win, Everyone Cheers! If They Lose, Everyone Grieves!","The three pairs of wings were three times the length of Black’s original wings.","When the giant black wings flapped, Black flew even faster.","Chao Tianlin watched as Black disappeared into the distance and scratched the back of his bald head.","He could not figure out what was running through Black’s mind.","If Black wanted teammates, there would be no one better than Chao Tianlin among the contestants.","So why did Black reject me? He even grew wings. He looked so cool!","As one of the previous members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence who had an eye-catching combat style and also occasionally live-streamed on Star Web, he had a significant following on Star Web.","The audience members watching Black and Chao Tianlin were all stunned.","It might be reasonable for Black to reject other people, but why did he reject Chao Tianlin too?","At that moment, the members of royalty on the golden pillars had already guessed that Black was the Moon Empress’ disciple.","From the direction that Black was flying, it was obvious that he was making a beeline for Gao Feng.","A strange look came over Liu Wencheng, and he sighed to himself.","“Whether the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection will proceed as per expectations will depend on these two boys!”","Liu Wencheng had put a lot of effort into preparing for the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","He had run countless tests in order to ensure that everything was as comprehensive and fair as possible.","However, Lin Yuan and Gao Feng were like two BUGs in his system.","If Lin Yuan even rejected Chao Tianlin as a teammate, anyone else would be able to receive a free ride if Lin Yuan chose them.","When the Moon Empress heard Liu Wencheng’s lament, she said, “My disciple knows where the line is. He will know what to do at such a time.”","While she spoke, the Moon Empress looked toward where the Freedom Federation envoy group was seated and went on to say, “I suggest that after the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection ends, the challenge battle with the Freedom Federation envoy group should also be broadcasted on Star Web!”","The Moon Empress’ words stupefied the other members of royalty.","The Spacetime Elder frowned but quickly realized what the Moon Empress’ intentions were.","Mystic Moon, the Spacetime Elder, and another member of the royalty were always instantly up to date on everything that happened on Star Web.","Black had already appeared in many debates on Star Web.","If the debates were not settled after the Radiance Hundred Sequence ended, they would become actual topics for conversation.","Moreover, even if Black intended to remove his mask to reveal his identity, he would not do so during the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","There was no way that Lin Yuan would prematurely reveal to the Freedom Federation envoy group that he was the Moon Empress’ disciple.","If the challenge was broadcast on Star Web, all the topics and debates surrounding Black would vanish.","Moreover, everyone would know that Black was putting his life on the line to safeguard the Radiance Federation’s pride!","The Moon Empress’ suggestion was understandable.","However, Iron Prison always liked to plan for the worst-case scenario and said, “If they lose the fight, the live stream will become an everlasting open wound for the Radiance Federation.”","Cicada Song’s lips twitched when he heard what Iron Prison said.","It seemed that Iron Prison and the Moon Empress would never be able to mend the bridge between them in this lifetime.","Can’t you wait to listen to what other people have to say? Why do you have to say something so distasteful? If Lin Yuan dies at the hands of the Freedom Federation envoy group, the Moon Empress will definitely go berserk! If Gao Feng dies, I won’t be able to stay silent either.","The Moon Empress glared at Iron Prison before she said, “Even if we do lose, what’s wrong with letting the world know about it? The 13 of us can’t overcome such a thing on our own! In order to truly protect the Radiance Federation, all of us have to step in. Every citizen has equal ownership of the Radiance Federation.”","Iron Prison did not respond when he heard what the Moon Empress said. Instead, he seriously pondered over her words.","At that moment, the elderly man seated on the center pillar said, “Let’s do as the Moon Empress suggested. The ten people who will emerge from the selection will battle for the Radiance Federation. They are heroes of the Radiance Federation. If they win, everyone will cheer. If they lose, everyone will grieve.”","The elderly man’s words were the final hammer in the nail. The conversation ended right there and there.","Iron Prison did not add anything. Instead, he balled his fists and thought, Lin Yuan, Gao Feng, the two of you have to win.","...","Lin Yuan flew so swiftly that he was almost out of spiritual power.","With a wave of his hand, he used Spirit Injection on himself.","He could have summoned Blackie and rode it to meet up with Gao Feng. However, Black’s presence was still a secret to the Freedom Federation envoy group.","Lin Yuan considered Blackie one of his secret weapons. As a secret weapon, it could not be revealed flippantly.","A talented Creation Master would be able to guess what Blackie’s bloodline was from the abilities it used.","Although it was difficult to guess abilities, it would be possible for someone to guess that Blackie had the exclusive skill Spirit Qi Imprint based on Lin Yuan’s previous battle performances.","It did not escape the audience’s notice that Lin Yuan had used Spirit Injection.","The fans who had been following Black since the beginning were reminded of his fight against Chen Hongfeng and how he regained his spiritual power then as well.","However, his current recovery abilities were on a completely different level from before.","Given Black’s healing and spirit recovery abilities, he would be a pivotal member of any team.","Black’s old fans were all aware of this.","However, the people who had never seen Black fight and did not know about him were all confused.","Are you a healing-, support-, or combat-type spirit qi professional? When did the lines between spirit qi occupations become so blurred?","It was possible for a person to have talent in two combat-types, but they would still end up subject to a caveat. For example, they could only contract snake-species feys or special insects.","It could be said that people with such talents were not any better than spirit qi professionals who could contract a whole array of feys.","Chu Ci was one example of this.","However, Black had already proved that he could contract numerous types of feys, including cats, birds, plants, and insects. He was skilled at healing, support, and even power offense.","At that moment, everyone was even more curious about Black’s feys.","The audience members on Star Web were not the only ones curious about Black’s feys. Even the members of royalty who watched Lin Yuan during the Guard Ye Banquet were also curious about his feys.","At that moment, Tian Feng could not help but ask the Moon Empress out of curiosity, “Xiyue, what feys has your disciple contracted? We aren’t outsiders, so there’s no harm in telling us.”"]},{"number":1650,"title":"Chapter 1650 Tian Feng is Dazed!","paragraphs":["1650 Tian Feng is Dazed!","While he was speaking, Tian Feng fiddled with the two pairs of peanuts in his hands.","The peanuts seemed to contain something terrifying as the air rippled around them as Tian Feng moved them around.","The ripples were very similar to vitality, yet they also had a completely different type of power that occasionally peeked out from the peanut shells before being quickly sucked back in.","The other members of royalty were already used to seeing Tian Feng toying with his sacred source lifeform.","The Moon Empress glared at Tian Feng before hissing. “Why don’t you offer up your Harvest Power? Tell the 12 of us how the Harvest Power comes about.”","Everyone present knew how important privacy was to the Moon Empress.","Till now, her secret source lifeform was still a mystery.","Thus, from the moment Tian Feng asked his question, the other members of royalty immediately expected her to rebuke him.","Due to Wang Fuxiang, a sizable grudge was now wedged between Tian Feng and the Bamboo Monarch.","No man would be able to forgive another for wanting to kill his wife, even if it jeopardized his country or was actually for his benefit. Hence, the Bamboo Monarch said, “If Tian Feng is willing to fully give out the Harvest Power and reveal its make-up, I will offer up 1,000 leaves of the Golden Thearch Bamboo.”","The Bamboo Monarch said this to intentionally annoy Tian Feng.","The taciturn man next to the Bamboo Monarch faltered in his wooden expression.","The Golden Thearch Bamboo’s leaves were extremely nourishing for wood-type feys. They could evolve the bloodlines of wood-species feys or even enable non-wood-type feys to become wood-type.","They would be extremely nourishing for the taciturn man’s feys.","Thus, the middle-aged man said, “Old Tian, the Bamboo Monarch has shown that he’s serious. It’s time for you to contribute too!”","Tian Feng was stunned. He looked at the two men and thought angrily, Don’t pretend that none of you is curious about what feys Lin Yuan has! Why do I have to shoulder all the responsibility just because I voice the question that all of us are thinking? Are you trying to bully the elderly? Let me show you that there’s someone even more simple-minded than me here!","Tian Feng turned to Ji Changdeng, who was watching the selection, and said, “Changdeng, I’m sure that no one is more curious about the Moon Empress’ disciple’s feys than you! I heard that her disciple is friends with your youngest disciple!”","Ji Changdeng did not expect Tian Feng to suddenly ask him about the Moon Empress’ disciple.","Of course I want to know! I want to know everything that’s related to the Moon Empress! But what are you suddenly asking me for?","Ji Changdeng knew that it would not be appropriate for him to say anything in such a circumstance.","He was a hopeless obedient puppy but still needed to be respectful, especially since his first disciple was in the vicinity.","Tian Feng’s eyebrow twitched when Ji Changdeng did not respond.","He had changed the topic just like that. It was easy!","How dare all of you target my Harvest Power. If I give the Harvest Power to you, how will Cultivated Garden continue to accumulate immense resources?","Besides Cicada Song, whose gaze never left Gao Feng, the other 12 members of royalty were all focused on Lin Yuan.","After all, no one else was showing promise yet.","As the overseer of the test, Liu Wencheng managed many invigilators.","There were two invigilators to one contestant who wrote a detailed account of everything that that contestant did.","These invigilators had the authority to write reviews of the contestant, and professionals would assess the reviews later before finally submitting them to Liu Wencheng.","Hence, Liu Wencheng did not need to pay attention to every contestant during the test.","Liu Yifan had been paying attention to the 11 original members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence who were also participating in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection, but he quickly noticed that Black stood out and started focusing on him as well.","Lin Yuan was completely unaware that he had the eyes of half of the Radiance Federation trained on him.","However, not all the people behind these eyes had good things to say about him.","Handsome: What is Black doing? He’s just flying about! I can’t help but think that he’s disrespecting the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection!","Sacred Heart White Tiger: Hello, please go and rest the posts. The analyses are already out! Anyone with a brain knows that the right thing to do now is to rush to the center.","Vegetable Rain: But will the terrain become smoother toward the center? Black isn’t flying in the direction of the center. He’s flying toward the edge!","Blind Fish: Can all of you hold back your opinions? The first dimensional rift hasn’t even opened yet! I for one hope that Black will leave the pack. This way, he’ll be able to reveal his true power when he faces the alien beast tide.","Lin Yuan had no idea about the ongoing debates on Star Web.","If he was aware, he would be over the moon because good and bad discussions about him would count toward his popularity.","He was not trying to be famous but because the amount of faith power he possessed increased proportionally to his popularity.","Once the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection, everything would reach a checkpoint, and Lin Yuan planned on taking a trip to the Divine Wood Federation’s Sacred Wood Mystic Realm then.","Next, he would raise Sky City to the sky above the Divine Wood Federation, where he would be able to proceed with gaining control of the Startling Lines Continent.","After he was done with all this, he would head to the Marsh East Palace in the marsh world to obtain more precious source-type items and sacred source lifeforms as well as find the thing that Morbius required.","He already sensed that he was getting nearer to Gao Feng.","Lin Yuan estimated that he had been flying for at least two and a half hours.","During this, he had used Spirit Injection on himself every 15 minutes.","This was because he needed to use spiritual power to fly and because the Source Sand was generating a large amount of sand underground to keep up with Lin Yuan’s flight speed.","Thus, he used up spiritual power very quickly.","By the time Lin Yuan spotted Gao Feng, a group of contestants had already made it to the center of the testing ground.","When they encountered each other at the center, a fight broke out among the contestants.","As a result, numerous contestants had already been eliminated.","This clash was the first highlight of the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","Finally, the forums were filled with posts besides those that discussed Black.","The most buzzworthy topic now was the clash that was taking place."]},{"number":1651,"title":"Chapter 1651 Brother Lin, which Lin?","paragraphs":["1651 Brother Lin, which Lin?","Liu Yifan nodded when he saw the clash.","All of the contestants were elites, and it was hard for them to ignore such a ripe opportunity and decide to trust another person instead.","Hence, the best option would be to fight it out.","The center of the testing ground would only calm down when someone won out above the rest and secured authority.","Soon, Li Nao, Sequence #97 of the original Radiance Hundred Sequence, gained control of the situation.","“I am the strongest among everyone here! I am also a power offense-type spirit qi professional with support abilities. Thus, I’ll be able to provide you with antidotes that will be effective against the abyss demons’ fire poison, the acid within the alien insects, and the corrosive poison within the subterranean lifeforms. None of you will be able to defeat me! What we need to do now is work together to build up our defense while we wait for the others to arrive!”","Li Nao used to be a Radiance Hundred Sequence member, and many contestants looked up to him. As such, he already had a certain aura of authority about him.","Moreover, he had proven himself with his power, so the 53 people present had no choice but to go along with what he said.","Although Li Nao sounded polite, he had not held back at all when he battled them. He had used his main fey, the Rotten Spotted Sky-Dog, to take out three of his strongest potential competitors.","If anyone dared to say a word against him, he would not hesitate to eliminate them.","Thus, when one person voiced his agreement, the other contestants present slowly agreed to join Li Nao’s team.","Now that everyone present had agreed to listen to him, Li Nao went on to say, “Since we’re all in agreement, let’s swear on it! Everyone here has comprehended Willpower Runes. But I don’t need you to swear on them, so you don’t have to be worried. All of you can swear on your honor as the Radiance Hundred Sequence contestants!","“For the next three days, none of you will betray your teammates, and you will listen to me as your leader. In order to ensure that none of you causes trouble while we’re setting up the defenses, I will remove all uncertain variables so as to ensure everyone’s safety.”","Li Nao’s speech was perfect, and everyone was promptly trapped by it.","Everyone realized that Li Nao wanted to reign over the central territory.","But, he phrased his words as intending to ensure everyone’s safety.","Swearing on Willpower Runes was effective within the spiritual spatial zone, and no one would do so flippantly.","As such, Li Nao did not request this.","Rather, he asked them to publicly swear on their honor as contestants of the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","Who would dare to break such a promise? Doing so would be the equivalent of trampling all over that honor, and no one who did that could be accepted as a member of the Radiance Federation.","Moreover, Li Nao had even left a way out for himself.","He said that betrayals were forbidden for the next three days.","This meant that they could start attacking their teammates three days later when the testing ground started to shrink.","At first, no one wanted to accept Li Nao’s suggestion. But they were all weaker than him and had no choice. If they did not give in, they would be eliminated.","Thus, these contestants decided to think about it from a different perspective.","They were the first batch of people to arrive at the center.","If they followed Li Nao, they would be like his ministers who were in the inner circle of the central territory.","The smartest person raised his hand and performed the swearing.","Li Nao said to his first follower, “You will be in charge of organizing everyone when we’re building the defense!”","The follower immediately beamed.","When everyone else saw how beneficial it was to follow Li Nao, they all started voicing their agreement.","With this, the inner circle of the central territory was formed.","Li Nao smiled in relief as he looked at the contestants who were already beginning to build the defenses.","He felt he was very lucky to have been the first to arrive at the central territory.","Amongst the 11 members of the original Radiance Hundred Sequence who were participating in the selection, the first one to arrive at the central territory would be able to receive all the advantages.","His team already consisted of more than 50 people, and there would soon be more people arriving to join them.","The number of people in his team represented the power he wielded.","This power would bring a new sense of security and pressure to the contestants who would be eager to join the group.","Even if the other original Radiance Hundred Sequence members arrived, Li Nao had enough subordinates that he was confident that he would not be eliminated.","In order to keep themselves from being eliminated, the other original Radiance Hundred Sequence members would have no choice but to join his group.","Li Nao felt that as long as the defense they built could last three days, nothing would stop him from returning to the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Many posts regarding Li Nao appeared on Star Web.","Despite not being a popular member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, Li Nao’s popularity skyrocketed.","This was what it meant for a hero to be a product of circumstances.","Feys continued to dig trenches that earth-type feys fortified using various methods.","The best option would be to build the defense outward from the center.","They would not have to worry about lacking secret weapons, and the members at the center could cover for the members in the outer circles.","At that moment, Lin Yuan landed next to Gao Feng and retracted his wings.","Gao Feng immediately smiled at Lin Yuan and said, “Brother Lin, you made me wait for so long! Another 15 minutes later, and the first dimensional rift would have opened. If it opened next to me, I would be eliminated immediately!”","The moment Gao Feng spoke, he realized that he had misspoken.","He slapped his forehead in irritation as he remembered that the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection was being broadcast on Star Web.","Every audience member who had chosen his perspective view could hear what he said.","Oh my God! Lin Yuan is Black!","Gao Feng had no idea how many Star Web users had chosen Lin Yuan’s perspective view.","At that moment, Lu Shuang and Poison Beauty’s live-streaming room were full of comments repeating, “Brother Lin?”","This was the same case for the posts on Star Web.","Brother Lin? Which Lin?","Lin was not a common surname, but it was not unheard of either.","However, it would be too astonishing for this surname to be linked to Black.","For the past six months, Black’s name had been inseparable from someone with the surname Lin.","Could it be that Black also had that surname?","What a coincidence! How could such a coincidence exist?"]},{"number":1652,"title":"Chapter 1652 Are Black and Lin Yuan the Same Person?","paragraphs":["1652 Are Black and Lin Yuan the Same Person?","Lu Shuang blinked several times.","Her popularity had soared because of Lin Yuan, and no one had recently paid closer attention to him than her.","She had not known much about him in the past.","But now, in order to better make use of him to boost her popularity, she had intentionally researched him.","There was no doubt that Lu Shuang was an expert on Black.","While she was researching him, she also looked into Lin Yuan, who had always been compared with Black.","After her research, a strange feeling had risen within her.","Both of them had appeared as though from nowhere.","One of them became a young hero of the Radiance Federation, while the other became a top genius of the younger generation.","Although their deeds and the feys they used were different, their basic structure seemed extremely similar.","Lu Shuang could not help but voice the question that everyone in the live-streaming room was thinking, “Can it be that Black and Lin Yuan are the same person?”","Lu Shuang’s instinctive comment was immediately spotlighted in the live-streaming room and took over all the comments repeating ‘Brother Lin?’","The audience in the live-streaming room started expressing their opinions.","Unplanned Meeting: I think that it’s just a coincidence. Black either has that same surname, or it was a slip of the tongue!","Path to Wealth: One of you should go and compare Black and Lin Yuan’s feys to see if there are any overlaps. If there isn’t, there’s no way the two of them can be the same person! It’s impossible for a person’s arsenal of feys to be so large!","Blooming Centerfield: I think Black flew so far, all the way to where the first dimensional rift will open, because he’s trying to find another expert. It will take him at least three hours to fly back.","Is Little Song Done For Today?: Why doesn’t Black think about his own situation? What if the dimensional rift opens? I can’t understand him!","The comments continued to stream in.","Meanwhile, Lu Shuang started to carefully analyze all of Black’s actions.","Black had crossed more than half of the testing ground just to meet up with another contestant.","Moreover, he seemed certain of where the contestant was as he had not taken a detour.","However, none of this was what Lu Shuang wanted to know.","She did not believe that Black would join the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection with no intention of becoming a member.","She had experienced his power and felt that he had the power to back up his confidence in taking on a dimensional rift.","Lu Shuang’s mind was focused on how Gao Feng addressed Black. She had a feeling that Black and Lin Yuan were indeed one and the same!","Most gifted elites acted ostentatiously, but Black and Lin Yuan kept low profiles. They had never even publicly replied to queries.","Setting aside all their previous records, Black and Lin Yuan indeed had startling similar personalities.","Lu Shuang intended to be the first to put this idea out into the world.","After struggling for a moment, she gnashed her teeth and decided to rip the band-aid off.","“I don’t believe that such coincidences exist. Black and Lin Yuan are definitely the same person. I’m going to hold a lucky draw. Everyone is welcome to join in! The rules are that everyone needs to bet on whether Black and Lin Yuan are actually the same person. I will choose one fan from the group that guessed right and give them a Bronze/Flawless fey!”","In order to take control of the situation, Lu Shuang pulled out all the stops.","A Bronze/Flawless fey’s price could reach six figures, and there were people who could never attain such wealth even after slaving for an entire lifetime.","But now, Lu Shuang was giving it away as a prize for a lucky draw.","This successfully attracted the attention of the entire live-streaming room.","Since they had to follow the host in order to participate in the lucky draw, Lu Shuang’s popularity reached another peak.","Only three minutes had passed since Lu Shuang announced the lucky draw, and her number of fans had exploded to 7.6 million.","This made Lu Shuang smile brightly.","Many Star Web users started to place their bets.","A while later, Lu Shuang realized that 99% of her audience did not believe that Black and Lin Yuan were the same person!","While Lu Shuang’s live-streaming room’s popularity soared, so did Poison Beauty’s live-streaming room.","However, both of them had completely different perspectives.","Poison Beauty had encountered Black thrice consecutively and managed to force him to reveal four of his feys as well as the other two that were topics of discussion online.","Black possessed many more feys than other spirit qi professionals.","Moreover, Black and Lin Yuan had both fought against Chen Hongfeng.","Lin Yuan defeated Chen Hongfeng with just one beam of red light while Black crossed swords with Chen Hongfeng for some time and even ended up injured.","If Black was as capable as Lin Yuan, why did he not demonstrate it when he was battling Chen Hongfeng?","Less than two months had passed between Chen Hongfeng’s battles against Lin Yuan and Black.","Most of the regular people on Star Web agreed with Poison Beauty’s stance.","Neither Poison Beauty nor Lu Shuang had recognized Gao Feng.","But this did not mean that no one in the audience had recognized Gao Feng.","Gao Feng was the Young Leader of a top faction and had started a rising faction.","It would be impossible that no one recognized him.","Moreover, the disciples of veteran and top factions who participated in the Guard Ye Banquet also knew that Gao Feng was Cicada Song’s disciple.","Besides the Moon Empress’ disciple Lin Yuan, no one else would be worthy of Gao Feng addressing him as ‘Brother Lin’.","Oh my God! Lin Yuan is Black!","The people who saw the truth were promptly dazed.","These were the people who had attacked Black online in order to curry favor with Lin Yuan.","What kind of situation was this?","In order to curry favor with a person, they had gone and insulted his alternate identity!","These members of the veteran and top factions could not help but start trembling.","Luckily, the incident had passed, and Lin Yuan had not pursued the matter.","But they had even pinned their posts to Star Web’s main page hoping to attract Lin Yuan’s attention.","At the thought of this, all of them hastily deleted all their posts attacking Black.","Most of the outstanding youths were very flamboyant, and many young disciples of veteran and top factions managed their own platforms on Star Web.","Occasionally, they bid for rare spiritual ingredients or gifted feys to fans.","Hence, these people’s follower count was no less than that of Star Web hosts."]},{"number":1653,"title":"Chapter 1653 The Yellow Castle in the Sky!","paragraphs":["1653 The Yellow Castle in the Sky!","If only one person deleted their posts about Black, it would not attract attention.","However, too many people were deleting their Black-related posts.","Such a circumstance was noticed immediately and was instantly turned into a topic for a post that shot to the height of popularity.","More and more people sensed that something was wrong with the situation.","Lin Yuan had not expected Gao Feng to address him in such a way.","But he knew that Gao Feng had not done that intentionally, so he did not dwell on the matter. After all, he was going to remove his silver mask today.","Gao Feng looked at Lin Yuan apologetically. He knew that it would be best for him to keep silent at such a time. Anything he said now would be plucked out and overanalyzed by the audience.","Lin Yuan was about to speak when a dimensional rift suddenly opened above him and Gao Feng.","The clear sky darkened.","The dimensional rift was like a black and red scar that twisted and ripped itself apart in the sky.","Judging from the size of the dimensional rift, Lin Yuan instantly knew that it was pinnacle Class 1.","Since the hole opened in the sky and not on the ground, it meant that it was not a subterranean dimensional rift.","Given that there was no water pouring out of it, it could not be a water world dimensional rift either.","Normally, a dimensional rift had to stew for some time after its formation before it eventually spat out an insect tide.","However, this was not the case for the dimensional rift above Lin Yuan’s head.","It was as though this dimensional rift had swallowed 250 kilograms of crotons as it voraciously spewed out alien insects.","In the blink of an eye, an alien beast tide was formed.","This was not normal for an alien beast tide.","The settings of the testing ground on Star Web could be adjusted at will.","For example, the dimensional rift had opened suddenly and instantly spouted out alien beasts without giving anyone time to prepare. This made the dimensional rifts that were going to open next seem even more perilous.","As Gao Feng watched the scores of alien insects marching toward him, he did not summon any feys.","All he did was cast his gaze toward Lin Yuan.","The only fey Gao Feng had that had even the slightest of combat power was the Breeze Hibiscus.","However, the Breeze Hibiscus was a support-type fey and was useless against a sea of alien insects.","Once the alien insects locked onto a target, they would immediately turn feral and gobble up their target.","The alien insects were even known to be cannibalistic in times of extreme hunger. Thus, every lifeform that crossed their path was food that had to be consumed by hook or by crook.","Lin Yuan did not panic at all in the face of the charging alien insects.","He was like a general who was staying his ground despite thousands of troops closing in on him.","He knew that the Star Web users were curious about his feys, and he was not intentionally trying to be mysterious.","However, he had never encountered a strong enough opponent who could force him to summon his feys.","Lin Yuan had many options to take on the insect tide. For example, he could use the wings made of the Day and Night Spirit Silver and carry Gao Feng into the air.","But if he did that, he would lead the insect tide in whichever direction he flew off to.","In a way, he would be an external force that destroyed the test’s original flow.","This was extremely unfair to the other contestants. Thus, Lin Yuan decided against this course of action.","Lin Yuan also did not intend to summon Red Thorn.","Red Thorn had reached Platinum III/Fantasy V and was not a pinnacle six-winged fairy that was merely a whisper away from reaching eight wings.","Thus, it was the secret weapon Lin Yuan could not reveal under any normal circumstance.","If he summoned Red Thorn, the latter would be able to use the sea of flowers to take out the Class 5 abyss demons.","Class 5 abyss demons only appeared in Class 3 and above dimensional rifts.","If Red Thorn appeared, the testing ground with its continuously opening dimensional rifts would become a feast for it.","With this insect tide, Lin Yuan could only use one fey and one method.","This fight would not affect the insect tide’s original path.","Currently, the insect tide was less than 20 meters away from Lin Yuan and Gao Feng.","The audience on Star Web who saw this was screaming.","Only three to seven people out of 100 could be spirit qi professionals. This meant that most of the people on Star Web were regular people who were not spirit qi professionals.","These regular people had never seen an insect tide from this view.","Everyone W: The alien insects are terrifying! My husband is going to be eaten to death!","Fruit Kernel: This feeling is great! Why am I not a spirit qi professional? Why don’t I have any spirit qi professional talent?","Dawn Happiness: Black has been pissing me off for a long time. Has his brain suddenly rotted? Is he immobile or frozen with fear? Didn’t they say that Black used a sea of flowers to single-handedly take on an alien insect dimensional rift in Millstone Town? If he could do it, then why doesn’t he do the same now?","The alien insects were only getting closer to Black.","The alien insects at the front only needed to take a small leap, and they would be able to reach Black.","At that moment, the ground started to shake.","A gully made of flowing sand appeared between Black and the alien insects, drawing a clear boundary.","The alien insects at the front were all pushed back by the granules of sand.","In an instant, the ground turned into seething quicksand.","The insect tide of a pinnacle Class 1 dimensional rift was promptly halted.","This sight stunned everyone who chose Black’s perspective view.","All of them knew that Black had a sand-elemental source-type lifeform.","However, they did not expect that it could produce such an immense amount of sand.","Before the group could gasp in amazement, a castle rose out of the sand.","The granules stacked on top of each other, and the castle’s construction only became more exquisite with each passing moment.","It was as though something was building up the castle structure from the inside.","After the castle appeared, the sand stopped bubbling.","Only the quicksand beneath the castle continued to move until the castle was pushed into the sky.","If these alien insects tried to scale the castle, they would end up slipping into the quicksand beneath.","The quicksand rapidly solidified, and all lifeforms were promptly barricaded out.","A moment later, the insect tide that had failed to climb the castle of sand eventually gave up and dashed away.","The sight of the castle of sand and alien insects, or rather Lin Yuan’s method, caused the audience to lose their ability to think rationally."]},{"number":1654,"title":"Chapter 1654 Black, What Are You Trying to Pull?","paragraphs":["1654 Black, What Are You Trying to Pull?","Soon, Black’s old fans felt as though they had returned to Black’s first fight on the Celestial Stairway.","All the other spirit qi professionals used standard methods or were overly ferocious during combat.","But Black was stunning every time he used his abilities!","A castle at least 500 square meters large rose out of the ground at the quicksand below had blocked any and all the alien insects.","It forced the alien insects to have no choice but to give up on attacking it.","The legend of Black protecting Millstone Town from an insect tide had been floating around Star Web for some time.","Both times he faced insect tides, he employed different methods. The extending sea of flowers had changed into a castle made of sand.","Nonetheless, both methods would allow Black to completely conquer the insect tide.","There had been many discussions about Black on Star Web.","At first, Black’s most prominent fey had been the plant-type source-type lifeform that could produce a rapidly extending sea of flowers.","Many Creation Masters had sent in posts to analyze the plant-type source-type lifeform.","Even Master Duan Li had dug out videos of Black’s previous battles and written an analysis dedicated to Red Thorn.","She came to the conclusion that Black’s plant-type source-type lifeform had a special disposition that allowed it to gain energy from any insect it caught and consumed once it reached a certain level of power. It would then use the energy to produce the sea of flowers.","This was the reason it could miraculously hold its own against a fervid insect tide.","It needed a large number of insect corpses to use as fuel in order to engage this ability.","Lin Yuan had not seen Master Duan Li’s analysis of Red Thorn. If he did, he would start clapping for her.","Due to the dimensional rift, all the electricity had gone out in Millstone Town. As such, there had not been any videos or recordings of the event to serve as proof.","Master Duan Li’s Class 4 Creation Master ability shone as she managed to analyze so many key and accurate points.","However, her analysis had been of Red Thorn Version 1.0.","At that time, Red Thorn had only been Bronze grade. It had not combined with any Willpower Rune or evolved to Fantasy Breed.","But now, Red Thorn had evolved several times and reached Platinum III/Fantasy III. It no longer needed a large number of insect corpses as an activation resource.","The Eye of Relinquish was Red Thorn’s store of energy. Each one would allow Red Thorn to produce a square kilometer of flowers.","Ever since the Mouth of Relinquish split into three, 324 Eyes of Relinquish had been produced.","If Red Thorn wanted to, it could use up the stored energy within the Eyes of Relinquish and generate a sea of flowers over 300 square kilometers.","The sea of flowers that Red Thorn produced was a large-scale ability that combined attack and control.","It had an attacking range that was way beyond what was expected of a Fantasy Breed fey.","Lin Yuan had never heard of a Fantasy Breed fey that had an equally large attacking range.","Even poison-type feys that were skilled at attack could not spread their poison that far without it dissipating.","The Creation Masters on Star Web used to be accurate in guessing that Red Thorn was a plant-type source-type lifeform.","But now, they were wrong because Red Thorn had completely turned into a fairy source-type lifeform.","It was only a step away from gaining its fourth pair of wings.","Its bloodline was the pinnacle of fairy source-type lifeforms.","After a short period of silence, the audience suddenly realized that Black’s name was a miracle in itself.","He seemed to be able to create miracles whenever he wanted.","Comments praising Black filled the screens of live-streaming rooms.","However, the audience soon realized with shock that the castle made of sand was equipped with shielding abilities.","If they tried to see Black or Gao Feng’s perspective view, they would only be able to see the castle itself and not the two people within it.","Your castle looks good. It looks just as good as the handiwork of a Class 4 Spirit Craftsman. But why are you only letting me see the castle and not the people inside it? If you decide to, you can stay in the castle until the test ends. Are you really going to make us watch a castle for the next three days?","Lu Shuang and Poison Beauty’s live-streaming rooms, which had the largest proportion of Black’s fans, were exploding with activity.","Slow Walk: Damn! What’s the point of watching now? It only became interesting five minutes ago, but now everything has fallen flat again.","Interesting Soul: Hehe, if this broadcast wasn’t free, I would be demanding a refund!","Alone From Now On: I’ll wait another half an hour. If this continues, I am going to switch to another person’s perspective view.","Black Pill: I recommend all of you take a look at Li Nao’s perspective view. The defense at the center is complete, and his team has grown to over 700 people. It’s the largest team presently, and they have the best location too! Don’t waste your time here!","Lu Shuang’s goal of live-streaming was to watch Black and take advantage of the popularity boost that came with it.","Black, what are you trying to pull?","Lu Shuang was well aware that if Black continued to hole up in the castle, the number of people watching her live stream would soon trickle down to nothing.","However, she would have no way of competing with the other hosts if she did not bank on Black!","When she caught sight of the comment from Black Pill, she immediately blocked him before kicking him out of the live-streaming room.","Damn him! Can’t he see that the audience number in my live-streaming room is already dropping precipitously? Only a few minutes have passed, and I’ve already lost half of my audience! These people are so pragmatic!","Lu Shuang looked at Star Web’s live-streaming room Popularity Ranking and saw that her live-streaming room had dropped to number four.","The top two live streams were both focused on Li Nao’s perspective views.","Lu Shuang pondered for a moment and decided to start analyzing the sand-elemental source-type lifeform to stall for time.","If Black and Gao Feng continued to hide within the castle, she would also switch over to Li Nao’s perspective view.","If you can’t beat them, join them. There was no shame!","“I’m sure all of you are curious about Black’s sand-type source-type lifeform! What grade is it at? How strong is it? Why is its ability range so large?”","Lu Shuang’s questions were the same ones that the live-streaming room’s audience harbored.","The sand’s movements had definitely reached beyond five square kilometers. The entire territory had been turned into a desert in an instant.","It was able to produce such power instantaneously."]},{"number":1655,"title":"Chapter 1655 That’s Right, That’s How We’ll Do It!","paragraphs":["1655 That’s Right, That’s How We’ll Do It!","This was too far beyond the power of a Fantasy Breed fey.","Lu Shuang ignored what the comments were saying and continued. “I’m standing by my previous conclusion that there’s no way Black has reached A-rank. This sand-elemental source-type lifeform’s power can only be Diamond X/Fantasy V at best.”","Since the test was being broadcast on Star Web, the Radiance Federation’s royalty had to consider the contestants’ privacy.","Hence, the audience member’s investigative abilities were blocked.","This meant they could only watch the events with their eyes and not use their spiritual and soul power to look deeper like they usually did.","Hence, even high-class Creation Masters were only able to make their analyses based on the power that the feys demonstrated.","This was also the reason the Radiance Federation’s royalty permitted the Freedom Federation and Azure Federation envoy groups to temporarily enter Star Web.","Every year, the Radiance Federation’s elites within the eligible age range took part in the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","The private information of these people could not be leaked to other federations.","Most of the posts on Star Web discussed Li Nao.","But now, Black’s popularity shot up again. He managed to overcome all chatter about a team of over 700 members by himself.","Lu Shuang noticed that the audience in her live-streaming room was hooked by her bait and went on with her analysis more seriously. “If my guess is right, the amber button that Black dropped to the ground is the sand-elemental source-type lifeform’s original body. It can use such a long-range ability to impact a large area because it had continuously created sand while Black was flying. This is the only possibility to explain why a Fantasy Breed fey is able to produce the power of a Myth Breed fey.”","She was about to go on but decided not to voice her hypothesis after a moment of silent pondering.","Ever since Lu Shuang fought and lost to Lin Yuan, she had been filled with confusion.","Not even a Myth Breed fey could take lightly the combined attack from the Diamond X/Fantasy V Exquisite Rhino Giraffe and two Diamond X/Fantasy IV Earth Walking Witch Snakes.","However, Black’s cat-species fey, which could only be Diamond X/Fantasy V at best, had not only managed to block the attack but even wiped out the Exquisite Rhino Giraffe in an instant.","Although both of them were spiritual-type, the Exquisite Rhino Giraffe also had the help of the two Earth Walking Witch Snakes. Given that it was three against one, it did not make sense for her to lose!","Yet, she had been completely defeated. Moreover, she did not even have a clue about how she had lost.","When she saw his other feys, the reason immediately dawned on her.","He definitely did not use normal resources to evolve his feys.","The most special thing about source-type lifeforms was that they needed to temper themselves using their affiliated elemental energy. The longer they tempered themselves, the stronger they would be.","From the way that Black could create such an impact with a Fantasy Breed source-type lifeform, Lu Shuang could not imagine how pure the elemental energy he used to temper his fey was,","Could it be heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls? If that were the case, just what status did Black have? Regardless, there was no question that there was more to him than met the eye.","Lu Shuang had a feeling that if she continued to analyze Black in such a cavalier manner, she would eventually run into trouble.","Thus, she switched her perspective view over to Li Nao.","She did not see any reason for Black to come out of his castle.","Li Nao was where all the action was at the moment.","Meanwhile, Gao Feng was looking around his surroundings in shock.","He watched as chain blades emerged from the sand and formed the interior structure of the castle.","The sand clung to the chain blades.","When Gao Feng touched the walls of the castle, he found the feeling no different from that of rocks. Even when he used force, not a single granule budged.","“The grains of sand are pushing together. Each grain can exert around 100 kilograms of force. We just need to stay here for the next three days. Once the test ends, we have to head to the center. We can also go and take a look at how the other contestants have been dealing with the alien beast tides,” explained Lin Yuan.","Gao Feng gulped when he heard what Lin Yuan said.","He was not shocked by Lin Yuan’s power because he was already well aware of how strong Lin Yuan was.","One could not become the leader of the Guard Ye Banquet’s Martial Arts Stage and attain all that honor without demonstrating the necessary power.","Gao Feng was shocked by how conspicuous Lin Yuan was being.","He always saw Lin Yuan as having an extremely low-profile character.","Lin Yuan’s current actions did not match the image of him in Gao Feng’s mind.","Gao Feng could not help but ask instinctively, “Brother Lin, are we going to do it like this?”","Lin Yuan nodded without hesitation and said, “That’s right. This is how we’ll do it. But for the next few days, I’ll need your help to recover the Source Sand’s spiritual power.”","When he heard this, Gao Feng waved his hand and summoned the two Diamond X/Fantasy V Spirit Spring Lilies.","The Spirit Spring Lilies’ flowers hung down, and spiritual power in the form of water flowed out onto the sand below.","The Source Sand absorbed the spirit qi from the Spirit Spring Lily to maintain its speed in the air while continuing to create sand underground.","Soon, the day passed.","On the first day of the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection, over 14,000 contestants were eliminated.","Besides the contestants who were already at the central territory, the other teams were also rushing there.","Ten pinnacle Class 1 dimensional rifts had opened on the first day.","They assumed that the first Class 2 dimensional rift that opened would be elementary or intermediate.","But, it turned out to also be pinnacle Class 2.","The Class 4 dimensional lifeforms that spewed from the pinnacle Class 2 dimensional rift were as powerful as Platinum feys.","Unless the contestants used their main feys, their chances of victory would be zero.","However, the Class 4 dimensional lifeforms did not give the contestants the opportunity to take them on individually.","They did within the insect tide and waited to pick off the exhausted contestants.","At that moment, the contestants realized with astonishment that a monster had appeared on the horizon."]},{"number":1656,"title":"Chapter 1656 Lost It!","paragraphs":["1656 Lost It!","The castle would crush at least 5,000 people to death if it fell.","Meanwhile, the audience had been staring speechlessly at the flying castle for an entire day.","The longer they watched, the more they felt that Black had joined the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection by mistake.","No matter how astonishing the castle was, it became boring after looking at it for a long time.","However, the contestants did not have a bird’s eye view and were completely ignorant.","At that moment, the contestant standing next to Li Nao, who he designated as his second in command, asked, “Big Brother Li, why don’t we try and attack this castle to see what it’s made of?”","Another said, “Boss, I don’t think we should touch this castle before it tries to target us. After all, there was no mention of a sand castle in the test summary. It also doesn’t look like something produced by a dimensional lifeform.”","Li Nao took a deep breath.","Since he was at the center of the territory, there was no way he was endangered in any way by the alien beast tides.","However, the sand castle could fly. If it stopped above his head, he might be convinced to attack it.","Just as Li Nao was about to issue an order to investigate the sand castle, a contestant with a broken arm rushed over and said, “Boss, numerous Class 4 alien insects are attacking the west outermost wall. They should be coming from a Class 2 alien insect dimensional rift. We need to send reinforcements to that area. Otherwise, we will lose too many troops!”","Li Nao looked up at the sand castle and weighed his options before deciding to send reinforcements to the outermost wall first.","Since he had been chosen as a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection before, it meant that he had already passed the character test.","Although he was sly, he took responsibility for the team’s safety as their leader.","As for the sand castle, he would wait to see how the situation unfolded.","Otherwise, if an area did not have enough members to take on the alien beast tide, all the troops there would fill with fear and lose confidence. This would lower their capabilities and fighting spirits.","Although there were over 20,000 members in his team, only a day had passed.","The next two days would be the true uphill climb.","Li Nao said to the people next to him, “Go and patrol the surroundings and assess the power of the insect tides. Then, send a group of healing-type spirit qi professionals according to the situation in each area. Start at the west side.”","Lin Yuan was slightly shocked when he saw the defenses set up at the central territory.","But that shock soon changed to admiration.","Gao Feng glanced at the central territory and said, “The person leading the group is not bad. The defenses are set up in a star shape, and the troops at the center can provide reinforcements to any direction at any time. But it looks like their air defense is weakening!”"]},{"number":1657,"title":"Chapter 1657 Because My Disciple is There!","paragraphs":["1657 Because My Disciple is There!","Lin Yuan nodded.","Managing a group of 500 was completely different from managing a group of 20,000.","One had to be much more capable of gaining the trust of 20,000 people in a short span of time.","Lin Yuan realized that the members of royalty who organized this Radiance Hundred Sequence selection were overzealous.","The abyss dimensional rift and alien insect dimensional rift were the strongest and most mobile dimensional rifts.","Abyss demons were extremely strong when it came to individual battles, while insect tides were overwhelming in quantity.","Both abyss demons and alien insects were adept at long-distance running and constantly searching for food.","Marsh, subterranean, and water world lifeforms were extremely reliant on their environment. They would not grow in non-suitable environments unless they were provoked.","If the abyss demons and alien insects had not encountered each other and started to fight, resulting in both hordes thinning, the test would have ended within two days.","Just like Gao Feng said, both pinnacle Class 2 abyss and insect dimensional rifts would produce flying dimensional lifeforms.","However, very few of the contestants had avian-type feys.","It would be extremely difficult for the contestants to take on Platinum and Gold abyss demons and alien insects that could fly.","The terrestrial feys would only be able to attack the flying alien insects and abyss demons if they flew closer to the ground.","However, this would result in many losses in troops.","Lin Yuan felt that it was unlikely that the contestants would be able to last for three days in such a state.","At the end of the second day, the alien beast tide would reach peak power.","Lin Yuan felt that this test was overly difficult.","Why did a test that involved survival skills and character assessment have to be so difficult?","Lin Yuan had no idea that while he was confused by these questions, Liu Wencheng was so embarrassed that he wished for there to be a hole that he could crawl into.","Ji Changdeng’s neck was also retracted, and he had an uncomfortable expression on his face. He completely ignored the scathing glare that Liu Wencheng was shooting him.","Night Leaning Moon could not help but ask, “Liu Wencheng, how did you come up with this test? I remember that you set it as four of each of the five types of dimensional rifts. Why are they all alien insect dimensional rifts and abyss dimensional rifts now? When you suggested the test format, I said that it was too difficult. Not only did you go through with it, but you even made it more difficult. What are you trying to do?”","Although both of Liu Wencheng’s ideas involved opening 20 dimensional rifts, ten of which would be pinnacle Class 1 while the other ten would be Class 2, opening five types of dimensional rifts was different from only opening two types.","If five types of dimensional rifts were opened, the five types of alien beasts would start to fight each other when their paths crossed.","Thus, the contestants would not have to fight as many opponents.","But now, the tides of alien insects would combine and advance together, as would the alien beast tide.","With both forces being such behemoths, only a small dent would be made even if both types of alien beasts crossed paths and started fighting each other.","As such, the force of the alien beasts that ended up attacking the central territory would be no different from their full force.","Liu Wencheng apologized and started to reflect on himself sincerely.","“It’s true that I made this test too difficult. I admit that it’s my fault. However, I’m not the one who suggested changing the five types of dimensional rifts to two. It was Ji Changdeng’s idea!”","Liu Wencheng’s words drew the gazes of the other 11 members of royalty.","Ji Changdeng felt extremely wronged.","He shot a tentative gaze at the Moon Empress before glaring at Cicada Song and saying, “Cicada Song, why isn’t your disciple making himself useful in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection? Didn’t you say that he contracted the strongest support-type sacred source lifeform in history?”","Cicada Song was stunned for a moment before he shot Ji Changdeng a strange look.","The Moon Empress’ disciple is also participating in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection. Weren’t you just praising him to the heavens? Why are you using me as a scapegoat now? My disciple is purely support-type. You know this! Moreover, the test circumstance is already difficult in itself. With your meddling, the test will probably end before it reaches the third day.","However, such a test would become meaningless.","The alien beast tides were just the sharpening stones that polished and thinned the herd.","The true fight from which the survivors emerged would come from the contestants fighting each other.","If the Radiance Hundred Sequence test ended too quickly, the first test with the new format would be considered a failure.","It was the Moon Empress who first suggested this new format.","The Moon Empress looked up at the sand castle in the sky. Her expression did not shift in the slightest.","A moment later, she said coldly, “This test will definitely be able to last three days. There is no way this new format will end in failure.”","The other 12 members of royalty did not understand what the Moon Empress meant.","At this moment, the eyes of the contestants in the central territory who were fighting the abyss demons and alien insects suddenly grew wide, and they let out cries of astonishment.","The wild alien insects and abyss demons were suddenly thrown into chaos.","It was as though the ground had turned into mud.","The abyss demons and alien insects started to grow shorter as they sunk into the ground.","After the alien insects and abyss demons fully disappeared, the crowd realized that the ground had turned into quicksand for as far as the eye could see, with the exception of the camp that had been built at the center.","The alien insects and abyss demons tried their best to crawl out of the quicksand but to no avail.","Eventually, all of them were dragged 50 meters underground and sealed in by the heavy sand until they eventually suffocated to death.","This was nothing short of a miracle for all of the contestants.","Lin Yuan, the creator of this miracle, had collapsed in the sand castle after being completely drained of spirit qi.","Despite having used Spirit Injection on himself and the two Diamond X/Fantasy V Spirit Spring Lilies continuously sending spiritual power into his body, he was so drained that he did not even have the strength to stand.","Lin Yuan thought, Although this is part of the Source Sand’s ability, instructing it to generate such a large amount of sand without opening the Spirit Qi Imprint is too much for the limited storage of spirit qi that a body of a B-rank spirit qi professional like me can handle.","At that moment, the Moon Empress’ lips curled into a small smile, and she said, “Because my disciple is there!”"]},{"number":1658,"title":"Chapter 1658 Go For Broke!","paragraphs":["1658 Go For Broke!","When the other members of royalty heard what the Moon Empress said, they could sense how heavily she relied on Lin Yuan.","She had not said such a thing because of Lin Yuan’s action but was in the midst of expressing it even before he did it.","This meant that the Moon Empress was certain that Lin Yuan would be the pillar that held up the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","Liu Wencheng said doubtfully, “Moon Empress, did you tell your disciple about this situation in advance?”","She shook her head and said, “Just like what our batch of Radiance Envoys at the Major Federation Meeting had to do, people need to be adaptable when the situation calls for it. Little Yuan used this method to take some of the pressure off of the other contestants because the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection is important to him. He even revealed a portion of his true power. Since he is already willing to go to such an extent, this test will definitely end well.”","From the Moon Empress’ words, the other members of royalty could hear how much she trusted and admired Lin Yuan.","Given the Moon Empress’ character, it was unbelievable for her to be praising even her disciple to such a degree.","But since the Moon Empress had said such a thing, it meant that she was beyond satisfied with her disciple.","This was true!","A total of nine months had passed since the Moon Empress accepted her disciple. During these nine months, her disciple had been the source of too many outstanding events.","He had even protected the lives of thousands of the Radiance Federation’s Creation Masters, thereby protecting the roots of the Radiance Federation.","By protecting Millstone Town from the insect tide, he had only shown himself to be a hero.","But by doing this, it proved that he felt a deep sense of responsibility for the Radiance Federation.","It was even possible that his contributions exceeded that of the previous batch of Radiance Envoys.","The members of royalty could not help but shower Lin Yuan with praise.","Liu Yifan was utterly shocked by Black’s performance.","A smile spread across Liu Yifan’s face when he remembered what An He said.","Any powerful spirit qi professional had to be competitive.","Even if they were teammates, they could not help but measure against each other.","All of them would continuously increase their power for fear of falling behind their teammates.","Before he became a Radiance Envoy, Liu Yifan would feel stress in the face of a young genius.","But now, after being a Radiance Envoy for so long, Liu Yifan understood how important legacy was to a federation.","The stronger Lin Yuan’s generation was, the more prosperous the Radiance Federation’s legacy would be.","If a federation reached a state where the young could not replace the old, it would become vulnerable.","Lin Yuan’s action attracted the attention of the Freedom and Azure Federation envoy groups.","Although they could not see Lin Yuan and Gao Feng inside the sand castle, the Freedom Federation envoy group decided to try to investigate nonetheless.","They wanted to see how special the rumored genius Black truly was.","This sea of sand was indeed expansive, as it covered 5,000 square kilometers. Not even Myth Breed feys could attack over such a large range.","However, this attack seemed too weak!","It was generated by the sand’s own movements to replicate quicksand in the desert.","Class 4 alien insects and abyss beasts were able to struggle for a long time within quicksand before they exhausted themselves and fell victim. It was easy to target such an attack.","The members of the Freedom Hundred Sequence would not be able to compete with such an opponent.","However, the Radiance Federation’s opponents would not only consist of the Freedom Hundred Sequence but also the three confirmed future Freedom Envoys, Yan Ling, Cai Huo, and You Changjian.","By now, the Freedom Federation envoy group had placed a target on Black’s back, and they were trying their best to investigate him.","Yin Lin was now certain that the person inside the sand castle was Leo.","Her eyes shone.","But at the same time, she mulled over how she would cooperate with his plan to involve everyone present from the Freedom Federation.","Previously, Yin Lin had been blind and completely ignorant of the world.","All her positive feelings toward the Radiance Federation came from Lin Yuan. Otherwise, she would feel completely indifferent about it.","Lin Yuan was going to put himself in danger by taking on the Freedom Federation envoy group and their scheme.","The only results would be Lin Yuan surviving while the Freedom Federation envoy group died or Lin Yuan dying while the Freedom Federation envoy group survived.","These were the only two possible conclusions regardless of what happened in between.","Yin Lin decided that she would go for broke to make Lin Yuan’s endangering of himself worth it.","She came to a decision.","Lan Xun sensed that something was off with Yin Lin’s expression and asked, “Lordess Azure Envoy, did you notice anything special or are you feeling unwell?”","Yin Lin turned and said seriously to Lan Xun, “Teacher, after the Radiance Hundred Selection ends, you have to support me regardless of what decision I make!”","Lan Xun knew what Yin Lin’s plan was. After all, he was aware that Yin Lin had been in the same fey carriage as the Moon Empress’ disciple.","The Azure Federation envoy group knew that the Freedom Federation had a scheme in mind for the Radiance Federation.","Since Yin Lin asked for his support, it meant that she had decided to side with the Radiance Federation.","Lan Xun did not take issue with this because Yin Lin had the authority to pick which side they joined.","He nodded at Yin Lin and said, “I will do everything I can to support you!”","Lan Xun had no idea that his nod sealed his support for an almost insane decision.","Every member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence seated on the silver pillars looked at the image of what was happening during the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection with strange expressions.","Li Ang could not help but gasp. “If Black uses such a move during the Radiance Hundred Sequence ranking, he will probably push me down a rank!”","Shi Xu chimed in. “Have some confidence. He’ll definitely push you down! Besides those two at the top of the ranking, no one else will be able to handle such an attack. I have teamed up with Black before. The yellow sand is very dynamic. It can accurately defend against any attack.”"]},{"number":1659,"title":"Chapter 1659 Red Thorn is Summoned!","paragraphs":["1659 Red Thorn is Summoned!","“In order to eliminate all the alien insects, the sand had expanded to 5,000 square kilometers. However, the location of our ranking is only one square kilometer. In such a space, the power of the quicksand will be unimaginable compared to its current state.”","The girl who just managed to keep her place as Sequence #89 said, “You can’t put it like that! Black’s sand-type source type lifeform needs time to generate sand.”","Zhao Xiaochun shot back. “You saw how Black could recover his spiritual power when flying! Anyone would need time to alter the environment. We walk on the land where the sand-elemental source-type lifeform can change to earth if it so desires. Black can fight as well on land with this sand-elemental source-type lifeform, as Long Tao and I can fight in the sea. Thus, he will definitely be able to change the environment of the testing ground faster.","“Moreover, this is only one of Black’s feys. I agree with Shi Xu’s comment that Black will definitely be able to make it to at least Sequence #3. To be honest, Black grew really quickly! I suspect that he has been purposely hiding his powers.","“His sand-elemental source-type lifeform can counter Liu Jie’s army of insects. There would be no opportunity for the terrestrial Flesh-Mincing Blade Insects to properly demonstrate their capabilities.”","While the people around him were engaged in discussions, a smile akin to the one that appeared when the Insect Queen recovered from the near-death state appeared on Liu Jie’s face.","He was Lin Yuan’s retainer knight. If Lin Yuan were insulted, he would use his life to avenge him. But if Lin Yuan was praised, Liu Jie would be filled with pride.","The others were unaware, but Liu Jie knew full well how far Lin Yuan had come.","While Lin Yuan had been growing at a breakneck pace, he had also been hiding his powers.","Despite being Lin Yuan’s retainer knight, even Liu Jie was not completely clear on how powerful Lin Yuan had become.","It was not until the fight between Lin Yuan and Zong Ze at the Guard Ye Banquet that Liu Jie realized Lin Yuan had been hiding a well of combat power.","At that moment, an urgency had risen within Liu Jie.","While the rest of the members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence were looking up to him, he was struggling to catch up to Lin Yuan.","All of his growth, whether it was the Cocoon of Evolution, the mutation of the Blade Queen Bee, the ability to control insect-species carcinoma feys, or his newly obtained Firefly Demon Fetuses, had to be attributed to Lin Yuan.","Liu Jie’s only wish in life was to stay by Lin Yuan’s side and fight side by side with him.","Perhaps, Lin Yuan was already so radiant that he could blind the entire world. All he needed to do was to stay by Lin Yuan’s side like a star adorning the moon.","Many audience members on Star Web had been accusing Black of treating the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection like a vacation.","But now, all of those people had their jaws zipped shut.","Black’s popularity on Star Web exploded.","After watching the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection for an entire day, their interest was waning.","They had been nervous as they watched the contestants at the center territory take on the insect tide.","But even after fighting for several hours, there was no change in the situation.","A person would become bored after playing a tower defense game for a few hours.","Although the activity on Star Web had not dwindled, there were many people who did not immediately log back on after logging out to sleep and eat.","This was unsurprising as even the contestants in the midst of the test needed to eat.","After exhausting themselves for an entire day, the contestants changed shifts and allowed their teammates to take over while they slept for one or two hours to replenish their energy.","The comments in the live-streaming rooms were also not streaming in with the same frenzy as they were in the beginning.","Lu Shuang was not even watching the comments anymore.","Now, it was even possible for a comment to remain on the screen for more than a second.","However, the shocking activity of the sand had reawakened the audience’s excitement.","Hehe: Ah! My husband is amazing! I don’t want to be a male fan anymore! I want to cross swords with Black!","Naming is So Difficult: Damn! What did I just see? How did so many alien insects and abyss demons die? How did Black do it?","Hush: What’s going on? Did Black just destroy all the alien insects and abyss demons? Why does he feel like an NPC in this test?","Items Are Not People: I think you’re right! Black seems just like an NPC! I already said that Black and the person he teamed up with would definitely be able to become members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence. My guess was tight! Black can carry another nine people with him to survive the test and become members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Carnelian Tangerine: Please don’t spout nonsense! Gao Feng is the Young Leader of a top faction. He might not be as strong as Black, but he won’t need anyone to carry him to become a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Lu Shuang did not have the authority to talk about the Source Sand. After all, Black had not used the Source Sand when he fought against Lu Shuang.","However, this was not the case for Poison Beauty because she had once been in the tight clutches of a fist formed from sand and even sunk deep into the sand.","She was all too familiar with the suffocating sensation of being smothered by the quicksand.","While the discussions on Star Web were intensifying, Lin Yuan realized that it would be impossible for him to control the situation on the ground using only the Source Sand.","Even if Gao Feng continuously replenished his spiritual power and injected spiritual power into the Source Sand, it was too much to ask of the Source Sand to control the alien beasts from ten pinnacle Class 1 dimensional rifts and ten pinnacle Class 2 dimensional rifts.","The best plan would be to use Red Thorn because Red Thorn’s sea of flowers used the flesh of alien insects as sustenance.","The alien insects’ flesh would be the best source of energy for the sea of flowers, and Lin Yuan would not have to supply any additional spiritual power.","However, this was not the case for the Source Sand.","Luckily, no one outside of the sand castle could see what was happening within.","Lin Yuan waved his hand and summoned Red Thorn.","After Red Thorn was summoned, it flew around Lin Yuan and pecked Lin Yuan’s cheek before letting out a clear chirp.","Gao Feng did not find it strange that a fairy source-type lifeform was acting affectionately toward Lin Yuan.","Fairy source-type lifeforms were more emotional than regular feys.","But as Gao Feng stared at Red Thorn, he kept asking himself what he was looking at.","Was this a six-winged fairy?"]},{"number":1660,"title":"Chapter 1660 Real Household Name!","paragraphs":["1660 Real Household Name!","Although Lin Yuan’s spiritual power had been used up, the Source Sand did not stop moving.","The river of spiritual power flowing from the Spirit Spring Lilies to the Source Sand kept the sea of sand moving.","However, the sea of sand was no longer moving with the same force it used to and could not restrain the abyss demons and alien insects to the same extent.","After walking for 100 meters, the Normal and Elite alien insects and abyss demons would sink into the sand.","However, the Class 1 alien insects and abyss demons could now climb out of the sand with some struggle.","Nonetheless, in order to prevent themselves from slipping again, they could only move tens of meters every few minutes.","The Class 2 alien insects and abyss demons were unable to move faster as they could only move around 300 meters every minute. This was slower than the pace at which a regular person could run.","However, the Class 3 and 4 alien insects and abyss demons were practically unaffected by the sand and were able to move without restraint.","Nonetheless, the recent events had been too shocking.","The abyss demons and alien insects at the edges had witnessed their comrades swallowed up by the quicksand.","The more powerful alien insects and abyss demons could control the insect tides and demon waves.","The Class 4 alien insects and abyss demons had gained substantial intelligence. They hastily let out cries to order their troops to stop advancing.","However, more pinnacle Class 2 dimensional rifts were opening, and the number of Class 4 abyss demons and alien insects was not dropping in numbers.","Thus, despite the commandeering alien insects and abyss demons issuing the order to halt from the front, the alien insects and abyss demons from the back continued to surge forward. As a result, they pushed the alien insects and abyss demons nearer to the front into the sand.","The sand was lethal to abyss demons and alien insects that were Class 1 and below but no longer a serious threat to those below Class 1.","Eventually, the alien beast tide was contained.","Additionally, the cramped environment caused the alien insects and abyss demons to start violently fighting against each other.","Lin Yuan and the contestants in the central territory noticed this.","When they first learned of this information, the contestants who acted as scouts reported it to Li Nao.","When Li Nao found out that the alien beast tide had been halted at the edge of the sand and their actions were uncertain for the moment, he said to the contestants around him, “The 200 of you are the captains that I specially picked out. Each of you is in charge of 100 people.","“Now, take your team and strengthen the defenses around the territory. Dig out the bodies of the alien insects and abyss demons from the sand. Cut off the alien insects’ shells and strip off the horns of the abyss demons to use them to secure the defenses.","“Also, each team should send out 20 members. The 4,000 combined members will work together to gather the other teams coming to join us at the center. The alien beast tide has not crossed the sea of sand, but the sand’s movement is slowing.","“As the pinnacle Class 2 dimensional rifts continue to open, the alien beast tide will eventually start trying to stampede us. The more time we have to prepare, the larger the army of alien beasts we’ll have to face. We can’t let our guard down now!","“Gather up all the healing-type spirit qi professionals and heal the feys with support and healing abilities first. For now, power offense-type feys are the lowest priority.”","In such a large-scale battle, healing-type spirit qi professionals were a rare commodity, while support-type spirit qi professionals could benefit a group of people.","Hence, for the sake of the general good, the best option would be to protect the support-type and healing-type spirit qi professionals first.","Although this was unfair, the power offense-type spirit qi professionals who would be relying on the support-type spirit qi professionals the most during battle would not have too many complaints.","With the help of a good support-type spirit qi professional, no one would benefit more than the power offense-type spirit qi professionals.","When there were many power offense-type spirit qi professionals, they would have to rely on the protection of defense-type spirit qi professionals.","Under Li Nao’s orders, the team jumped into action.","The Star Web users were very impressed by this.","Nicholas Seven: Li Nao’s adaptability is so strong! He’s leading a team of over 20,000 people and doing it perfectly. I have always felt that his defenses were built well. But now, with some time to prepare, it seems like most of the contestants in the central territory will be able to make it past the three days.","Head to the Capital: I also think that Li Nao is amazing. They are all taking the test together. Not only does he stand out, but he even managed to win their hearts in two days. Although the newer members haven’t fully submitted to him, those who have been with him for more than a day are all completely loyal to him! This is his personal charisma!","Three Questions: All of you are praising Li Nao, but why do I feel like he pales in comparison to Black? If not for Black, the alien beast tide would have charged forward unceasingly, and this team of over 20,000 people would have dropped to 16,000 or even less!","Unfaithful Carrot: Why do I want to laugh? I don’t think Li Nao knows that Black created the castle in the sky and the sea of sand! He even ordered to dig out the alien insects and abyss demons from the sand to use them as defense fortification.","No matter how well Li Nao performed, Black still had the spotlight on him.","Poison Beauty and Lu Shuang had stopped mentioning Black in every sentence.","With the amount of power he demonstrated, everyone knew that he was powerful.","If they continued to praise him, it would become annoying to their audiences.","With one move, Black had become a true household name!","The circles that paid the most attention to Black were those that fixated on heroes and Star Web battles.","But now, after the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection, the number of people paying attention to him had skyrocketed.","It was not an exaggeration to say that he was a superstar in the eyes of every citizen of the Radiance Federation!"]},{"number":1661,"title":"Chapter 1661 The Seas of Flowers Connected Into One Piece!","paragraphs":["1661 The Seas of Flowers Connected Into One Piece!","After watching Li Nao’s performance for the past day, Liu Wencheng said, “I never knew that Li Nao was so capable! This test allowed me to see sides of Li Nao that he usually did not have the chance to reveal.”","Night Leaning Moon also said approvingly, “Li Nao can join the Spirit Guards. After being nurtured for some time, he might even be able to become a Spirit Envoy. If Cicada Song is interested, he can also nurture Li Nao into a reserve consul of the cities.”","At that moment, Li Nao was completely preoccupied with organizing his troops and strengthening his defenses.","He had no idea that his performance had caught the attention of royalty.","Gao Feng stared in shock at Red Thorn, who was flapping its wings as it hovered in front of Lin Yuan to speak to him.","“Yuan, I haven’t seen you in so long! Did you call me out to play or so that I can beat up some bad guys?”","Fairy source-type lifeforms were so rare that they were unfamiliar to most spirit qi professionals.","Given that Gao Feng came from a top faction, he had heard of them but did not own any himself.","It had been rumored that fairy source-type lifeforms had the highest intelligence and had the same intelligence as a human, even with only one pair of wings.","Once they obtained their second pair of wings, they would become smarter than humans.","Gao Feng had heard of six-winged fairy source-type lifeforms before, but they should be comparable to Creation Breed power.","Gao Feng had seen Cicada Song summon a light-green-bodied and long-haired six-winged fairy before.","He was not a Creation Master and could not discover anything for himself.","However, the feeling that Cicada Song’s six-winged fairy gave Gao Feng was completely different from the one that he was getting from Red Thorn.","There was no question that Cicada Song’s six-winged fairy was stronger.","However, Gao Feng felt that this green-haired and red-eyed fairy with a long flower skirt seemed even more venerable.","Gao Feng had chatted with Lin Yuan and found out that Lin Yuan was still a B-rank spirit qi professional.","This was the main reason for Gao Feng’s shock.","It was astonishing enough that he possessed a six-winged fairy.","But, this six-winged fairy had gained its third pair of wings when it was Fantasy Breed. This went beyond the knowledge that humans currently knew about fairy source-type lifeforms.","Gao Feng thought, Luckily, the sand castle is blocking Red Thorn. Otherwise, the people from the Freedom Federation envoy group would find out that Lin Yuan had a six-winged fairy.","The six-winged fairy was worthy of being Lin Yuan’s secret weapon.","If the Freedom Federation envoy group had two-winged or four-winged fairies, Lin Yuan could order Red Thorn to release its aura without summoning it.","The pressure from its bloodline would immediately cause the two-winged and four-winged fairies to lose their will to fight.","Lin Yuan seriously replied, “Red Thorn, what we’re about to do is very important. First, produce some spore cavities. I will instruct the Source Sand to send the spore cavities to designated positions. Then, use the spore cavities to produce spores at the spore cavities’ locations so that numerous seas of flowers are formed.”","Red Thorn felt that Lin Yuan was not asking something difficult of it.","As such, it did not summon the Mouth of Relinquish.","The Mouth of Relinquish was Red Thorn’s original body. With it around, Red Thorn would be able to use its abilities to their maximum extent.","Although the abilities that Red Thorn used on its own would not produce effects as quickly as the Mouth of Relinquish, it could still easily handle something like producing spore cavities and spores.","Red Thorn’s green hair billowed in the wind, and grayish-green spores drifted down from its hair.","These spores grew rapidly within the sand castle.","A moment later, besides where Lin Yuan and Gao Feng were standing, everywhere else was covered by spore cavities that were waist height.","After the special spore cavities were produced, the sand inside the castle started to move until it swallowed up the spore cavities.","Pillars of sand extended down from the castle and delivered the spore cavities to the quicksand on the ground.","Lin Yuan activated the spiritual power he had just replenished to increase the speed of the Source Sand’s movements.","The quicksand buried the spore cavities at various positions in the sea of sand.","Soon, Red Thorn controlled the spore cavities to produce spores and take root in the sand as per Lin Yuan’s request.","Red Thorn used up 14 Eyes of Relinquish for this endeavor.","The audience on Star Web noticed that dark green plants were growing out of the sand in neat rows.","These vine plants were very special as they had metal gleams to them. It seemed that they were all very tough.","Red Thorn was about to use more Eyes of Relinquish before Lin Yuan stopped it.","“Red Thorn, we will need the entire sea of flowers to last half a day. You don’t have to use the Eyes of Relinquish. There are many corpses of abyss demons and alien insects within the sand. The Source Sand will deliver them to the sea of flowers! Use the mouths on the brutal vine ramets to consume their bodies and expand the sea of flowers as fast as possible,” said Lin Yuan.","Red Thorn dutifully extended the brutal vine ramets into the ground, where it noticed that many bodies of abyss demons and alien insects had indeed been delivered to it.","Red Thorn was a glutton by nature.","There was no way it was going to turn down the food that Lin Yuan was offering to it.","Although Red Thorn was no longer interested in the flesh of dimensional lifeforms below Class 5, Lin Yuan still gave it food.","The brutal vine ramets first consumed the weaker alien insects and abyss demons.","With the energy from the alien insects and abyss demons, the sea of flowers started to expand rapidly.","Soon, the numerous seas of flowers joined together.","The Star Web users who were watching this remembered the memory that first sealed Black in their minds.","The sea of flowers was Black’s signature!"]},{"number":1662,"title":"Chapter 1662 Impending Arrival of the Goddess of Mercy!","paragraphs":["1662 Impending Arrival of the Goddess of Mercy!","Black had used this terrifying sea of flowers to give Millstone Town hope for survival by protecting them.","The incident had spread all over Star Web.","However, there had been no video recordings during the dimensional rift, and all accounts were by word-of-mouth from the residents of Millstone Town.","The citizens of Millstone Town had sworn that Black’s feys were all below Silver grade but had been capable of defeating the insect tide from a pinnacle Class 1 alien insect dimensional rift.","This had exceeded the understanding of regular people. Hence, many people on Star Web did not believe these accounts.","Black had indeed used the sea of flowers to protect Millstone Town and deserved immense praise.","However, they did not believe that Black was so capable.","Given that Black had saved the entire Millstone Town, the residents of Millstone Town were all upset when no one believed their retelling of the events.","They anxiously posted more messages and even sought out the Ascending Dragon Guards, who had also witnessed the sea of flowers, to try and prove that they were telling the truth.","However, no guard of a city would respond to private messages on Star Web just to verify an exclamation.","Although many people did not believe that Black had used a plant-type source-type lifeform below Silver grade to defend against the insect tide from a pinnacle Class 1 alien insect dimensional rift, they still acknowledged Black as a young hero.","After all, not everyone was willing to stand out to defend a crowd from danger.","Black had also used Red Thorn in a Star Web battle.","However, the Celestial Tower’s battleground had only been around 200 meters in length and width.","Even if Red Thorn used its sea of flowers, its effects would be greatly limited.","Lin Yuan had not used Red Thorn on Star Web ever since it evolved to Fantasy Breed.","Now, all the people who had doubted that Black had used Red Thorn to defend against an insect tide were eating a feast of crows.","The eight seas of flowers moved toward each other.","The audience could not understand what Lin Yuan was trying to do because they had not even realized the difficulty of this Radiance Hundred Sequence selection,","The eyes of the members of royalty seated on the golden pillars lit up.","“Black’s source-type lifeform is really special. Look how the vines are extending below the sand as though they are searching for something. There are many sharp teeth covering the vines. Whenever they emerge from the sand, they are dragging many pieces of flesh along with them. The flesh has the bones and skin of alien beasts stuck to them. Clearly, the vines are linked to the Source Sand and are using the bodies of alien insects and abyss demons buried under the sand as energy sources.","“Once the alien beasts charge over, they will be slowed down by the eight seas of flowers and divided into nine groups. By wiping out a portion of the alien beasts, a significant amount of pressure is taken off of the contestants.","“Moreover, the seas of flowers are one kilometer away from the central territory. When the alien insects and abyss demons make it through the sea of flowers and regroup at the central territory, they will start fighting each other again. As long as Black is willing to continue controlling the situation, there should be nothing keeping the test from reaching the third day,” said Liu Wencheng.","Liu Wencheng was happy about Black’s presence but also felt that the entire situation was too ridiculous.","This test was stumping thousands of contestants, yet Black’s two feys solved the entire problem.","With just Black alone, he could take on all the burden of defense for the three days.","After careful observation, Liu Wencheng still could not discern the grade of the vines.","However, one vine that was clearly thicker and stronger than the rest dragged a Class 4 abyss demon from the sand.","Besides the horns of the abyss demon, its entire body was gobbled up by the teeth on the vines.","Given that one vine could take on a Class 4 abyss demon, its strength had to be at least Platinum grade.","Moreover, the vine became even thicker after it consumed the Class 4 abyss demon. This meant that the plant not only consumed flesh to expand itself but also to increase its power.","Liu Wencheng imagined what would happen if the source-type lifeform broke out of Lin Yuan’s control and ended up within the dimensional world. If given enough time and if the Dictators did not discover its ortet, it would probably devour the entire dimensional world.","Li Yang said to You Changjian, “Changjian, Black is one of your targets. Are you ready?”","You Changjian was one of Li Yang’s favored experts.","Hence, after Li Yang appeared, You Changjian left his original position and took his place respectfully next to Li Yang.","You Changjian hurriedly responded, “Don’t worry. Yan Lin, Cai Huo, and I are definitely able to defeat the sea of flowers before it fully forms. When our sacred source lifeforms work together, they reach the second stage. There’s no way we’ll lose!”","You Changjian glanced at Qian Yu and thought about the pressure that Qian Yu had put on the three of them, as well as his request.","You Changjian said to Li Yang, “Lord Qian Yu asked us to involve several more disciples of royalty during the fight. Including Gao Feng, there is already one member of royalty. If we involve more than three disciples of royalty, we—”","Before You Changjian could finish speaking, Li Yang interrupted him. “Are you stressed?”","Li Yang looked at Qian Yu. After a moment of silence, he said, “Qian Yu is the Freedom Envoy leading this Freedom Federation envoy group. All arrangements are up to him. But he will also have to shoulder the blame if something goes wrong.”","Although the Freedom Envoys did not enjoy as much honor as Radiance Envoys and Azure Envoys did, they still represented the young generation of the Freedom Federation.","As long as his benefits were not infringed upon, Lin Yuan did not want to butt heads with Qian Yu.","Thus, Li Yang handed the authority back to Qian Yu."]},{"number":1663,"title":"Chapter 1663 Alien Beast Tide Makes a Move!","paragraphs":["1663 Alien Beast Tide Makes a Move!","Qian Yu let out a breath of relief when he heard what Li Yang said.","Qian Yu had been afraid that all his authority would be lost now that Li Yang was here.","This meant that he would lose the chance to make the arrangements for the upcoming fight.","As the Freedom Envoy leading the envoy group, he would have to shoulder all responsibility if anything went wrong.","Despite Li Yang returning the yoke of authority to him, he still had to perform the necessary formalities.","Qian Yu asked Li Yang, “Since the Radiance Federation sent its current third Radiance Envoy to host the Radiance Hundred Sequence, do you think that he will engage with me if I invite him to go a round with me?”","Li Yang looked at Qian Yu with amusement.","He did not expect Qian Yu’s appetite to be so voracious.","With such a large appetite, he could indeed become stronger by eating. However, there was also a chance that he would overstuff himself.","Li Yang did not intend to respond. All he said was, “I will not be participating in anything related to the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection. The Goddess of Mercy will be arriving at the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection. You are the Goddess of Mercy’s favored expert. I hope that you won’t end up a disappointment in front of her.”","The originally calm Qian Yu became anxious when he heard that the Goddess of Mercy would be coming to the Radiance Federation.","...","Gao Feng looked at the eight vast seas of flowers outside and was suddenly filled with a curious feeling.","He instructed the Spirit Spring Lilies to release more spiritual power to recover Lin Yuan’s spirit qi faster.","He also buried several springs that continuously released spirit qi within the Source Sand.","What Gao Feng needed most were good teammates who would enable him to show his true talents.","This was the first time he had a teammate whose combat power could match Gao Feng’s capabilities properly.","Gao Feng truly enjoyed this feeling of being able to fully support and help his teammate.","Lin Yuan continued to give orders. “Red Thorn, when the insect beast tide makes it through the flowers, you can consume the alien insects and abyss demons at will! If the sea of flowers is damaged in any way, you can recover it in any way. But, you don’t need to create another sea of flowers, nor will you need to use any other ability.”","Red Thorn gently nodded.","It felt that Lin Yuan’s orders would allow him to feast for an entire day.","The contestants at the central territory who were in charge of scouting were shocked when they sensed the endless seas of flowers.","They finally remembered that Black was also participating in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","These seas of flowers were proof of Black’s presence!","Since the seas of flowers were situated on top of the sand, it meant that the sand had also come from Black.","This indicated that Black was inside the sand castle in the sky.","Li Nao had been observing the defenses and healing injured contestants alongside a team of healing-type spirit qi professionals.","When Li Nao first heard the report, he thought the sand would be so hard that it would be difficult to dig through.","However, the sand turned out to behave like it had a life of its own and revealed many alien insects and abyss demon corpses for them to collect.","At that moment, the contestants in charge of scouting came to see Li Nao and tell him about the situation.","Li Nao looked up at the sand castle with shock. Fear was apparent in his gaze.","Black’s appearance was a blessing to the contestants at the outermost layers who were doing the bulk of the fighting.","However, he was a huge threat to Li Nao, who ruled over the central territory.","Li Nao had no doubt that if Black emerged from the sand castle and challenged him, his overwhelming power and the fact that he had just the contestants at the outermost layers would result in Li Nao losing his throne.","If Li Nao were smart, he would decide to lock the information down. He could even kill the scouts if he wanted to take it a step further.","After all, the seas of flowers were a kilometer away from the central territory, which was too far for most of the contestants under Li Nao to spot.","If he hid the news of Black’s presence, he would be able to retain the control he had over his team.","However, Li Nao did not decide to do this.","He had never had the chance to lead a large team. But now, he had been leading a team of 20000 people for half a day.","As such, he now understood the responsibility that came with leadership.","This feeling had already influenced his subconscious, and his instinct was now to secure the benefits of the whole team rather than just trying to ensure that he made it to one of the last ten members and regain a spot in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","At this point, everyone was exhausted. All of them longed to have a drink of water, eat a mouthful of food, or take a nap.","Most of them had been beaten to the point that they were downcast.","While patrolling, Li Nao noticed that most of the contestants’ eyes were empty.","None of them thought that they would be able to pass the test. Thus, they lost the will to fight with the same tenacity that they had at the beginning.","Li Nao called over the 200 managers he had designated and said, “Send the information down. The quicksand is a result of Black. He’s helping us to defend against the alien beast tide. There are also seas of flowers outside of the sand. So everyone, perk up. We will definitely make it through!”","Li Nao’s words made the 200 managers’ eyes light up.","They were suddenly filled with courage.","When they looked up at the sand castle, they sent down the information like the melody of a harp.","Soon, cheers arose from the camp that slowly melded together.","If the audience were not aware that this was a serious test, they would assume that a festival was taking place if they heard these cheers.","The sounds of joy traveled up to the sand castle, and Lin Yuan and Gao Feng heard them.","At this moment, someone yelled, “Black is the best!”","Soon, cries of people repeating this declaration caused the granules of sand on the ground to tremble.","Gao Feng smiled when he heard these cheers.","However, this expression was not present on Lin Yuan’s face.","Rather, he frowned because he noticed that the alien beast tide in the distance had started to move."]},{"number":1664,"title":"Chapter 1664 Red Thorn’s New Technique!","paragraphs":["1664 Red Thorn’s New Technique!","After a few hours of preparation, Lin Yuan could sense through True Data that the Class 2 abyss demons and alien insects were ceaselessly surveying the sea of sand and flowers.","Although the alien insects and abyss beasts had not joined forces and were still bitterly fighting against each other, with thousands of bodies already littering the ground, the Class 4 abyss demons and alien insects had gathered together to form a small group at the edge of the alien insect tide.","This small group was orchestrating the alien insects and abyss beasts.","They controlled the alien insects and abyss beasts to attack the central territory from all directions to test the power of the sea of flowers.","Lin Yuan had instructed the Source Sand to move according to its will.","Through the alien beast tide’s movements, Lin Yuan noticed that the Normal and Elite grade alien beasts were not able to make it far before they sunk into the sea of sand.","It could be said that the Source Sand had managed to eliminate many low-grade alien insects and abyss beasts on its own.","But very soon, Lin Yuan realized that something was very wrong.","If things kept going the way they were, the alien beasts and abyss beasts that eventually made it to the central territory would be Bronze grade at least. The stronger ones would be Gold or even Platinum grade.","Even if Red Thorn consumed endlessly, the alien beasts that the contestants at the central territory had to take on would be the strongest of the lot!","This method went against Lin Yuan’s original intent.","It was much more difficult to fight an alien beast tide made up of Class 1 alien insects and abyss demons than it was to fight one made up of Normal and Elite grades.","Thus, Lin Yuan instructed the Source Sand to stop consuming the Normal and Elite alien insects and abyss beasts.","According to its grade and abilities, Red Thorn would continue to pick the high-class abyss demons and alien insects.","This was the only proper way to regulate the alien beast tide.","When the sand under the alien beast tide stopped moving, the alien beasts charged forward in a frenzy. They made a beeline for the central territory.","Now, the sea of flowers could exhibit its full might against the alien beast tide.","Red Thorn’s brutal vine ramets had not even finished consuming all the dimensional lifeform flesh within the sand, but all of them had already gained enough energy to reach Silver grade. There were even a few that had reached Gold grade.","But no matter how strong the sea of flowers was, it could not defend against the alien insect tide.","However, unlike Lin Yuan’s expectation, the alien beasts did not charge into the central territory.","Rather, they dashed headfirst into the sea of flowers.","Red Thorn did not hold back at all against these alien beasts.","However, their numbers were so vast that it was too much for the sea of flowers to handle.","As such, Red Thorn used up a few Eyes of Relinquish and started gesturing angrily at Lin Yuan.","Red Thorn felt that these Class 4 alien insects and abyss beasts were nothing more than low-class appetizers.","Red Thorn was insulted that these snacks were trying to revolt. It planned on giving the alien beasts a taste of the power of the sea of flowers.","“Yuan, I want to strengthen the sea of flowers and eat all of them up.”","Lin Yuan did not oppose this idea and gave his silent consent.","Red Thorn produced pink spores and asked Lin Yuan to use the Source Sand to deliver the pink spores to the sea of flowers.","Lin Yuan realized what Red Thorn was trying to do and agreed to its request.","The Source Sand quickly delivered the pink spores to various parts of the sea of flowers.","Soon, several brutal vine ramets’ roots started to dance.","When the pink spores grew to the size of fists, the brutal vine ramets wrapped their roots around the spores and fused with them.","Then, the brutal vine ramets continued to consume alien beasts to provide energy to the beings within the spores.","As waves of alien insects charged into the sea of flowers, the sharp tips of the brutal vine ramets slipped through the cracks of the insect armor or pierced through the flesh of the abyss demons to consume them.","The brutal vine ramets could not digest instantly like the Mouth of Relinquish could.","The brutal vine ramets needed more than ten seconds to consume even the Normal and Elite grade alien beasts.","The brutal vine ramets could not defend themselves when they were consuming food.","The abyss beasts and alien insects continuously trampled the brutal vine ramets while attacking them with their teeth, horns, acid, and flames.","After consuming the alien insects and abyss demons for some time, the brutal vine ramets had built up a strong resistance against their acid and flames.","Nonetheless, the barrage of damage from their teeth and horns still took down a number of the brutal vine ramets.","After a few minutes passed, the sea of flowers visibly shrunk under the attacks of the alien beast tide.","Within these few minutes, Lin Yuan realized with a shock that these small beings that had sprung from the pink spores had already grown more than two meters tall.","They formed a strange spiked ball.","Lin Yuan felt that it resembled a simplified version of the Mouth of Relinquish that did not have any Eyes of Relinquish.","This thing could not consume food like the Mouth of Relinquish could.","It grew past two meters and only stopped when it reached almost four meters.","The entire ball was so engorged that it became translucent.","There were many tubes running along its surface that resembled blood vessels.","These tubes extended out of the ball and linked up with every brutal vine ramet.","The fluid within the ball flowed out through the tubes to the brutal vine ramets.","Suddenly, the brutal vine ramets were charged with power.","Now, they only needed less than three seconds to digest Normal and Elite grade alien beasts.","The sea of flowers could now consume food at almost three times its original rate.","Previously, the alien beast tide had pushed it to the edge of its limits.","But with help from the ball produced by the pink spores, the sea of flowers had recovered at a breakneck pace!"]},{"number":1665,"title":"Chapter 1665 I Give Into Black!","paragraphs":["1665 I Give Into Black!","The eight seas of flowers were stabilized.","While the seas of flowers were battling the alien beast tide, the central territory’s defenses had completed construction.","The small team of contestants who were analyzing battle strategies had not realized it yet, but the audience on Star Web, who had a bird’s eye view, had witnessed the battle between the seas of flowers and the alien beast tide.","The battle was like a scene from a blockbuster movie.","Those who had not believed that the sea of flowers was capable of holding its own against an alien beast tide now realized how Black had managed to use the plant-type fey to protect Millstone Town from the alien insect tide.","There were a few new spirit qi professionals who had their eyes opened to what a fey could achieve.","They now knew that a fey or source-type lifeform could be nurtured to such a degree.","Poison Beauty was now a mega horn that sang Black’s praises.","Ever since the sand castle rose to the air, she had been praising him to the skies.","When Lu Shuang realized that Black was far from ordinary, she became much more cautious when she praised him.","She no longer compared herself to Black.","She had not understood why she lost to Black and was rather indignant about the result.","Lu Shuang had never publicly admitted that she acknowledged Black’s power because she felt that he had only won by taking advantage of the fact that his feys were unknown entities.","As a B-rank spirit qi professional, B-rank did not have any Myth Breed feys.","Both Lu Shuang and Black’s feys had been Diamond X/Fantasy V.","If she only knew what Black’s cat-species fey’s abilities and exclusive skills were, she could have dodged its attack and might have stood a fighting chance.","But now, she knew Black better and learned that he had two other feys besides the cat-species feys.","She had no clue if Black had demonstrated the two feys’ full power.","But there was no question that Lu Shuang would not be able to compete with even the amount of power that they had exhibited.","Lu Shuang sighed at the screen and said, “I truly give in to Black. I think that he is just as powerful as any disciple of royalty.”","Lu Shuang was always very careful during her live streams and filtered all her speech.","She only said such a thing because she truly felt this way.","Disciples of royalty were as legendary as the members of royalty themselves.","There were always a few anonymous people on the god-class list.","This was the same for the Celestial Stairway streak list.","Most of these anonymous people were young elites from top factions or disciples of royalty.","Lin Yuan’s performance during the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection made Lu Shuang speak from the heart.","The entire live-streaming room became abuzz with activity when they heard what Lu Shuang said.","Cheng: Shuang finally gave in to someone! Black is indeed powerful. His two feys are strong enough for me to be at a loss about what his flaw could be. But isn’t it inappropriate to compare a disciple of royalty with Black?","Magic Mini Jie: I don’t think there’s anything inappropriate about it. We can’t tell how powerful Black’s feys are through Star Web. But all those posts say that Black’s sand-elemental source-type lifeform is Diamond X/Fantasy V. That’s the power of a top genius! Is it possible that disciples of royalty who are of the same age as Black have reached A-rank and obtained Myth Breed feys?","Endless Supply of Loneliness: No matter what happens, I’m a lifelong fan of Black! Unless those disciples of royalty appear and fight against Black, he is the strongest to me!","Lemon Early Summer: Do you remember the bet that the royalty made with the Freedom","Federation royalty a month ago? I think that Black might be able to become one of the next Radiance Envoys. There is a citizen’s vote during the Radiance Envoy voting. Although it only makes up 10% of the weightage, I’m still voting for Black!","Maple Dance: Hey! Black might have revealed the sand-elemental source-type lifeform and plant-type fey but don’t you guys still want to see the small blue bird, eight-tailed cat, and bee healing-type fey?","There were posts about the sea of sand and sea of flowers all over Star Web.","With Liu Lang at the helm, Black’s official fan club was bursting with exuberance.","Lin Yuan and Gao Feng were completely unaware of all this.","Gao Feng looked at how the eight seas of flowers continued to stand strong in the midst of the alien beast tide.","The seas of flowers were so ferocious that even the alien beast tide felt fear creeping up on them.","Gao Feng noticed the dimensional lifeforms crawling frantically toward the two seas of flowers at the center.","Lin Yuan single-handedly took on the entire test.","This left Gao Feng temporarily speechless.","Gao Feng had seen his share of crises as one of the top young experts.","But if Lin Yuan was replaced by anyone else, not even Zong Ze, Gu Lang, and An He would be able to do all that Lin Yuan had achieved.","But all his clouds of confusion faded away when he remembered that a six-winged fairy beyond the understanding of history had created the sea of flowers.","Lin Yuan was talking to Red Thorn curiously, “Red Thorn, I remember that you can only change into two types of plant shapes.”","He remembered that Red Thorn could only use its spores to produce spore cavities and brutal vine ramets.","This was with the exception of the red gill-shaped flowers that it could produce when it was battling underwater.","The ramets Red Thorn produced from the pink spores were completely unfamiliar to Lin Yuan.","Red Thorn replied casually, “Yuan, besides the digestion cavities I just produced, I can also produce another new type of ramet. The new ramet can gobble up the entire tide of alien beasts! Yuan, do you want a demonstration?”","Red Thorn had been over the moon when Lin Yuan praised it, and it was dying to receive even more.","Lin Yuan hurriedly interrupted Red Thorn and said, “Red Thorn, it’s enough. You don’t have to show me your new ramet!”","Lin Yuan massaged his forehead.","If he knew in advance that Red Thorn could produce two types of ramet, he would have instructed Red Thorn to keep them hidden as secret weapons."]},{"number":1666,"title":"Chapter 1666 The Real Test Officially Begins!","paragraphs":["1666 The Real Test Officially Begins!","Red Thorn could have used other methods to enable the seas of flowers to take on the insect tide besides producing the spore cavities.","It could have used the Eyes of Relinquish to continuously produce more brutal vine ramets to cover the territory.","Many bodies of abyss demons and alien insects were buried within the sand. The sea of flowers could consume the flesh to replenish the Eyes of Relinquish.","Lin Yuan had limited the size of the sea of flowers so as not to affect the test.","However, the sea of flowers could expand rapidly if it was needed.","Moreover, the Platinum/Fantasy V Red Thorn could easily produce Platinum ramets.","If Red Thorn changed all the brutal vine ramets at the front to Platinum grade, no alien beast tide will be able to do damage to the brutal vine ramets.","Although Lin Yuan was very curious about the fourth type of ramet that Red Thorn had claimed could quickly eat up all the alien beasts, he would not instruct Red Thorn to reveal it.","All that Lin Yuan was doing was regulating the test and ensuring that it proceeded according to its original setting.","Lin Yuan was doing what a cultivator should be doing.","If Red Thorn consumed the entire alien beast tide, there would be nothing to test the contestants at the central territory.","Red Thorn pouted when Lin Yuan told it not to display the fourth type of ramet.","It did not know another way besides showing off its fourth ramet that would earn it more praise.","Given that Lin Yuan had contracted Red Thorn with blood, Red Thorn’s bloodline was tightly bound with Lin Yuan’s.","Hence, Lin Yuan immediately sensed what Lin Yuan was thinking.","He reached out his hand and gently stroked Red Thorn’s long green hair as he said, “Red Thorn, you’re amazing! If not for you, the contestants would not have made it!”","Red Thorn’s lips turned up into a smile.","Even if it did not reveal its fourth ramet, it would be happy as long as it received praise from Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan also started to self-reflect.","All he had been doing was silently evolving his feys. But after they evolved, they rarely had the chance to fight.","As such, Lin Yuan did not understand his feys’ powers well.","Lin Yuan had no idea when Red Thorn obtained the third and fourth types of ramets.","The third ramet was an external digestion cavity, and each one could send digestive acids to nearby brutal vine ramets to raise their digestion abilities, thereby raising the sea of flowers’ combat power and endurance.","Lin Yuan suddenly remembered that he had chosen consumption and digestion when Red Thorn asked him to choose a direction to evolve in.","It was likely that Red Thorn obtained the third ramet at that time.","Lin Yuan thought, I’m really failing as a spirit qi professional!","Lin Yuan had been doing Creation Master work in the Spirit Lock spatial zone in order to accumulate resources.","He rarely had the opportunity to go out and train like other spirit qi professionals did.","The best way to understand his feys’ powers and increase their combat teamwork would be to train in the wild.","Although spirit qi professionals could also increase their combat abilities and fey compatibility by matching up with strong opponents on Star Web, this would not be an effective method for Lin Yuan.","It was very difficult for Lin Yuan to meet an enemy of comparable power to him.","When he fought against Lu Shuang, her feys had been countered, so Lin Yuan defeated her using just Genius’ Spiritual Energy Expansion.","Lin Yuan’s biggest problem at the moment was that he did not understand his own power.","He had never pulled out all the stops in a fight.","Even when he fought against Zong Ze at the Guard Ye Banquet, he had not used the Source Sand, Red Thorn, or Chimey so that he could protect his identity as Black.","Once the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection ended and he had the chance to fight against the Freedom Federation envoy group, Lin Yuan felt that he would have the opportunity to unleash his true strength.","Two days ago, Lin Yuan had instructed the Medusa Snake Demons to work with the Spirit Craftsmen, and they built a cat sanctuary overnight in the marsh world.","There were already more than 1,000 cat-species feys living at the cat sanctuary.","The 100 Hundred Questions Beasts started to nurture the cat-species feys.","They had even utilized spirit fluids that had been stored up.","Lin Yuan really wanted to test out Genius’ combat power.","Since Lin Yuan had limited the sea of flowers, there would be a group of alien beasts that inevitably made it to the central territory.","The contestants had rebuilt the defenses and filled with drive once more.","They instructed their feys to use their abilities against the insect tide.","The Rotting Wood Horned Adder spat out a pool of venom, which sunk into the sand.","When any alien insects or abyss demons stepped into this pool, they would start to decay.","A large seven-meter-long crocodile spat out knives that sailed toward the abyss demons.","The sea of flowers had pushed the alien beasts together, and they immediately started to fight.","Normally, the alien beasts and abyss demons would have struggled to escape the sea of flowers, and only one type of alien beast would be left.","After all, they would immediately start to fight when they encountered each other.","The alien insects and abyss beasts were attacking the contestants because they saw the contestants as food.","But at the same time, they were also sources of food for each other.","The chaos between the alien insects and abyss beasts relieved some of the pressure on the contestants.","By working together and with help from the healing-type spirit qi professionals and support-type spirit qi professionals, the contestants did not have to do anything, and the territory remained secure.","As a result, many contestants let out a breath of relief.","However, Lin Yuan and Gao Feng knew that the true test that the royalty had planned was about to officially begin."]},{"number":1667,"title":"Chapter 1667 Righteousness Descended!","paragraphs":["1667 Righteousness Descended!","The people in the central territory were the first ones to submit to Li Nao and agree to become his subordinates.","There were two extreme behaviors that the people in this group were now exhibiting.","One side of the spectrum saw themselves as the true leaders of the 20,000 people on this team.","They could live in a carefree manner in the central territory. Some of them even took out the food they had brought with them and ate while they enjoyed a game of chess. They did not care that contestants still fought for their lives at the outermost layers of the territory.","The other side of the spectrum rushed to the outermost layer in their spare time and fought bravely against the alien beasts.","Li Nao belonged to the latter group.","He led two support-type spirit qi professionals and two healing-type spirit qi professionals with him to reinforce the weaker areas of the outermost layers.","He ordered the Platinum IV/Fantasy II Folded Wings Purple Wolf to attack the Class 4 abyss demons and alien insects hidden in the alien beast tide with electricity.","It was difficult for the normal contestants to take on the Class 4 alien insects and abyss demons.","However, it was easy for Li Nao because the Folded Wings Purple Wolf was of a higher grade than the alien beasts.","Gao Feng sighed and said, “The people playing chess at the central territory might be geniuses, but they don’t have what it takes to be City Guards, much less Spirit Guards.”","Lin Yuan nodded.","From the moment the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection began, many contestants who had been anxious to form groups had already been taken out.","The actions of these elites were all plastered on Star Web. This included the scene at the central territory where some of the contestants were playing chess.","These contestants were clearly at an advantage but had lost the people’s hearts as well as many opportunities because this was not only the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection but also an interview that was taking place in front of the entire Radiance Federation.","There had to be many veteran and top factions who had their eyes on these contestants to try and find the most outstanding ones who they would recruit into their factions to nurture them.","No matter how powerful a person was, they would put others off if they did not have a sense of teamwork and turned selfish at key moments.","Li Nao was doing well.","This incident had drummed up significant discussions on Star Web.","Mr. Money: I have no idea what the people playing chess in the central territory are thinking. Do they not care about the survival of their comrades just because they’re safe at the center?","This Car Doesn’t Go to Kindergarten: Why do I feel so uncomfortable after seeing that scene? Isn’t Black the one to thank for the test becoming so easy? I think Black should get rid of the sea of flowers to let the alien insects in and see if those people still have the arrogance to play chess then!","Guest in Life: Don’t tell me that these people will become members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence. I won’t have it! They don’t deserve to sully the Radiance Hundred Sequence!","Lonely Traveler: I bet that this test isn’t as easy as it seems. The members of royalty probably have more prepared!","Time passed very quickly.","41 hours had already passed since the Radiance Hundred Sequence began.","After one more dimensional rift opened, only one more day of fighting would be left.","Then, the place would start to shrink, and the alien beast tide would become stronger.","The number of people would fall until only ten contestants were left.","At that moment, a dimensional rift opened right above the central territory.","Without giving anyone below any time to react, numerous abyss demons tumbled out onto the contestants from above.","The contestants who had let their guard down were all obliterated by the rain of alien beasts.","Many of these eliminated contestants had not even had the time to summon their feys.","This incident was astonishing to all of the contestants and the audience.","The contestants were very aware of everything that happened within the territory because every small area had a designated scout in charge of delivering information back and forth.","The scouts were filled with anger when they saw the chess-playing contestants at the central territory.","If not for the fact that the troops were already stretched so thin that losing a single member would result in a hole in the defenses, the contestants at the outermost layers would have marched to the central territory and taught the chess-playing contestants a good lesson.","The pinnacle Class 2 abyss dimensional rift had opened too abruptly above the central territory.","All of the contestants were nervous, but the contestants at the outermost layers felt slightly more relaxed.","The wave of abyss demons from the pinnacle Class 2 abyss dimensional rift was like righteousness falling from the sky.","However, the battle formation that used to only require the contestants at the outermost layers to fight now turned into a fight from the inside-out.","They now went through their troops at twice the original speed.","Li Nao gnashed his teeth and came to a decision.","He declared, “Row 35 to 50, turn back! Work together to attack the newly opened pinnacle Class 2 abyss demon dimensional rift and provide cover for the outer layers. For the rows beyond row 50, close in and try to concentrate the defenses. Set up a basic defense beyond row 50, and I’ll immediately send support-type spirit qi professionals and healing-type spirit qi professionals to help you!”","Li Nao spoke with anxiousness and shock in his heart.","He was anxious because there were insufficient spirit qi professionals to go around now that the amount of fighting had increased.","He was shocked that the royalty had already guessed how the test would unfold. There was no way that the dimensional rift opened above the central territory by coincidence.","Lin Yuan decided to keep the status quo and not send any more help to the contestants.","Once the three days were over, only about 4,000 people would be left.","Lin Yuan did not know how quickly the testing ground would start to shrink once the three days were up.","But with Red Thorn around, it could manage the situation and take the pressure off of the contestants no matter how small the testing ground shrunk to.","However, the deal that Li Nao made with his subordinates would come to an end on the third day.","At that time, the fight of human nature would officially begin.","Time passed like the blink of an eye and the third day arrived."]},{"number":1668,"title":"Chapter 1668 Prompt and Resolute Decision!","paragraphs":["1668 Prompt and Resolute Decision!","At that moment, the audience members on Star Web were all holding their breaths.","Most of them had started out spectating the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection out of interest and switched between their favorite contestants.","But once the first dimensional rift opened three hours later and Black sent the sand castle into the air, the audience members were all shocked to the core by Lin Yuan’s ability to change geography.","More and more of them started paying attention to Black.","As the number of contestants gathered at the center increased and the defenses were constructed, the audience was excited to switch between the perspective views of the contestants at the center to watch them fight against the alien beast tide.","But when the fight really began, Ji Changdeng and Liu Wencheng’s misjudgment caused the contestants to struggle to the point that they found it difficult to draw breath.","At that moment, Black changed the geography outside of the central territory into a sea of moving sand.","The sea of sand had enveloped all the alien insects and abyss beasts in an instant, halting the alien beast tide.","This gave the contestants at the center a chance to stage a comeback.","The eight seas of flowers had also appeared in the sea of sand.","Finally, the audience members got to see Black utilize a second fey.","Black’s two feys used breathtaking methods.","Every member of the audience was so stunned that they did not know what to do with themselves.","Although they knew that there were thousands of contestants in the central territory who were doing their best to construct the base, this did not come close to the excitement of watching the seas of flowers fight against the alien beast tide.","After watching the sea of flowers battling the alien beast wave, the battle between the few alien beasts that made it through the sea of flowers to take on the contestants seemed rather dull by comparison.","However, the pinnacle Class 2 abyss dimensional rift that opened above the central territory made everything interesting again.","After the pinnacle Class 2 abyss dimensional rift did its job of delivering justice, it turned into a headache for the remaining contestants.","Some contestants had been reassigned to help the center of the base, and the number of experts there had increased to almost 26,000.","However, the number of contestants fighting the alien beasts that were trying to fight their way in from the outer layers had dropped by half.","Presently, only around 12,000 contestants were left.","Besides the healing-type and support-type spirit qi professionals who had been protected, almost every other contestant’s feys were injured.","Wounds also decorated the spirit qi professionals themselves.","But this did not mean that the healing-type and support-type spirit qi professionals were having a good time.","In fact, they were in worse shape because they were completely emptied of spiritual energy,","They were so weak that they could no longer stand properly. Yet, they still insisted on healing the other experts’ near-dead feys.","Although only 1,0000 experts were left, they were much more experienced than when they started out.","Wilderness survival could raise a person’s various abilities.","Objectively, the over 50 people who first joined Li Nao were not of equal strength. They only enjoyed authority within the central territory because they were the first to join Li Nao’s team.","But now, less than 20 of those 50 people were left.","This meant that this test was not a favorable environment for luck.","Normally, those in the central territory should be leading their team to provide reinforcements to the frontline, just like what Li Nao was doing.","If they lost their might, they would not be able to make it to one of the final ten contestants.","A person’s strength did not just come from their power but also their ability to communicate, adapt, and be resilient, among other traits.","When one was trying to survive in the wild, it was a test of whether they were truly strong.","There were a few people who had been unable to join a group at the beginning but had gained many protectors now because of the authority that Li Nao afforded them.","These people were able to distinguish themselves because they had exceptional leadership qualities.","However, the more capable one was, the more responsibility one would have to shoulder.","These people had gained a significant amount of authority but also had to offer a lot more than others.","The Folded Wings Purple Wolf had been attacked by a group of Smooth Flying Jumping Demons, and there were now many large holes in its wings.","The Smooth Flying Jumping Demon was one of the rare Class 3 abyss demons that used venom.","The venom hidden within the Smooth Flying Jumping Demon’s nails and teeth could produce strong hallucinogens that turned its target violent.","The Platinum IV/Fantasy II Folded Wings Purple Wolf had been a force to be reckoned with as it used bolts of electricity to launch long-range attacks at the flying abyss demons and alien insects.","However, the Folded Wings Purple Wolf had fallen under the influence of the Smooth Flying Jumping Demon’s venom and had escaped Li Nao’s control.","It started to wildly launch bolts of lightning in all directions.","It killed all the contestants in a 500-meter-radius and resulted in many teams losing close to 1,000 members.","Hence, while the Folded Wings Purple Wolf was struggling to break out of the control of the Smooth Flying Jumping Demon, Li Nao had no choice but to use his other main fey, the Rotten Spotted Sky Dog, to bite the Folded Wings Purple Wolf to death.","Luckily, the fight was taking place on Star Web.","He might not be able to make the same decision if this battle was taking place in reality.","He used to be a Radiance Hundred Sequence member and had his fair share of survival training.","As such, he would eventually still make the same decision if this was reality. He could not allow 1,000 people to die in place of his fey.","As a leader, he had to do what needed to be done even if the Folded Wings Purple Wolf’s death would cause his power to plummet.","At that moment, most people’s eyes were on Li Nao.","The Folded Wings Purple Wolf’s death allowed all of them to realize that this was war.","Although all of them were elites, they were reduced to sorry states when they were fighting a Class 2 dimensional rift.","The audience members started to wonder how the City Guards and Spirit Guards, who fought Class 3 and 4 dimensional rifts during the dimensional rift active period managed to handle it.","Many regular people were completely saved from feeling any effects of the dimensional rift active period when it was happening."]},{"number":1669,"title":"Chapter 1669 Pretty Good Couple!","paragraphs":["1669 Pretty Good Couple!","While such thoughts filled the minds of the audience, the gears in Lin Yuan’s head also started turning as he watched everything from above in the sand castle.","The night before the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection, Lin Yuan had communicated with Su Yiren.","Although Lin Yuan had not recently visited the Divine Wood Federation so he could prepare for the Radiance Hundred Sequence, he still communicated with Su Yiren every few days.","From their communications, Lin Yuan discovered that a major change had occurred within the Great Lush Federation.","The secret elite families of the Great Lush Federation had started ordering their merchant groups to stop selling and accumulating goods simultaneously but to stock up on as many goods as what was available on the market.","Within a few weeks, the atmosphere in the Divine Wood Federation had become much more solemn because of the change in the Great Lush Federation.","Su Yiren’s guess was that the Great Lush Federation was preparing for war.","Lin Yuan had not felt anything special when he first heard this.","But now, he felt that he needed to start preparing.","At the same time, he thought that even though the resources he possessed were considered immense in the context of a private faction, they were far from being sufficient for a federation or continent.","As such, a sense of urgency rose within Lin Yuan.","He noticed more than once that Gao Feng wanted to help but eventually held himself back.","Lin Yuan said, “Gao Feng, you can go and help if you want to. Many people saw your feys during the Guard Ye Banquet, so they’re not secrets. The Freedom Federation has definitely already obtained information about you.","“Your biggest chip lies with your sacred source lifeform and the Yellow Spring Lily’s new ability. The Breeze Hibiscus and Spirit Spring Lilies’ main abilities lie in healing the spiritual power of others. You can use these abilities if you want.”","Given that Gao Feng was from a top faction and Cicada Song’s disciple, he would attract a lot of negative attention if he stayed in the sand castle the entire test and became a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence without participating in the test.","This was the perfect chance for Gao Feng to exhibit his support capabilities.","Gao Feng shot Lin Yuan a grateful look.","This was not just because Lin Yuan had been protecting him since the start of the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection but more so because Lin Yuan truly had his best interests at heart.","Since Lin Yuan could attach the wings made of Day and Night Spirit Silver to his back and use them to fly, he could enable someone else to do the same.","However, this would require Lin Yuan to inject spiritual power into the Day and Night Spirit Silver in order to turn it white.","Gao Feng watched with shock as many black and gold feathers appeared from the sand castle.","These feathers turned white and arranged themselves into large white wings on his back.","Soon, the wings started flapping in spite of Gao Feng’s inaction.","The layers of thin feathers that interlinked with each other flew up into the air, taking Gao Feng with them.","From the moment Gao Feng stepped out of the sand castle, he immediately became the target of all the Class 4 abyss demons and alien insects.","But the white wings blocked all of the attacks.","If any alien insects or abyss demons drew close to the white wings, a few feathers would fall. This would be a beautiful sight filled with deadly intent.","Every feather was like a dagger that pierced through the alien insects and abyss demons’ bodies.","Gao Feng was already dressed in white. As such, he seemed like an angel at the moment.","He landed steadily beside Li Nao, and the white feathers on his back immediately wilted and turned back into sand granules when they touched the ground.","At that moment, all the contestants near Gao Feng and the audience on Star Web realized that the white wings had come from the sand-elemental source-type lifeform.","But why had Black’s wings been black but turned white when they were on Gao Feng?","Black and white came hand in hand since the dawn of time.","There were many people posting comments on Star Web.","Gao Feng was not the ripest source of analysis among all the contestants because he had been chosen by Black to enter the sand castle.","This seemed to suggest that there was more going on behind the scenes.","The recent events resulted in there being many posts on Star Web discussing links between Black and Gao Feng.","Black and Gao Feng were quickly paired together.","The central territory was in the greatest danger at the moment.","Everyone was wondering why Gao Feng was going there during such a circumstance. Could he have been kicked out by Black?","It would be easier to accept the fact that Gao Feng had been kicked out of the sand castle by Black. But why had Black also given Gao Feng a set of wings?","Was it because Black was just a gentle and compassionate person? Was it because he took their previous ties into consideration?","If so, the seemingly cool and high-and-mighty Black was too adorable!","Gao Feng did not have many fans on Star Web, but Black did.","Black’s obsessive fans went insane when they saw Black being paired up with Gao Feng.","What! My son hasn’t even grown yet. Why are you all pairing him up?","Usually, the two parties of fans would have started fighting. But somehow, Black’s fans felt that this couple seemed pretty good.","Gao Feng was rather impressive!","When Gao Feng arrived, he said to Li Nao, “Send all the healing-type spirit qi professionals and support-type spirit qi professionals to me now!”","If anyone else had tried giving him orders right after arriving, Li Nao would have ignored them.","However, Gao Feng had come out from the sand castle.","The sand castle was the contestants’ biggest shield at the moment. It was like an entity that was set up to help them.","If not for that sea of moving sand and the seas of flowers, all the contestants would already have been wiped out.","Gao Feng had to have his reasons for giving such an order.","However, Li Nao had just decided to kill the Folded Wings Purple Wolf, and his emotional state was in pieces.","He needed some time to recover before climbing back to his feet and getting back into action.","Hence, he just nodded at the remaining 97 managers.","The 97 managers looked at Gao Feng before calling over some of the healing-type and support-type spirit qi professionals.","At that moment, two white flowers suddenly bloomed."]},{"number":1670,"title":"Chapter 1670 Doubts Vanished!","paragraphs":["1670 Doubts Vanished!","The 97 managers were annoyed when Gao Feng arrived and gave Li Nao the instruction.","What? Call over all the support-type and healing-type spirit qi professionals?","At that moment, all the power offense-type spirit qi professionals who had been fighting the alien beast tide were covered with injuries and completely drained of spiritual power.","They depended on the support-type spirit qi professionals to restrict the alien beast tide while aiding them at the same time.","The healing-type spirit qi professionals disregarded their drained spiritual power and continued to use their abilities.","The support-type and healing-type spirit qi professionals were the most important pillars holding up the remaining contestants.","The power offense-type spirit qi professionals would crumble if they were all gathered now.","Not only would the number of troops fall, but the lack of aid would also cause the power offense-type and defense-type spirit qi professionals would lose their confidence.","However, Li Nao had nodded.","Moreover, Gao Feng was still the Young Master of a top faction. He would not harm a large group in front of the entire Star Web.","Thus, the managers agreed to call the support-type and healing-type spirit qi professionals over.","Meanwhile, Gao Feng’s actions had caused another wave of activity to rise on Star Web.","Too Scared to Live or Die: What’s going on? That contestant who just left the sand castle took control the moment he arrived. Is he trying to publicly snatch the authority away from Li Nao?","Passing Guest: I can’t help but think that gathering the support-type and healing-type spirit qi professionals will be the death of the power offense-type spirit qi professionals. After fighting for so long, they have long run out of spirit qi and are only barely holding on. If things change now, won’t it cause the situation to devolve rapidly?","I Know Sour and Sweet: I think Gao Feng has reasons for gathering support-type and healing-type spirit qi professionals. He was safe in the sand castle and under Black’s wing. Why would he put himself in danger out of the blue?","Memory in the Wind: As someone who has insider information, I can’t be bothered to say much. Just keep your eyes peeled and watch what it means to be a true top young expert!","Memory in the Wind was a famous personality on Star Web. He did not have legions of fans because he was powerful or had very interesting live streams.","In fact, he had never hosted a live stream. All he did was share his life on a personal forum he had set up.","As a young expert from a top faction, he usually ate dishes made from Platinum spiritual ingredients.","Moreover, he was a Class 3 Creation Master and shared tips on concocting spirit fluids.","As a result, he became the ideal man in the hearts of many young girls.","Very few members of top factions shared so much on Star Web.","Memory in the Wind’s comment in Lu Shuang’s live-streaming room immediately attracted the attention of many audience members.","What did he mean by what it meant to be a true top young expert?","Everyone agreed that Black had the power of a top young expert. There were even a few people who felt that he was stronger than disciples of royalty.","However, Memory in the Wind’s comment was clearly directed at Gao Feng, not Black.","Could it be that Gao Feng, despite having relied on others, had the power of the Radiance Federation’s top young experts? What a joke!","Gao Feng had already made his move. All he did was summon a flower-species fey that kicked up a gust of wind that blew a contestant away.","His attack had been so ordinary that it seemed that the most he would be able to do was keep some flying abyss demons and alien insects at bay.","He would not be more useful in a team than Li Nao was.","But before the Star Web users could ruminate further, two white flowers bloomed in front of Gao Feng.","The flowers did not immediately use their abilities after blooming.","They planted their roots firmly into the ground and continued to sprout. Then, it grew seven or eight more branches.","There was a large lily on each of the branches.","Soon, fountains of water burst out of the lilies. The fountains of water were shaped like dragons as they shot into the sky and clashed against each other.","Each time the fountains of water crashed together, clouds were produced.","As more and more clouds were formed, the sky slowly turned bluish-gray, and the entire sky started to darken.","While the contestants and audience were trying to figure out what these two clearly special flower-species feys were exactly, Gao Feng shouted, “Spirit Spring Lily! Spirit Spring Rain Call! Rush of Spirit Replenishing Rain!”","Soon, droplets of rain descended down on the support-type and healing-type spirit qi professionals, drenching them completely.","In the past, these people would be extremely displeased if they were drenched to this degree.","Moreover, there were many female contestants.","The contestants had already been fighting fiercely for three days. They were all exhausted and in a dazed state.","Having rain dumped over them perked them up significantly.","As these spirit qi professionals waited for Gao Feng to give further instructions, the support-type and healing-type spirit qi professionals realized that their empty tanks of spiritual power were being refilled.","Even their feys’ spiritual power had also been replenished.","The rate at which their spiritual power was being replenished was astonishing!","Every contestant’s spiritual power was fully recovered in less than two minutes.","After replenishing the spirit qi of the over 300 contestants, Gao Feng said, “All of you, go back to your original positions now and continue fighting! Since your teammates are protecting you, you should contribute too!”","At this moment, Li Nao was stupefied by what Gao Feng just did.","He replenished the spiritual power of over 300 people in an instant. What special support technique had he used?","The power that Gao Feng exhibited was beyond Li Nao’s understanding.","With such power, did he even need to participate in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection?","There were probably very few support-type Radiance Hundred Sequence members who were stronger than Gao Feng.","All the doubts that the audience had about Gao Feng promptly vanished!","All of them had an idea of what a hero was."]},{"number":1671,"title":"Chapter 1671 Beautiful Future!","paragraphs":["1671 Beautiful Future!","At that moment, Gao Feng fit all their ideals of what it meant to be a hero.","Power offense-type spirit qi professionals made up the largest proportion of the four types of spirit qi professionals. They also had the strongest combined power.","Defense-type spirit qi professionals were the best companions to healing-type spirit qi professionals.","Healing-type spirit qi professionals were absolutely necessary for a team.","Support-type spirit qi professionals were always seen as inferior as compared to the other three spirit qi occupations.","The main teams that participated in the S Tournament always contained combat-class, defense-type, and healing-type spirit qi professionals. Support-type spirit qi professionals were only part of the team if they were individually outstanding.","For example, the Dragon Gate Guild Club and Rhine Guild Club did not even have support-type spirit qi professionals as part of their reserve teams.","As such, the audience members who had watched the S Tournament and understood the dynamics of the spirit qi occupations instinctively saw support-type spirit qi professionals as useless.","But now, Gao Feng’s actions had enabled the audience to realize how important a powerful support-type spirit qi professional could be to a team.","While recovering the spiritual power of the 300-over contestants, he also replenished Li Nao’s spiritual power.","Thus, Li Nao was now looking at Gao Feng with gratitude.","After pausing for a moment, Li Nao stood up and thanked Gao Feng before riding off on the Rust Spotted Sky Dog to continue helping the various regions of the base fend off the flying Class 3 and 4 abyss demons and alien insects.","Li Nao’s actions shocked Gao Feng and the other 97 managers because it signified that Li Nao was handing the reins over to Gao Feng.","Li Nao came to this decision because he had weighed Gao Feng’s power against his own and knew that he would not be able to defeat him.","Gao Feng could recover the spiritual power of all spirit qi professionals in a certain area.","Even if Li Nao did not willingly hand over the authority to Gao Feng, the latter could easily steal the team away if he wanted to.","Additionally, Li Nao felt such a sense of responsibility for this team he had built that he could not stand by and watch as the flying Class 3 and 4 abyss demons and alien insects ceaselessly hurt the contestants at the outermost layers who were trying to protect their comrades.","Now, Gao Feng had everyone’s eyes on him.","Thus, not many people had noticed Li Nao’s actions or understood his intentions.","However, the members of royalty had started discussing Li Nao.","Liu Wencheng said approvingly, “Night Leaning Moon and Cicada Song, are either of you interested in nurturing Li Nao? If not, I don’t think it’s a bad idea to keep him at the Radiance Sacred Hall and make him the manager!”","“I think that it would be a waste of his abilities for him to just be the manager of the Radiance Sacred Hall. Although he doesn’t have much power now, he has nurtured his two feys well. He is affiliated with power offense-type dog-species feys and has many good options for his next fey. Moreover, after some more training, Li Nao definitely has what it takes to command a team of more than 10,000 members,” replied Night Leaning Moon.","Cicada Song said, “Li Nao is capable of keeping the big picture in mind. He can safeguard his own benefits while not losing sight of what needs to be done. Given his talents, he is worthy of becoming a City Lord’s apprentice. After the test ends, I will go and find out which city he comes from and instruct the City Lord of that city to take Li Nao under their wing.”","Cicada Song’s words indicated that he had chosen Li Nao.","But he did not choose to accept Li Nao as another disciple but intended to keep him under the wing of a City Lord who would nurture him.","Iron Prison had not said much up till now.","But as he continued to watch the contestants bravely fight the alien insects and abyss demons, he said, “Besides Li Nao, there are a few other contestants who are showing considerable potential and impressive character. However, I don’t think that they’ll make it into the final ten. I suggest getting the various City Lords to recruit these contestants and provide them with resources.”","Iron Prison looked at Cicada Song, who nodded back at him in agreement.","However, Night Leaning Moon did not share their sentiments.","“What? Iron Prison, do you think that my Spirit Guards are unworthy of nurturing these contestants? How many resources can the City Guards have? I can assign them to shadow Guard Envoys, who will properly train them. They will be able to grow even faster with the Spirit Guards!”","Iron Prison looked at Night Leaning Moon with frustration.","All I said was that it’s possible for the City Guards to nurture these contestants. I didn’t say that the Spirit Guards can’t. Why is she trying to rile me up?","Iron Prison was also about to say that the Sin Cleansing Pool needed several jailers, but he eventually decided against doing so.","The Sin Cleansing Pool was inferior to both the Spirit Guards and major cities.","After the 300 healing-type and support-type spirit qi professionals’ spiritual power was replenished, they returned to their original positions and unleashed a sea of spiritual power, saving the lives of almost 1,000 contestants and their feys.","This did not mean that the healing-type spirit qi professionals had fully healed the contestants because it would require too much spiritual power. It would be more efficient to keep ten people alive than to fully heal one person.","This was the best way to defend against the alien beast wave.","Only around 8,000 people were left, and they were all the true young elites of the Radiance Federation.","All of them knew that the longer the test dragged on, the more meaningful it would become.","This meaningfulness did not come from being able to join the Radiance Hundred Sequence but that two envoy groups from the Freedom Federation and Azure Federation were watching.","As the top young experts of the Radiance Federation, they had the duty of doing their absolute best so as to earn as much glory for the Radiance Federation and show the Azure Federation and Freedom Federation just how strong the Radiance Federation was.","At that moment, Gao Feng waved his hand, and all the audience members on Star Web were instantly shocked."]},{"number":1672,"title":"Chapter 1672 Mother Gao! Lily Dragon Spirit!","paragraphs":["1672 Mother Gao! Lily Dragon Spirit!","The dragon-shaped fountains that spewed out of the Spirit Spring Lilies turned into clouds in the sky that covered a 200-square-meter radius.","The fountains maintained the rain of spiritual power that descended from the clouds.","But now, the two Spirit Spring Lilies started swaying their branches and generated two whirlpools of spiritual power.","Soon, the flowers started trembling, and every movement led to nine dragon-shaped fountains spewing out.","The hundreds of dragon-shaped fountains flew and danced above Gao Feng’s head.","Previously, clouds were formed when the fountains crashed against each other. But now, they collided together until one of them broke and was promptly subsumed into the other fountain.","During this time, the clouds continued to expand, and the sky above Gao Feng now seemed like an even more intense battleground than the one that was taking place on the ground between the contestants and alien beasts.","One of the fountains gained the upper hand from early on and continued to gobble the other dragon-shaped fountains.","The form of this fountain also became clearer.","After the last dragon-shaped fountain was absorbed, white lilies formed on its surface.","By now, the clouds had expanded to almost 2,000 square meters, and this area was large enough to easily cover 1,000 contestants.","However, the situation was urgent. The power-offense spirit qi professionals who stood at the frontlines were covered with injuries as they continued struggling against the alien beasts.","Gao Feng could not call over the power offense-type and defense-type spirit qi professionals like he did with the healing-type and support-type spirit qi professionals.","He also did not want to do so.","Otherwise, he would not have expanded the clouds to such a large size.","When he saw that the Lily Dragon Spirit had been formed in the sky, he ordered, “Start from my anterior and release a shower of spiritual power rain. Spirit Spring Lilies, do all you can to recover our spiritual power!”","The two Spirit Spring Lilies’ flowers started to grow longer until they wrapped around Gao Feng.","The flowers covered Gao Feng’s waist, shoulders, and back and injected spiritual power into his body.","The 50-meter-long translucent dragon had an air of auspiciousness. The lilies blooming all over it enveloped the clouds, and rain started falling down on the contestants.","As the rain fell, the contestants realized that their spiritual power was restored to maximum capacity within two minutes. This went for their feys as well.","The contestants took advantage of the falling rain to use their spiritual power without constraint and wiped out as many alien beasts as possible.","Although there were two different types of alien beasts present, both of them shared the special characteristic of cannibalizing corpses of the same species.","The alien insects and abyss beasts were advancing continuously because they wanted to consume blood power to increase their powers.","Gao Feng wanted to replenish the spiritual power of every contestant at least once. However, he ended up shocked by what the contestants were doing.","He could understand the reason behind their actions, but it did not change the fact he was not a god.","Even with the Spirit Spring Lilies’ help to recover spiritual power, the supply was not unlimited.","It was already a stretch for him to recover the spiritual power of 8,000 people.","If all of these people started using their spiritual power without holding back, Gao Feng would have to replenish the spiritual power of 15,000 people at once using the rain.","He could not sustain this!","The Lily Dragon Spirit was creating rain in the direction that Gao Feng had instructed.","The contestants sensed the speed at which the dragon was moving and started pulling back the reins of their usage of spiritual power.","In less than ten minutes, the Lily Dragon Spirit started to become more transparent, and the droplets of rain thinned into threads.","Once the Lily Dragon Spirit fully disappeared, the rain clouds in the sky disappeared.","Gao Feng fell to the ground in an inelegant heap.","The two Spirit Spring Lilies hunched over listlessly next to him, clearly utterly drained of spiritual power.","However, they were feys that were skilled at gathering spirit qi from nature and did not need long before the flowers straightened themselves.","The Spirit Spring Lilies lit up next to Gao Feng and started to transfer spiritual power into his body.","After some of his spiritual power was recovered, Gao Feng waved his hand, and a large light green and white rose appeared in front of him.","After the rose appeared, the petals broke off and soon turned into a torrent.","Each petal landed accurately on a contestant and turned into an imprint on their body.","The light breeze produced by the imprint could form a thin protective barrier in front of the contestants.","The barrier was so thin that even an Elite abyss demon could break past it. It would only be effective in deflecting pebbles that were being thrown about by the wind.","However, the imprint’s true strength did not come from its defensive ability but that it could condense spirit qi from the air and inject it into the contestants.","This allowed the contestants to understand what thoughtful care on the battlefield was.","The power offense-type and defense-type spirit qi professionals had been running on empty tanks of spiritual power for at least a day.","They used as much as they could without the tank going fully dry.","There were times when they could have used their feys’ abilities to defend themselves but chose to use the feys’ bodies to take the damage instead because utilizing the abilities would take up more spiritual power.","After being in this environment for a prolonged time, the aided contestants almost turned to call Gao Feng “Mom”.","These contestants felt the same kindness from Gao Feng as they would from a mother.","The Breeze Hibiscus’ wind had cleansing effects.","After all the blood and grime were cleaned off them, the contestants felt exceptionally refreshed.","The audience on Star Web had only been praising Black and Li Nao and assumed that Gao Feng was only a supporting character."]},{"number":1673,"title":"Chapter 1673 Dare to Be the First!","paragraphs":["1673 Dare to Be the First!","Although they had already acknowledged Gao Feng, recovering the spiritual power of 300 people was far from creating a floating castle, using a sea of flowing sand to consume alien beasts, and creating eight seas of flowers like what Black did.","It also could not compare to efficiently leading 10,000 people to defend against an alien beast tide in a remarkable show of leadership like what Li Nao did.","But Gao Feng had just recovered the spiritual power of 300 healing-type and support-type spirit qi professionals, followed by replenishing the spiritual power of all the contestants within ten minutes.","Previously, the 8,000 people had seemed rather helpless in the face of the alien beast tide. It seemed as though they were going to succumb any moment.","But now, the contestants had gained the advantage. The power offense-type spirit qi professionals fighting at the frontline were even able to toss the alien beast corpses behind them as safety nets for their comrades behind them.","During the past two days, the mindsets of the contestants had been changing continuously.","At first, all of them wanted to fight to become one of the final ten.","But after fighting alongside the other contestants and getting to see their comrades’ merits, they realized their own flaws.","It could be said that every contestant was a genius in their own right.","After all, the Radiance Federation was enormous.","But now that they were working together, they could feel their comrades’ power much more clearly than if they were fighting against each other.","The contestants at the frontline had only managed to survive for so long because they depended on each other.","As a result, the contestants no longer saw each other as rivals but as comrades.","These feelings would not disappear once the test ended.","Even when they eventually returned to their own corner of the Radiance Federation, they would gather together often.","The contestants’ actions made the royalty smile.","It seemed that in spite of Ji Changdeng and Liu Wencheng’s mistakes, this restructure of the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection was a big success. The honor of the Radiance Federation was shining through the test!","The honor of the Radiance Federation was shining through the test, and the meaning behind it was being passed down on its own.","Night Leaning Moon said to Zuo Ming and You Zhe, “Record the names of the contestants who built defenses for their comrades and find out more about them. I’m planning on creating a new team among the Spirit Guards. Go and contact these contestants and provide them with the same resources that being members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence would have given them.”","Zuo Ming and You Zhe nodded. They knew that these young people had gained the acknowledgment of Night Leaning Moon.","The two of them felt that these young people were worthy of this acknowledgment.","At that moment, the Moon Empress said, “Leaning Moon, let Mystic Moon gather the information instead. It’s easier for him to collect information from Star Web than it is for others. This Radiance Hundred Sequence selection allowed us to see something even more eye-catching than power. I will provide resources myself to help you build this new team of Spirit Guards.”","The Moon Empress’ words stunned the other 12 members of royalty.","Normally, the Moon Empress addressed Night Leaning Moon as Chief Guard Ye. So why did she suddenly address her by her name like she used to do ten years ago?","Given that the Moon Empress had not talked about the Lifespan Mouse nor had she discussed her situation during the imperial meetings, the other members of royalty only knew that the Sacred Cry Moon Beast’s power had evolved past Eternal.","The Moon Empress’ own power had also reached a new level.","However, Night Leaning Moon had been staying by the Moon Empress’ side to protect her.","Hence, she knew more about the Moon Empress’ situation than the other members of royalty did.","She knew that the Moon Empress was providing her with resources to help her as a way of repaying her.","The Moon Empress wanted to repay her own favor but also wanted to repay Lin Yuan’s favor on his behalf.","However, the Moon Empress had no clue that Night Leaning Moon was the one who owed Lin Yuan a favor.","Lin Yuan had given her the feathers that contained night power and also 12 Firefly Demon Fetuses to Liu Jie. As a result, Liu Jie’s prospects were now boundless.","Essentially, Lin Yuan had built bridges for her and her legacy to cross over to brighter futures.","Thus, Night Leaning Moon was about to instinctively turn down the resources from the Moon Empress.","But before Night Leaning Moon could speak, the Moon Empress said, “I will not only provide Night Leaning Moon with resources. The rest of you can also come to me if you lack any Creation Master resources.”","The Moon Empress’ words momentarily dazed Night Leaning Moon and the other members of royalty.","The eyes of the elderly man seated on the center pillar lit up as he said, “Xiyue, do you mean to say that your Creation Master class has reached a higher level?”","The Moon Empress was not ostentatious. She did not like to let others know about her abilities.","But now, the Moon Empress was openly admitting to it.","“My Creation Master level has indeed been raised. I’m going to try and see if I can extract eternal power from the Eternal Heart. If it’s possible, I’m going to make concocting pure Eternal power the standard for becoming a Class 6 Creation Master.”","The Moon Empress’ words excited the other 12 members of royalty.","If the Moon Empress was willing to say such a thing, it meant that she was confident that she would be able to become a Class 6 Creation Master.","Chef Supreme and the Bamboo Monarch shared a look.","When the two of them became Class 5 Creation Masters, the Moon Empress was not even a Radiance Envoy yet.","But now, she was about to overtake them.","The Bamboo Monarch and Creation Master had not gained the opportunity to raise their Creation Master level, but the Moon Empress had.","It seemed that the Radiance Federation was no longer going to be under the protection of three Class 5 Creation Masters but two Class 5 Creation Masters and one Class 6 Creation Master.","Although every member of royalty was seemingly of equal standing, the Moon Empress would only be second to that elderly man.","The Moon Empress’ expression did not change in the slightest, even when she felt all their eyes on her.","Normally, the Moon Empress would not reveal the news that her Creation Master abilities had reached a higher level.","But after deep contemplation and consideration, the Moon Empress decided to take the daring step to do so!"]},{"number":1674,"title":"Chapter 1674 The Members of Royalty Known as ‘Gods’!","paragraphs":["1674 The Members of Royalty Known as ‘Gods’!","At that moment, the Moon Empress’ emotions were in a tangle.","A person who usually kept a low-profile needed courage in order to suddenly become showy.","There had never been a Class 6 Creation Master in the history of the world.","The Moon Empress felt that it was not because no Creation Master had ever reached this step.","Before she became the third Class 5 Creation Master of the Radiance Federation, there were already three Class 5 Creation Masters in the Azure Federation and four in the Freedom Federation. Moreover, they also had a Class 5 Creation Master legacy.","In the past, when there were only two Class 5 Creation Masters in the Radiance Federation, the concept of the three great federations had not taken shape.","Only after the Moon Empress became a Class 5 Creation Master and the Radiance Federation gained its third Class 5 Creation Master—the same number of Class 5 Creation Masters as the Azure Federation—did the concept of the three great federations emerge.","The Azure Federation was centered around its families, which was not the case in the Freedom Federation and Radiance Federation.","There was no royalty in the Azure Federation. The 12 heads of aristocratic families all had equal ownership over the Azure Federation.","With such a system, any other family that gained a Class 5 Creation Master besides the ones that already declared that they had one would definitely keep the news under wraps.","When it came to overall power, the Freedom Federation was slightly stronger than the Radiance Federation and Azure Federation because they had gained four 4 Class 5 Creation Masters early on.","Due to internal conflict over the last 150 years, two of their Class 5 Creation Masters lost their lives.","Thus, despite the Moon Empress’ power reaching another level, she still did not look down on the Freedom Federation.","Rather, she felt that given the yardsticks of the classes, it was not impossible for there to be a Class 6 Creation Master in the Freedom Federation.","If the Moon Empress announced her suggestion for the yardstick of a Class 6 Creation Master, she would eventually attract the attention of the entire world.","This would not benefit her in any way.","However, she was going to do this because it would significantly benefit the Radiance Federation.","The Radiance Federation and Freedom Federation were currently butting heads, and the Moon Empress needed to give the other members of royalty and the entire Radiance Federation an anchor.","If she tried to hide her abilities as a Class 6 Creation Master, she would not be able to provide the other members of royalty with Creation Master resources.","None of the other members of royalty were stupid. Once she exposed abilities beyond those of a Class 5 Creation Master, they would quickly pick on it.","At that time, news that she had become a Class 6 Creation Master would be exposed.","Rather than this, the Moon Empress preferred to announce the news herself.","The other members of royalty would only continue to be unaware of the fact that the Moon Empress had become a Class 6 Creation Master if she did not supply them with any Creation Master resources.","But given the state of chaos that the main world was currently in, the Moon Empress needed to step in to increase the power of the other members of royalty.","This was the only way she would secure the Radiance Federation amidst the mayhem of the main world.","On the other hand, Sky City was still developing, and Lin Yuan could supply the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, which not even the regular Class 5 Creation Masters could produce.","Lin Yuan was still growing. Although he could roll grades to attain emperor-class combat power, he was still just a B-rank spirit qi professional that possessed pinnacle Fantasy Breed feys.","A spirit qi professional could not be counted as a king-class spirit qi professional as long as they were not an A-rank spirit qi professional.","Thus, the Moon Empress would rather draw all the attention onto her rather than let Lin Yuan be on the receiving end.","Now, the Moon Empress would not be afraid even if she came face to face with the three members of royalty from the Freedom Federation known as ‘gods’.","Their might was centered on the fact that they had 11 Stars sacred source lifeforms.","10 Stars sacred source lifeforms could manipulate celestial phenomena, but 11 Stars sacred source lifeforms could channel celestial phenomena into an ability that they could utilize.","It was true that such ability was no different from the traditional definition of what gods could do.","Coincidentally, with Lin Yuan’s help, the Moon Empress was now worthy of being called a god as well.","However, she did not intend to change her title to Moon Goddess.","The Moon Empress defined what it meant to be a Class 6 Creation Master because she wanted the Radiance Federation to grab the opportunity first as well as protect her disciple.","These two duties led her to make a decision against her character.","Nonetheless, the Moon Empress planned only revealing her powers when necessary.","She nodded in acknowledgment amidst the other members of royalty’s congratulations.","At that moment, the Moon Empress could not help but remember the pure spirit qi that Lin Yuan had supplied her with.","The pure spirit qi had allowed the Moon Empress to unlock her birth horoscope and even take a step further.","It was this step that allowed the Moon Empress to understand something new about life and enabled her to raise her Creation Master level.","But when the Moon Empress tried to concoct spirit qi after raising her Creation Master level, she realized that she still could not concoct spirit qi as pure as the one that Lin Yuan gave her despite her best efforts.","Once one became a Class 5 Creation Master, there would be clear distinctions between each class. However, the classes were just yardsticks determined by people.","It was just like how the Moon Empress decided that being able to draw out eternal power from an Eternal Heart was the standard for becoming a Class 6 Creation Master.","If Creation Master classes were really carefully compared, it would end up as a comparison of who could concoct purer spirit qi.","This was because spirit qi was the basic ingredient that allowed feys to evolve and mutate.","The Moon Empress had assessed Lin Yuan’s Creation Master powers early on.","Although he was clearly her disciple, his Creation Master abilities had already surpassed hers.","Moreover, Lin Yuan had used a special technique to take control of the Class 5 Creation Master, Di Wanmi.","Although Di Wanmi was a new Class 5 Creation Master who could not concoct spirit qi as pure as what Chef Supreme and Bamboo Monarch could concoct, she could easily perform tasks like purifying willpower power out of Willpower Runes, law power out of Law Runes, world power out from World Crystals, and immortal power out from Immortal bodies.","Moreover, she could create instruments from the bodies of dead sacred source lifeforms."]},{"number":1675,"title":"Chapter 1675 Flying Sky Battle Cry","paragraphs":["1675 Flying Sky Battle Cry","The Moon Empress had thought about the Radiance Federation’s circumstance while she was locked away for a month.","At that moment, the Radiance Federation’s top Creation Master resources had been lacking considerably compared to the Freedom Federation.","Now, the Radiance Federation had one Class 6 Creation Master and two Class 5 Creation Masters in the spotlight while there was also Lin Yuan in the shadows.","The was the equivalent of another Class 6 Creation Master and Class 5 Creation Master.","The Moon Empress did not think Lin Yuan could produce such pure spirit qi by solely relying on his Creation Master abilities because there was no way he could have found the path to becoming a Class 5 Creation Master given his powers.","There was a direct correlation between Creation Master powers and a spirit qi professional’s powers.","But as long as Lin Yuan could concoct such pure spirit qi, he would be worthy of being counted as a Class 6 Creation Master.","After all, being able to concoct pure spirit qi was much more important than being able to extract eternal power from an Eternal Heart.","The Moon Empress had intentionally examined Coiling Dragon’s Valley, which had recently replaced Whale Ocean Commerce as one of the top three top factions in the Radiance Federation.","Coiling Dragon’s Valley had obtained numerous Law Crystals from Lin Yuan, which had helped the previous head of the family attain Immortal power.","By that time, Lin Yuan had already taken control of Di Wanmi.","But, he had already traded Law Crystals with Coiling Dragon’s Valley before that.","Moreover, the Miao family that Sky City had destroyed had also traded Law Crystals with Lin Yuan before.","The Moon Empress clearly remembered that she had never given Lin Yuan any Law Crystals.","After all, the Moon Empress had not expected Lin Yuan to grow so quickly to the point that he required Law Crystals.","But once she realized he was extraordinary, she blinked her eyes, and he already became strong enough to aid her.","Recently, he had even taken her to the marsh world to harvest its moon.","The Moon Empress felt that it was already difficult for her to help Lin Yuan grow.","However, she could still do her best to protect him and ensure that he was safe.","The other members of royalty had no idea what the Moon Empress was thinking.","All of them were smiling with genuine joy.","The elderly man seated on the center golden pillar let out a heavy sigh as he raised his hand to the sun to gaze at his wrinkled and live spot-covered hand.","He felt that he could finally relax.","The elderly man believed that as long as his body could hold out for another five years, so the Moon Empress had enough time to strengthen herself, she would be able to take his place to protect the Radiance Federation even if he died.","At that moment, the Mountain River Grain God Bells suddenly started to ring.","Ripples appeared above the barrier that the Mountain River Grain God Bells had created.","The faint silhouette of a figure could be seen standing above the barrier.","At that moment, bright bronze light lit up above the Mountain River Grain God Bells.","The phantom images of a man covered in the patterns of mountains and a girl covered in the patterns of rivers appeared on each side of the Mountain River Grain God Bells.","Both of them were holding mallets and wearing top hats.","They appeared like two palace musicians.","Soon, the two people raised the mallets and slammed them against the Mountain River Grain God Bells.","A deadly tune rang out.","The chime was grandly sonorous.","Every chime produced a celestial fairy holding an orchid.","The celestial fairies elegantly flew around the sky.","Their bodies were made from water, and the shrouds covering their bodies were covered with the patterns of mountains.","The orchids in their hands started to grow longer until the stems turned into swords and the leaves turned into ribbons.","The 36 celestial fairies seemed to be waiting for something.","At that moment, a dancer appeared in the middle of the 36 celestial fairies as though she was a sacrifice.","There were threads formed from mountain patterns and river patterns in her hands.","The threads wrapped around the 36 flying celestial fairies.","In an instant, the deadly auras of the celestial fairies fused together. It was as though they were going to go into battle formation and charge at the figures standing above the Mountain River Grain God Bells at any moment.","This was the deadly formation automatically generated by the Mountain River Grain God Bells. It was known as the Flying Sky Battle Cry.","Li Yang, who had left Star Web to wait for the Goddess of Mercy’s arrival, narrowed his eyes when he sensed this deadly aura.","It could not be denied that the Radiance Federation’s Secure Federation Treasures were powerful.","Li Yang glanced fearfully at the elderly man seated on the center golden pillar.","In the past, the elderly man had refined the seven Secure Federation Treasures despite his legs being crippled and his greatly weakened life force.","There was no question that the Secure Federation Treasures would be able to protect the Radiance Federation.","Although the Mountain River Grain God Bells’ attack was not as accurate as an attack from a celestial phenomenon, it was almost no different from one of the randomly aimed attacks from a celestial phenomenon.","Even he would have to exert some effort to receive this attack.","If someone of comparable power appeared at that moment to attack him, he would definitely be overcome.","When the Radiance Federation’s seven Secure Federation Treasures were utilized in conjunction with the Radiance Federation’s royalty, they could enable the members of royalty to defeat those who were of equal strength.","It was likely that the Mountain River Grain God Bells’ attack would easily be able to kill a pinnacle Creation Breed fey and even heavily injure feys using their Immortal bodies.","However, an attack of such a level was a far cry from the Goddess of Mercy’s ability.","The Goddess of Mercy would be able to easily defend against such an attack even if she did not activate her birth horoscope and spirit qi to protect herself.","At that moment, a purple and gold bamboo imprint appeared on the forehead of the generally silent Bamboo Monarch.","His eyes also turned yellow and purple.","The phantom image of a yellow and purple bamboo shot out from the ground into the sky, attacking the figures above the barrier alongside the celestial fairies.","A voice full of sympathy said, “I didn’t come to the Radiance Federation to start a fight. I only came to fetch the people from the Freedom Federation after the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.”","While she spoke, a gold and red slender fish tail extended down from above the barrier.","The tail was about the size of a regular person’s legs and was covered with cinnabar spots.","These cinnabar spots radiated mystical red light.","The seemingly soft tail crashed against the purple and gold bamboo."]},{"number":1676,"title":"Chapter 1676 Second Page Revival’s Terror!","paragraphs":["1676 Second Page Revival’s Terror!","The gold and red light from the fishtail overshadowed the purple light from the bamboo.","The fishtail and bamboo did not start a vicious battle like they were expected to do.","Instead, the fishtail calmly kept the purple and gold bamboo at bay. It was like a pair of hands holding onto a pair of chopsticks to prevent the chopsticks from moving forward.","The 36 sword-wielding celestial fairies were slashing away at the fishtail.","The red and gold light rippled along with the movement of the fishtail and rolled toward the celestial fairies.","A moment later, the celestial fairies were reduced to nothing more than patterns of mountains and rivers.","The fishtail not only held off Bamboo Monarch’s attack but also easily dealt with the Mountain River Grain God Bells’ attack that could have killed a Creation Breed fey.","At that moment, the merciful voice spoke again. “Bamboo Monarch, your attack is still at the same level it was a decade ago. There’s no way you haven’t improved since that time. It looks like the Radiance Federation still likes to hide everything. I have shown my sincerity by defending your attack and not retaliating.”","While she spoke, the fishtail swished, and the light crashed against the purple and gold bamboo phantom image.","The waves immediately shattered the gold and purple bamboo phantom image.","Meanwhile, the figure wielding the red and gold fishtail finally fully emerged.","She wore a long red shawl that was adorned with large pearls.","The beautiful girl had an exquisite figure, features, and ivory skin. Her gold and red hair cascaded past the fishtail that extended out from below her.","There were two red moles in the corner of her eye.","Besides her skin, everything else about the girl was red and gold.","However, there was a wisp of blue in her eyes.","Although the blue was very faint, it still overpowered the red and gold. It was as though this hint of blue was the most spirited part of her.","The 13 members of royalty’s expressions immediately turned stern when they saw the girl.","However, the biggest reaction came from the person standing right at the back of the Freedom Federation envoy group.","Although initially expressionless, a look of annoyance now appeared on this person’s face. But at the same time, terror spread across his face.","This person’s gaze fell on Li Yang, and the latter immediately picked up on it.","When he saw the roiling gray within the person’s eyes, Li Yang used his soul power to communicate with this person.","“Second Page Revival, the Goddess of Mercy’s arrival won’t affect our plan. You don’t have to worry too much about it!”","This person’s expression did not change. But the gray in his eyes intensified when he heard what Li Yang said.","“Li Yang, the person that the Goddess of Mercy hates the most in this world is me, followed by the Moon Empress. If she finds out I’m here, will she really let me be and allow me to move freely?”","Li Yang glanced at Qian Yu.","It had been decided during a meeting in the Freedom Palace that Li Yang would be the only member of royalty leading this envoy group.","Every member of royalty from the Freedom Federation managed their own faction and profits.","Li Yang had privately contacted and established a connection with Second Page Revival.","The other members of royalty from the Freedom Federation did not know about this.","However, the Goddess of Mercy favored Qian Yu, who privately contacted her. This led to her arrival.","Although Li Yang had found out about it from Qian Yu in advance, he had not been happy about it in the slightest.","Nonetheless, power was king in the Freedom Federation.","They might both be members of royalty, but they held very different levels of authority.","Li Yang did not have the power to change the Goddess of Mercy’s decision in front of her.","Li Yang could not give Second Page Revival a definite answer to her questions.","Ever since Li Yang arrived at the Radiance Federation and started interacting with Second Page Revival, he had been extremely displeased with her because Sixth Page Lashing still had yet to appear.","Li Yang had asked Second Page Revival more than once about the Black Mass Cup, but her answers were always ambiguous.","Eventually, her answers did sound more resolute.","This made Li Yang feel that she was unreliable.","Thus, he replied, “The Goddess of Mercy’s arrival will not affect our partnership. According to the contents of our partnership, you don’t have to reveal your identity to her. Even if she does notice you, I can just give her a share of the benefits. Rest assured that the Goddess of Mercy will not touch you before our partnership ends.”","If the Mountain River Grain God Bells had not already protected the entire Radiance Sacred Hall and the barrier did not require some time to be broken, Second Page Revival would have immediately hightailed it out of there.","She had not anticipated such a public situation.","Moreover, Second Page Revival still had not found Sixth Page Lashing.","The Goddess of Mercy had used the deep-sea mermaid’s blood to cleanse her body and obtain the bloodline in order to take that step forward.","As a result, the deep-sea mermaid race had almost gone extinct.","Because of this, the First Emperor Whale Clan lost its source of support.","Nonetheless, they still managed to stay ahead of the First Emperor Shark Clan and First Emperor Ray Clan.","But because she had used this method to take the mermaid bloodline by force, the Goddess of","Mercy had been cursed by the deep-sea mermaids.","In order to break the curse, she needed to purify the mermaid bloodline within her body to a certain level.","There were two ways to evolve the mermaid bloodline. The first method was to continuously cleanse one’s body with the fresh blood of regular mermaids. The second method was to gain the affection of the Mermaid Emperor Clan.","After the Goddess of Mercy learned that obtaining the Forbidden Imprint from mermaids could evolve one’s bloodline, she used the Freedom Federation’s power to search the lands and seas.","Eventually, her hard work paid off, and she finally found a group of mermaids living in the sea near the forbidden area.","These mermaids’ bloodlines had been extremely rare.","The Goddess of Mercy had wanted to capture and nurture them so that she would have a sustainable source of development.","However, Tower Canon’s plan had also required mermaid bloodline, and Second Page Revival had personally killed these mermaids, which were no different from treasures to the Goddess of Mercy, and brought their bloodlines back to Tower Canon.","This was the reason Tower Canon and the Freedom Federation’s originally close bond dissolved.","After that, Tower Canon informed the Goddess of Mercy that deep-sea mermaids were the descendants of a high-class dimensional lifeform."]},{"number":1677,"title":"Chapter 1677 The Moon Empress and Goddess of Mercy’s Confrontation!","paragraphs":["1677 The Moon Empress and Goddess of Mercy’s Confrontation!","This high-class dimensional lifeform could have accidentally entered the main world through a pinnacle Class 5 dimensional rift before leaving descendants with their rare bloodline in the depths of the sea.","At first, the Goddess of Mercy did not agree with this theory.","But when an expert from the Freedom Federation contracted the sacred source lifeform called the Moving Source Water, the Goddess of Mercy sensed an affiliation with the bloodline’s roots.","This was what eventually led her to believe Tower Canon.","The Goddess of Mercy had used resources to nurture this expert and even enabled him to become one of the Freedom Federation’s royalty.","Yet, the expert eventually died at the hands of the Moon Empress.","This was the reason the Moon Empress had overtaken Second Page Revival’s place as the Goddess of Mercy’s most hated person.","But this still meant that the Goddess of Mercy hated Second Page Revival.","Second Page Revival decided that she would only protect herself during the fight.","Even if all the young experts from the Freedom Federation envoy group died, she would not step in.","Second Page Revival did an estimation of time and realized that First Page Crimson’s four horsemen would be arriving soon.","As a result, she calmed down significantly.","The Bamboo Monarch replied coldly to the Goddess of Mercy, “It’s not a good habit to make oneself an uninvited guest. You also don’t have to worry about how capable we are.”","The Goddess of Mercy was unbothered by what the Bamboo Monarch said.","But when her gaze fell on the Moon Empress, her aura sharpened into ferocity, and malevolence filled her eyes.","“It’s been a long time, Moon Empress.”","The Moon Empress looked at the Goddess of Mercy and said, “Ten years indeed is long. Our power will probably increase even if we don’t do anything. But my guess is that you’re not having a great time being constantly stuck there.”","The Goddess of Mercy smiled bitterly. As long as the mermaid bloodline could not be evolved, her power would be stuck at its current level.","Thus, no matter how hard the Goddess of Mercy had worked over the last ten years, her power had not grown in the slightest.","The Moon Empress’ words were like salt that rubbed into the Goddess of Mercy’s open wound.","The Goddess of Mercy had only come to the Radiance Federation to take Qian Yu safely back. This was only because Qian Yu’s sacred source lifeform allowed the Goddess of Mercy to see the light at the end of the tunnel.","Otherwise, she would not have bothered with choosing an expert and nurturing him.","But when she heard what the Moon Empress said, the Goddess of Mercy exploded.","“Moon Empress, it’s true that my power hasn’t increased in the past ten years. But so what? You are only left with a few years in your lifespan. You’re either struggling fruitlessly or already on your last legs!","“If your power hasn’t improved since a decade ago, the Radiance Federation will probably lose a member of royalty and a Class 5 Creation Master in three or four years’ time. The Radiance Federation will be in the same situation it was in a few decades ago, having one fewer Class 5 Creation Masters than the Azure Federation.","“At that time, the membership of the three great federations will be reshuffled. I heard that the Sand Island Continent just obtained its second Class 5 Creation Master. I wonder if the Radiance Federation will be able to remain a part of the three great federations in that not-so-distant future?”","The members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence were seated atop the silver pillars, and contestants who had already been eliminated were watching this confrontation unfold.","The Moon Empress knew that the Goddess of Mercy wanted to use her to belittle the Radiance Federation and deliver a blow to the Radiance Federation’s spirits.","Hence, the Moon Empress did not waste time speaking.","She pointed at the Goddess of Mercy, and a moonbeam chain shot out toward the Goddess of Mercy.","At first, the Goddess of Mercy seemed unbothered. But when she saw the faint light covering the moonbeam chain, her expression turned solemn.","The dark red spots on the fishtail started to grow larger until the gold and red fishtail turned fully red.","The Goddess of Mercy flew in a circle in the air, and the fishtail slammed against the moonbeam chain.","At that moment, there was also faint light on the Goddess of Mercy’s tail.","When the two entities crashed against each other, the Goddess of Mercy looked at the Moon Empress in shock and said, “Interesting! You managed to resolve your lifespan peril! There isn’t any treasure on earth that can significantly increase lifespans. Your power must have reached another level. But even if you trigger your birth horoscope, you’ll only be able to reach that level.”","The Goddess of Mercy’s expression was no longer as haughty as it had been.","Besides that elderly man, the Radiance Federation now had another genuine top expert.","The Goddess of Mercy was confident that she would be able to retreat safely if only the elderly man was present. But now, the Moon Empress had joined the party.","Even if the Goddess of Mercy managed to escape, she would be able to take Qian Yu with her.","It was not an exaggeration to say that Qian Yu was the Goddess of Mercy’s heart. If he died, she would lose all hope. Thus, the Goddess of Mercy did not say anything else.","With a flash, she reappeared next to Li Yang.","The Moon Empress shared a look with Night Leaning Moon.","The two of them initially intended to do all they could to keep the people from Tower Canon in the Radiance Federation.","The Moon Empress made this decision because she had increased her power.","But now that the Goddess of Mercy had arrived, the Moon Empress had no choice but to reassess her plan.","She was not afraid of the Goddess of Mercy because Lin Yuan had helped her to take a step further after awakening her birth horoscope.","The Moon Empress was confident that she would be able to perfectly protect the Radiance Federation even if an expert with Eternal power arrived on Radiance Federation soil.","However, if the Goddess of Mercy attacked with her full power, the Radiance Federation would be utterly ravaged, and many regular people would be dragged in.","The responsibility of a member of royalty was to safeguard the Radiance Federation.","Technically, every federation in the world should be of equal standing.","However, there were always top experts within federations, and these top experts acted as the best deterrents and means of protection for the federations.","For example, because of the Startling Lines Continent’s lack of such top experts and Class 5 Creation Masters, they existed in constant turmoil despite being rich in resources.","The Freedom Federation and Radiance Federation had never gotten along, but neither of them had attacked the other.","This was the reason why.","No matter which side attacked first, they could not be certain of their victory.","The Goddess of Mercy’s arrival forced the Moon Empress to reconfigure her original plan.","However, she did not know which two pages of Tower Canon had come.","The Goddess of Mercy was the main reason the Freedom Federation and Tower Canon had never managed to become truly close.","At least four of Tower Canon’s current Eight Pages detested her and had fought against her.","Initially, the Moon Empress had not planned on touching the Freedom Federation envoy group.","As such, the Goddess of Mercy’s arrival might not be a bad development."]},{"number":1678,"title":"Chapter 1678 Support Has Been Propped Up High!","paragraphs":["1678 Support Has Been Propped Up High!","The relationship between the Freedom Federation and Tower Canon had always been vague. In fact, this went for the relationships between the Freedom Federation and most of the factions in the world.","Yet, at the same time, there was enmity between them.","These confusing relationships arose because of the personal vendettas of the Freedom Federation’s members of royalty.","Every member of royalty could become close to a faction for the sake of their own merits. However, the relationship only involved themselves and not the entire Freedom Federation.","For example, while the Goddess of Mercy had a grudge against Tower Canon, the two other members of the Freedom Federation’s royalty, who were known as gods, and Li Yang enjoyed close ties with Tower Canon.","The Heavenly Family Cottage had provided the information that two Pages of Tower Canon would be coming to the Radiance Federation.","Given that the Moon Empress and Lin Yuan had done the Heavenly Family Cottage such big favors, it was impossible that the information they provided was fake.","Experts who came to be known as ‘gods’ had already reached that level.","Experts at that level, especially those from the Freedom Federation, would not sacrifice themselves for the sake of someone else’s benefits.","Hence, it was unlikely that the Goddess of Mercy knew that two of Tower Canon’s Pages had arrived in the Radiance Federation.","If the two Pages of Tower Canon wanted to find allies during their time in the Radiance Federation, Li Yang would be the best option.","The Moon Empress intended to keep a close watch and her guard up when it came to Li Yang.","She could not relax around the Goddess of Mercy either because there was no telling what other scheme she might have planned.","By now, three days had passed, and the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection was entering its tail end.","The testing ground was rapidly shrinking.","The last day of fighting had not brought any surprises with it.","This battle had allowed everyone within the Radiance Federation who was watching to see what it was like for human spirit qi professionals to battle dimensional lifeforms.","Now, all of them knew that the peace and security they enjoyed had come from sacrifices of flesh and lives.","At this point, only around 1,700 people were left in the central territory.","There were only so many people left because of Gao Feng.","The Spirit Spring Lilies had gathered spirit qi and produced two translucent spirit qi whirlpools in the air.","The Spirit Spring Lilies did their best to transfer spirit qi to Gao Feng and recover the spiritual power he had lost.","The Breeze Hibiscus’ petals that had fallen on the spirit qi professionals and turned into rose imprints were continuously supplying spiritual power to the contestants.","It was an overwhelming burden for Gao Feng to replenish the spiritual power of 8,000 spirit qi professionals when he himself was lacking in spiritual power.","If not for the two Diamond X/Fantasy V Spirit Spring Lilies that had the ability to rapidly recover spiritual power, Gao Feng might have already fainted from being over-drained.","But although Gao Feng had managed to hold on, the effects of the rose imprints were far from being as strong as when Gao Feng was at his usual strength.","Nonetheless, these tiny bursts of spiritual power recovery gave the contestants hope and support.","They managed to push through time and time again after being injured and healed repeatedly.","As the number of contestants fell, the pressure on Gao Feng’s shoulders lightened.","When the number of people dropped to 2,000, Gao Feng took a turn for the better, and the two Spirit Spring Lilies fully replenished his spiritual power.","Gao Feng activated the rose imprint with his full power while instructing the Spirit Spring Lilies to use Lily Dragon Spirit again.","The giant phantom image of a dragon covered with lilies released another shower of rain that fully replenished the spiritual power of all the surviving contestants and their feys.","Lin Yuan was the savior of the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection as he had used inexplicable techniques to lower the difficulty of the test. This made him seem like an invigilator of the test.","Meanwhile, Gao Feng’s actions made him the contestants’ savior.","Although he was only a support-type spirit qi professional who did not have any combat abilities, he had become the strongest pillar of support for the contestants.","At that moment, the various live-streaming rooms were not only praising Black and Li Nao.","Gao Feng’s performance had fully overshadowed Li Nao.","Lu Shuang said with certainty, “The three feys that Gao Feng summoned have to be Diamond X/Fantasy V. There’s no other way for them to handle such a situation. Additionally, they have to be equipped with extremely strong abilities. Among all the support-type spirit qi professionals I’ve seen, no one has benefited a team as much as Gao Feng has.”","While she spoke, Lu Shuang started to think.","At that moment, she seemed to understand why Black had flown off right at the start of the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection to seek out Gao Feng.","She now knew that Black and Gao Feng were participating in the test solely to provide aid.","Both of them had Diamond X/Fantasy V feys. Their power was already beyond the scope of the test.","The two of them had only planned to watch from the sand castle. They only stepped in when they saw the contestants slipping.","It was rumored that Cicada Song had accepted a disciple who was a pure support-type spirit qi professional from a top faction.","It was likely that this person was Gao Feng.","Lu Shuang would not reveal such a guess to the live stream.","If Gao Feng truly was the disciple of a member of royalty, only he had the right to reveal such information.","If she revealed such information, she would be crossing the line.","But if her analysis was wrong and Gao Feng was not Cicada Song’s disciple, she would create a rumor by putting her guess out into the world.","She did not have the authority to assign a disciple to Cicada Song.","Although Lu Shuang had not said anything herself, the audience in the live-streaming room did not hold back their discussions.","Snowflakes on Clouds: Did you see the posts on Star Web? Gao Feng is the Young Leader of the Gao family! No wonder he’s so strong! I declare that from now on, both Gao Feng and Black are my husbands!","Falling Peaches in the Rain: Sister, control yourself! Black is mine, and so is Gao Feng!","Life That Blooms For You: I’m going to set a trap for them now. Let’s see if any of them fall in!","Shadows: Gao Feng is definitely the strongest support-type spirit qi professional I’ve ever seen. I was wrong. I shouldn’t have been biased against support-type spirit qi professionals. I will definitely choose support-type spirit qi professionals the next time the Guild Alliance forms teams!","Regretful Journey Through Life: I suggest that all of you think carefully before rushing to choose support-type spirit qi professionals from now on. After all, not all of them will be Gao Feng."]},{"number":1679,"title":"Chapter 1679 Lily Gather Spirit!","paragraphs":["1679 Lily Gather Spirit!","Carnelian Tangerine: That’s true. Once you form the group and your defense or healing ends up lacking, don’t blame that support-type spirit qi professional!","The comments streamed into the live-streaming room so swiftly that Lu Shuang could not read them all.","It could be said that this three-day battle that became increasingly boring to watch had become exciting because of heroes like Black, Gao Feng, and Li Nao.","A person’s character, resistance, communicative ability, and power were all tested during the three days.","Anyone participating in the test who was capable had earned fans.","A post written in a childish tone set the forum abuzz with activity.","The general summary of the post was.","‘I’m lucky enough to have the talent to become a combat-class spirit qi professional. I have to work hard to become stronger! My village is in a remote region that’s part of Cloud Lake City. Numerous marsh dimensional rifts have opened here, and large crocodiles, bugs larger than my head, and giant lizards that can sweep a house down come out of them. Everyone who lives here is already used to it because every time one opens, an uncle wearing black clouds and City Guards wearing light green will appear to fix the situation. I want to thank them! I will work hard to become just like them in the future!’","It was possible to see who posted the post on Star Web. When one clicked on the name, they could enter that person’s page.","They saw that the person who posted this message had just turned eight years old and had just started attending the Spirit Qi Professional Primary School.","Before this message was posted, many people had already shared this child’s sentiments.","The passion in their bones was linked to invisible dots of light.","Many spirit qi professionals had not intended on going into the abyssal world but were now packing their bags.","At that moment, every person with combat-class spirit qi professional talent felt that they were one of the lucky ones.","Despite how difficult it was to evolve feys and how dangerous fighting was, they were still capable of protecting themselves.","As more and more similar posts appeared, the radiance of Star Web’s forums grew brighter.","Everything that was taking place in the Star Web live-streaming rooms and forums was related to the contestants who were currently fighting the alien beast tide.","Star Web only blocked external spying.","But if anyone within the test had Creation Master abilities, they would be able to check on his teammates and opponents’ feys’ abilities and exclusive skills.","The benefits of being a Creation Master were not only the ability to evolve feys, but they were also very helpful during combat.","The benefits were negligible when they were fighting spirit qi professionals who were stronger than them.","But when they fought against spirit qi professionals who were of similar power to them, they would be able to make effective preparations after learning about their opponents’ powers and exclusive skills.","If they became certain that they would not be able to emerge victorious, they would be able to find a chance to flee.","They would not have to find out about the disheartening outcome only after fighting for some time.","Lin Yuan had checked on the feys of numerous people while he was in the sand castle.","Both the Folded Wings Purple Wolf and Rotten Spotted Sky Dog were power offense-type dog-species feys.","Dog-species feys were common, and many of them were outstanding.","Li Nao’s talent gave him plentiful opportunities to become a top spirit qi professional.","Li Nao had only summoned two feys, but both of them were remarkable dog-species feys.","Lin Yuan felt that Li Nao was a prime well of potential.","When Lin Yuan first saw the Spirit Spring Lilies, they had only been Platinum grade.","At that time, they still had not gained the abilities Riding Dragon Spirit and Cloud Cover Rain Shower.","When Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the Spirit Spring Lilies, he noticed that both of them had the same Diamond ability, Lily Gather Spirit.","There was a high chance for Normal and Elite abilities to be the same, but there was a smaller chance for them to share Silver abilities.","Lu Pinru had invested significant effort to find the Glowing Silkworm Weavers with the same Bronze exclusive skills.","Even when she approached White Devil, she only managed to find one such Glowing Silkworm Weaver.","When Lu Pinru eventually joined the Dome Guild Club and became a reserve team member, Lin Yuan helped Lu Pinru obtain the Glowing Silkworm Weavers she wanted from the Cage of Brahma Insects. In total, he managed to obtain 13 of them for her.","The main reason was that the Cage of Brahma Insects dominated 70% of the insect-species fey market and possessed tens of millions of the Glowing Silkworm Weavers.","But as a fey’s power increased, their abilities also varied more.","Creation Masters had researched and learned that the abilities feys gained when they evolved were closely linked to their environments and personal characters.","A fey’s bloodline would change to a certain extent by the time it reached Platinum grade.","Thus, it was already very difficult for two Platinum feys to have similar abilities.","It was impossible that all the Glowing Silkworm Weavers that Lu Pinru had would keep the same abilities as they continued to evolve.","However, this would not affect Lu Pinru.","As long as the first three abilities were the same, Lu Pinru would be able to quickly support her team.","The Glowing Silkworm Weaver’s high-grade abilities required the use of more spiritual power. As such, they could not be used as often as low-grade abilities.","The high-grade abilities only served to enable Lu Pinru’s support-type abilities to become more comprehensive and make her more valuable to a team.","Lin Yuan felt that if Cicada Song had not encountered Gao Feng, he might have considered accepting Lu Pinru as his disciple if their paths had ever crossed.","There was a 1 in 10,000 chance for two feys to have the same Platinum abilities.","But, Gao Feng had hit a lucky break as the two Spirit Spring Lilies had the same Diamond abilities.","Lily Gather Spirit: By absorbing the souls of animal-type feys through the roots, the Spring Spirit Lily can gain the abilities of the feys through their bloodlines and use them to disperse spiritual power.","Lin Yuan felt that Lily Gather Spirit was very special.","The dragon was only one of the ways that the ability presented itself.","If Gao Feng wanted to, he could manipulate Lily Gather Spirit in many ways."]},{"number":1680,"title":"Chapter 1680 End of the Test!","paragraphs":["1680 End of the Test!","Lily Gather Spirit was very similar to the Golden Wings’ exclusive skill Unset State.","Unset State’s ability was that it made a copy of the exclusive skills and triggered abilities of the feys it was used on.","Unset State would be continuously swapped out between different exclusive skills and abilities. It could be changed once every lunar cycle.","Although Lin Yuan still did not have time to nurture Shiny, he had instructed it to use Unset State to copy the Mirror Silver Obsidian Bull’s ability Sacrifice.","Lin Yuan had chosen the near-dead Sharp Iron Horn Bull because he saw the ability Sacrifice.","It could be said that Lin Yuan had always badly wanted that ability.","So far, he had only seen this ability in cow-species feys. However, it rarely appeared.","Once Shiny became stronger, Lin Yuan would be able to transfer any damage he sustained to it.","It was an important ability that could make the difference between life and death at key moments.","Moreover, it was very easy for Shiny to copy the exclusive skills and triggered abilities.","He could change it after a day.","However, Lily Gather Spirit had an even shorter time limit than Unset State,","The only caveat was that it required a large number of resources during the swap. After all, it was not easy to refine a fey’s soul.","Before the fey’s soul could be refined, it had to have enough power in order for its soul to take shape after the fey’s death.","Moreover, the help of a soul-type fey was also needed. The soul-type fey also had to be at least Myth Breed.","If the soul-type fey was below Myth Breed, it had to have powerful talents in order to extract the target’s soul.","However, this did not apply to the Remembrance Soul Whale.","Gao Feng used the Lily Dragon Spirit to create rain and recover the spiritual power of targets. This made it evident that Gao Feng had allowed the Spirit Spring Lilies to absorb the souls of many flood-dragon-species feys.","Essentially, Gao Feng had many other options.","After all, every fey had different talents.","If Gao Feng instructed the Spirit Spring Lilies to absorb the soul of the Drought Sand Insects, the spirit qi professionals and their feys could recover spiritual power by walking on the ground.","But there was a limitation to this as avian-type feys would not be able to replenish their spiritual powers during battle through this method.","However, absorbing the souls of flood-dragon-species feys to produce the Lily Dragon Spirit was not perfect either.","If Lin Yuan was Gao Feng’s enemy, he could just summon Chimey and instruct it to use Clear Sky to immediately dissipate the dark clouds formed by Lily Dragon Spirit.","Hence, Gao Feng needed to prepare more souls when he fought in remote areas.","This was to ensure that Lily Gather Spirit did not end up countered by his opponent.","Lin Yuan could feel the toughness of the test more than the other contestants could.","The testing ground had an area of 100,000 kilometers. It shrunk at a rate of around 10,000 kilometers every half an hour.","This meant that the testing ground would be fully gone five hours later.","While the testing ground was shrinking, the dimensional rifts would not disappear. Rather, they would gather toward the center.","The smaller space would increase the power of the alien beasts.","The contestants had only been able to hold on because of Lin Yuan. Without him and the fists of sand that were already starting to attack the Class 3 and 4 alien insects and abyss beasts and the still-expanding seas of flowers, not even ten more Gao Fengs would be able to keep the over 1,000 contestants at the central territory alive.","At the end of the day, support was just that, especially if it was softcore support.","Softcore support-type spirit qi professionals would only be able to exhibit their power when they had strong teammates. Without strong teammates, not even the strongest softcore support-type spirit qi professional would be able to make any difference.","Lin Yuan silently watched the over 1,000 contestants at the central territory.","As of this moment, the deal that everyone had made with Li Nao had expired.","It was clear that people were already starting to develop schemes.","This situation immediately sparked intense debate on Star Web.","Given that every person had different perspectives, the Star Web users’ ideas were also endless.","However, Lin Yuan felt that a fight would be pointless now.","The over 1,000 people present had given up too much for the team and were covered with both new and old injuries. Some even continued to wield their feys in battle despite the clear absence of limbs.","This Radiance Hundred Sequence selection was still a competition.","Three days ago, these people had already proven their characters.","They would have to go through with the inevitable fight three days later.","Presently, there were six members of the previous Radiance Hundred Sequence selection left. This demonstrated how strong they were in both character and strength.","Now, they were no longer partners but competitors.","The members of royalty were also looking out for the way that these contestants would react.","Sense and sensibility were always at odds.","People who lived by their senses would find it difficult to attack the people they had fought alongside for three days.","Those who were sensible would keep in mind that this was a test and that they would still have to do what needed to be done.","Night Leaning Moon and Cicada Song were both paying close attention.","The remaining over 1,000 people were the true young elites of the Radiance Federation.","Night Leaning Moon preferred those who were sensible.","The Spirit Guards’ job was to capture dangerous feys, destroy dimensional rifts, and provide aid during disasters. As such, they were in constant potential danger and needed to always remain pragmatic.","Although both the Spirit Guards and City Guards were protectors, the City Guards extolled their motto of never abandoning and always protecting their cities.","If the city shifted by even a step, the people within would be in danger.","Thus, the City Guards could only charge forward and never retreat.","This made those who lived with their heart on their sleeves more suited to being City Guards.","When Spirit Guards were in danger, they faced the risk of being completely wiped out. As such, a sensible person was needed to make decisions.","When it was time to retreat, it had to be done.","Sometimes, a temporary retreat would lead to winning the war.","The contestants in the central territory had already been split into two groups by the two members of royalties.","In the next year, they would be sequentially recruited by the Spirit Guards and City Guards."]},{"number":1681,"title":"Chapter 1681 The Green Light from the Sand Castle!","paragraphs":["1681 The Green Light from the Sand Castle!","Of course, these contestants could turn them down.","But those who did agree would receive many resources from the Spirit Guards and City Guards.","When the Indigo Azure Guard Captain and Raging Waves Guard Captain worked with Lin Yuan, they had obtained high-quality Bronze feys from him to nurture their new recruits.","Although it was dangerous being a Spirit Guard, they would handsomely compensate the families of any Spirit Guard who had passed away while on duty.","!!","Lin Yuan’s parents had been two Spirit Guards with Platinum main feys. They were considered very average among the Spirit Guards.","They had obtained a significant amount of aid in the form of resources from the Spirit Guards when they were alive. When they died, their contributions were compensated with a source-type item and 100 Radiance dollars.","Lin Yuan and Chu Ci had not immediately gained access to these resources because their parents had entrusted them to Auntie Zhang and Uncle Li.","The two of them became the siblings’ guardians.","Their parents had intended for the siblings to only receive the money once they matured and understood the importance of money management.","It was when Auntie Zhang and Uncle Li left the Xia Region and because they had given notice to the Spirit Guards that Lin Yuan and Chu Ci received the money from Dong Hai because they were left without guardians.","Moreover, he had not given them all the money at once.","Lin Yuan received 100 Radiance dollars annually. This was a large mountain of riches.","But recently, the Spirit Guards had increased their budget on this, and the benefits were becoming increasingly better.","This year, they introduced free healthcare for the families of Spirit Guards.","If Lin Yuan and Chu Ci were regular people, they would be able to live opulently with their annual grant of 100 Radiance dollars.","After all, after working in the spirit lifeform store for a year, he had only managed to earn a few tens of thousands of Federation dollars. They amounted to less than even 1 Radiance dollar.","The number of contestants at the center had fallen to 500 people.","Yet, Gao Feng had yet to be targeted.","He looked at the contestants and sighed.","If not for the fact that he was trying to conserve power, he would have been able to easily use his fey with the Barren bloodline to take control of the situation and end the test.","However, Gao Feng needed to keep his fey with the Barren bloodline a secret for the sake of the impending fight against the Freedom Federation envoy group.","Li Nao had lost an arm and half a leg during his fight against the alien beast army.","At that moment, Li Nao was leaning against one of the ditches.","The Rotten Spotted Sky Dog was standing right next to Li Nao.","Given that Li Nao had been using his full strength against the alien beast tide, the Rotten Spotted Sky Dog did not have much spiritual power left, in spite of Gao Feng’s help.","Li Nao was currently at the edge of the base. Thus, he would be next after the power offense-type spirit qi professionals at the outermost layers were devoured by the alien beast tide.","There were only about 300 contestants left.","Li Nao felt that he could no longer hold on.","He sighed faintly.","At first, he had been poised to win. But, he had given up his advantage for the sake of the team and allowed the chance to recover his membership in the Radiance Hundred Sequence to slip through his fingers.","Before the test started, Li Nao never saw himself doing such a thing.","But now, he finally understood the weight of responsibility.","Four Horn Demons that were completely out of spirit qi charged toward him, and Li Nao slowly closed his eyes.","It seemed that it was not his fate to rejoin the Radiance Hundred Sequence through this test.","But he had done what was right. Thus, despite regret gnawing at him, he would not feel guilty or reproachful when he remembered this event in years to come.","At that moment, Li Nao felt the area below his body soften.","The horns that should have punctured him had struck a small batch of sand instead.","Li Nao had already sunken into the quicksand.","Despite being under the sand, Li Nao did not feel suffocated in the slightest because the sand had left air pockets around his nostrils.","The sand granules could exert force on their own. Thus, Li Nao would not be able to breathe the sand in.","Li Nao immediately realized that Black had saved him.","Soon, Li Nao felt the sand pushing him upward until he was eventually pushed out of the ground and into the sky.","Suddenly, light flooded Li Nao’s vision.","When he opened his eyes, he saw a young man wearing a silver mask standing in front of him while he himself was sitting in a crumpled heap on the ground.","After the fight with the alien beasts, his clothes were in tatters, leaving a part of his body completely exposed.","Li Nao was immediately overcome with embarrassment.","He also realized that the mask that Black was wearing was different from the one in his memory.","Black’s mask was also no longer just silver like it had been on Star Web. It now had faint patterns all over it.","Li Nao had seen this mask at the 100 Buildings but had assumed that it was being worn by one of Black’s less committed fans.","Yet, it turned out to be Black himself.","Li Nao was about to express his gratitude when he saw that Black was already holding out a set of spirit qi clothes for him.","However, Li Nao had already lost an arm and a leg. Hence, he could no longer wear clothes on his own.","Suddenly, Li Nao remembered the changing rooms he had read about in inappropriate books.","Is Black going to help me change clothes? Please no!","Lin Yuan had no idea what was running through Li Nao’s head.","He had helped Zhang Xiaobai to regrow his hand in Millstone Town.","Moreover, when he fought against Chen Hongfeng on Star Tower, he had healed the hole in his shoulder bone.","It was no longer a secret that Lin Yuan had healing abilities.","Just as Li Nao started to blush from the inappropriate thoughts flashing through his mind, Lin Yuan raised his hand and a green beam landed on Li Nao.","Soon, the pain in Li Nao’s body started to wane and his superficial cuts and injured internal organs started to heal.","Then, Li Nao’s arm and leg started to feel itchy at the point they were missing.","Li Nao looked down and saw his arm and leg slowly regrowing.","This made Li Nao widen his eyes.","There were too many rumors about Black on Star Web.","Li Nao had noticed Black but was skeptical of most of the rumors.","But now, he realized that most of the rumors were real. Moreover, the rumors did not live up to reality.","Li Nao finally knew why Black called himself a healing-type spirit qi professional despite having such powerful combat abilities."]},{"number":1682,"title":"Chapter 1682 Real Healing!","paragraphs":["1682 Real Healing!","As a member of the previous Radiance Hundred Sequence, Li Nao was not only stronger than the other young experts but also had more experience.","Thus, Li Nao could tell how powerful Black’s healing abilities were.","Healing-type spirit qi professionals were very rare. There were only one to two of them in a group of a few hundred spirit qi professionals.","In the beginning, healing-type spirit qi professionals had mediocre combat abilities. They were only able to become useful once they reached C-rank and their feys evolved to Silver grade.","Before that, they would be nothing more than dead weight in the group that needed to be protected without being able to offer much healing treatment.","This was why many Guild Alliance teams needed healing-type spirit qi professionals.","They knew how rare healing-type spirit qi professionals were, yet they only ushered in those who could meet their standards, like celebrities.","There were only three healing-type spirit qi professionals in the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Besides White Devil, the other two were Sequence #76 and Sequence #81.","All of them were able to become members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence because they were not purely healing-type.","All of White Devil’s healing-type feys had attacking abilities. In fact, her healing abilities were not as powerful as that of Sequence #76 and Sequence #81.","Li Nao felt that White Devil was a power offense-type spirit qi professional who only wore the mask of being a healing-type spirit qi professional.","A person like this had impressive individual combat abilities, but they were much less useful in a team.","Gao Feng used his own power to prove the value of a pure support-type spirit qi professional in a team.","Pure healing-type spirit qi professionals would be even more valuable than Gao Feng was to a team.","Li Nao had never heard of any healing abilities that could regrow limbs.","Even king-class experts could only seek out high-class Spirit Craftsmen and ask them to create prosthetics out of jade-textured wood and metal spiritual ingredients after losing limbs during battle.","The prosthetics differed greatly from real limbs. During the battle, any excessive force would break them.","Hence, once a spirit qi professional lost a limb, it would be virtually impossible for them to rejoin a team of equivalent power.","They would have no choice but to resign themselves to weaker teams.","In the past, there had been an instance where a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence lost his right hand.","It was much more common to lose hands than it was legs and feet.","Nonetheless, this member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence’s rank started falling precipitously from his initial rank of Sequence #58 until he was eventually kicked out two years later.","Black’s technique could perfectly regrow limbs.","Li Nao had heard the rumor that Black had regrown Zhang Xiaobai’s hand in Millstone Town.","However, there had been no recording of the incident, and the news had only spread by word of mouth. Thus, not many people believed that it had happened.","It was only when Black used the ability again during the fight on Star Web that people realized how terrifyingly strong his healing abilities were.","Since then, they all believed that Black had indeed regrown Zhang Xiaobai’s hand.","Nonetheless, no one had proven this fact.","Zhang Xiaobai seemed to be hiding something as he rejected all interviews.","Li Nao felt that no matter how strong Black’s combat power was, he could still call himself a healing-type spirit qi professional based solely on the fact that he had this ability.","Unlike White Devil, who was essentially only pretending to be a healing-type spirit qi professional but was actually a combat-class spirit qi professional, Black was the opposite.","If he had been willing to heal the large team, there would still have been at least 10,000 contestants by the third day of the test.","When feys and spirit qi professionals were fighting against alien insects and abyss demons, an attack from a Class 4 alien insect would only severely injure a Platinum fey but not be enough to kill it.","If healing-type spirit qi professionals were around, they could slowly heal the injuries.","But if the attack led to broken bones and severed limbs, it would be impossible to rejoin them.","As a result, only feys that relied on elemental attack stood a fighting chance after being crippled by the alien insects and abyss demons because they could still unleash attacks.","But if the feys relied on their physical bodies in combat, being crippled would reduce them to sitting ducks.","Previously, the combat abilities that Black demonstrated made Li Nao feel he was a genius that he would never be able to compete with him.","But now that he knew how powerful Black’s healing abilities were and that he had this irreplaceable technique, Li Nao realized the strategic significance of Black.","From a certain point, it could be said that Black’s strategic significance was more important to the Radiance Federance than his power was.","Li Nao felt that once Black became a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, he would be able to become a Radiance Knight, at the very least, if not a Radiance Envoy.","Li Nao had never had the authority to witness the power of a disciple of royalty. However, he felt that any of the three moves that Black had demonstrated had reached the level of a disciple of royalty.","After his limbs were fully regrown, Li Nao hurriedly stood up and respectfully thanked Black.","Next, he lowered his head to gaze at his tattered spirit qi clothes.","Luckily, he had worn waist armor made from metal spiritual ingredients. Otherwise, he would have been in a wholly unpresentable state.","But he remembered that they were all men, and there was nothing for him to be embarrassed about.","After all, Li Nao frequented public baths.","Just as he was about to start changing, he noticed that the sand had created a changing room for him.","Li Nao had not expected Black to be so thoughtful.","At that moment, he suddenly remembered the rumor that Black had not even turned 20 years old yet.","Now that he was in close quarters to Black, Li Nao could sense the youth emanating from him.","Li Nao thanked Black again.","He picked up the blue and white spirit qi clothes that Black had given him and entered the changing room.","Li Nao knew Black had pulled him into the sand castle to protect him.","He could also tell Black wanted him to be part of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Li Nao was extremely grateful for this. Black had casually gifted him with an opportunity.","In the past year, he had been doing all he could to increase his power and nurture the new fey he had contracted."]},{"number":1683,"title":"Chapter 1683 Long Tao is Suited to be Your Disciple!","paragraphs":["1683 Long Tao is Suited to be Your Disciple!","A year later, Li Nao might not end up as one of the last ten rankings.","He only ended up with such a low rank this time because he had failed to make a final sprint but also ended up being targeted by other members.","Li Nao was filled with gratitude toward Lin Yuan, but the latter was not on the same page as him.","He had been watching the test from the sand castle for two whole days.","There were at least 50 contestants who were worthy of being part of the final ten.","Lin Yuan did not want to interfere too much with this so the 50 of them could fight freely.","After all, there were a limited number of spots, and the 50 comparable contestants needed to battle it out to determine who was actually stronger in terms of resilience, faith, character, and communicative ability.","Eventually, it would all boil down to power.","There was no question that Li Nao was stronger than all of the other contestants in all these facets.","He especially towered over them in terms of his leadership skills.","Moreover, at least four members of the previous Radiance Hundred Sequence had started conserving power and gathering in the central territory from the moment the third day rolled around.","Evidently, the four of them intended to team up.","This was a very logical outcome.","However, Li Nao’s preference to be led by his heart was also not wrong.","Lin Yuan felt that Li Nao did deserve to be a Radiance Hundred Sequence member. Thus, he stepped in to save Li Nao.","Lin Yuan’s action caused Iron Prison to furrow his brow.","“Moon Empress, your disciple is blatantly giving Li Nao a leg up. This isn’t fair to the other contestants.”","Cicada Song could not hold back from slapping his forehead when he heard this.","Iron Prison had been willing to sacrifice his bloodline for the Moon Empress. So why was he also intentionally saying something that would upset her now?","Tian Feng stowed away the peanuts he had been playing with and said, “Iron Prison, anyone can tell that besides the Moon Empress and Cicada Song’s disciples, Li Nao is the most outstanding. His feys also have the most potential.","“There isn’t much fairness to speak of in this test. Is it fair to the other contestants that the four previous Radiance Hundred Sequence members are colluding? There isn’t any external element in this test. Everything depends on the contestants’ individual powers.","“I don’t see anything wrong with Black using his power to help Li Nao. Rather, I think that Black’s action shows that he’s an even better leader than Li Nao. Black is helping the Radiance Federation to pick out true talents.","“Iron Prison, I think that you should accept a disciple. With a disciple, your mindset and thought processes will change. Your feys are all dragon-species feys.","“Coiling Dragon Valley’s previous head of the family has gained Immortal power. Coiling Dragon’s Valley will be taking over Whale Ocean Commerce’s position as one of the top three factions.","“Long Tao is suited to be your disciple. While researching Coiling Dragon’s Valley, I also looked into Long Tao. Both of you are eccentric. He will definitely grow into a strange personality as well.”","Iron Prison’s face darkened when he heard what Tian Feng said.","You’re the eccentric one. You’re the strange person!","However, Tian Feng’s words did strike a chord with Iron Prison.","Recently, he had been butting heads with the Moon Empress, Night Leaning Moon, Chef Supreme, and the rest during imperial meetings more often. Even Cicada Song’s opinions had differed from his more often than not.","Could it be because they had accepted disciples?","Iron Prison cast a look at the silver pillars, and his gaze landed on Long Tao.","Iron Prison turned away and started to mull deeply. His eyes darkened, and his thoughts were indiscernible.","Star Web was also a cacophony of activity over Black’s action.","As opposed to Iron Prison’s comment about unfairness, the people on Star Web were full of praise.","Missing the Past: I cried when Li Nao was about to be pierced by the Horn Demon! But why did he sink into the quicksand? Is Black going to eliminate Li Nao?","Mountain Thoughts: Hey! What are you thinking? If Black wanted to eliminate Li Nao, he could have just used the sand. Besides those that can fly, everything else would have sunk underground. Moreover, the sand castle can fly. This means that Black’s sand-elemental source-type lifeform can levitate. Clearly, Black wants to keep Li Nao around!","Taichi Gu Zheng: My son saved my new husband! How touching! Is Li Nao in the sand castle now?","Rest of Life: Black performed wonderfully! I used to just be a casual fan of his. But now, I’ll be a fan for life!","Gangster Rabbit 88: Besides Black and Gao Feng, no one is more suited than Li Nao to be a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence! I admit that I didn’t think much of Li Nao at the beginning. But after seeing the way he contributed to the team, I can’t ignore him.","Most of the people watching the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection were drawn to heroics.","After watching the test for three days, they all felt a sense of attachment to the contestants akin to how they would feel about the characters of a television show.","None of them wanted to see the characters die.","As opposed to the energy on Star Web, a fierce battle was ongoing at the central territory of the testing ground.","Gao Feng was no longer helping to heal anyone.","The two Spirit Spring Lilies were continuously replenishing Gao Feng’s spiritual power while the Breeze Hibiscus protected him by creating a gust of wind around him.","The Breeze Hibiscus was Diamond X/Fantasy V. The wind did not have any combat effects, but any elemental attacks that drew near or people who tried to attack him would end up blown away.","The alien beast tide had cornered the central territory to a size of only 300 square meters.","Only 100 were still left viciously fighting.","Numerous contestants had been blown almost 500 meters away into the alien beast tide and ended up devoured after they tried to attack Gao Feng.","Gao Feng picked up the two Spirit Spring Lilies and Breeze Hibiscus before walking toward the center.","The people who saw him all understood that they needed to back away.","The four members of the previous Radiance Hundred Sequence watched as Gao Feng stood at the exact center.","The four of them decided to protect each side of him and secure the most advantageous position."]},{"number":1684,"title":"Chapter 1684 Really Embarrassing!","paragraphs":["1684 Really Embarrassing!","At that moment, Gao Feng positioned his posture in a way that said: ‘”I won’t attack you, but you better not attack me either.”","Where he stood, Gao Feng seemed like a starting point.","The previous Radiance Hundred Sequence members entrusted their backs to each other because Gao Feng was at the center.","All of them used their feys to defend one side of Gao Feng.","Their feys drew a clear line in front of them. The meaning was clear.","If anyone crossed the line, they would be attacked by the four members of the previous Radiance Hundred Sequence.","After fighting for three days, these four experts finally revealed their full power.","All of them had more than one Platinum/Fantasy fey.","These members of the previous Radiance Hundred Sequence could be said to represent the limit of power that these contestants could attain.","Now that they were on guard with their feys, nobody dared to cross the line.","It would be fine if all of them attacked together. But if one person tried to attack on their own, they would be sealing their fate of elimination.","All the remaining 100 people felt that they had a good chance of emerging as part of the final ten.","Once they became a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, they would not only bring honor to their family and enable their family members to walk around with their heads held high, but their own futures would be extremely bright.","Once they became a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, they would be able to receive resources that they would never have had access to otherwise.","In the one year that they were members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, the Radiance Sacred Hall would provide them with 5,000 Radiance dollars at least.","This would be enough for them to buy a Bronze/Epic fey and evolve it to Platinum/Fantasy.","But it went without saying that they also had to first comprehend a Willpower Rune.","It was a challenge for most people to comprehend a Willpower Rune, but it would not be difficult for the contestants who were still surviving.","There were many of them who already had Willpower Runes prepared and ready. They just needed to find a suitable high-quality Bronze fey.","Becoming a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence was a chance for them to elevate themselves.","After fighting to this point, none of them were willing to give up.","Li Nao was already done changing and had stepped out of the changing room.","He walked to Lin Yuan and saw that he was watching the fighting that was taking place on the ground.","Li Nao stood next to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan had returned Red Thorn to the Spirit Lock spatial zone before he fetched Li Nao to the sand castle. Otherwise, Li Nao would be currently staring in shock at the six-winged Red Thorn instead of calmly analyzing the situation with Lin Yuan.","“Black, no one will be able to break through the wall of wind that Gao Feng’s feys created around him. Hence, he will definitely be able to secure a spot. Zhang Zihao, Du Xu, and the rest are stronger than the other contestants. The four of them will definitely be able to make it to the end. Thus, including you and me, there are three spots left up for grabs.”","The comments on Star Web reflected the same thoughts.","Three to Five Years: Besides Black, Gao Feng, Li Nao, Zhang Zihao, Du Xu, and the other members of the previous Radiance Hundred Sequence who have all but secured spots in the final ten, I wonder how the rest will be able to fight for the final three. This competition is too intense!","A Youngster With a Dream: I also think that given their individual power, Gao Feng, Zhang Zihao, Du Xu, and the rest in the central territory make up the strongest contenders on the ground. There are some contestants who have comparable strength to Du Xu and Zhang Zihao, but they will have to take on the group of four at the center. Such an action can only end in elimination! It was a good idea for Zhang Zihao, Du Hao, and the rest to join hands from the start!","Source of Happy Water: Du Xu and Feng Cong’s feys are too powerful at constraining! Feng Cong’s poison-type fey’s poison is slow-acting and can kill from a distance away. However, it takes too long to take effect and isn’t good at defense. Du Xu’s main fey’s intelligence is too low. Once it goes into a frenzy, it doesn’t listen as well to Du Xu’s instructions. I think that the two of them aren’t capable enough.","Lin Yuan did not share the same opinions as the Star Web comments and Li Nao.","After Red Thorn returned to the Spirit Lock spatial zone, the eight seas of flowers lost their roots.","Although the seas of flowers could continue to sustain themselves by consuming alien beasts, they would quickly end up trampled if they were not supplied with energy.","At that time, the central territory’s burden would multiply.","Every contestant would want to secure a position in the central territory.","At that time, even Lin Yuan would end up attacked if he joined the fray.","It was possible that the other contestants would attack the group of four at the center even before the seas of flowers crumbled.","Less than ten minutes later, a voice shouted from among the contestants, “The alien beast wave is much more intense now than it was before! My feys discovered that the alien beasts have already eaten half of the eight seas of flowers. Soon, we will be faced with a bigger struggle. If we don’t head to the center, we’ll all be eliminated! Rather than being eliminated, why don’t we put everything we have into a final charge?”","This voice triggered the contestants.","Only around 80 contestants were left.","Rather than fighting among themselves for the last three spots, it seemed like a better idea to eliminate the four members of the previous Radiance Hundred Sequence so they would have seven spots to go around instead.","At that moment, someone else shouted, “In past Radiance Hundred Sequence selections, only three or four members of the previous Radiance Hundred Sequence were left. If all five of them re-enter the Radiance Hundred Sequence this time, won’t that mean that our batch is too weak? That will be really embarrassing!”","These two voices caused Zhang Zihao, Du Xu, Feng Cong, and the others’ expressions to darken.","Clearly, someone was trying to target them and wanted to make use of a herd mentality to induce a group attack.","Before they could speak, several contestants ordered their feys to cross the line that had been drawn.","Feng Cong ended up in the worst state. His main fey spat out all of its venom, but the contestants were not afraid of him at all.","His main fey’s venom attacked the blood. After the contaminated blood stewed for some time, it would eventually congeal and lead to death."]},{"number":1685,"title":"Chapter 1685 Real Fight Begins!","paragraphs":["1685 Real Fight Begins!","When they first started fighting the alien beasts, Feng Cong had led a group of defense-type spirit qi professionals on his own and used his main fey to spread its venom around a large area to contaminate all the alien insects and abyss demons in the area.","Next, he instructed the defense-type spirit qi professionals to fend off the alien beasts. Within three minutes, all the alien insects and abyss beasts’ blood congealed and they died.","In the past, the contestants would have been terrified of Feng Cong.","But there were only around 70 contestants left.","The fight would be over in two minutes, much less three minutes.","No matter how strong Zhang Zihao, Feng Cong, and the rest were, they would not be able to take on so many contestants at once.","Under the attack from the barrage of feys, Zhang Zihao managed to hold his own while two of them were immediately eliminated. The last one fought to the point that he did not have an ounce of strength left in him before he was wiped out with one stab.","Just as the remaining contestants were about to launch another round of attacks at Zhang Zihao, he shouted, “Piercing Damask White Vine, ignite your vitality and form a net of vines!”","The vines next to Zhang Zihao started to grow rapidly with him at the center. The vines interweaved and formed a 20-meter-tall pile of vines,","Zhang Zihao was a defense-type spirit qi professional. His most powerful defense-type ability was to instruct the Piercing Damask White Vine to protect him with the ability Withered Vine Protection.","He was certain that given the contestants’ lack of spirit qi, they would not be able to break through the vines in less than five minutes.","After using this ability, Zhang Zihao had assured himself a spot in the final ten.","The others hurriedly rushed forward to fill the three gaps around Gao Feng.","None of them tried to attack Gao Feng.","While Zhao Zihao, Feng Cong, Du Xu, and the rest were surrounding Gao Feng, the latter had received the bulk of the damage from the attacks that the four of them dodged.","The air currents around Gao Feng blocked all the elemental attacks, burning several contestants around him. These unlucky contestants ended up eliminated.","Thus, no one dared to attack Gao Feng, given how powerful he was.","The contestants who had been at the outermost layers of the central territory had all wanted to take on the people in the middle of the base.","But after the circumstances changed, these contestants had been unable to react in time and ended up devoured by the alien beast wave.","For some reason, the alien beast wave had increased several times in ferocity.","It seemed that something was herding them forward.","As she watched the alien beasts charging toward her, a female contestant covered in dirt cradled her broken arm as she said to her heavily injured main fey, “Iron-Skinned Gorilla, toss me at the wall of air around Gao Feng!”","The girl’s instruction was very rushed, and the Iron-Skinned Gorilla was devoured by the alien beasts immediately after tossing the girl.","The girl flew in a perfect arc and crashed against the shield of wind around Gao Feng.","At that moment, the girl felt excruciating pain akin to her organs being set on fire.","Star Web had turned the pain sensitivity up to 100% for the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","Thus, even a small injury received on Star Web would feel the same as if it had been inflicted in real life.","The girl was ejected far away after she crashed against the shield of wind.","Just as she was about to crash into the alien beast tide, the girl was suddenly transported out of the testing ground.","At that moment, the contestants standing in the Radiance Sacred Hall opened their eyes and realized that they had returned to reality. It dawned on them that the Radiance Hundred Sequence test had come to an end.","A cheer arose from the group.","The cheer had come from the girl who had just been about to fall into the alien beast tide.","The test ended before I died. This means that I’m a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence!","After the contestants were eliminated, they would have to continue to watch the test.","Thus, the contestants all knew how everyone had performed.","The contestants instinctively looked around them to see if the strongest experts were around them.","They quickly noticed Lin Yuan standing next to Gao Feng.","The contestants were all shocked when they saw the mask Lin Yuan was wearing. They realized that the person they thought was a fake fan of Black was actually Black himself.","All these contestants felt like someone had painted a clown face on them.","But this feeling was quickly replaced by excitement as they scrutinized Black and Gao Feng.","Gao Feng had become famous from this test. However, Lin Yuan’s popularity had not only started today.","Even before he joined the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection, Black was already very well known on Star Web. It could be said that he was the cream of the crop of the younger generation.","This was the first time that Black had appeared in reality.","If they were not currently in the Radiance Sacred Hall and the two federation envoy groups were not in attendance, not to mention the spectating members of royalty, many people would have started asking Black for his signature.","Li Nao, Zhang Zihao, and the previous Radiance Hundred Sequence members stood together.","At present, only Li Nao and Zhang Zihao were smiling because they had managed to return to the Radiance Hundred Sequence and recaptured the glory that came with it.","The previous Radiance Hundred Sequence members were downcast but not indignant.","At that moment, Liu Wencheng said from his golden pillar, “This year’s Radiance Hundred Sequence selection has officially come to an end. The final ten contestants, please ride the Jade-Holding Cinnabar Cranes to the silver pillars!”","Liu Wencheng’s words made all the contestants’ breaths hitch in their throats.","Ten golden cranes with jade patterns on their feathers and each with a jade piece in their beaks flew out and positioned themselves in front of the ten contestants.","Lin Yuan and Gao Feng lifted their legs and climbed aboard the back of the Jade-Holding Cinnabar Cranes in front of them.","Once they sat securely, the Jade-Holding Cinnabar Cranes flew to the silver pillars.","They were brought to the silver pillar that corresponded to their performance in the test.","Lin Yuan saw that there were nine empty silver pillars to his left.","This meant that he had attained Sequence #91.","As he looked through his mask at the Freedom Federation envoy group, he thought, The appetizers are over. The real fight is about to begin."]},{"number":1686,"title":"Chapter 1686 What is Black’s Title?","paragraphs":["1686 What is Black’s Title?","Gao Feng sat directly adjacent to Lin Yuan on the pillar meant for Sequence #92.","Next came Li Nao, followed by Zhang Zihao.","The person at the end who had attained Sequence #100 was the girl who had been rebounded by Gao Feng’s wind shield and almost fell prey to the alien beasts right before the test ended.","Once the ten new members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence took their seats on the silver pillars, the Radiance Hundred Sequence representing the Radiance Federation’s top young experts was finally complete.","The eliminated contestants looked at the 100 figures on the silver pillars sadly. However, they could not help but start clapping.","Li Nao and Zhang Zihao shared a look.","It was very difficult for contestants to acknowledge the contestants who had been part of the previous batch of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","This was because spirit qi professionals were naturally competitive with each other.","Bullying was common.","Many people felt that they would be able to become a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence as long as they could find an opponent they naturally countered.","Every person had tried their best in that largescale test.","They had not competed against each other in the past three days but instead worked together.","After their interactions over the last three days, the contestants now felt genuine respect for these final ten members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","Yu Tiantian, who had managed to squeeze in as Sequence #100 at the final moment, had weaker combat power than the other contestants, but her instruction to her main fey to toss her into the air was still a smart tactic.","Star Web was full of cheers.","The Star Web reporters who had been watching the test had finished writing their articles.","After the test ended, they just needed to fill in the names of the final members, and they would be able to submit their drafts.","The posts from the Star Web reporters quickly took center stage in all the forums and comments.","However, the cheers were so intense that people had not started reading through the information.","Many of the audience on Star Web had experienced the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection themselves and had related to the entire experience.","They did not need to read the posts to understand what had transpired during the test.","At first, Lu Shuang and Poison Beauty had been disappointed about how Black had not emerged from the sand castle at all throughout the entire test, as it resulted in their audience numbers being lower than expected.","As a result, they had no choice but to swap to Li Nao and Gao Feng’s perspective views.","But after the test ended, their live-streaming rooms immediately exploded with activity.","The members of the audience who had been waiting for Black’s perspective view in Lu Shuang and Poison Beauty’s live-streaming rooms all returned to their original live-streaming rooms when Black became Sequence #91.","An exciting discussion started.","The Most Hated Gray: I already said that Black would make it into the Radiance Hundred Sequence! I told you all so!","Insanity: You didn’t need to give your opinion that Black would become a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence Sequence. Anyone with eyes could tell! Black is the best! He not only became a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence himself, but he even brought two people along with him!","Not Evil: Please! Gao Feng didn’t need Blacks’ help! If Gao Feng had not been waiting for Black and headed for the center territory instead, he might not have encountered the first alien beast wave! Li Nao also wouldn’t have ended up in such a sorry state.","Taichi Gu Zheng: Nonetheless, Black and Gao Feng are more powerful than the others! Li Nao and Zhang Zihao are far from his level!","Spirit Without Moon 1: There’s no need to disparage any of them! All of them are the Radiance Federation’s young experts. I’m just curious now about what Black’s title will be.","The members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence did not choose their own titles. Instead, it came from the Star Web users who posted ideas on the Radiance Sacred Hall’s forum.","The thousands of titles would be listed in the forum where the Star Web users would be able to vote over the next 48 hours. The one with the most votes at the end would become that member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence’s title.","However, the Radiance Hundred Sequence members could change their titles if they were not satisfied with them.","For example, Zhao Xiaochun had been eating non-stop during her Radiance Hundred Sequence selection. She had managed to eat three pig knuckles and five chicken thighs by the end of the selection.","As a result, she had received the title of Glutton.","When she found out what her title was, she went to the Radiance Sacred Hall the next day and changed it to Food Hater.","Although her official title had changed, people still associated her with the title Glutton.","Chu Ci was currently sitting with the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer in the Return from Faraway Mansion.","As Chu Ci watched Lin Yuan on the silver pillar, she felt as though the past ten months had been a dream.","Ten years ago, Lin Yuan was still a weak young man who ran a spirit lifeform store.","He had been struggling to maintain a livelihood and skimping and saving to earn Chu Ci’s school fees so he would eventually be able to send her to university.","Chu Ci would do other students’ homework to earn money so that she would be able to buy more medicine for Lin Yuan.","But ever since the time Lin Yuan went to see her at school and gave her the Bronze Sharp Iron Horn Bull, everything had changed.","Chu Ci did not know how Lin Yuan became a Creation Master or how he obtained so many precious resources. She also had no clue how he became a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence despite not having spirit qi professional talent.","But she did know that her brother must have struggled significantly throughout this journey.","Chu Ci’s eyes filled with tears as she gazed at Lin Yuan. Her heart swelled with pride.","No one knew better than Chu Ci how hard life had been for Lin Yuan in the past.","Although the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer were happy that Lin Yuan had become a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, that was the extent of their feelings about the matter.","This was because they felt that it was only right for him to attain such a position.","If not for the rule that new members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence could not reach ranks above Sequence #90, Lin Yuan could have competed for Sequence #1 against Liu Jie.","Liu Jie turned to look at Lin Yuan.","In a way, the two of them were side by side."]},{"number":1687,"title":"Chapter 1687 Friendly Match!","paragraphs":["1687 Friendly Match!","It would even be possible for him to fight alongside Lin Yuan in the future.","This thought caused Liu Jie’s stony expression to shift. This came from his delight over being able to fight side by side with Lin Yuan and because he had just heard from the Insect Queen that the Blade Queen Bee had shown signs of transforming.","The Blade Queen Bee had comprehended a Willpower Rune when it fused with the Firefly Demon Fetuses.","Since the Insect Queen controlled the Blade Queen Bee using psychotoxin, it did not restain the Blade Queen Bee’s grade.","This meant that as long as the Insect Queen allowed the Blade Queen Bee to roll grades, it would be able to trigger a special World Cleansing and become a Myth Breed insect-species carcinoma fey.","It would then become a fairy through the Firefly Demon Fetuses.","There would be a definite risk in allowing the Blade Queen Bee to roll grades. However, greater risk would also bring with it greater rewards.","The Diamond X/Fantasy Blade Queen Bee was already from a completely different level from the Diamond X/Legend Blade Queen Bee. But the gap would be even wider when it reached Suzerain /Myth I.","There had been no record in the Radiance Federation of insect-species carcinoma feys transforming into fairies.","However, Liu Jie had heard from Lin Yuan that carcinoma feys gained numerous wings when they transformed into fairies.","Lin Yuan had said that because he had managed to combine the Sea Burial Lotus Flower with the Fairy’s Heart and turned it into a fairy.","The fairy that the Sea Burial Lotus Flower turned into had six wings right out of the gate.","It had transformed to such a degree because of the pure spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone and because of the spotted coral jade.","The spotted coral jade was what had transformed the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s bloodline.","Without pure spirit qi and an external item, the Blade Queen Bee would only be able to transform to four wings at the very most.","Once he used all 12 Firefly Demon Fetuses, the Insect Queen would be able to orchestrate the 12 four-winged fairies.","As the fairies transformed from the insect-species carcinoma feys continued to evolve their bloodlines, Liu Jie felt that his hard work would eventually enable him to catch up with Lin Yuan.","At that moment, within the Freedom Federation envoy group, Li Yang said to the Goddess of Mercy, “Next, we will be challenging the ten new members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence to a fight. We’ll also try to involve a few disciples of royalty—”","Before Li Yang could finish speaking, the Goddess of Mercy interrupted him. “You’re in charge of this. You don’t have to run it by me. As long as nothing happens to Qian Yu, I don’t care what happens.”","The Goddess of Mercy had only come because of Qian Yu.","When she heard about his situation, she had been afraid that he would be in danger. There was no other reason someone who hated being bothered as much as her would go to such lengths.","Swimming in the Freezing Lake Water Mirror behind the Freedom Mystic Temple was much more interesting than spectating the Radiance Hundred Sequence test.","The Goddess of Mercy saw Qian Yu as her future.","She was not against his participation but would not hesitate to step in to save him if he were in danger.","Given that the Goddess of Mercy had ascended to the title of Goddess and possessed an 11 Stars sacred source lifeform, she was certain that she would be able to achieve greater things once she freed herself from the curse.","Li Yang looked displeased when the Goddess of Mercy interrupted him. However, he did not voice his unhappiness.","It seemed as though he had already become accustomed to being interrupted by her.","Since the Goddess of Mercy did not care, Li Yang planned to carry out his plan as intended.","Li Yang said to You Changjian, Yan Ling, and Cai Huo, “The three of you, go and prepare.”","Next, Li Yang turned to look at Qian Yu and said, “I hope that you will proceed with our original plan and drag in Liu Yifan! Next, pull in another one or two disciples of royalty besides Gao Feng. I’m sure you know what to do. If you can pull in two disciples of royalty, I will give you a 7 Stars precious instrument once the matter is over. If you can’t drag in Liu Yifan, pull in three other disciples of royalty besides Gao Feng, and you will still receive the 7 Stars precious instrument.”","While Li Yang was speaking, his gaze fell on Black.","He did not know what Black’s identity was, but he felt that Black’s power was comparable to that of a disciple of royalty.","Qian Yu’s chest throbbed.","He had been in life-or-death situations countless times. Every time, the Goddess of Mercy had swooped in to rescue him.","As a Freedom Envoy, he eventually learned how to act in ways that guaranteed his own benefits.","The best way to secure his own profits would be to obtain the 7 Stars precious instrument that Li Yang had just promised to give him.","Qian Yu did not want to involve Liu Yifan because he had crossed swords with Liu Yifan before and knew how powerful he was.","Liu Yifan’s fey with the Barren bloodline was especially troublesome.","Thus, Qian Yu preferred to involve another three disciples of royalty rather than Liu Yifan.","However, Qian Yu knew that as a Freedom Envoy, his target would have to be a Radiance Envoy.","If he said that he wanted to challenge Liu Yifan, the Radiance Federation would have no choice but to agree on account of upholding their pride.","But if he challenged one of the Radiance Federation’s royalty’s disciples, the Radiance Federation would be sending these disciples to their deaths if they agreed.","After all, he was three or four years older than them on average, and his feys were all Myth Breed.","To a young genius, three years was a gap as wide as an ocean.","Although Li Yang appeared to offer two options, there was only one right answer.","Before he made his decision, Qian Yu looked at the Goddess of Mercy and asked, “Teacher, can you help me check how old Black is?”","The Goddess of Mercy immediately responded, “Black is definitely younger than 19 years old.”","When he heard what the Goddess of Mercy said, all the worry vanished from Qian Yu’s heart.","He immediately took a step forward and declared, “The Radiance Federation’s younger generation is indeed impressive! We, the Freedom Federation envoy group, not only came to spectate but also to engage in a friendly match with the new members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence!”"]},{"number":1688,"title":"Chapter 1688 The Radiance Federation Accepts the Challenge!","paragraphs":["1688 The Radiance Federation Accepts the Challenge!","Qian Yu always struggled to see past Black’s shroud of mystery.","Although Black had demonstrated such astonishing tactics, there was too little information available on him.","If Black’s real age was around 28 or 29 years old, which was the limit for a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, Qian Yu would have had to slow down and contemplate further.","If he was 28 or 29 years old, Black would be older than him.","If the Radiance Federation had planned it out intentionally, there was a possibility that Liu Yifan, two other members of royalty, Gao Feng, and Black could work together to take Qian Yu, Yan Ling, Cai Huo, and You Changjian on.","It would be bad if they made a mistake and wrecked the plan.","Qian Yu knew that the Goddess of Mercy had taken hold of her birth horoscope.","An expert who had taken hold of his birth horoscope would be able to tell another person’s age with one glance.","This was why Qian Yu had asked the Goddess of Mercy to take a look at Black’s age.","When he discovered that Black had not even reached 19 years old, he stopped worrying about him.","Even if he was a genius, how strong could a 19-year-old spirit qi professional be?","Setting himself, Yan Ling, Cai Huo, and You Changjian aside, even the members of the Freedom Federation were geniuses.","All the hesitation that had existed in his heart vanished, and he could challenge Liu Yifan and another two disciples of royalty without any worries plaguing him.","Their side’s advantage came from You Changjian, Yan Ling, and Cai Huo’s sacred source lifeforms being complements.","It was not easy for sacred source lifeforms to be linked together.","This was the first time in the Freedom Federation’s history that three sacred source lifeforms could link up with each other.","After all, unlike source-type lifeforms that most king-class experts could easily obtain, sacred source lifeforms were extremely rare.","The Freedom Federation had the fey with the Barren bloodline, while the favored experts of the Freedom Federation’s royalty had devils from the Demon Church that they could form contracts.","The feys with the Barren bloodline could control a type of natural power and were synonymous in a way with Heavenly Family Feys.","However, they were not as reliant on nature to grow. All they needed was someone to nurture them. They were lifeforms that had formed contracts with nature.","The devils from the Demon Church controlled inauspicious power. They prioritized strengthening their bodies or souls.","Devils that could evolve their bodies would possess powerful combat skills as well as strange abilities.","Devils that leaned toward their souls were skilled at seduction and strategic mind games to lure their victims into dropping their guards.","The people from the other federations were more afraid of the devils from the Freedom Federation than they were of the feys with the Barren bloodline from the Radiance Federation.","The aura from the feys with the Barren bloodline could suppress lifeforms of the same type.","This suppression was understandable by humans.","However, the ugly appearance of devils and the inauspicious aura that radiated from them would cause goosebumps to rise on any person’s skin.","When the contestants, members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, and the audience on Star Web heard what Qian Yu said, the connotations of those words immediately took hold of them.","The contestants had similar thoughts to that of the Star Web audience.","All of them looked forward to the friendly match proposed by Qian Yu. They wanted to see if the top talents from the Radiance Federation or Freedom Federation were stronger.","It could be said that a sense of honor and duty arose in the hearts of the contestants and Star Web audience.","A fervent discussion broke out on Star Web.","Deep Mountain: I wanted to go to the personal page that the Radiance Sacred Hall just created for Black to give my suggestion for his title. I was just about to leave the live-streaming room when the Freedom Federation suggested the friendly match!","Clear: Ah! Go for it, Radiance Federation! Crush them!","Nicholas Seven: According to the rules of the past few years’ Radiance Hundred Sequence spectating, the new members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence will take part in the friendly match. The Freedom Federation will definitely send out stronger opponents. Black will have to reveal more of his feys now!","Spirit of Mountain Water: I’m looking forward to the fight! Since it’s a friendly match, the two sides probably won’t use any lethal attacks. Amber Button: Impossible. The bet between the Freedom Federation and Radiance Federation is charged to maximum voltage. I’m willing to bet five Radiance dollars that this only has the facade of a friendly match. There’s definitely more to it than meets the eye!","The Star Web users and contestants were looking forward to this match because they did not have much foresight.","The members of veteran and top factions who were paying attention to the situation all knew that the Freedom Federation envoy group was baring their fangs now that the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection was over.","This match was going to be extremely important.","These people’s gazes were fixed on Black, Gao Feng, Li Nao, Zhang Zihao, and the rest with their fists tightly clenched.","The two federations were about to flex their muscles using their young experts.","Normally, the match’s result was unimportant because it was not a fight between the current Radiance Envoys and Freedom Envoys.","However, the Freedom Federation envoy group had proposed the match in the Radiance Federation’s Royal Capital, in front of all the citizens of the Radiance Federation, right after the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection had ended.","If the Radiance Federation lost this match, it would be a serious blow to the entire Radiance Federation.","Besides Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, Xia Qing, and Gao Feng, the other members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence on the silver pillars frowned.","The four of them already expected this to happen.","Long Tao was from the top faction Coiling Dragon’s Valley.","Half of the Radiance Hundred Sequence members were from top and veteran factions.","These people had all guessed that the Freedom Federation envoy group would make their move after the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection ended.","But those had only been speculations. When it actually happened, they still could not help but feel their chests contract.","As members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, all of them kept the Radiance Federation in mind at all times. They knew there was no permissible result for the friendly match other than victory.","Even if they died, they had to safeguard the Radiance Federation’s glory.","Qian Yu looked at the 13 members of royalty sitting on the golden pillars as though he was waiting for a reply from them.","However, the 13 members of royalty did not have any intention of replying to Qian Yu.","At that moment, Liu Yifan replied loudly, “The Radiance Federation will accept the Freedom Federation’s challenge! It is customary for the other party to decide on the rules of the challenge. The Freedom Federation can decide on how the challenge should proceed.”"]},{"number":1689,"title":"Chapter 1689 What Can the Radiance Federation Do?","paragraphs":["1689 What Can the Radiance Federation Do?","Liu Yifan had been in seclusion in the Barren Mystic Realm, preparing for the Major Federation Meeting that would take place two years later.","The Major Federation Meeting was attended by two batches of envoys from each federation.","The previous batch of federation envoys would be the main attendees, while the later batch would be the substitutes.","Liu Yifan had been a substitute at the last Major Federation Meeting.","The three days that the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection lasted felt extremely long to many members of the audience.","Meanwhile, it was a massive test for the contestants.","This was because they had no concept of what the Major Federation Meeting was.","The Major Federation Meeting took place once every decade on an uninhabited continent.","This continent was far from the vastness of the Radiance Federation, but it was about 1/5 the size of the Divine Wood Federation.","Then, 30 participants from each federation would represent their federation to take on the other participants.","There were many ways to contend against each other.","There were one-on-one battles, duo battles, and five-person group battles.","Every person could only step foot on the dueling stage once.","There were many approaches as they involved the strategies of each team.","In a complicated structure, each participant would be transported to a random location in the federation after the individual and team battles were over.","At that moment, the participants would move around freely in the federation, making use of whatever strategies they had.","The goal was to conquer as much territory as possible.","This test would last for a full six months.","When Liu Yifan participated in it last time as a substitute, he had witnessed the cruelty of the Major Federation Meeting.","The dueling ground was just a method to thin out the number of participants.","In the last Major Federation Meeting, one of the Radiance Envoys had been grievously injured during the dueling stages, three Radiance Knights had lost their lives, and every substitute member had returned covered with injuries.","This was why the Radiance Federation did not allow their substitutes to participate now, but just to gain experience from watching.","After the Major Federation Meeting was over, the previous batch of Radiance Envoys would retire and go into seclusion.","Two years later, Liu Yifan would meet his fate.","As such, Liu Yifan was rather happy that the Freedom Federation had come to cause trouble in the Radiance Federation, as this would allow the Radiance Federation’s younger generation to learn how evil the other federations could be.","Liu Yifan’s gaze fell on Black and Gao Feng.","Given that Cicada Song had accepted Gao Feng as his disciple, Gao Feng definitely had more up his sleeve than what he had already demonstrated.","Thus, Liu Yifan felt that as long as Gao Feng possessed something special, he would be able to become a Radiance Knight even if he could not become a Radiance Envoy.","Liu Yifan did not know what Black’s circumstances were, but he was still full of hope for him.","After all, Black had beaten that person’s Celestial Stairway record.","This was enough to prove his talent.","When Qian Yu heard what Liu Yifan said, a relaxed smile spread across his face, and he said, “If that’s the case, I’ll come up with something off the top of my head. Why don’t you come down and play with me? We’ll each lead a team and have a brawl.”","Qian Yu’s use of the word ‘friendly’ was just superficial.","If the two federations truly had a deep friendship between them, they would already have started a merry feast instead of proceeding with this so-called friendly match.","However, Liu Yifan had not given him the chance to say much more before he went straight to the point.","If only Li Yang were present, Qian Yu would not dare to say such a thing on the Radiance Federation’s soil despite being a Freedom Envoy.","But now, the situation had changed.","The Goddess of Mercy’s arrival filled Qian Yu with confidence.","Qian Yu’s words caused the expressions of the members of Radiance Hundred Sequence to change.","The contestants and audience on Star Web fell silent.","In the age of the Spirit Qi Awakening, Star Web was the Radiance Federation citizens’ only pastime. It was tightly interwoven with what they considered life itself.","Although these people were already managing their personal pages on Star Web, on top of watching live streams and fighting on Star Tower, they also paid attention to any exciting event that took place.","But after hearing what Qian Yu said, the people who had intended to watch the friendly match all realized that it was not just any ordinary exciting event.","The members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence were celebrities in the Radiance Federation.","It could be said that 80% of the Star Web users had been a fan of a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence at least once in their lives.","The Radiance Envoys had a similar status to the members of royalty. They were the backbone of the Radiance Federation.","Regardless of Qian Yu’s background or the fact that he was a Freedom Envoy, dragging Liu Yifan in immediately piqued the fury of the citizens of the Radiance Federation.","Lucky Little Panda: What is going on this time? How can they be so insulting? How dare they involve Lord Yifan? Kill them!","Scar of Hidden Star: I’m hopping mad! Do your best during the fight! Smash all the people from the Freedom Federation six feet underground!","Fruit Kernal: Black, I used to be such a big fan of yours. I’m not asking for much. Just do your best this time to beat down all the people from the Freedom Federation! Otherwise, I will immediately switch camps and become your hater!","I Know Sour and Sweet: The Freedom Federation envoy group better not be trying to cause trouble! The bet we have with the Freedom Federation isn’t that far away. But why do I feel like the Freedom Federation might have a scheme in mind?","The contestants who had been eliminated were all looking at the Freedom Federation envoy group.","Qian Yu had already participated in the Major Federation Meeting, so the eyes of the thousands of geniuses on him did not bother him in the slightest.","However, Yan Ling, Cai Huo, and You Changjian could not help but feel the tension rising.","The 13 members of royalty had not expected Qian Yu to involve Liu Yifan.","However, none of them could do anything now because the decision of whether or not to participate and how the match proceeded lay in the hands of Liu Yifan himself.","Liu Yifan said loudly, “I am willing to participate. Under normal circumstances, the last ten ranks of the Radiance Hundred Sequence should be taking on the last ten ranks of the Hundred Sequence of the opponent.”","Now that Liu Yifan had agreed, a different thought entered Qian Yu’s mind.","Yan Ling, Cai Huo, and You Changjian had participated in this year’s Freedom Hundred Sequence selection.","However, the three of them had massacred half of the contestants.","As a result, the invigilators had had no choice but to pull them out of the test and give them the ranks of Sequence #88, Sequence #89, and Sequence #90, while the original members of the Freedom Hundred Sequence who held these ranks participated in the Freedom Hundred Sequence selection instead.","Although this went against the rules, Cai Huo, You Changjian, and You Changjian were still members of the Freedom Hundred Sequence.","If he, Yan Ling, Cai Huo, and You Changjian killed Liu Yifan instead of involving three disciples of royalty, what could the Radiance Federation do about it?"]},{"number":1690,"title":"Chapter 1690 You’re Useless Now! Die!","paragraphs":["1690 You’re Useless Now! Die!","There was always risk in a fight between spirit qi professionals, regardless of whether the intention was friendly or malicious.","An accident might not be the result of an overzealous opponent but might also be because the expert had failed to defend themselves.","If he did manage to kill Liu Yifan in such a public setting, the Radiance Federation would not be able to assign blame.","Otherwise, they would end up the laughingstock of the entire main world.","!!","At that point, even if the Radiance Federation gained another Class 5 Creation Master, they would not be able to command the same amount of respect that they currently did.","Qian Yu had not expected Liu Yifan to attend the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection.","Previously, Qian Yu had only tried to come up with ways to involve the disciples of royalty but not the Radiance Envoys.","Although Qian Yu had agreed to Li Yang’s terms, it would also mean that he would have to put himself at risk.","He could not be as confident as if he was only battling Liu Yifan.","If he could kill Liu Yifan through this friendly match, he would still receive a significant reward once he returned to the Freedom Federation, even if he did not meet the requirements to obtain the 7 Stars precious instrument from Li Yang.","Qian Yu cast a greedy glance over at Liu Yifan as though Liu Yifan himself was a treasure trove.","A moment later, Qian Yu said, “Then let us begin!”","When they heard what Qian Yu said, three people’s expressions changed.","These three people were Lin Yuan, Li Yang, and Yin Lin.","Li Yang’s gaze darkened as he looked over at Qian Yu.","Qian Yu had changed the plan on his own and ruined Li Yang’s original plan. Or rather, he ruined the partnership between Li Yang and Second Page Revival.","The partnership with Second Page Revival was vital to Li Yang.","In the past, Li Yang would definitely have stopped Qian Yu from changing the plan in such a way.","However, the Goddess of Mercy was present.","Qian Yu was the Goddess of Mercy’s favored expert, so Li Yang needed to give her the necessary respect.","After ascertaining that the decision could not be changed, Li Yang intentionally avoided looking at Second Page Revival.","He and Second Page Revival had their own motives for entering into the partnership. Neither of them asked the other what their motive was.","They were just making use of each other and did not have any real ties.","Hence, Li Yang decisively abandoned Second Page Revival after weighing his own circumstances.","Li Yang could not feel secure without seeing Sixth Page Lashing.","He also had not seen even a hair of the four horsemen that Second Page Revival had mentioned.","Li Yang decided that he would break off his side of the agreement. He murmured under his breath, “Second Page Revival, you’re useless now! Die!”","Li Yang’s expression was stern, and his fist was tightly clenched.","Having witnessed numerous sacred source lifeforms, he knew how terrifying their abilities could be.","Sacred source lifeforms’ abilities surpassed that of feys’ abilities and exclusive skills.","Feys could combine their exclusive skills and abilities to produce magnified attacks, and so could the three sacred source lifeforms belonging to three members of the Freedom Federation envoy group.","When the three sacred source lifeforms combined their abilities, they could even kill opponents stronger than them.","Lin Yuan’s own sacred source lifeform was very special because it was formed from the fusion of two sacred source lifeforms.","Even if they had not been fused, Lin Yuan still would have been able to wield the Sacred Sword to produce attacks above his current level.","Lin Yuan had heard the news from Yin Lin.","After receiving the news, he had been trying to devise a way to deal with it.","Luckily, good news eventually came in the form of Gao Feng contracting his sacred source lifeform.","Although Lin Yuan knew that he was powerful, he would not dare to be so arrogant as to think that he could compete with a Radiance Envoy.","No matter how strong Fantasy Breed feys were, there was still a large gap between them and Myth Breed feys.","Freedom Envoys were the best that the Freedom Federation had to offer.","Even if the Freedom Federation could not produce pure spirit qi and elemental energy like Lin Yuan could, they could still nurture their feys to the same level as Zong Ze and Gu Lang had.","Lin Yuan was not afraid of taking them on.","But besides him, Gao Feng, Li Nao, and Zhang Zihao, the other contestants did not even have Diamond/Fantasy feys.","If they had to take part in a real fight, they would end up as nothing more than fodder.","If Lin Yuan were matched with Qian Yu, he was not confident that he would be able to protect Gao Feng.","Lin Yuan had not told the Moon Empress about Yan Ling, Cai Huo, and You Changjian. He only mentioned the Freedom Federation’s scheme.","Thus, Lin Yuan silently decided that he had to find a way to change the current situation.","Yin Lin’s brow was furrowed even tighter than Lin Yuan’s.","She had been trying to come up with a plan to send more disciples of royalty in to help Lin Yuan.","However, Qian Yu had promptly slammed the door shut on this plan.","Given Yin Lin’s knowledge, there was no question that she knew how terrifying three cooperating sacred source lifeforms could be.","When she sensed that the situation was not looking good for Lin Yuan, she stood up and said, “The friendly match seems interesting. It makes me want to take part too! But since it’s a friendly match, fairness is the most important.","“From what I know, Qian Yu, the nine people you brought with you aren’t Sequence #91 to Sequence #100 of the Freedom Hundred Sequence but Sequence #88 to Sequence #97. Three of them are even lucky enough to be favored by the Freedom Federation’s royalty.","“According to my knowledge, there is only one disciple of royalty among the Radiance Hundred Sequence’s Sequence #91 to Sequence #100. This would be Sequence #92 Gao Feng. How can an unfair fight be considered friendly?”","Yin Lin’s words completely stripped Qian Yu’s scheme bare.","As a result, Qian Yu’s expression changed immediately.","He had said what he said because he had not been afraid of the Radiance Federation turning down his proposal.","Even if the Radiance Federation knew that they had not brought Sequence #91 to Sequence #100, they were still newcomers.","If the Radiance Federation wanted to maintain its magnanimity, it could not dwell over such a trivial thing.","Yan Ling, Cai Huo, and You Changjian being favored by the Freedom Federation’s royalty had been a secret that the Freedom Federation envoy group revealed to the Azure Federation envoy group as bait to convince them to form an alliance.","The Radiance Federation’s royalty was supposed to have no clue regarding this.","But now that Yin Lin had revealed the secret and decided to participate, the Radiance Federation no longer needed to maintain any sort of magnanimity.","Now, there was no question that the Freedom Federation was the one trying to pull off a treacherous scheme."]},{"number":1691,"title":"Chapter 1691 What Do You Think About Becoming My Favored Expert?","paragraphs":["1691 What Do You Think About Becoming My Favored Expert?","Qian Yu glared at Yin Lin.","He had personally gone to offer her the proposal but had been turned down.","Could it be that the Azure Federation envoy group had intended to side with the Radiance Federation from the beginning?","But, was this the stance that Yin Lin herself was taking or the entire Azure Federation?","!!","Since You Changjian, Yan Ling, and Cai Huo’s identities had been revealed, Qian Yu had no choice but to abandon the idea of using them to hunt down Liu Yifan.","Yin Lin had spoken the truth, but there was no way that Qian Yu could agree to it.","“There are many experts favored by the Freedom Federation’s royalty. It doesn’t have any significance. The people in our team are all newly chosen members of the Freedom Hundred Sequence, just like how Gao Feng participated in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection despite being the disciple of the Radiance Federation’s royalty.”","Qian Yu cast his gaze on a young man white with short white hair and plain features and thought, The young man that Na Na has been nurturing for 20 whole years also has the Disaster World Faceless Beast now.","Qian Yu became more terrified the longer he looked at the white-haired young man.","At first, Qian Yu had not intended to showcase this white-haired young man.","Every time the Disaster World Faceless Beast was reincarnated, it would cause people’s minds to blur.","Moreover, the young man had formed a contract with one of the seven major devils in the Demon Church.","Not even every member of the Freedom Federation royalty could form a contract with one of the major devils.","The three members of royalty who had contracted major devils were given the title of ‘god’.","Only the disciples of the Freedom Federation’s royalty and the Freedom Envoys were aware of this young man’s presence.","Despite being disciples of royalty, not even Yan Ling, Cai Huo, and You Changjian were fully aware of this young man’s background.","Qian Yu was filled with confidence as long as this white-haired young man was around.","Lan Xun finally knew why Yin Lin had asked him to support her no matter what.","He knew that she was siding with the Radiance Federation but did not expect her to make her stance so obvious. He wondered what spell Lin Yuan had put over Yin Lin.","However, the fact that Yin Lin had contracted two sacred source lifeforms had to be kept secret no matter what.","This was one of the Azure Federation’s secret weapons that they would only debut at the Major Federation Meeting two years later.","Lan Xun used his spiritual energy to communicate with Yin Lin, “Lordess Azure Envoy, I can fully support you in your decision to help the Radiance Federation. However, under no circumstances can you participate in the fight. I will support you in anything as long as you don’t enter the fray yourself!”","Yin Lin froze when she heard what Lan Xun said.","He was her teacher. Although he addressed her as Lordess Azure Envoy, she knew that it was because he cared for her.","She also knew that he did not approve of her participation because the members of the Azure Hundred Sequence she was leading had not made any preparations, unlike the three favored experts from the Freedom Federation envoy group.","Even the Radiance Hundred Sequence had two disciples of royalty.","Yin Lin fell silent.","If she could not personally participate in fighting alongside Black, the least she could do was to send in two more of the Radiance Federation’s disciples of royalty.","At that moment, even the contestants in the Radiance Sacred Hall and the audience on Star Web, with the slowest reactions, had detected the strong odor of dynamite and realized that there was more to this situation than met the eye.","It was as though the three federations were cracking their knuckles toward each other.","Additionally, both Yin Lin and Qian Yu had brought up Gao Feng’s identity.","This allowed the contestants and audience to understand why Gao Feng was so powerful.","It turned out that he was Cicada Song’s disciple. Everything made sense now!","When the balloon flower bloomed above the Radiance Federation and released a shower of lava, an irreconcilable grudge was formed between the Freedom Federation and Radiance Federation.","The Azure Federation had always been allied with the Radiance Federation.","Yin Lin’s involvement had poked holes in the Freedom Federation’s plan.","As a result, many audience members on Star Web started paying attention to this Azure Envoy and gained a good impression of her.","After a moment of silence, Yin Lin said, “A friendly match is only interesting if it’s fair. Only one of the Radiance Federation’s disciples of royalty is involved. Why don’t you add in two more of the Radiance Federation’s disciples of royalty and remove the last three ranked members of the Freedom Hundred Sequence?","“This way, both sides will have a team of ten, making it fair. Qian Yu, I’m sure you don’t want to see the three sides fighting messily. I don’t want to be the factor that pendulums in the middle, either.","“So, I’ll just add some fun. I’ll take out a major sea demon, a specialty of the Lantis Mystic Realm. Excluding the two federation envoys, I will give it to the member from the victorious side who performs the best.”","Lan Xun smiled bitterly when he heard what Yin Lin said.","The Azure Federation’s Lantis Mystic Realm, Radiance Federation’s Barren Mystic Realm, and Demon Church were all mystic realms of the same level.","Everything that was produced inside them was precious.","The major sea demon Yin Lin promised away was about the same level as an intermediate devil from the Demon Church.","Lan Xun was truly confused and curious about what Lin Yuan had said to Yin Lin in the fey carriage.","The moment Yin Lin spoke, the white-haired young man flinched.","It was as though he would be able to obtain the major sea demon as easily as he could take candy from a baby.","The 13 members of the Radiance Federation’s royalty all looked surprised. They had not expected Yin Lin to offer such a thing for the sake of the Radiance Federation.","At that moment, the Moon Empress said, “I will also offer a fey with the Barren bloodline that has achieved a truly Barren bloodline to the best performing contestant, excluding the two federation envoys.”","Almost immediately after, the Goddess of Mercy said, “A fey that has gained a truly Barren bloodline and a major sea demon. How interesting! If that’s the case, I will offer a pregnant intermediate devil from the Demon Church.”","The Goddess of Mercy paused before going on to say, “I will offer a big devil to the most outstanding member of the winning side, excluding the two federation envoys. However, I have a condition.”","At that moment, the Goddess of Mercy looked at Lin Yuan and said in a curious tone, “Not even 19 years old and yet already this powerful. I’m very interested in you. I will give you an opportunity to open the door to heaven by being my favored expert. What do you think?”"]},{"number":1692,"title":"Chapter 1692 I Have a Master!","paragraphs":["1692 I Have a Master!","The Goddess of Mercy’s gaze had landed on Black for some reason.","She had a wealth of experience and was never interested in nurturing descendants.","Black had not demonstrated his full power during combat. But even if he did, it would not mean much to the Goddess of Mercy, who had already awoken her birth horoscope.","Thus, the Goddess of Mercy’s interest in Black was unrelated to how remarkable he was.","Another reason was her attraction to beauty.","Besides increasing her power, collecting resources, and garnering authority, her biggest interest was in garnering the finer things in life.","When the other members of the Freedom Federation’s royalty obtained precious yet adorable feys, they would choose to nurture the feys. However, the Goddess of Mercy would not do so.","Instead, she turned them into specimens that she mounted in her palace.","She preferred the quiet elegance of death over the beauty of life.","The elegance of death was more deserving of admiration.","A few years ago, the Goddess of Mercy had invested resources into nurturing a small team of 200 people.","Every person on the team was requested to contract fairy source-type lifeforms after comprehending a Willpower Rune.","After contracting the fairy source-type lifeforms and evolving them to Fantasy Breed, the Goddess of Mercy would immediately kill the fairies that had displayed their appearances and characteristics before sealing the fairy bloodline within them to turn them into toys.","Then, she hung the dolls made of the fairy source-type lifeforms on the windchimes at the front of her palace.","From a distance, it looked as though the fairies were flying. But in reality, they had been killed to be turned into beautiful handicrafts.","Due to the deaths of their main feys, the members of the team’s spirits were injured and reduced to vegetables.","The Goddess of Mercy had sent every team member to the marsh world to do hard labor.","The Goddess of Mercy’s exquisite body hid the carnage and brutality within.","She was so hedonistic that anyone weaker than her in the Freedom Federation trembled before her.","One of these people was Li Yang.","The Goddess of Mercy always acted according to her own fancy.","If he opposed her, she would injure him seriously even if she did not kill him.","In the past, the Goddess of Mercy clearly had the chance to contract the second of the seven big devils in the Demon Church.","However, she gave up on the second devil in favor of the third despite the second being more powerful and having more potential because the third devil had a more pleasant appearance.","The Goddess of Mercy’s preference for looks had reached an almost insane level.","Black’s face was covered by the silver mask.","No matter how outstanding his aura was or how beautiful his bone structure was, none of these were important to someone who only fixated on looks.","The Goddess of Mercy felt that she should not set her sights on one young man. However, no matter how many times she tried to tear her gaze away, it drifted back to him.","She even felt a twinge of affection in her bloodline.","It was very difficult for the Goddess of Mercy to become interested in a person.","She only said what she said in such a public setting on the Radiance Federation’s soil because she was now interested in Black.","Besides that elderly man, no one else in the Radiance Federation deserved to be called a god.","Once a spirit qi professional gained the ability to utilize their birth horoscope, they would have a strength that was no different from that of a god.","They would be able to fight using more than just their feys.","This was the reason the Goddess of Mercy’s fishtail could block the image of the Golden Thearch Bamboo.","The Goddess of Mercy was clear that if she crossed swords with the elderly man, they would be stuck in a deadlock where she would not be able to defeat him, and he would also be unable to protect the Radiance Federation from her.","An 11 Stars sacred source lifeform was completely different from a 10 Stars sacred source lifeform.","Only one of the Goddess of Mercy’s two sacred source lifeforms had reached 11 Stars.","But if she triggered the 11 Stars sacred source lifeform with his full power, all the lifeforms between the Royal Capital and Lantern City would lose their lives.","Other than the elderly man, the Heavenly Family Fey that Moon Empress had adopted from the Heavenly Family Cottage had already reached Eternal power.","A Heavenly Family Fey that reached Eternal could not even be discussed in the same sentence as a normal fey that reached Eternal.","Given the Heavenly Family Fey’s relationship with the Moon Empress, it would definitely step in to help if she attacked the Radiance Federation.","If these considerations were not present, the Goddess of Mercy would not have tried to recruit Black so publicly but directly snatched him away.","Before Lin Yuan could react, the Moon Empress frowned and balled up her left fist.","Cold Moon and Mystic Moon collectively thought, Oh no!","The Moon Empress doted on Lin Yuan and was exceedingly protective over him.","Mystic Moon and Cold Moon were afraid that the Moon Empress would attack the Goddess of Mercy.","Both of them knew that the Moon Empress had also started going down that path after she unlocked her birth horoscope.","Although the Goddess of Mercy had started almost ten years before the Moon Empress, the Goddess of Mercy had been unable to advance her power due to her bloodline.","If they really started fighting, it was likely that the Moon Empress and the Goddess of Mercy would be evenly matched.","However, it would not be beneficial to the Radiance Federation if the Moon Empress really lost her temper.","The other 12 members of royalty’s expressions also changed.","Although none of them were looking at the Moon Empress, they had sensed the change in her aura.","At that moment, a voice said clearly from one of the silver pillars, “Please get it through your head that I’m a citizen of the Radiance Federation. Moreover, I already have a master and will not be your favored expert.”","The young man’s voice was very calm.","However, the voice shook up the entire Radiance Federation through the Star Web broadcast.","Star Web had already gone into a frenzy from the moment that the Goddess of Mercy publicly recruited Lin Yuan.","Memory Ink: What the hell? A member of the Freedom Federation’s royalty publicly tried to recruit Black! Is Black that strong? She’s openly trying to rob the Radiance Federation!","Little Zhang’s Cries Dried Up: Didn’t you guys hear that Black hasn’t even reached 19 years old yet? Why does this age remind me of someone? Damn! Isn’t Black the same age as Lin Yuan?","XXX Tired: This member of the Freedom Federation royalty is so disgusting. Is there no one left in the Freedom Federation? How dare she openly lure Black?","Dream of You: Didn’t you hear that the Freedom Envoy leading this envoy group is the favored expert of this member of royalty? If Black agrees, his power will skyrocket! Do you think that Black will be able to resist such temptation?"]},{"number":1693,"title":"Chapter 1693 Something like This Doesn’t Deserve to be Used as a Stake!","paragraphs":["1693 Something like This Doesn’t Deserve to be Used as a Stake!","Maple Dance: Even if he can’t resist it, he still has to! As Black’s loyal fan, I will become his enemy if he agrees!","The discussions on Star Web were going wild.","Although Black had put on a shocking performance during the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection, they wondered how much power he had demonstrated while he was holed up in the sand castle.","The member of the Freedom Federation’s royalty had invited Black despite him not revealing his full abilities. This was an acknowledgment of his abilities.","After all, this was not the first time that the Freedom Federation envoy group had attended the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection. But, such an incident had never happened in the past.","But before the Star Web users could discuss any further, Black had given his answer.","His response fully displayed his stance and sent the Star Web users into another frenzy.","What he said about being a citizen of the Radiance Federation called forth an invincible and unending strength from their bloodlines.","Black had gone on to mention that he already had a teacher and turned down the member of royalty’s offer.","Regardless of whether or not Black’s teacher could compete with this member of the Freedom Federation’s royalty, Black’s attitude made him deserving of being idolized by those people who did not use to think much of him.","Daydream Starry Sea: Good job, Black! As long as I still have a breath in me, I’ll support you to the end!","Dawn Light: I saw on Star Web that someone did not think Black had enough power to represent the Radiance Federation’s young generation. But I think he is worthy of that position.","Little Bookworm: When Black said that he’s a citizen of the Radiance Federation, it made me want to chug two jugs of beer.","Passing Water: Aren’t you curious about who Black’s teacher is? This is the first time I’ve heard Black say that he has a teacher so publicly!","Black’s words ignited the passion of the audience on Star Web and caused the Goddess of Mercy to frown.","The Goddess of Mercy thought that her desire to kill Black would bubble up.","However, she soon found that she could not bring herself to feel that way about Black.","Rather, after being rejected by him, she wanted even more to become close to him.","After she realized how she felt, the Goddess of Mercy was stunned. She did not understand why she was suddenly acting as though she was under a spell.","It would be an easy fix if she was truly under a spell.","However, this was not what was happening.","The Moon Empress had been suppressing the anger and murderous urges within her.","As a member of the Radiance Federation’s royalty, she knew that she should not attack the Goddess of Mercy.","She had to hide her power in order to draw out the two members of Tower Canon.","But the Moon Empress could not stand by and watch as the Goddess of Mercy targeted Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan’s words had been like medicine that soothed the ugly emotions within the Moon Empress.","Yet, his words also left her feeling dejected.","The Moon Empress took a deep breath and relaxed her fist.","The Freedom Federation and Tower Canon were about to launch their attacks on the Radiance Federation.","Presently, the Radiance Federation was playing a big game of chess.","Lan Xun sensed the tension between the Freedom Federation and Radiance Federation and could not help but feel very unlucky.","He was not afraid of a fight breaking out between the Freedom Federation and Radiance Federation.","The Azure Federation had always remained neutral. If the two sides started battling it out, it would undoubtedly affect the Azure Federation’s trade. However, neither side would end up attacking the Azure Federation.","No matter which federation the Azure Federation sided with, they would end up disrupting the balance.","However, the Azure Federation could no longer sit on the fence of this fight after Yin Lin declared her support for the Radiance Federation so publicly and even exposed Qian Yu’s scheme.","Lan Xun had promised to support Yin Lin.","Since the tension had already been created, Lan Xun decided that the two sides should compete on a dueling ground to avoid serious accidents.","“Since both federations intend on sending their young experts and a federation envoy, I shall be the dealer and start a bet. Both federations can support their own teams, and the members of royalty can enter their own bets. No matter how many resources you bet on your team, the losing team will have to compensate for it. Moreover, I’ll also add in three top-grade strange water as a dealer’s gift to the winning side!”","Alarm bells rang in Li Yang’s head when the Goddess of Mercy tried to recruit Black so publicly.","Although he had broken off his side of the partnership with Tower Canon, Second Page Revival would be smart enough to sense that something was wrong if the situation deviated too far from the original plan. That would be bad!","He could break off his side of the partnership with Second Page Revival, but he still needed to borrow her strength.","If Second Page Revival sensed that something was wrong, he would not be able to borrow her strength.","Li Yang had no idea why the Goddess of Mercy had done something so insane.","She had ignored all the geniuses in her own federation and tried to recruit a genius from another faction, only to end up rejected.","Li Yang did not know if the Goddess of Mercy was embarrassed. But he was definitely extremely embarrassed for her.","Lan Xun’s proposal had set the parameters. As a result, the situation would not change too much from his original plan.","Li Yang was the first to speak/ “I will bet 10 Island Whales, three of which have S-rank strategic class. I’ll also add in one ton of spiritual ingredients from Myth Breed feys.”","Li Yang’s bet caused the jaws of all the contestants and the audience on Star Web to drop.","Ten Island Whales and a ton of spiritual ingredients from Myth Breed feys were immense wealth!","In terms of Radiance dollars, it would take billions to nurture one mature Island Whale.","Although there were many different types of Myth Breed feys, of all various shapes and sizes, only the main parts of the Myth Breed feys that had valuable medicinal value that would be of use to Creation Masters could be used as spiritual ingredients.","Even if the Myth Breed fey was enormous, it would take at least 300 of them to produce one ton of spiritual ingredients.","Such wealth was incomprehensible for a regular person.","Additionally, three of the ten Island Whales’ strategic class had reached S-rank.","The Island Whale of S-rank strategic class was twice as valuable as the regular Island Whale.","But before the crowd could express their marvel, a clear voice said, “Something like this doesn’t deserve to be used as a bet!”"]},{"number":1694,"title":"Chapter 1694 Seed of Satan","paragraphs":["1694 Seed of Satan","When the Goddess of Mercy publicly tried to recruit Lin Yuan, fury surged within the Moon Empress.","Although she was aware of what the big picture was and knew that she needed to suppress her anger as part of her duty as a member of royalty.","But she still needed to vent in some way.","Li Yang was the best channel for her to vent through.","Li Yang’s face froze when he heard what the Moon Empress said.","Ten Island Whales and a ton of spiritual ingredients from Myth Breed feys were definitely not a small sum.","Giving out this sum of resources, Li Yang would not be bankrupted. However, he was not a Creation Master, and there was no way he possessed as many resources as the Moon Empress.","The Moon Empress’ words made Li Yang understand what her intention was.","She was going to use resources to one-up him!","But, this did not enrage Li Yang but rather delighted him.","This was because he had two safety nets within his team. The probability of him losing was zero.","The more the Moon Empress offered, the more Li Wang would be able to earn.","Na Na had been willing to send her precious disciple over and was using Li Yang as a cover.","Given how much Na Na adored her disciple, he definitely had at least five precious instruments.","Lu Ou felt that even if Na Na’s disciple did not step in, Yan Ling, Cai Huo, You Changjian, and Qian Yu would be able to defeat the participants that the Radiance Federation sent out.","In recent years, the younger generation that had emerged from the Freedom Federation had been the strongest batch in a century.","The confident Li Yang said loudly, “The Moon Empress truly lives up to her position as a Class 5 Creation Master. You have a wealth of resources in your possession, to the point that ten Island Whales and one ton of Myth Breed spiritual ingredients mean nothing to you. How about this? I’ll match however many resources you put in.”","The Moon Empress’ expression did not change in the slightest, but there was now a layer of scorn in her voice as she said, “Li Yang, I remember that the intermediate devil you contracted has evolved into a major devil. It has produced one Seed of Satan. I will stake 20 Island Whales, three of which have reached strategic class S-rank, 2,000 tons of Myth Breed spiritual ingredients, 50 tons of Creation Breed spiritual ingredients, 500 Law Crystals, 50 World Crystals, and ten cleansed Immortal bodies. I don’t need you to match my resources. You just need to stake the Seed of Satan.”","A strange expression came over Li Yang.","The Seed of Satan would spawn a devil with the bloodline of a major devil. Only one could be produced at a time, and it was mostly used to carry on legacies.","Other devils could absorb the Seed of Satan to comprehend the abilities within it.","A devil could only fuse with one Seed of Satan in its life.","The Seed of Satan that Li Yang’s devil produced was desired by all other members of the Freedom Federation’s royalty because the devil that Li Yang had contracted was very special.","No matter how many times the other members of royalty offered a trade for the Seed of Satan, Li Yang turned them down.","The Moon Empress has not contracted a devil from the Demon Church. What use could she have for the Seed of Satan?","She had offered ten more of the Island Whales than Li Yang had, as well as 2,000 tons of Myth Breed spiritual ingredients, 50 tons of Creation Breed spiritual ingredients, 500 Law Crystals, 50 World Crystals, and ten cleansed Immortal bodies.","Given Li Yang’s power, he would be able to obtain the first few types of resources as long as he was willing to invest time.","However, there was no way that Li Yang would be able to obtain the Law Crystals, World Crystals, and cleansed Immortal bodies on his own.","Every person in the Freedom Federation only cared about his own profits, and the members of royalty were no exception.","Every time the Freedom Mystic Temple received greetings, the members of royalty who were Creation Masters were seated apart from the other members of royalty.","The Freedom Federation’s Class 5 Creation Masters were treated far better than the other members of royalty.","The Goddess of Mercy was a Class 5 Creation Master.","Every time Li Yang begged the Goddess of Mercy for Creation Master resources, she would require him to pay an immense amount of resources.","She asked more of him than if he asked the same of any other Class 5 Creation Master from the Spirit Mother Federation, Sand Continent Federation, Violent Wind Federation, or Black Tung Federation. This was the reason the members of the Freedom Federation’s royalty all had deep ties with the Class 5 Creation Masters of other federations.","Class 5 Creation Masters could produce very precious resources. As such, Li Yang badly wanted the resources the Moon Empress offered.","Normally, he would never use the Seed of Satan as a stake in a bet.","But when he remembered that there was zero chance of the Radiance Federation winning, Li Yang decided to agree.","He kept in mind that he was in the Radiance Federation, where he would not have any safety nets in any negotiations or bets.","Li Yang took out the Seed of Satan.","When the black and purple crystal appeared in Li Yang’s palm, evil inauspicious aura poured out of it.","“Since Lan Xun is acting as the dealer, we shall leave our resources with him. He will give the resources to whichever side ends up winning.”","The Moon Empress took out a pendant made from a moonlight stone and said, “All the resources I mentioned are within this moonlight pendant.”","She tossed the moonlight pendant to Lan Xun.","Since Lan Xun had volunteered to be the dealer, he had been prepared to hold onto the stakes from both sides.","The stakes offered by the Moon Empress and Li Yang caused the other 12 members of the Radiance Federation’s royalty to share looks.","The Moon Empress seemed to be coming from a place of confidence where she was certain that her disciple would be able to defeat the Freedom Federation envoy group and win the intermediate demon offered by the Goddess of Mercy.","The trade that the Moon Empress secured later that involved Li Yang’s Seed of Satan was meant to enable the intermediate devil to gain a new ability.","The Moon Empress was making plans for Lin Yuan.","However, was the Moon Empress so certain that Lin Yuan would be able to defeat the members of the Freedom Federation envoy group?","If the Freedom Federation envoy group had the confidence to propose the challenge, they had to be sure of their imminent victory.","Although the Radiance Federation was already prepared for this fight and the members of royalty had no intention of losing, the audience on Star Web had temporarily lost their ability to think.","They knew that the Moon Empress had negotiated an earth-shattering bet with the Freedom Federation’s royalty."]},{"number":1695,"title":"Chapter 1695 The Moon Empress! 6 Stars!","paragraphs":["1695 The Moon Empress! 6 Stars!","The regular people who had not even heard of the Island Whale before had no concept of what the items that the Moon Empress had mentioned were.","But they knew that these items were very valuable.","When Li Yang and the Moon Empress made such large bets, the Goddess of Mercy became interested and said, “There are probably many uncontracted fairy source-type lifeforms inside the Radiance Federation’s treasure vault. I want 300 of them. In exchange, I will stake 150 complete fairy bloodlines. Additionally, I will throw in 200 different types of insect-species carcinoma feys, 5,000 Bronze/Epic feys, and 100 Bronze/Legend feys. What will the Radiance Federation offer me?”","The Goddess of Mercy’s words set Star Web off.","Things like the Island Whales, Myth Breed spiritual ingredients, and Creation Breed spiritual ingredients were far too foreign for regular people.","However, Bronze/Epic and Bronze/Legend feys were used by low-class spirit qi professionals, and everyone knew of their value.","They cost 3,000 to 4,500 Radiance dollars each.","5,000 of them would amount to hundreds of billions.","Chu Ci had been called the number one genius in the Radiance Federation when she revealed that they had the Bronze/Fantasy Obsidian Iron Wild Bull.","Maple Forest Snowy Night: What? 5,000 Bronze/Epic feys and 100 Bronze/Legend feys! Oh my god! I’m getting dizzy! I can’t imagine what would be able to match such value.","Guan Haotian: My mother just asked me why I’m kneeling! I also want to know the reason. My knees just acted on their own!","Peace is Bliss: Just how confident is the Freedom Federation that they are willing to offer such a sea of resources? Both the Moon Empress and the Freedom Federation are so confident. Who do you think will win?","Glass Heart: With such an enormous bet, I think that Liu Yifan, Black, Gao Feng, and the rest will have to give it their all!","After the momentary shock, the audience on Star Web had noticed that the situation was not normal.","Previously, many people had held on to the naive belief that the Freedom Federation had suggested the friendly match as a test for the bet with the Radiance Federation that would take place two years later.","But after the bets were made, all of them threw such naive thoughts out of their heads.","After all, neither side would be willing to lose all that resources.","Additionally, the Radiance Federation and Freedom Federation were far from being on good terms.","The excitement that the audience on Star Web had felt had changed into a rage when Liu Yifan was involved.","But now, the rage had turned into nervousness and sombreness.","Regardless of what the result ended up being, this match would inevitably spill the blood of heroes fighting for the sake of the Radiance Federation.","The Goddess of Mercy had thrown in such stakes because she wanted to trade off a batch of resources she possessed.","She had the hobby of collecting fairy source-type lifeforms and turning them into dolls. Thus, she wanted to obtain more fairy source-type lifeforms that were not in her collection.","If she gave the 150 fairy bloodlines to the fairy source-type lifeform, their bloodlines would be evolved.","But this method would only be fully effective the first time. One use required the use of exactly 150 fairy bloodlines.","The Goddess of Mercy also collected carcinoma feys as toys.","She had done many experiments on carcinoma feys and found insect-species carcinoma feys to be the ugliest.","Hence, she wanted to use insect-species carcinoma feys to trade for some animal-type or plant-type feys.","She did not need to offer Legend and Epic quality feys.","But since the Moon Empress had used this method to overpower Li Yang and the Freedom Federation’s might, the Goddess of Mercy did not mind doing the same to the Radiance Federation.","The Goddess of Mercy’s Class 5 Creation Master level was very high.","She had easily defeated the Bamboo Monarch during the last Creation Master competition.","The Goddess of Mercy had offered so many Creation Master resources to put the Radiance Federation in a difficult position and to use the chance to accumulate even more.","However, the Goddess of Mercy’s plan had failed.","Before anyone else said anything, the Moon Empress said, “I accept this stake! There is no problem with you using the fairy bloodlines to trade for fairy source-type lifeforms. But it’s too greedy of you to use 200 insect-species carcinoma feys to trade for other carcinoma feys. Insect-species carcinoma feys are the most common carcinoma feys. Their value is far from that of animal-type carcinoma feys and plant-type carcinoma feys.","“I won’t be using carcinoma feys to trade for your 200 insect-species carcinoma feys. However, your stake also doesn’t equal the value of what I’m about to offer. You’ll need to add another 5,000 Bronze/Epic feys and 150 fairy bloodlines!”","The Goddess of Mercy frowned when she heard what the Moon Empress said.","Nonetheless, she became interested. What was the Moon Empress going to offer?","Its value was equivalent to 150 fairy bloodlines, 10,000 Bronze/Epic feys, 100 Bronze/Legend feys, and 200 insect-species carcinoma feys.","This was enough to pay a Class 5 Creation Master for a year.","No one in the world would dare to hire a Class 5 Creation Master to work tirelessly for a year because Class 5 Creation Masters were already the richest group of people in the world.","“Moon Empress, if what you’re offering satisfies me, I don’t mind entering the bet with you. 5,000 Bronze/Epic feys and 150 fairy bloodlines aren’t worth much to me.”","“You definitely won’t turn down my offer of one pure Eternal Heart”, replied the Moon Empress calmly.","The Moon Empress had decided that she was going to announce herself as a Class 6 Creation Master.","News of the current clash with the Freedom Federation would undoubtedly spread throughout the entire main world.","This was the best time for the Moon Empress to announce that she was a Class 6 Creation Master.","Once the fight against the Freedom Federation envoy group was over, she would declare to the world that Lin Yuan was her disciple.","Once that happened, no matter how outstanding Lin Yuan became, her status as a Class 6 Creation Master would allow her to continue attracting more attention than him. She might even be able to strike fear into all who bore ill intent toward him."]},{"number":1696,"title":"Chapter 1696 Girl in the Black Coffin!","paragraphs":["1696 Girl in the Black Coffin!","The other 12 members of royalty in the Radiance Federation already knew that the Moon Empress could purify the Eternal Heart.","Nonetheless, they were still shocked by what she said because they had not expected her to declare her newly attained Creation Master class to the world at such a moment.","The Moon Empress pulled the full attention of the Goddess of Mercy and Li Yang onto her before the fight to dim the spotlight over Lin Yuan.","She was truly going to as many lengths as she could for his sake.","But there was more than one benefit to this than just helping him to keep possible predators off his scent as it would also test the reactions of the Goddess of Mercy and Li Yang after they heard this news and use it to make a guess about whether the Freedom Federation could also reach the same Creation Master class.","In the battles between the Radiance Federation and Freedom Federation, the Radiance Federation had always been the weaker side.","After all, the Radiance Federation had only become part of the three major federations after the Moon Empress became a Class 5 Creation Master.","Before the Moon Empress became a Class 5 Creation Master, the Radiance Federation only had two Class 5 Creation Masters and lagged significantly behind the Freedom Federation and Azure Federation.","The amount of top Creation Master resources a federation possessed was dependent on the number of Class 5 Creation Masters they had. This was because the top Creation Master resources would eventually turn into powerful combat power.","It could be said that the weaker Radiance Federation had only been able to stand toe-to-toe against the Freedom Federation all this time because of how well they banded together and the elderly man who had held down the fort before the Moon Empress, Night Leaning Moon, and the rest came into their own.","Although the elderly man and the Moon Empress had not changed their titles to include ‘god’ or ‘goddess’ despite attaining that level of power, they were still mighty enough to deter the Freedom Federation.","After the Goddess of Mercy heard what the Moon Empress said, she said with an incredulous expression, “I can’t believe your Creation Master level has broken through that level too! You’re actually able to purify the Eternal Heart now!”","While she was speaking, the Goddess of Mercy’s countenance darkened.","Her words shocked the Radiance Federation’s 13 members of royalty as well as Lan Xun.","From her words, they realized that there was already someone in the Freedom who could also purify the Eternal Heart.","Everyone could tell from her expression that the Goddess of Mercy was not talking about herself.","Lan Xun gasped internally.","He had not expected the bet he proposed to lead to such a revelation.","If both the Freedom Federation and Radiance Federation now had Class 5 Creation Masters who could purify the Eternal Heart, they were more than worthy of being classified as Class 6 Creation Masters.","This would usher in a new era for Creation Masters!","The purified Eternal Heart could help experts that had reached Eternal power to take a step beyond that level.","Previously, the Azure Federation and the Freedom Federation had been in the lead, while the Radiance Federation remained in their shadow for some time before eventually catching up.","But now, it was the Freedom Federation and Radiance Federation who were in the lead while the Azure Federation had slipped behind.","If none of the Class 5 Creation Masters from the Azure Federation could break through to this level soon, the Azure Federation would not be able to hold out when they eventually had to face off against the other two federations.","This thought caused Lan Xun to sigh.","Today’s battle was akin to two federations foreshadowing the power they would be demonstrating during battle.","Yin Lin had inserted herself into this battle from the beginning and even allied with the Radiance Federation.","If a battle truly broke out today, Yin Lin’s choice to lean toward the Radiance Federation might be the more advantageous one.","Moreover, regardless of which federation the Azure Federation decided to side with, their priority would be to obtain the Eternal Heart.","The Freedom Federation placed its individual profits above all.","If the Azure Federation wanted to work with the Freedom Federation, they would have to negotiate under the table with the various members of royalty.","If they worked with the Radiance Federation, whose royalty acted as one entity, the chances of success were undoubtedly higher, and they would have to jump through fewer hoops.","Regardless of which federation the Azure Federation obtained the purified Eternal Heart from, that federation would require the expert who had attained Eternal power to swear on it using their birth horoscope.","The Azure Federation would ask the same if they gave away high-class Creation Master resources to other federations.","Given the chaotic state of the main world, only strong power would be able to grant salvation.","A year ago, fights started breaking out in many federations with Class 5 Creation Master. The repercussions had been significant.","If the Azure Federation partnered with the Radiance Federation, there was no question that the Radiance Federation would be willing to give the Eternal Heart to friendly parties.","Regardless of the other party’s request, they would do it as a favor.","Regardless, Lan Xun still had to deliver the news back to the Azure Federation, so the 12 Class 5 families could hold a meeting about the matter before making any concrete plans.","Li Yang’s expression had also changed vastly.","Previously, Second Page Revival’s brow had been furrowed as she took her bearings in relation to how circumstances were unfolding. She also pondered what Sixth Page Lashing’s objective was.","But after she heard that the Moon Empress could purify the Eternal Heart, the body she was possessing started to sway slightly,","Soon, the gray eyes turned purplish-black.","In the inverted image of these purplish-black eyes, two black candles were burning with purple flames.","Under the candlelight, a breathtakingly beautiful girl slowly opened her eyes inside a black coffin.","There was a common-looking toy hanging around her neck. There were four wings sprouting from the toy’s back that radiated the aura of death. It was as though they were the messengers of Death himself.","A moment later, the body stopped trembling, and the eyes returned to gray.","But at the same time, the image of a black candle rose to the surface of the skin above this person’s heart.","The figure walked forward until he was at the front of the group.","An extremely elegant smile spread across his plain face. He looked as languid as the royalty of the past reclining under the afternoon sun in the garden and sipping on sweet fruit tea.","It was a huge boost of morale when the Moon Empress accepted the Goddess of Mercy and Li Yang’s bets on her own.","After the Goddess of Mercy and the Moon Empress handed the additional stakes to Lan Xun, he quickly glanced over most of them as a check before storing them inside his spatial equipment.","But when he got to the Moon Empress’ moonlight stone pendant, he was temporarily dazed."]},{"number":1697,"title":"Chapter 1697 So They’re Disciples of Royalty!","paragraphs":["1697 So They’re Disciples of Royalty!","“There are no problems with the bets from either side. Now...”","Before Lan Xun could finish speaking, the Goddess of Mercy cut him off and said, “Lan Xun, I want to see the Eternal Heart for myself before we proceed.”","Lan Xun instantly looked annoyed.","Damn! What did you just say? You didn’t ask to see it when the Moon Empress mentioned it. But now that it’s in my hands and I’ve looked at it, you suddenly need to see it. Are you trying to say that I’m untrustworthy or something?","Lan Xun scoffed and injected spiritual energy into the moonlight pendant he was holding.","Soon, a heart made of crystal appeared in Lan Xun’s hand.","The heart flew around an exquisite scorpion with silver and yellow scales. There were color-changing gems that resembled stars dotting the silver and yellow scales.","The gems shone with a strange light. They looked like opals that were used to adorn accessories.","The scorpion’s tail was a different color from the scales, and it looked almost transparent. There were many thin gold threads within the scale.","These threads moved freely within the tail.","When the Goddess of Mercy saw the crystal heart and the scorpion, she could not help but say, “A purified Golden Opal Earth Mother Scorpion’s heart! The Moon Empress is actually willing to give up the heart of the Golden Opal Earth Mother Scorpion. It is one of the top-ten poison-type feys! It just so happens that I have a use for this Eternal Heart. Let me thank the Moon Empress in advance!”","The Goddess of Mercy spoke as though she had already won.","The Moon Empress replied calmly, “Let me also thank you for giving the Radiance Federation these resources, Consort of Mercy!”","Next, she turned to address the contestants, “These feys will go to the people who perform well in the test.”","The Moon Empress’ words caused the Goddess of Mercy’s gold and red fishtail to thump a few times forcefully.","Although she maintained the faint smile on her face, a grinding sound could be heard coming from her mouth.","Li Yang might be a member of the Freedom Federation’s royalty, but he was not stepping in now because it was a confrontation between the Moon Empress and the Goddess of Mercy.","Lan Xun’s expression was interesting, to say the least.","Everyone in the world knew that the Goddess of Mercy’s previous title was the Consort of Mercy.","By calling the Goddess of Mercy the Consort of Mercy while maintaining her title of Empress, she was clearly placing herself above the Goddess of Mercy.","The Moon Empress did have the right to do so because she had surpassed the level of Class 5 Creation Master.","Moreover, the Moon Empress possessed a Heavenly Family Fey that had exceeded Eternal.","Even if she did not have more power than the Goddess of Mercy, she would still be standing on equal ground.","The Moon Empress was trying to exert pressure on her, and the Goddess of Mercy did not have any rebuttal.","The Goddess of Mercy had only thought about herself during the bet, while the Moon Empress had promised all the spoils to the contestants.","This action warmed the hearts of these geniuses of the Radiance Federation.","Nonetheless, the members of the Freedom Federation envoy group were unbothered because they were used to such behavior in the Freedom Federation.","All the other 12 members of the Radiance Federation’s royalty knew why the Moon Empress was targeting the Goddess of Mercy.","She had openly tried to poach her disciple. From how much she loved him and how protective she was over him, it was already impressive that she had not directly attacked the Goddess of Mercy. But, there was no way she was going to leave the Goddess of Mercy’s ego unscathed.","Although the fight between the Radiance Federation and Freedom Federation had not officially begun, Qian Yu could tell that the Goddess of Mercy was close to being checkmated.","He hastily said, “There is one disciple of royalty among the Radiance Hundred Sequence, while my side has three experts who are favored by royalty. For the sake of fairness, I would like to invite another two of the Radiance Federation’s disciples of royalty to participate. Every one of the Radiance Federation’s disciples of royalty must have been nurtured meticulously. As such, I’m sure the Radiance Federation’s royalty won’t be opposed to me picking the disciples!”","An evil aura immediately exploded from Chef Supreme when he heard what Qian Yu said.","Zong Ze’s curse that had caused him to lose control of his bloodthirst for battle had come from Tower Canon.","Chef Supreme would never believe that the collusion between the Freedom Federation and Tower Canon could be simple.","Most of the people from the Freedom Federation’s side would pick Zong Ze in order to take advantage of the curse.","In the past, Chef Supreme would have been incredibly worried.","But now, the situation had changed.","Lin Yuan’s gift had suppressed Zong Ze’s curse, and Zong Ze’s combat power had reached a whole new level.","Moreover, after his period of seclusion, his feys’ powers had also improved.","A few days ago, Chef Supreme had evolved Zong Ze’s sacred source lifeform.","In fact, he really hoped that Zong Ze would be picked.","Since the other side wanted to pick, the Radiance Federation was in no position to say no.","Soon, Chef Supreme, the Bamboo Monarch, and Ji Changdeng’s attendants fetched Zong Ze, Gu Lang, and An He to the golden pillars.","But this was not all.","The Star Web audience realized with shock that You Zhe and Zuo Ming, as well as the elderly man’s two attendants, had jumped down from the golden pillars and were walking over to the silver pillars.","The audience on Star Web held their breaths.","Could it be that there were two other disciples of royalty among the Radiance Hundred Sequence?","The minds of the audience members who were familiar with the previous members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence immediately went to Zhao Xiaochun, Liu Jie, and Xia Qing.","Liu Jie had retired from the Radiance Hundred Sequence when his main fey became seriously injured.","But now, he had made a triumphant return as Sequence #1.","Xia Qing had first participated in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection three years ago. She started as Sequence #91 but rose to Sequence #1 the following year. This year, she had been beaten down to Sequence #3.","Zhao Xiaochun’s improvement had been extremely outstanding. She jumped over 20 ranks into the top ten.","No one was guessing Long Tao to be a disciple of royalty because he had been Sequence #3. It was not exceptional for him to have risen up a spot to Sequence #2.","It had taken Long Tao three years to reach Sequence #3. Every year, he improved his rank by about ten spots.","Hence, his performance had not been as outstanding as Xia Qing, Liu Jie, and Zhao Xiaochun.","While the members of the audience were busy guessing, You Zhe, Zuo Ming, and the elderly man’s two attendants stopped below the first and third silver pillars before all dropping to one knee.","Liu Jie and Xia Qing had jumped down from their silver pillars and landed on the ground.","Liu Jie now stood between Zuo Ming and You Zhe, while Xia Qing stood between the other two attendants.","At that moment, there was no question about Liu Jie and Xia Qing’s identities."]},{"number":1698,"title":"Chapter 1698 The Admired Six!","paragraphs":["1698 The Admired Six!","The members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection had always guessed about Xia Qing’s identity.","Thus, they were not overly shocked by this reveal.","Meanwhile, Liu Jie had held Long Tao completely down with just a few insect-species carcinoma feys. The Diamond/Fantasy IV Sea King Cretaceous Dragon had not been able to fight back at all.","Previously, Liu Jie’s rank had been around Sequence #30. Given his current rank, it could only be said that his power had skyrocketed.","Two years ago, Liu Jie had been unable to fight because the Insect Queen’s roots had been injured.","All the previous members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence knew that he had left the Radiance Hundred Sequence. Hence, they were all astounded by Liu Jie’s increase in power.","Currently, Liu Jie was standing in the position of Sequence #1 in all his glory.","It turned out that he was Chief Guard Ye’s disciple!","As Liu Jie and Xia Qing walked forward side by side, Zuo Ming and You Zhe walked behind Liu Jie while the other two attendants walked behind Xia Qing.","The discussions on Star Web were going wild.","Time is Like Love: Damn! My favorite member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence has always been Liu Jie. Although he disappeared two years ago, I never stopped liking him. It turns out that he’s Chief Guard Ye’s disciple! As a citizen of Cold Frost City, I’ll never forget what he did for us!","I’m Watching You: I’m a member of the Cold Frost Guards. When I arrived at the scene, he was already out of spiritual power, and the Insect Queen was heavily injured. Nonetheless, he continued instructing the almost-fully crippled insect tide to hold back the dimensional lifeforms! Lord Liu Jie is truly deserving of respect!","Cloud Husk: Both Xia Qing and Liu Jie are disciples of royalty. One of them is Sequence #1, while the other is Sequence #3. If both of them participate, Lord Liu Yifan’s team will have a much better chance of winning!","Constellation Sea: To be honest, I’ve already made it to the Celestial Stairway Hall. You can check my battle statistics! Look at the anonymous names who are also young. Most of them are disciples of royalty! Frankly, disciples of royalty might not be weaker than Liu Jie and Xia Qing. Rather, they might even be stronger! Don’t ask me how I know because I might have encountered one of them!","Building Blocks: Why do I feel like Black and Lin Yuan are getting more and more similar? Besides their different feys, they are identical in age and even aura! I can’t believe it unless a person can have two different fey arrangements!","The various popular live-streaming rooms were also abuzz with activity.","Normally, people would be poking fun and making jokes. Yet, not a single person was doing it now.","This was because these people knew that there were about to be ten elites who were strong enough to represent the Radiance Federation that were about to lay down their lives to fight to the death with the Freedom Federation.","In the past, the Scholars and Creation Master academics would be stripping Xia Qing and Liu Jie down. They might even be reanalyzing Black’s feys.","But now, none of these scholars and Creation Masters wanted to do so. Instead, they held their breaths and silently prayed as a form of support.","When Liu Jie and Xia Qing arrived atop the golden pillars, the entire Radiance Federation held their breaths as they gazed at the full radiant picture that was Liu Jie, Xia Qing, Zong Ze, Gu Lang, and An He.","There was no question that the five of them represented the strongest combat power in the under-25 demographic in the Radiance Federations.","Although An He, Gu Lang, and Zong Ze were shrouded in mystery, the public also did not know much about Liu Jie and Xia Qing’s methods either.","Not even the Radiance Hundred Sequence members knew what Xia Qing’s main fey was or exactly how many insect-species carcinoma feys Liu Jie had.","However, they had all already seen how Gao Feng had singlehandedly supported a team of 10,000 and kept them afloat against an insect tide.","Thus, no matter how strong the other disciples of royalty were, they would be strong enough for Gao Feng’s standard.","At that moment, both Liu Jie and Zong Ze’s eyes were on Lin Yuan.","When the six of them were discussing battle tactics, Lin Yuan had given Zong Ze a large box of the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen.","Although Zong Ze’s curse had not been fully cleared, he would be able to take on anything without fear after using such a large box of the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen.","With this thought, Zong Ze clenched his fists tightly.","His power had come a long way from the Guard Ye Banquet. Zong Ze from the two time periods could not even be compared in the same sentence.","Half of the merit for his evolution went to Lin Yuan for giving him the Heavenly Maiden Sleet elemental pearl.","This Heavenly Maiden Sleet elemental pearl had purified the Fiery Sky Hou’s bloodline.","The power of the fey with the Barren bloodline came more from its bloodline than its grade.","The Fiery Sky Hou had already been capable of rolling its grade during combat in the past. Now, doing so would be easier for Zong Ze than ever.","A few months ago, Zong Ze had been sparring with Lin Yuan. Now, he was likely going to fight alongside Lin Yuan.","Zong Ze naturally thrived in battle and liked to fight against powerful opponents.","But, compared to the enjoyment he felt when he fought against Lin Yuan, Zong Ze preferred to join hands with Lin Yuan to take on the Radiance Federation’s enemies who had dared to insult them.","Liu Jie’s thoughts were simple. He was going to stand in front of Lin Yuan throughout to protect him, thereby performing his duty as Lin Yuan’s retainer.","The only other thing he was going to do was do everything in his power to defeat the enemy.","An He’s eyes were on Liu Yifan.","He had been following in Liu Yifan’s footsteps from a very young age.","An He badly wanted to fight side by side with Liu Yifan.","He wanted his senior brother to see how much he had grown.","In the past, he would have racked his brain to come up with a way to be one of the participants.","But now, he was not going to do so.","This was because he knew that his position in the team would overlap with that of Liu Yifan.","He was not the best candidate for this fight.","However, the decision was not up to him.","The Freedom Federation envoy group was going to choose who from the Radiance Federation was going to participate.","At that moment, Yan Ling, Cai Huo, You Changjian, and the other members of the Freedom Hundred Sequence had walked over to Qian Yu.","In case of accidents, the Freedom Federation had sent more members of the Freedom Hundred Sequence than usual."]},{"number":1699,"title":"Chapter 1699 Crimson and Warbler Candle!","paragraphs":["1699 Crimson and Warbler Candle!","The body of the Freedom Hundred Sequence member that Second Page Revival possessed did not step forward.","As such, Li Yang frowned at her.","This was when he realized that her gaze was very different from before.","Previously, Second Page Revival’s gaze had been dead and dark. But now, her gaze was full of confidence and elegance. It was as though there was nothing on earth that could cause her to falter.","This extraordinary change in attitude caused an unknown pressure to fall onto Li Yang’s shoulders.","When the member of the Freedom Hundred Sequence that Second Page Revival possessed met Li Yang’s gaze, a smile of amusement played on her lips, and she sauntered over to him.","Second Page Revival’s action astonished Li Yang.","Li Yang felt that with the Mountain River Grain God Bells around, Second Page Revival should be terrified of being noticed by the Goddess of Mercy and the Radiance Federation.","But now, she had the courage to stand within five meters of the Goddess of Mercy.","There was a large gap between Li Yang and the Goddess of Mercy’s powers.","If Li Yang was paying attention, even he would be able to sense that something was wrong if he was in such close proximity to Second Page Revival.","Hence, he was certain that the Goddess of Mercy could too.","Yet, she did not.","The change in Second Page Revival made Li Yang feel as though the situation had veered completely off course from his original plan.","He had abandoned Second Page Revival, but she was also not going to uphold her side of the deal.","But eventually, Li Yang decided against exposing Second Page Revival because he knew that both of them had the same goal of taking down the Radiance Federation.","...","A large lamp hung in an enormous castle.","The lamp was not luminous on its own, but the entire hall was almost blindingly bright.","The light came from the crystal heart above the lamp.","The crystal heart seemed to house a ferocious beast that intermittently released a shocking aura.","A string of pearls hung down from the middle of the lamp.","The string of pearls did not look special, but it shone with nine colors.","Upon careful inspection, the pearl string was a string of small squares.","It was as though the squares could release dimensions of their own after absorbing a type of power.","Eight large black coffins were positioned in a circle at the center of the enormous hall.","Six of the black coffins were tightly shut, while two were open.","The beautiful girl that just awoken touched the long purplish-black hair behind her. The contrast of her ivory skin and upturned eyes should have made her come across as cold.","But, her small and pretty nose neutralized the coldness of her eyes and made her appear elegant and dignified.","The occasional smile that spread across her face morphed her overall expression into one of slyness.","It was as though a scheme that could bring about the catastrophic destruction of every living thing had just appeared in her mind.","She looked at the figure next to her wrapped in a red robe and said, “Thank you, First Page Crimson! When the little toys are broken, you’ll need to step wake up first to take charge of the situation! Although I didn’t wake up naturally either but because of the fact that the loss of the Gardener Konjac’s seeds will affect The Sleeper’s Revival, the fire in my birth horoscope has been ignited! I don’t need to sleep anymore. You can sleep a while more! I’ll wake you when it’s time.”","The figure wrapped in a red robe said in a hoarse androgynous voice, “Warbler Candle, don’t have too much fun while the seven of us are sleeping. The Sleeper’s Revival is not only meant to wake us up faster. Don’t get in the way of the larger purpose!”","Second Page Warbler Candle raised her hand and plucked the gold earring from her ear.","She tossed it to the ground before using her broken pointer finger to touch the earring.","Vitality and soul power immediately flowed out from this earring.","Soon, the earring turned into a muscled man wearing golden half-armor.","The man knelt before Second Page Warbler Candle and said, “Mother, please give me an instruction!”","Second Page Warbler Candle frowned slightly. It was as though she hated being called this way.","“You can just call me Lordess Second Page! Sister Falling Rainbow’s tower is now called the Tower of Truth. Go to the Startling Lines Continent and bring back the Tower of Truth. When Sister Falling Rainbow wakes up and finds out that her tower’s name has changed, she will definitely melt it down and build a new one. There aren’t many Endless Scarlet Gold Rocks left. Sister Rainbow cannot be allowed to continue to waste them!”","Second Page Warbler Candle placed her hand on the head of the man kneeling in front of her.","Soon, Second Page Warbler Candle plucked a toy from the man’s head. It was a caricature of the man in golden half-armor.","Second Page Warbler Candle casually strung it up on the string around her neck that resembled both a vine and a snake.","It thudded softly when it bumped into the doll of the young girl with gray wings.","First Page Crimson said, “Fifth Page Truth wants to rule over the Startling Lines Continent. He wants to use their resources to charge toward the road to heaven! I want to collect another birth horoscope, so I’ll leave him alone for now.”","Second Page Warbler Candle said casually, “Crimson, your plan and actions are always so slow!”","Second Page Warbler Candle said to the man in golden half-armor, “If that’s the case, go up to the Radiance Federation through the Spatial Transport Mirror. Seek out Sixth Page Lashing, even if the Radiance Federation’s royalty ends up noticing you! Then, eliminate him! At that point, you’ll be the new Sixth Page! You shall be called Sixth Page Inverse Growth! Before heading to the Radiance Federation, go to the Dimensional Pool and pick a Dictator’s body. Consume its bone marrow and turn it into your sacred source lifeform.”","First Page Crimson did not comment.","Before he entered his black coffin, he removed his robe."]},{"number":1700,"title":"Chapter 1700 Precious Sword 4!","paragraphs":["1700 Precious Sword 4!","In an instant, a red tentacle emerged from the robe.","The red tentacle overshadowed even the blinding golden light coming from the ceiling.","The odor of contamination mesmerized Second Page Warbler Candle, and she relaxedly stretched.","A moment later, the odor of contamination disappeared from the hall.","The string of birth horoscopes hanging from the lamp lit up with golden light that flooded the hall again.","When she saw that First Page Crimson’s coffin had closed, Second Page Warbler touched the two toys around her neck and said, “I clearly had more than ten toys before I fell asleep. I can’t believe Epoch God Palace broke all of them! Only Little Revival is left. Now that I’m awake after 3,000 years, it’s time for the black candle to be relit!”","...","At that moment, a man with righteousness written all over his face appeared in the Spirit Food Pavilion.","It could be said that the entire Radiance Federation was focused on the fight between the teams led by Liu Yifan and the Radiance Federation envoy group.","The Spirit Food Pavilion was at maximum capacity, and there was not even space to sit.","There were many well-to-do families who had booked tables in the Spirit Food Pavilion for the entirety of the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection. During this time, they would leave Star Web as they pleased to eat at the Spirit Food Pavilion before returning to watch the competition.","Time in Star Web passed at the same rate as that of reality. When one second passed in Star Web, one second passed in reality as well.","Hence, Star Web had retained the feeling of hunger and sensitivity to ensure that people did not end up accidentally hurting themselves while they were logged in.","The situation was tense as the Freedom Federation envoy group was in the midst of picking another two disciples of royalty.","Star Web was full of opinions on who they thought was going to get picked. However, no consensus was reached because they had no idea how much power Zong Ze, Gu Lang, and An He actually had, or even what their main feys were.","Their position within a team was also a mystery. Thus, there was no point in guessing.","Hence, most of the comments were about Liu Jie and Xia Qing.","Although more people on Star Web idolized Liu Jie, they did not have high hopes for his performance during the upcoming fight as his fighting style was too mundane. All he did was use his main fey to commandeer a sea of insects.","This technique might work on people who were on the same level as him, but he would be at a disadvantage if he had to face feys that were capable of large-scale attacks.","An example would be Black’s sea of sand and the expanding sea of flowers. Liu Jie would be helpless against them.","While the audience on Star Web was watching with their breaths held, the servers and managers in the Spirit Food Pavilion were not allowed to log into Star Web during working hours.","Hence, they rushed up to serve the righteous-looking man.","All of the servers remembered him.","The man ordered a few dishes and sipped on strong wine. He looked like he was waiting for something as he kept palming his phone.","This righteous-looking man was Sixth Page Lashing, who had been holed up in Feng Rou’s home all this time.","Feng Rou had not visited the Spirit Food Pavilion for four straight days.","This confounded all the servers of the Spirit Food Pavilion.","Feng Rou was usually puffed up on her immense inheritance and the fact that she was a Class 2 Creation Master. As such, she regarded the Spirit Food Pavilion as her food court.","She saw the Spirit Food Pavilion as her main hunting ground for attractive toys.","Even when she found a partner, she could continue to return to the Spirit Food Pavilion to dine.","It was extremely strange for her to disappear for four days.","Sixth Page Lashing had returned to the Spirit Food Pavilion, but Feng Rou was not with him.","The Spirit Food Pavilion’s servers were all being eaten up by curiosity.","Is it possible that Feng Rou dumped this man? Feng Rou seemed so interested in him, but it didn’t even last a week. It turns out that he’s nothing more than a pretty face!","At that moment, Sixth Page Lashing’s phone started to ring.","He snapped his fingers and an invisible spirit qi barrier surrounded him in a three-centimeter radius.","This barrier would ensure that no one would overhear Sixth Page Lashing’s phone call.","When he picked up the call, a gentle female voice said from the other end, “Ah Shuo, Tower Canon has definitely noticed that you didn’t act as per Second Page Revival’s deal. This trip to the Radiance Federation is Tower Canon’s first important operation. Your lack of cooperation will make it very difficult for the operation to proceed! You infiltrated Tower Canon to find out that secret. Although you haven’t uncovered it yet, Captain has decided that you should return! If anything happens to you, our team will lose a main attacker, and the other members will be devastated.”","Sixth Page Lashing frowned deeply when he heard this.","He could not remember the last time someone addressed him as ‘Ah Shuo’, and the name felt very foreign.","However, the captain’s decision and the right thing to do were different.","The team might be afraid that he would sacrifice himself, but Sixth Page Lashing could not shake the feeling that there was something very wrong with Second Page Revival.","He had not cooperated with Second Page Revival because he wanted to find out exactly what she was up to.","All the other seven Pages of Tower Canon had resources they could not touch.","So why had Second Page Revival claimed she could use them all? There had to be a reason.","Sixth Page Lashing needed to find out what it was. This would make the past 40 years he had spent as a spy in Tower Canon worth it.","When he came to this decision, Sixth Page Lashing replied, “Xi Cai, don’t call me Ah Shuo next time. Address me by our team name, Precious Sword 4! Otherwise, I will be confused. I will return to the team once I have ascertained Second Page Revival’s identity.”","Sixth Page Lashing hung up without hesitation and took out a Star Web Card.","Normally, a person’s Star Web Card had their signature on the back. But Sixth Page Lashing’s card did not have it.","Every spirit qi professional who became a Creation Master would obtain a second Star Web Card."]}]);
